window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":301,"title":"Chapter 301 - You’ve changed!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[Smoking loneliness... Mr. Fang is unrivaled.]","[I admire him for it!]","“...”","All the big chat groups were boisterous with this topic. Meanwhile, Mo Xian and her companions each spent 800 crystals with great reluctance to buy a membership card and increased the daily computer time to eight hours which allowed them to watch eight episodes today.","It was already night when they returned to the Nanhua Faction.","“Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell!” A female disciple yelled on the Nanhua Square and pointed her index finger and middle finger toward the sky.","“Senior Sister, what do you think of my imitation?”","“You can’t even use the sword control technique, let alone the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell!” another female disciple said contemptuously, “After I master the sword control technique, I’ll travel from the Haoran Faction in the south to Yimu Palace in the north and give them a great shock!”","“So powerful! I never imagined that such a place existed in the world!” A female disciple said in amazement, “I feel an increase in cultivation strength, proficiency in sword techniques, and spiritual spell power. I learned a lot from watching those grand masters fight! It was a totally different experience from cultivating and learning in the faction!”","“Senior Sister, by then, you’ll surely defeat Liu Ningyun and get the title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy!”","“Right!”","Mo Xian’s face froze. “What Nanhua Heavenly Fairy? I’m still young; why should I take the title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy?”","“Ugh?” The other female disciples were baffled. “Senior Sister, who would deserve this title but you?”","“Yeah, you’re senior to Liu Ningyun. After you master the powerful spiritual spells of the Green Cloud Faction, she will be no match for you!”","“Senior Sister, are you afraid of her?”","Mo Xian snorted, “My junior sisters, you’re so silly. What’s the benefit of being the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy? Just think, why is Junior Sister Liu grounded?”","“She is grounded because she went to Half City several times and didn’t cultivate,” the other girls answered.","“Exactly! After becoming the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy, one can learn Nanhua Heavenly Light, the ultimate technique of the Nanhua Faction. But we plan to learn the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, so why should I fight for that title?!”","“Right...” The other girls suddenly understood. “If you take her position, you will be grounded and can’t go and watch Jade Dynasty!”","“It means that you can’t learn Tai Chi Mystic Pure Dao and the sword control technique! You can’t learn the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell as well in the future!”","“Exactly!” Mo Xian was proud of her cleverness. “For one thing, Master will be stricter on me. For another, I will have to guard the Nanhua Forbidden Place. Guarding it means that I can’t leave whenever I want! When Jade Dynasty releases the 100th or 200th episode, how can I watch them?”","“Right!” one of the female disciples said, “What if we want to eat the instant noodles? That damn shop owner doesn’t allow people to take it out!”","“Senior Sister, you can’t become the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy then!”","“Senior Sister is right! It’s best to let Junior Sister Liu become the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy!”","Soon, all of them agreed to each other.","Nodding, Mo Xian said, “From now on, we must speak well of Junior Sister Liu in front of Master to ensure that she won’t take the title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy from Junior Sister Liu and put it on one of us!”","“Elder Senior Sister is right!”","“Now that I think about it, Junior Sister Liu is a fine girl,” a round-faced female disciple said, “She’s pretty and has good talent; her temperament and manners are all excellent.”","“Now that you mentioned it, I think Junior Sister Liu has great deportment even though I couldn’t bear her lofty aura in the past!”","“Of course...” a female disciple said, “She’s still no match for Senior Sister Mo.”","“No match for me?” Mo Xian rolled her eyes at her. “Junior sister Liu has the best talent in the Nanhua Faction over the past 1,000 years, which has been confirmed by the elders. As for the Nanhua Limitless Technique, she mastered it better than any of us...”","...","The Xichi Spiritual Master was the well-respected and powerful Second Elder of Nanhua Faction, and she was also Mo Xian and Liu Ningyun’s master.","– In the Xichi Spiritual Master’s residence on the next morning –","“Disciple An Ya and Yue Yan are here to greet Master.” Two white-clothed female disciples came in.","“Okay.” The Xichi Spiritual Master nodded casually. Except for during her seclusion cultivation, her direct disciples must come and greet her every day.","However, she found that the two disciples didn’t leave after greeting her.","“Is there anything else you want to say?” the Xichi Spiritual Master asked.","“Ugh...” They looked at each other, and An Ya, the round-faced disciple on the left, stepped up and said, “We heard yesterday that Junior Sister Liu is grounded by Master...”","“Enough.” The Xichi Spiritual Master didn’t like to hear their gossip. “I know that you don’t get along with your Junior Sister Liu, but didn’t I teach you not to badmouth others behind their backs?”","“No...” the other disciple Yue Yan immediately explained, “We wanted to say that Junior Sister Liu has great talent and is a rare genius in our faction!”","An Ya nodded and added, “Junior Sister Yue is right. Junior Sister Liu works very hard in cultivation. Last night, I happened to walk past her residence, and I found that she was still cultivating at midnight and didn’t sleep!”","When the two disciples left, the Xichi Spiritual Master was a bit confused.","At this moment, another female disciple came to greet her.","“Disciple Xu Yun and Yue Yan are here to greet Master.” a petite disciple bowed to her and greeted.","“Okay.” Xichi Spiritual Master nodded.","“Master,” Xu Yun said haltingly.","“Ugh?” Xichi Spiritual Master asked curiously, “You also have something to say?”","“Yeah...” Xu Yun said hesitantly, “In fact... Junior Sister Liu is a very good person! I just didn’t know it before...”","Then more disciples came.","“Disciple Jiang Yan...”","“Disciple Lv Xin...”","By now, the Xichi Spiritual Master was a bit dazed. Then, she saw Mo Xian in a black dress walk up and say, “Master, I heard yesterday that... you grounded Junior Sister Liu?”","“What?” The Xichi Spiritual Master knew that her eldest disciple disliked Liu Ningyun the most and would find fault with Liu Ningyun whenever she could. The Xichi Spiritual Master wondered if Mo Xian would do it again today.","The Xichi Spiritual Master said in a cold voice, “You don’t need to get involved in this!”","However, Mo Xian said, “Master, I know you’re still angry, but you shouldn’t be too hard on Junior Sister Liu!”","Xichi Spiritual Master was surprised. “Ugh?”","“Junior sister Liu isn’t a person who does things rashly. Even if she did something you don’t understand, she might have her reasons...”","“Please don’t take back her title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy in a moment of anger...”","The Xichi Spiritual Master was stunned!","What do you mean?! Your words were different yesterday! You said she was lazy and a good for nothing!","You even said that she doesn’t deserve the title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy! How come you are going back on everything you said?! The Xichi Spiritual Master gaped at Mo Xian who continued talking."]},{"number":302,"title":"Chapter 302 - Monsters Besieging Cities and the Devil Emerges","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While Su Tianji and the others played small games and grew vegetables in Qzone with an idle attitude, the number of players of the Legend of Mir 2 continued to grow. After the establishment of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild, the big forces also established their respective guilds, such as the Royal Clan Guild and Black Demon Guild, etc.","The maps that they fought over spanned from the Corpse King Hall to Wilma Temple. Right now, the members from different guilds had arrived at Zuma Temple, the only holy temple for the Orcs that remained on the continent.","However, posters that appeared in all the major cities disturbed their plans.","[Wilma’s crisis has come. The evil forces hidden in different places of the continent have been released by a mysterious force, and large troops of monsters are marching toward Biqi Royal City, Viper Valley, and Earth City in the Mengchong province. They are approaching the humans’ last resting places! Heroes of Wilma, pick up your weapons and defend our homeland!]","[If the troops of monsters take the big cities and kill the King of Biqi, the Wilma Continent will sink under the curses of the evil force!]","[Adventurers! Pick up your weapons and assist us! Fight and protect our world!]","Today, this announcement was the newest topic in the two shops.","“The monsters will be laying siege to the cities?”","“Did you see the announcement on the bulletin boards in the cities?”","“I did. Will the monsters attack us?’","The Wilma Clan Master who hadn’t been able to walk out of the godly palace will come out of it!","The Zuma Clan Master who had been sleeping in the Zuma Temple will lead its followers to attack the human world.","The many mutant worms in the dark underground of Death Valley will swarm up under the leadership of the Evil Centipede!","Many horrifying monsters will wake up in the darkness!","“Second Royal Brother, did you see the announcement in Earth City?” Fifth Prince Ji Yang had gotten online, and he was baffled. “What’s happening?”","“Who has gathered the troops of monsters?” The Second Prince said curiously, “I don’t understand the situation. Is there a powerful force hiding behind all this?”","“What on earth is this?!” Captain Yu Chi cussed in a fury, “A big counterattack of the evil forces?”","It seemed like the Orc Empire’s army of one million soldiers was coming back to redeem their honor.","– In the Half City Shop –","“Who knows what will happen after the cities are taken by monsters?” Black Demon was also confused.","“Taken by monsters...” Tang Yuan of the Yuanheng Pavilion said while eating instant noodles, “If nothing else, the stores and guards in the cities will vanish if the monsters take the cities. When we travel back with Town Portal Scrolls, we probably will return to the gathering places of the monsters. Without fortification and supplies, I’m afraid it will be difficult to level up!”","“How can such a thing happen?!” Xi Chenzhou said in a deep voice, “From the looks of it, we are being forced to fight to the death, right?”","Black Demon looked nonplussed. “Getting me, Black Demon, to protect the world?? What a joke! From the looks of it, I have to fight to the death?”","Tang Yuan said, “I share your feelings... but we’re doing it for our own benefits too...”","“Let’s talk about it tonight!” Xi Chenzhou said, “We must save some time and use it when defending the city.”","The Zuma Temple that was outside Earth City was a popular training spot where many forces battled for, but there weren’t many people here today.","“So soon?”","“Is it tonight?!”","Today, the number of concurrent players was clearly higher than usual, and some players who only played in their teams to get experience points, such as Su Tianji, had also become more active.","[Your friend, Yuji Immortal, is online.]","“Ugh?” Mr. Fang who was killing archers outside the Zuma Temple was surprised and sent her a message on QQ. [How come you’re online so early?]","[They said that monsters are going to attack the cities, so I came here to have a look.] Su Tianji controlled her wizard character which had just reached level 31. [What’s this invasion of cities? Are you going?]","[Of course!] Fang Qi thought about it and replied. [Go with some low-level items and store the valuable ones in your warehouse.]","[Why is that?]","...","While Fang Qi and Su Tianji chatted about the monsters besieging the cities in the game, something was happening in the Nanhua Faction.","Nanhua Forbidden Place was a wasteland full of steles with engraved inscriptions.","There was a cliff that was as smooth as a mirror, as if it had been cut by a sharp weapon. The black steles were engraved with many blood-red characters, and the withered yellow weed surrounded them, giving the place a lifeless look.","No one knew why the Nanhua Faction, a place that was as warm and pleasant as spring all year round, had such a weird place in it.","The black steles closer to the center were dozens of meters tall and as reflective as a mirror. At a closer look, the darkness in the stele looked so deep that it could swallow people!","The characters engraved on them were ancient and weathered. The weird characters looked like symbols, and it seemed like they were swimming on the steles like tadpoles.","All the steles stood together as if they were in a huge array. In the center of the array, there was a spot where all the withered weed had turned into black ashes, and a white-haired woman wearing white clothes was sitting there cross-legged.","She looked like a statue made of rotten wood, emitting a decayed and profound aura.","The characters on the steles seemed to brighten a bit.","Suddenly, the inscriptions lit up!","The entire land seemed to shake strangely, but the cultivators stationed outside of the valley sensed nothing!","Streaks of black mist oozed out from the underground one after another, and they gathered in the air and condensed into vague human faces.","The woman opened her eyes abruptly, and her decayed look instantly disappeared at this moment. In its place was a horrifying presence which kept surging. She chanted incantations at a fast speed, and spiritual energy rushed up violently, creating tornadoes!","Meanwhile, the black mist-like energy got more intense, and it seemed like murmurs resonated in the sky as if they came from a devil, luring ignorant mortals to fall into the dark abyss of Hell!","“Give up!”","“Release me!”","“You can’t suppress me!”","“I will give you more! Much more than what they can ever give you!”","“Your power is weakening, but I’m getting stronger!”","“Open your mind and accept my power!”","“...”","In the endless murmurs, a clear and lengthy chanting sounded, and the sky dimmed and then brightened. A dazzling golden light shot down from the high sky, and the darkness found no hiding place on this land.","The murmurs stopped at the same time!","The woman heaved a sigh of relief.","At this moment, the guards stationed outside of the valley had obviously sensed the strangeness in this place, and two teams of cultivators strode in. “What happened?”","“It’s fine.” The woman looked fatigued. She was about to sit down, but her expression suddenly changed.","In the chilly winds, the people who had just entered the valley found that the path behind them had vanished!","The land wriggled as if it had turned alive, and the disciples who had just entered the valley were swallowed by the squirming land!","“Such fresh blood and flesh!”","The woman looked horrified since the whole valley was sealed as if it was inside a huge blood-red cocoon!","“Impossible!” The woman screamed in horror.","“Your heart is summoning me!”","“You belong to me...”","“Are you dissatisfied?”","“Are you bitter?”","“With your talent, do you really want to stay here to die alone?”","“No... No!”","Half an hour later, the white-haired woman’s eyes suddenly revealed a weird red light in them. The decayed aura turned vibrant, and her aged skin turned rosy and smooth swiftly. She licked her blood-red lips, and her cold look turned bright and seductive, like a blooming deathly flower!","“Go and take more lives. The whole world will be our slave!”"]},{"number":303,"title":"Chapter 303 - Fierce City Defense Battles!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s infuriating that they put our items in the small item auction hall! They claimed that it is hard to set the reserve prices!” Ruan Ning and Xi Yue walked into the shop in a huff and complained.","“Sister Xi Yue, your Magic Shield Spell Skill Book and the Limitless Stick can sell at least for 10,000 crystals!” Right now, no one had found any of the three godly weapons, including the Judgement Staff, Dragon Mark Sword, and Bone Jade Scepter. The big guilds from the Morning Star Sea Realm and Dajin had been exploring, but they hadn’t entered the Zuma Temple yet, let alone seeing the Zuma Clan Master.","Right now, the items such as the Limitless Stick and the Moon in Well were the top weapons in the game!","When Mr. Fang stood in the cities with the Moon in Well in his hand, there wasn’t another weapon like it within a 100-kilometer radius; it was the same with the Limitless Stick.","“Forget it!” Xi Yue frowned. “10,000 crystals aren’t a big fortune in the inner city anyway. Let’s play the game first...”","Before they could get online, they saw that the huge internet café was almost full!","“Ugh? What’s happening today?” Ruan Ning was curious, “How come we have so many people here?”","She looked at Mr. Fang’s screen. “Sir! You bullied Xiaoyue just yesterday, and you have the face to ask her to heal you today?!”","“Nonsense,” Mr. Fang said in displeasure, “You got it wrong. Xiaoyue asked me to play the game with her.”","Ruan Ning laughed in disbelief. “Xiaoyue gave up Plants vs Zombies today and asked you to play the Legend of Mir 2?”","“Do you have any objections?”","“Humph!” The girls went online.","“Xiaoyue, today, we will teach you how to play Plants vs Zombies!” They sent Jiang Xiaoyue a message on QQ.","“I can’t. I’m playing the Legend of Mir 2 with Boss 😁.”","“Ugh?!” The girls were dumbfounded while many thoughts flashed through their minds:","“The Guild President is scummy!”","“What tricks did he play?!”","“...”","Suddenly, they saw a huge, dark-red monster stand among several Zuma Guards, and it spat out flames fearlessly!","“What is this?!”","“A new monster in the Zuma Temple?”","“Is it the Zuma Clan Master?”","“No! Xiaoyue is healing it!”","It must be noted that the Zuma Guards had high-level defensive and offensive abilities. When more than one of them came out, they were hard to defeat even when the girls were here. As for the skeletons, the level 3 skeletons that they summoned would be smashed apart very soon by the Zuma Guards.","However, this monster was fighting several Zuma Guards all by itself!","“This is a godly beast.” In this era where everyone summoned skeletons, they had never seen such a beast before.","“I got it!”","“Xiaoyue pulled the Guild President out to test her new technique!”","“She had me worried for a moment!”","Fang Qi was displeased. “What were you worried about?”","“Oh. Guild President, how come there are so many people in the shop today?” Ruan Ning immediately changed the topic.","“Because the monsters are going to attack the cities,” Fang Qi explained, “The Biqi Kingdom is fighting with the main force of Orcs, and they asked us to help them guard the cities since they lack soldiers.”","...","When it was close to 7 PM, the Half City Shop and Jiuhua City Shop were full of people, and many even stood behind other players to watch the game.","“I wonder how the monsters will attack the cities.”","“There are so many people in this city!” Some players of other games exclaimed from behind. At this moment, almost all the players of the Legend of Mir 2 had returned to the main cities.","Some big guilds had begun to organize their forces to prepare the defense of the cities.","At about 7 PM, the troops of monsters appeared. Outside of the magnificent city walls, large groups of low-level monsters charged at big cities.","“So many monsters!”","However, these low-level monsters only dropped gold coins and low-level items with little value. Soon, they were cleaned up!","After the first wave of monsters fell, they saw rows upon rows of white skeletons.","After the skeletons were large groups of zombies. In the sea of skeletons and zombies, everyone saw the huge, dark-red skeleton kings, Skeleton Spirits, and the huge white-grey zombies with iron chains, Corpse Kings!","Now realizing that the monsters would violate their interests if the cities were broken, the players knew that this wasn’t child’s play and charged at the sea of monsters. Some of them even rushed into herds of zombies with Magic Shield while waving their staffs and shooting out lightning bolts!","Hell Lightning!","“Corpse Kings! Get the Corpse Kings!” Standing at the foremost of the group with a Magic Shield, Black Demon suddenly realized that this crisis would also bring them great opportunities. The monsters that they had just killed had dropped many small ultimate items. Now that the Corpse Kings appeared, the players would be well rewarded if a skill book such as the Magic Shield Spell dropped.","It would be even better if the Corpse Kings dropped an Enchanting Light Skill Book; it was a godly skill book that every wizard craved for!","There were so many players that they overwhelmed bosses like the Corpse Kings. Instantly, the Corpse Kings were killed, and they dropped items all over the ground!","In the blink of an eye, crowds swarmed up like wasps!","Even the players who stood behind and watched the game was elated. “Book! There’s a skill book over there!”","Black Demon pushed into the BOSS zone with his Magic Shield activated and picked up a small yellow book. When he looked up, he found that he was surrounded by people, and the ground was as clean as a slate! Even an hair couldn’t be found!","“Boss! What did you pick up?” A Black Guard walked over and offered a skill book – Half Moon Saber.","Surprised, Black Demon laughed. “Good boy! You’re excellent at picking up stuff!”","Half Moon Saber might not be a very powerful combat technique in the real world, but it was the most useful AoE technique for warriors in the Legend of Mir 2. Since AoE attack meant high efficiency in killing monsters, and killing monsters would directly increase the players’ cultivation strengths, this technique was highly valuable!","Right now, a Half Moon Saber Skill Book would sell for an exorbitant price since it was so rare. Not even every high-level member of the Royal Clan Guild had this technique!","“After the battle, go and take one ultimate magic staff from Wang Jin; tell him that it’s my order!” Black Demon laughed and immediately went and stored the skill book in his warehouse.","The great items dropped by the bosses instantly ignited the atmosphere in the internet café and pushed it to the climax!","“I picked up a Ghost Spiritual Shield Skill Book! F*ck!” Someone roared hoarsely.","“A pair of Death God Gloves with [Damage: 0-3]! An ultimate item!” A soldier of Jiuhua was red with excitement.","“Hahahaha! I got a Group Healing Spell Skill Book!” The master of the Yuanheng Pavilion slammed his hand on the desk and laughed like a seven-year-old kid.","Meanwhile, the monsters from the Stone Tomb swarmed up. The players had easily overwhelmed the low-level monsters, but the higher leveled monsters were not so easy to kill. The players in the front rows died or escaped back to the cities to heal up, and they rushed back after respawning and healing to make another charge.","“Young Master Song! White boar! There is a white boar by me!” Lin Shao yelled. Wild White Boars were small bosses in the Stone Tomb. If the players were lucky, they might get some very good items from these boars!","In the Royal Family’s QQ channel, Yu Chi, who had just picked up an ultimate skeleton ring, was in a great mood. “I have a white boar here. Guys, come and kill it!”","Ji Wu also yelled in the QQ Channel, “I have two Wild White Boars! Where are the Royal Guards!”","“Moon in Well! I got a Moon in Well!” Xu Luo suddenly roared and began to pant in exhilaration.","“What are you playing? You’re so boisterous.” In the Half City Shop, Mo Xian. who had been watching TV Series, felt like her head was about to explode as all kinds of shouts sounded in the shop, and she looked toward Mr. Fang and asked."]},{"number":304,"title":"Chapter 304 - The Appearance of the Three Godly Weapons! Everyone Is Stimulated","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“We’re playing the Legend of Mir 2,” Fang Qi answered casually. Since Mo Xian was sitting next to Xi Yue, she could look at Xi Yue’s screen and then the screens of the cultivators who were yelling. “So many people are playing this game? Is it very powerful?”","“It’s okay,” Xi Yue said, “There are some good stuff in here.”","“Just okay? How come so many people are playing it?” Mo Xian was curious.","“Because we have a lot of people here, and it’s thrilling,” Xi Yue said.","“Thrilling?” Mo Xian watched the game on the side curiously.","“Guild President!” Xi Yue yelled in alarm, “How come there are so many monsters in the safe zone? I almost died again after respawning!”","After many new players entered the game, there were more players than monsters in the main places where people went to kill monsters and level up. But now, monsters swarmed up like waves, and some of them broke the defensive-line and entered the safe zones while the players fought the bosses and hurried to pick up items!","“Now you know why I told you to come to battle with low-level items?” Mr. Fang said.","“Guild President, you were right!” Xi Yue lost her weapon, but she wasn’t sad about it since it was only an ordinary Crescent Moon of little value.","If not for Fang Qi’s warning, she might have lost the ultimate magic staff, and that would have been a heavy blow to her!","“For once, you’re dependable...” Ruan Ning murmured to herself. Although the independent players were fighting monsters chaotically, more players came from guilds, which organized charges on QQ. The organized players such as the Royal Clan and Jiuhua Army were still resisting the sea of monsters.","By now, Fang Qi had also gathered the players in the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild. “Draw the monsters out from the safe zones! Otherwise, they will slaughter the city!”","In the safe zone, quite a few players who had just respawn were killed, and the items that they dropped were taken by others in a hurry.","Fortunately, other forces also saw this situation, and they began launching all kinds of spells into the safe zone, trying to drive out the monsters from there. While many flames and lightning bolts crashed onto the monsters, many people died and respawned before charging up again. This scene was as magnificent as the war between human and Orcs at the end of the world.","Many people used the screenshot function on QQ to save the pictures and posted them in chat groups, thus saving this historical moment.","Perhaps they would remember their unforgettable youthful days when they happened to see these pictures many years later.","The endless herds of monsters, all the golden treasures on the ground, and hoarse shouts filling the internet café constituted this grand moment!","Two players who were about level 10 were sitting in a corner in the crowd. The Daoist was named Gongshu while the wizard was called Gongyi, and they were laughing, “Brother Gongyi, I picked up a Holy Armor Spell Skill Book! Hahahaha!”","This was the first good item that Gongsun Chui had picked up in his pathetic gaming life in the Legend of Mir 2 after he was forced to erase his original character and change his name.","[TL Note: When their names are spelled out, it doesn’t seem like they changed names. But their names are different when written out in Chinese; they just sound the same.]","“I’ve gotten an ultimate Ocean Soul with [Magic: 1-4]!” Gongyi Xiu felt like he hadn’t been this excited even when he became the master of the Gongyi Family. After all, it was the first time that he saw such an ultimate item after he was forced to change accounts and names!","Since they had low-level items on them, they were not afraid of being killed and dropping them. After storing the good items, they rushed toward the monsters again, picking up all the things that they could get their hands on and putting them into their backpacks.","“I got a gold bar!” In a time when items, skill books, and gold coins were all in shortage, some good items finally fell into the hands of some low-level players.","However, others were not so lucky since they were killed, and their good items were dropped. In fact, perhaps the items that the players dropped were more valuable than the items that the monsters drop.","The siege of the cities went on. While the players worked together and killed the monsters from the Stone Tomb and Zuma Temple that had broken into Earth City, they received the news from the guards of the other cities, and they learned that the Wilma Clan Master had broken into Biqi Royal City with its troops!","Even the Biqi Royal Palace had been occupied by the Evil Centipede from the deep abyss!","“Help Biqi! Help Biqi!” The commanders of the main forces roared hoarsely in their channels on QQ.","Since Mengchong Province was an advanced map, and most of the advanced players gathered there, the military force of the players in Biqi Province was much weaker in comparison. Besides, the Orc Troop had obviously bypassed the main force of the players in the safe zone and raided the Royal City!","After entering the Royal Palace, the players soon saw large groups of monsters, and a huge hill-like centipede was coiling deep inside the palace!","Evil Centipede! This horrifying monster from the deep abyss was immune to magic attacks and could turn any players near it into stone statues. Instantly, some players were turned into stones; they didn’t even have the chance to escape using teleportation scrolls!","However, the players were ferocious since no one wanted to see Biqi Royal Palace taken by monsters. After some players were turned into stone status, more players swarmed up!","The main force of the players gathered at Biqi Royal Palace! Different from before where they were divided and in three different places, there were about 4,000 of them here together!","Even though Biqi Royal Palace was grand, the square was crowded with players while many dashes of magic light whistled across the sky. It was a magnificent scene that almost no one had witnessed before!","“Wilma Clan Master! Wilma Clan Master!” The players roared. The Wilma Clan Master was now surrounded by about 1,000 players, who were so packed together that they looked like ants!","Even the Evil Centipede was no match for this huge army of players since anyone who slashed it with a weapon would reduce its HP.","“Go get the Evil Centipede!” Fang Qi was also excited, and he squeezed into the crowd while rolling up his sleeves.","“It died! It dropped items!” The players yelled in the internet café and in the game while they swarmed up with red, crazy eyes.","The players in the game were in chaos while the internet café was filled with boisterous yells. A lot of people even roared, “New items!”","“Bone Jade Staff!” Suddenly, someone gasped in astonishment. “[Magic 2-6!]”","It was more powerful than the best magic staff they had seen!","Instantly, all the people swarmed up to watch!","Bone Jade Staff was a legendary godly weapon, and no one had ever seen it before!","More importantly, the players in Half City were all cultivators, and almost all of them chose the professions of wizards and taoists! They could all use this item!","“Do you want to sell it?” In the blink of an eye, this lucky player was surrounded by about 100 people!","“I offer 10,000 crystals!”","– Meanwhile in Jiuhua City –","“Judgement Staff!” The whole internet café was in an uproar! Instantly, the Royal Clan and Jiuhua Army all swarmed up!","“Ahh!” At this moment, Ruan Ning shrieked.","“What are you screaming about?” Startled, Mr. Fang almost fell to the ground.","“Enchanting Light! I don’t even know when I picked it up!”","“F*ck!”","“The godly skill book for wizards!”","“Want to sell it?!” The atmosphere in the internet café reached a new height!"]},{"number":305,"title":"Chapter 305 - This Might Be the Weirdest Auction","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After picking up the loot, the players quickly flew into the safe zone, afraid that they would be killed, and their treasures would be dropped. The players who exclaimed that they got the three godly weapons didn’t dare to show them off until they reached the safe zone.","“Hahahaha! The monster troops are lame! Come on! People of the Yuanheng Guild, take a screenshot!”","Many cultivators of the Yuanheng Pavilion stood in the Royal Palace before clicking open QQ and screenshotting everything around them.","Behind them was the huge corpse of the Evil Centipede!","Several hours had passed since the monsters began charging at the cities. By now, edicts of the Biqi Royal Palace had been issued, and the monster troops had been stopped.","The players either took group pictures in the Royal Palace or flew back to their main cities to organize their loot.","Excitement, elation, and thrills filled the minds of players in the internet café, and they almost looked crazy!","Beside them, Mo Xian looked surprised. “What was that item? Someone yelled to offer 10,000 crystals to buy it?”","She saw that players fought for the treasures, but she wondered why people would offer such a big fortune to buy the treasures that couldn’t be taken out of the game. After all, the treasures didn’t sound like they were super powerful spiritual spells.","Before she could finish asking questions, she heard someone yell not far from her, “I offer 15,000 for the Bone Jade Staff!”","The disciples of the Nanhua Faction, who had just begun their experience in the internet café, were dazed. “15,000 crystals?!”","In the safe zone of Biqi City, the wizard who had gotten the Bone Jade Staff equipped it and instantly attracted a big crowd from both shops.","The player in the Jiuhua City Shop who had gotten the Judgement Staff also raised it. This staff had a huge black iron body that looked like a bamboo stick. It looked like a Chinese sword breaker, but it was several times thicker; it appeared to be powerful and aggressive.","The entire Biqi City was crowded with people who came to see the three godly weapons.","“Hahahaha!” Mr. Fang suddenly burst into laughter.","In his backpack lay a silver ring that was inlaid with precious blue pearls.","[Numb Ring – damage: 0-1]","“It has only a damage boost of 0-1. Why are you so smug about it?” Ruan Ning was at a loss for words.","“Damage of 0-1. What is the use is that thing?” Xi Yue said contemptuously, “I got a Strength Ring. Do you want it?”","“No! I don’t want it!” Mr. Fang had a Strength Ring and a Dragon Ring. He replaced the low-level Dragon Ring with the Numb Ring.","Then, he hacked someone randomly outside the safe zone.","New Snow (Nalan Mingxue) asked, “Why did you hack me?!”","Mr. Fang was surprised that he had hacked someone he knew, but he smirked. “It was just a greeting.”","Then, he hacked at Nalan Mingxue again.","Nalan Mingxue was about to hack him back when she sensed that her body turned stiff!","“What’s happening?!”","“The Evil Centipede?!”","“What’s this thing?” Nalan Mingxue froze. If Mr. Fang struck her twice more, she wouldn’t be able to run!","The girls beside them saw the effect and almost jumped up: it was the Evil Centipede’s ability to turn people into stone!","“The Numb Ring has the ability to turn people into stone, just like the Evil Centipede! The shop owner got a godly weapon!” There were a few players asking Ruan Ning if she would sell the Enchanting Light Skill Book and how much it was, and their eyes widened at this scene.","...","“I also want to see the three godly weapons.” Standing by the edge of the crowd, Jiang Xiaoyue was frustrated that she couldn’t squeeze in.","At this moment, the crowd grew so big that some of them stood outside of the safe zone.","“How come there’s a monster here?” Jiang Xiaoyue heard someone nearby gasp, and a wizard who was lower than level 30 shot out a Lightning Spell.","A rare beast that had two horns and looked like a Fire Kirin engulfed in flames became furious when it was hit by the Lightning Spell, and it stood up on its hind legs and turned into a huge hill-like demon beast!","It spat out thick fire beams and knocked down several players who were about level 20!","“Its damage is so high!” A warrior who was higher than level 30 lost a lot of HP when he was hit by several fire beams.","“Where are the Black Demon Guards? There’s another Clan Master?!”","“Come to the lower left of the safe zone! Come and attack it!”","“Its damage is so high!” Some Black Demon Guards yelled in their channel in QQ, “This Clan Master will for sure drop good stuff!”","“It is dying! It is dying!” With a cracking sound, the godly beast was killed.","“Why did you kill my godly beast?!” Confused, Jiang Xiaoyue raised her small hand and summoned another one.","“Another one?!” People exclaimed. In the chaotic Biqi City, no one heard Jiang Xiaoyue’s words, and they attacked it again and again.","After the second godly beast was killed, Jiang Xiaoyue continued to summon.","Sometime later, several Taoists yelled, “Stop! This isn’t a Clan Master! It’s a godly beast summoned by a Taoist! Summon Godly Beast is a level 35 technique of Taoists!”","“Summon Godly Beast?!” None of them had seen such a technique yet, and they were all dazed.","“It is just as powerful as a Clan Master!”","“So powerful!”","Soon, people swarmed up to see Jiang Xiaoyue.","For the first time, the horrifying power of godly beasts was presented before the players. Meanwhile, someone yelled in the crowd, “Summon Godly Beast Skill Book! I have a Summon Godly Beast Skill Book!”","Instantly, bedlam broke out among the Taoists!","...","Today was definitely the liveliest day since Fang Qi opened the internet cafes; it was even more crowded than the chaotic war between the two regions!","Many treasures were sold on the spot, but the prices of some treasures obviously weren’t suitable to be determined right now.","For example, two out of the three godly weapons on the server: the Bone Jade Staff and the Judgement Staff.","The second Enchanting Light and Summon Godly Beast Skill Books on the server.","Some super rare skills including the Half Moon Saber, Ice Roar, and Flame Sword Techniques.","Some skills that were hard to determine the values of right now, such as Devil Trapping Curse, Holy Words Spell, and Teleportation.","The big forces gathered around the Bone Jade Staff, obviously not able to reach an agreement on the price.","Many people were asking about the price for Enchanting Light, and most of them offered more than 10,000 crystals. However, the final price hadn’t been determined.","“Are you planning to sell it?” Fang Qi looked at Ruan Ning and asked since she had a hesitant expression.","“Eh...” Ruan Ning indeed wanted to sell it. She could only use it in the game. In the real world, with her Spiritual River Realm, she could only enchant demon beasts of the Spiritual River Realm, and the value was much less than when it was used by a cultivator of the Divine Ocean Realm.","“How about auctioning it in the inner city,” Xi Yue suggested.","Besides the cultivators who wanted to buy the Enchanting Light Skill Book, there were other cultivators who were stuck in negotiations for the other treasures.","When they heard this suggestion, they brightened up. “Let’s go and do the deal in the auction house in the inner city as well!”","“This Daoist Brother,” Black Demon reminded him, “How about auctioning the Bone Jade Staff in the inner city? The highest bidder will get it!”","“Good idea!” Xi Chenzhou agreed. “It will give me time to prepare crystals.”","“Guys, the next auction in the inner city is imminent. Let’s go and visit the auction house, okay?” the leaders of the major forces suggested.","“Ugh...” Mr. Fang’s face turned dark. “The inner city earns easy money... With so many of us entering the inner city, they will earn hundreds of thousands of crystals, eh?”","After all, one must pay the fee of 1,000 crystal for each entrance!","“Hahaha!” Xi Chenzhou laughed and said, “Mr. Fang, you are new here so that you might not know. Some of the forces in the outer city enjoy the privilege of entering the inner city for free. Otherwise, no one would want to go there.”","“Do I have the privilege?” Fang Qi asked.","“Yes...” Xi Chenzhou said awkwardly, “Qin Honglin of the 36th Block used to have this privilege. Now that the leader of the 36th Block is Mr. Fang, you certainly enjoy this privilege.”","“Excellent!” The red-clothed cultivator who had the Bone Jade Staff said, “I’ll auction the Bone Jade Staff at the auction house in the inner city! The people who want it can bid for it and the highest bidder will get it!”","In the next moment, hundreds of players swarmed toward the inner city!","Before today, no one had ever imagined that these virtual treasures could one day be auctioned together with the treasures in the real world!"]},{"number":306,"title":"Chapter 306 - Items That Can’t be Understood","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– In the Taixi Faction –","The white-robed old man was still fishing leisurely by the Xishui [Meaning – Xi Water] Lake.","Today, a burly black-robed old man sat beside him.","“It’s been years, and Duyou [Meaning – Lonely] Holiness still lives an idle life,” the black-robed old man stroked his long beard and said with a chuckle.","The white-robed old man said with a faint smile, “Cultivation has many forms. Meditation while sitting cross-legged is cultivation, and what I do is another form of cultivation, right? I’ve never been idle...”","The black-robed old man laughed and changed the subject. “I heard that there is a minor situation with the Yundian Upper Realm?”","The white-robed old man said mildly, “It’s no big deal. The situation will end soon.”","The sunlight reflected off the lake surface, shining onto his serene and peaceful face. Suddenly, a series of urgent footsteps sounded from behind him.","“Master, we got news from the Yundian Upper Realm,” the disciple reported.","“What is it?” The old man said with a faint smile, “Did they hurt each other as I predicted?”","“Hurt each other?” The black-robed old man said, “Duyou Holiness, don’t you want to give them a helping hand?”","“My Taixi Faction usually doesn’t interfere with worldly business,” the white-robed old man said thoughtfully, “But it’s time for us to make a move. When the Yundian Upper Realm comes to ask for our help, I’ll loan one treasure to them...”","“They didn’t hurt each other,” that disciple said in embarrassment.","“They didn’t hurt each other?” the old man said in surprise, “Is that force this weak?”","“No...” the disciple said, “They... they haven’t done anything to each other yet!”","The black-robed old man: “...”","Duyou Holiness: “...”","“Oh?” According to his judgement, after Dajin gave the Yundian Upper Realm such a heavy blow with the support of Fang Qi’s shop, the two parties would engage in a war. He wondered why nothing had happened.","“Is the information reliable?” Duyou Holiness’s face turned stiff.","“I...” The disciple said haltingly, “I found the situation weird but thought that the Yundian Upper Realm needed time to prepare. I asked the spies to observe them for a few more days, but they still did nothing!","“Strange.” Duyou Holiness subconsciously put aside the fishing rod and began stroking his beard in bafflement.","Taking the most conservative view, even if the Yundian Upper Realm thought that it couldn’t defeat its opponent, it would have come to the Three Saint Gates to get help...","It was strange that they neither fought nor came here to get help.","“I... em... also heard some rumors...” that disciple said.","“What rumors?!”","“It’s said that that shop has a poison technique called Internet Addiction,” the disciple reported, “Our spies heard of it from a casual conversation.”","“Once a cultivator touches it, they will get addicted and can only...”","“Only what!”","“Can only be cured by being struck by lightning!” the disciple said, “The reason that Junior Brother Feng Xi didn’t contract this poison was that he was struck by lightning... It proves what the rumors said.”","At a loss for words, Duyou Holiness’s old eyes looked confused.","...","Half City was like a poisonous tumor to the cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm as a whole.","However, they had to rely on this place sometimes to get the special items that they couldn’t get from other places.","“Ms. Xi, you’re here again?” In the auction house, a middle-aged man who was wearing a pale golden robe was fiddling with plants. He said impatiently, “I’ve told you that there’s no more space available for the low-level to middle-level items in the auction...”","Besides, who knows how much the so-called Magic Shield Spell Skill Book and Limitless Stick can sell for?","“Even if your father was here, the answer would be the same!”","“Executive Jin!” Xi Chenzhou walked in at this moment, and he said while his face twitched a little, “This seems off.”","He was displeased that Executive Jin, who had been accepting bribes from others, showed no respect to him today.","“What seems off? How can you say that?” Jin Wu had been bribed by the Feng Family of the Morning Star Sea Realm to sell some items that they obtained illegally, and he couldn’t return those items now that he already accepted the money. Also, he didn’t fear Xi Chenzhou.","“I think something is off as well!” Black Demon walked up.","“Sorry, Executive Jin, but I also think that something is off.” Tang Yuan walked up.","“Executive Jin, aren’t you going to show any respect to my White Dragon Office?” A white-robed cultivator walked up.","“Executive Jin!” Mo Tianxing also walked up. “I’m not a stranger in the inner city. Do you want me to make a big fuss over the whole thing?”","“Executive Jin!” A Divine Ocean Realm cultivator with great presence and a rare beast symbol embroidered on his chest also walked up.","“Executive Jin!” A chilly-eyed cultivator who was wearing a blood-red robe stood out.","“Executive Jin...”","A little more than ten big forces from the outer city and several forces from the inner city, including the White Dragon Office, all walked up.","“Perhaps you should think twice before you answer us.”","“Hahahaha!” Ruan Ning laughed so hard that her body shook. “Sister Xi Yue, look at that guy’s face!”","Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at her. “Look at your smug face...”","“Humph!” Ruan Ning pouted and showed him her smug face even more.","Jin Wu’s expression was fantastic. “What are you all doing here? Do you want to make trouble in the inner city?”","“Hurry up and register the items for us!” With so many people together, even the cultivators who usually didn’t dare to make rash moves in the inner city were emboldened.","“I want to buy a Summon Godly Beast Skill Book! Do you know how expensive it is?!”","“I want to sell the Bone Jade Staff, which is an one of a kind item on the whole server. Can you bear the consequences if something happens to it?”","“Do you know how much my Ice Roar Skill Book costs?! How dare you put it in the small auction house?!”","Jin Wu was at a loss for words.","What on earth are these damn things?!","“Executive Jin, what should we do now?” A black-clothed cultivator beside him asked.","Experienced in many situations, Jin Wu soon calmed down. “You must show me your stuff so that I can estimate their value, right?”","“Show you? Easy!” Black Demon waved his hand, and a layer of golden spiritual light emitted from his body and turned into a translucent golden spiritual light sphere. It looked much more solid than the spiritual light sphere created by spiritual artifacts.","“It’s a magic shield. Have you ever seen it before? Someone blocked attacks from Divine Ocean Realm cultivators with it already. Do you want to try, Executive Jin?”","“It can block the attack of a Divine Ocean Realm cultivator?”","When Xi Yue used it, this shield could only protect her from being killed by an attack from a True Lake Realm cultivator. However, in the hands of grand cultivators such as Black Demon, the shield had much greater power.","“How about the others?” Jin Wu finally began to put priorities on these items.","“Come with us, and you’ll see their value!” Tang Yuan of the Yuanheng Pavilion said.","“Right! You’ll understand after watching us play the Legend of Mir 2 for a few minutes!”","“Executive... What should we do with the Feng Family?” that black-clothed cultivator whispered to Jin Wu.","“Do you want me to offend so many forces in Half City?!” Executive Jin replied to this cultivator with a dark expression before saying to everyone else, “I’ll go and see if your items are truly as valuable as you claim!”"]},{"number":307,"title":"Chapter 307 - It doesn’t sound right!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Executive Jin, kill this chicken first!”","“You leveled up! You leveled up!”","In the Half City Shop, a large group of players stood behind a golden-robed, middle-aged man and watched him play.","“There are such things in the world!?” As a small executive in the auction house of the inner city, Jin Wu didn’t have a high opinion of the shops in the outer city.","But now, he was filled with shock and bafflement, and many thoughts flashed through his mind.","This shop had been hiding under my nose?!","After he looked down at his crude cotton clothes, he glanced at the grand-looking items of the other players in the game and saw the big difference.","“Where did you get the items that you’re wearing?!” Jin Wu was envious.","Good items gave the players the abilities to kill monsters and level up faster. With good items, players could go to more dangerous places to kill more powerful monsters and get better treasures.","“Hahaha!” Wearing a Devil Robe and holding an ultimate magic stuff in his hand, Black Demon had a great sense of achievement. “These things cost me great efforts!”","“Come on! I’ll show you the power of the Magic Shield Spell!”","“...”","Sometime later, Jin Wu finally understood that the Taoist’s ‘dogs’ were like bosses, a wizard with a shield was tougher than a warrior, and Enchanting Light was a powerful spiritual spell that could enchant seven demon beasts that were on the same realm as the summoner.","[TL Note: These Chinese players call the creatures that Taoists summon ‘dogs’.]","By now, Jin Wu’s attitude completely changed. “Guys! Don’t worry! I will not underestimate these treasures! I ensure you that they will sell for great prices!”","After all, these items could attract more than the players from this shop!","Although the Summon Godly Beast Spell might be useless to grand cultivators, it could be gifted to the geniuses in the young generation. Since a Taoist with godly beasts was unrivaled, with such a Taoist on a spiritual boat, it means that there was a mobile cannon turret!","As for the Magic Shield, although it could only block one powerful attack, it was a life-saving trump card.","The other skills had their own advantages.","Jin Wu was excited and couldn’t wait for the auction to begin!","...","“Senior Sister, did you hear that two disciples went missing last night... We haven’t found them yet!” Liu Ningyun was cultivating in the faction powerlessly, and the only entertainment that she got was listening to the gossip in the faction to kill time.","“Maybe the two disciples just went down the mountain for fun,” Liu Ningyun said with a sweet smile, “Junior Sister, don’t be so paranoid. In the past thousands of years, no thief has ever dared to come into our Nanhua Faction to mess with us!”","At this moment, Liu Ningyun suddenly heard voices from outside. “Master, I told you that Junior Sister Liu isn’t a lazy disciple! Look how hard she is cultivating these days!”","“Junior Sister Liu will for sure correct her mistake. Among us, she is the most obedient and diligent one!”","“Junior Sister Liu...”","Several female disciples chirped like birds around the Xichi Spiritual Master, and the latter was a little fed up with the high praises. “Okay! That’s enough!”","Although baffled, the Xichi Spiritual Master was still pleased that her disciples had finally forsaken their old grudges, and she wondered what caused the transformation and who she should thank.","Therefore, she even showed a rare smile today.","Today, she came here with another purpose. A powerful spiritual treasure appeared in Half City, and it looked like the one lost by an ancestral master of the Nanhua Faction. The Nanhua Faction planned to take it back.","Since the Nanhua Faction didn’t have the intention of starting a war with Half City, the only option was to attend the grand auction in Half City.","Besides the Nanhua Faction, the Haoran Faction, Yimu Daoist Palaces, and some other big factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm had also come to Half City with different purposes.","Big families such as the Feng Family also came to Half City.","However, Half City was so big that it didn’t show any congestion due to the arrival of so many outsiders; their presence only added some colors to small parts of the city.","...","The auction house in Half City was named Heaven-Hiding Pavilion, and it was the core of the whole city. There were rumors outside that said one could buy anything in the world in Half City; the rumors were talking about Heaven-Hiding Pavilion.","Despite its reputation, it was the first time that virtual items were auctioned in this place!","“What are these things?” Before the auction began, a woman with snow-white skin, brown hair, and green eyes puzzled over the list of auctioned items in her hand. “Summon Jin Wu for me!”","...","Right now, Ruan Ning was in a formal red silk dress and looked more sedate than usual.","Looking at Fang Qi who glanced around the place and mocked everything he saw, she teased him, “Guild President, is this the first time that you attended an auction?”","Xi Yue and the other girls giggled with their hands covering their mouths.","Mo Tianxing strode before them and said with a light cough, “I’ll go and find the seats for our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.”","Why are you speaking the truth? Although I have lived in this world for several years, I was broke before. Where can I find the money to participate in auctions?","With a snort, Mr. Fang instantly looked calmer. “Do I look like someone who knows nothing about grand occasions in the world? It’s just that auctions in the place that I come from are different from yours.”","“Guild President Fang, what do your auctions look like?” Xi Chenzhou asked.","The internet café’s players almost all came to the auction in groups, and the major forces walked in together with Mr. Fang.","“Our auctions?” Mr. Fang smiled with a mysterious expression. “I’ll tell you a small story about our auctions.”","“You have stories about auctions?” Ruan Ning asked in doubt.","Fang Qi began telling the story, “They were auctioning an immortal egg that a Daoist found in an immortal palace in some ancient ruins. The egg was named Tea Egg.”","[TL Note: Tea egg is a typical Chinese savory food commonly sold as a snack, in which a boiled egg is cracked slightly and then boiled again in tea and sauce or spices.]","“Ancient Immortal Palace?!” the girls exclaimed after hearing that.","“Tea egg?!” Xi Chenzhou frowned. “What kind of an immortal egg is that?”","Mr. Fang chuckled, “I guess you don’t know the miraculous effects of tea eggs. If you are dying after being severely wounded by an enemy, eating one tea egg will immediately heal your injuries and restore your vitality. It’s a magic item that can’t be measured by crystals.”","“So powerful?” Ruan Ning exclaimed.","“Auction begins!” Fang Qi told the story vividly as if he had been there. “That old man yelled, ‘the reserve price is 10,000 ultimate crystals!’”","“At this moment, a voice came from the second floor, saying, ‘I offer one bag of spicy sticks!’” Fang Qi said, “What are spicy sticks? They are ultimate godly items that were created in the chaos before the world was born. Even my shop can only copy their flavor but can’t re-create their essence!”","“Really?” Doubts appeared in Xi Yue’s beautiful eyes.","“Of course! Why do you think the spicy sticks in my shop are so delicious?!” Mr. Fang said confidently, “All the people looked toward the voice and saw a guy in his early twenties. They were even more shocked when they saw the logo on his Daoist robe; it was the logo of the mysterious and powerful Lanxiang Academy! And he came from the most horrifying Excavator Department...”","[TL Note: The Shandong Lanxiang Vocational School was founded in 1984, and it admits about 20,000 students per year and offers courses in subjects like cooking, auto repair, construction equipment operations (specialized in excavator), hairdressing, as well as computer skills. This school is a meme in China since they aired a lot of student recruitment commercials advertising their excavator department.]","“Do you know what kind of a school Lanxiang Academy is?”","They all shook their heads.","“It was heard that a big faction offended a student from the Excavator Department of Lanxiang Academy, and that student drove an excavator to this faction’s headquarters. This faction’s grand protective array was as fragile as a piece of tofu in front of this spiritual artifact, and all the members in the faction were killed! You can just imagine how frighteningly powerful the Lanxiang Excavator was! ”","“Huh?” They heard Mr. Fang’s vivid story and felt like they were there, but they felt like something wasn’t right.","What on earth is an excavator? How come it is so powerful?!"]},{"number":308,"title":"Chapter 308 - Sell the Magic Shield Skill Book First","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","If the potential buyers of the skill books were not limited to the players in Fang Qi’s shop, then the items were put on auction just for fun.","Of course, there might be another reason. The special and heated atmosphere of the auction house and the urging of the auctioneers might get the same group of buyers to offer higher prices than otherwise.","Fang Qi had come to the auction to experience the event and to see if there were things he needed such as Bone of a Master, Deep Ocean Black Iron, and Spiritual Marrow. He had gotten the Dragon Bone from Huangpu Tao, but the others...","If he were lucky enough to run into these things, he would certainly buy them. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to hold the event, Battle of Sand City, even after the players had reached level 40 or 50. He wouldn’t be a qualified shop owner if that happened.","After all, this was his job.","After walking through the antique-looking wooden corridor into the interior, he found that the auction hall wasn’t big but was exquisitely decorated.","The guests were either masters of big forces or powerful cultivators with great backgrounds. Under the pale golden light, exquisite spiritual fruits and snacks were placed on the tables.","Fang Qi even saw some familiar faces in the auction hall, such as Liu Ningyun who had been absent from the internet café recently.","“Ugh? Senior Brother Duan!” In a nearby seat, a chubby cultivator yelled, “Look! Isn’t he the guy who asked us for directions while standing on a sword?”","“It is him?!” Duan Lan coldly glanced at Fang Qi, who was exchanging greetings with acquaintances and recognized that Mr. Fang was the person who had stolen his thunder last time!","Before he could say anything, he heard chatters beside him.","“Wow! Junior Sisters! Look! Isn’t he the guy who flew past us on a sword?”","“So powerful! I wonder what faction that technique belongs to!”","“One man one sword, flying across the sky! It was so dashing!”","“Senior Sister Ye! Come and look! Over there!”","With veins bulging on his forehead, Duan Lan slammed his liquor cup on the table as his lips twitched. “I couldn’t find him when I tried, but I now ran into him when I wasn’t looking!”","“Stop yelling! Where are your manners?!” A grey-robed, middle-aged cultivator gave them a hard look.","“Ugh... we are sorry.” The girls immediately shut up.","Then, the grey-clothed cultivator stroked his beard and said, “I heard that a cultivator who flew on a sword once turned Black Dragon City upside-down and defeated the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy with a sword technique named the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell. Its power is as great as our Haoran Faction’s Heaven-Conforming Grand Sword. I wonder if the rumor is true.”","“Father, the Nanhua Faction’s Nanhua Heavenly Light is an ultimate technique in the world, and its power is almost the same as that of our Heaven-Conforming Grand Sword,” a boy who was about 12-years-old reminded him, “If the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell could defeat Senior Sister Liu, then it must be more powerful than our Heaven-Conforming Grand Sword; how can it be on par with...”","The grey-clothed cultivator’s face twitched, and he was at a loss for words.","Around him, the disciples exclaimed, “So young and so powerful...”","“He’s awesome!”","“I wonder which faction he comes from...”","“...”","Sitting at the table next to Haoran Faction was a cold-eyed young Daoist who was wearing a black-and-white Daoist robe.","“Elder Senior Brother, is that guy the mysterious cultivator who defeated Fairy Liu? He looks ordinary...”","“It’s said that he even named Fairy Liu as the No.1 Cultivator of the younger generation. He’s so arrogant!”","“...”","...","“Achoo!” Mr. Fang who had been chatting with Huangpu Tao sneezed. “How come I feel like everyone’s watching me?”","“Today, people are here to attend the auction; who would check you out, Guild President?” Ruan Ning and the other girls obviously didn’t know about Mr. Fang’s reputation in the Morning Star Sea Realm outside Half City, and they looked at him in disdain.","Ruan Ning whispered, “Even if people are watching you, they must have come here to get revenge.”","“I heard that Guild President even bullied Sister Liu...” Su Zhi gossiped in a low voice.","“He’s so much older than her! How could he bully someone that much younger than himself!”","“Damn it...” Mr. Fang had the urge to commit some violent act. “Can’t you keep your voices low?! By the way, do I look that old?”","We are all young people!","“The auction begins now!” Beside them, Mo Tianxing was feeling sympathetic toward Fang Qi. “I think Guild President is less than 200 years old; he’s not too old...”","“Forget it...” Mr. Fang was a bit desperate while he thought, I’m young! Why can’t you believe me?","“Let’s watch the auction! Watch the auction!” Mr. Fang didn’t want to explain anymore.","Under the illumination of the lights, they saw that the auctioneer was a woman who was wearing a silverfish-white long dress.","“A foreigner?” Fang Qi was surprised, but he saw that her oval face and arched eyebrows were oriental. However, her slightly curly brown hair and green, ocean-like eyes gave her an exotic aura.","With her snow-white skin, she looked elegant, charming, and mature, as if she had all the best feminine features. Her silverfish-white tight-fitting long dress accentuated her curvy figure that was perfect from all angles, heating the blood of young men like Mr. Fang.","She opened her small mouth and revealed two pointy canine teeth, which looked charming and cute. “Everyone, welcome to the auction in our Heaven-Hiding Pavilion.”","“You’re still staring at her!” A pair of hands waved before Mr. Fang’s eyes, blocking his sight. “Your eyeballs are going to pop out.”","“I was thinking about her race!” Fang Qi rolled his eyes at Ruan Ning. “I heard that devils and demons could walk in Half City during day time. She is too perfect; is she a devil?”","The room suddenly fell silent in a weird way, and the quietness was strange.","Even the grey-clothed cultivator of the Haoran Faction and the Xichi Spiritual Master of the Nanhua Faction had traces of dislike and indignation on their faces.","“Now, I’m going to introduce the first item.” A silver-robed old man presented that beautiful woman a transparent bead. It seemed like this bead contained many twisted human faces. “Corpse Soul Bead...”","Fang Qi didn’t even spare a glance at such a thing, and the disciples of the big factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm showed nothing but dislike and disapproval in their eyes. Only the cultivators of unorthodox factions with gloomy auras would bid for such an item. The process continued until the fifth item.","“The following treasure that we are going to auction is a bit special.” The woman waved her hand, and an image of a book with a yellow cover appeared before the audience.","“Magic Shield is a very powerful defensive spiritual spell. It’s said that True Lake Realm cultivators can block the full-force attacks of Divine Ocean Realm cultivators. After our Executive Jin Wu’s personal testing, this spell’s power is true. The starting price for it is 5,000 crystals.”","“What?!”","“There’s such a defensive spiritual spell in the world?!”","“How long is the casting time?”","“How effective is it for Divine Ocean Realm cultivators?”","“How long does it take to master this spell?!”","Not only the unorthodox cultivators who had bid for the items such as Corpse Soul Bead, but many cultivators of the big forces turned their attention to the skill book as well.","The Xichi Spiritual Master said in surprise, “There’s such a spiritual spell in the world? The Heaven-Hiding Pavilion is full of wonders... If the price is good, I think our Nanhua Faction can buy it.”","Mo Xian, who had been sipping tea, almost spat it out on someone’s face. “Magic Shield?!”","Wasn’t it one of the items the monsters dropped while they attacked the cities?! Why didn’t I play the game?! The girl sitting next to me had picked up such a book!","Even Liu Ningyun, who was sitting next to Mo Xian, looked astonished. Last time I saw it, it was only going for 2,000. But now, the starting price is as high as 5,000?!"]},{"number":309,"title":"Chapter 309 - Why can’t I use it?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Different from other cultivators who attended the auction, Mr. Fang didn’t care about how to practice the Magic Shield Spell and how much it could sell for.","Instead, he picked up a spiritual fruit and stuffed it into his mouth before asking in a muffled voice while chewing, “This girl looks grand. The moment that she showed up, the room quieted down.”","“Girl?”","“Grand?”","The moment he said it, Ruan Ning and the other girls around him looked toward him with weird expressions.","“What?” Fang Qi stared back at them.","“Sir...”","“Guild President...”","“I guess you didn’t try to learn anything about the inner city; you don’t even know the basic stuff.” Ruan Ning and the others looked at him as if he was an alien.","From their viewpoint, anyone who went to a new place must get to know the forces in the area and the people that they couldn’t mess with. However, Mr. Fang knew nothing about the city after being here for a while now.","“What basic knowledge?” Mr. Fang shrugged.","Ruan Ning became furious with him instantly. “Now, I’ll fill you in with the basic knowledge. In the inner city of Half City, you might be okay if you offend some people, but you can never mess with five people. Four of them are the true rulers of Half City, and they are respected; they are known as the Four Kings. The fifth one is the woman standing in front of us. Even the high-level cultivators of the big factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm only dare to cuss her and call her ‘Demonic Girl’ in private; they don’t dare to show any disrespect in front of her!”","“So...” Fang Qi asked earnestly, “She is truly a monster, right?”","“That Little Brother over there; it’s not polite to ask this question.” Suddenly, a charming glance turned toward him.","Fang Qi thought to himself, Such good hearing?","The woman was so charming that she could dazzle people with her smiles and frowns.","However, it seemed like she didn’t pursue the topic. Instead, she continued to introduce, “It takes about half a month to two months to master this technique.”","“So fast?!”","“So, it means that one can obtain an extra life-saving technique in a short time!”","All the cultivators in the room looked surprised. After all, it usually took months to years to master a powerful spiritual spell.","This Magic Shield Spell is not only powerful but also easy to master?!","The Xichi Spiritual Master asked, “Then, how long is the casting time? Does it need incantations?”","“The casting time is very short,” the woman answered. “It doesn’t need incantations, but the only drawback is that it has a special cultivation method.”","While she said that, she glanced back at Mr. Fang meaningfully. “You need to cultivate it in a specific place in Half City.”","“The starting price is so high?!” With a dark expression, Black Demon hesitated and didn’t know if he should bid for it.","“5,500!” At this moment, someone bid for it.","It was a male cultivator who was hiding in a black cloak.","“6,200!”","“7,000!” That grey-clothed cultivator of the Haoran Faction joined in.","Seeing the fast-climbing prices, the internet café players who had either come here to watch or to bid for items were all dumbfounded since they found that the people who were doing most of the bidding weren’t them!","After all, in their minds. a Magic Shield Spell Skill Book was only about 5,000. If they were lucky, they might get one in the game one day.","However, for other cultivators, this simple and powerful spiritual spell deserved a high price tag, and they were willing to spend time to master it.","The price of the first Magic Shield Spell Skill Book grew sharply.","“10,000!” the Xichi Spiritual Master snorted. Obviously, she was determined to get it.","“11,000!” The cultivators sitting at a table near Fang Qi all had gloomy auras, and the person who spoke was the oldest one among them.","“Feng Family!” Sitting next to Fang Qi, Mo Tianxing said with a cold expression.","“12,000!” Xichi Spiritual Master continued bidding; she didn’t frown and wasn’t a bit bothered by the high price.","“Since the Xichi Spiritual Master is determined to get this Magic Shield Spell, I give up on bidding!” the gloomy cultivator of the Feng Family said in a deep voice.","Soon, the Xichi Spiritual Master bought the first Magic Shield Spell Skill Book.","Sitting beside her, her disciples such as Mo Xian and Liu Ningyun were at a loss for words.","Should I take Master to level up? Liu Ningyun was torn inside since her own level wasn’t that high!","Should I play this game too? Mo Xian had tears on her face. But the skill books are so expensive...","Then, the second Magic Shield Spell Skill Book was put on auction, and the bidding war was fiercer than the first one. In the end, a golden-clothed cultivator bought it for 18,000 crystals.","“A cultivator from the inner city!” Xi Yue said in a low voice.","Since the inner city was the administration of the entirety of Half City, this cultivator must have a high status.","“The next item...” The woman smiled, and the image of a long stick appeared before her.","“What’s this treasure?”","“I’ve never seen it before?”","“What’s it for?”","“Limitless Stick!” The Taoist players who were in the auction exclaimed. Right now, the Limitless Stick was the best weapon for Taoists before the Dragon Mark Sword appeared.","“Limitless Stick. Damage: 8-16; Daoist Spell: 3-5.” The woman obviously had learned a lot of gaming knowledge, and her introduction sounded quite professional. “This stick was made with a branch of the World Tree and Five Elemental Godly Water. It is a virtual item in a fantasy world. Due to its special function, the starting price is 3,000 crystals!”","“Special function?”","“Fantasy world?”","“What is it?!”","“3,500!” Iron Rock Daoist, one of the guardians of the Huang Family, began bidding.","“4,000!” Yu Cangshan, the chubby old man who sat with Mo Tianxing, opened his mouth and made an offer.","“5,000!” The middle-aged cultivator of the Feng Family snorted and joined in.","“Do you even know what this thing is for?!” Yu Cangshan was angry. “What can you do with it?!”","“I’m rich, and I just want to buy it for fun!”","“6,000!” This came from Xue Shuilong of White Dragon Office, the Taoist whom Fang Qi had once killed.","“What’s this thing? Why are so many people fight for it?” The grey-clothed cultivator of the Haoran Faction was suspicious. “Fantasy world? Is it a secret realm that we don’t know about?! I offer 7,000!”","“Master...” The cold-eyed young Daoist who was wearing the black-and-white Daoist robe said, “Should we...”","“Let’s observe them first,” the grey-haired cultivator, who was sitting next to him, said. “If necessary, we can bid for it!”","“8,000!” The Xichi Spiritual Master placed the bid already.","“Master...” Liu Ningyun couldn’t help but say, “You have a skill book for wizards now. Why do you want to buy this one?”","“So many people are fighting for it; it must be a rare treasure,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said with a snort, “Yun’er, if the price is good, I will buy it!”","Mo Xian couldn’t bear it anymore. “Master, this is a weapon for a Taoist; you can’t use it...”","“Why can’t I use a weapon for a Taoist?!” the Xichi Spiritual Master said in a cold voice, “I have practiced Daoism for many years and had joined the Nanhua Faction, a Daoist faction! Why can’t I use it!”","Liu Ningyun: “...”","Mo Xian: “...”"]},{"number":310,"title":"Chapter 310 - The Last Item in the Auction","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","When the price increased to 8,000, the bidding slowed down, and even Xue Shuilong, who had kept bidding for it without hesitation, thought for a while before placing a bid of 8,300.","For others, this was a treasure that they didn’t quite understand the function of. It meant that this price was very close to their limits as well.","The cultivator of the Feng Family increased the bid to 8,500 tentatively.","The price increment for the Limitless Stick was no less than 200 crystals. After placing the bid of 8,700, Xue Shuilong said, “Daoist Brother Feng, if you buy the Limitless Stick, you can’t use it right now. If you still want to bid for it, then I’ll give it up.”","“Since Daoist Brother Xue wants this treasure, I won’t take it from you forcefully,” the cultivator of the Feng Family gave him a fake smile and said. “It’s yours, Daoist Brother Xue!”","Finally, Xue Shuilong bought the Limitless Stick for 8,700 crystals.","“Demon-Trapping Curse. It’s very effective against filthy and evil entities. One can draw a circle around an evil entity, and the latter will be confused by the curse and won’t be able to see the outside world.”","Another small yellow book appeared before the woman. “Although it’s not very useful in battle as a spiritual spell, it can help you a lot when you’re surrounded by evil entities!”","“As with the Magic Shield Spell, this curse has a special cultivation method.”","“The starting price is 1,000 crystals.”","Obviously, many people wanted to bid for the unknown treasures. Compared to these novelties, the other treasures were less attractive.","Many people turned their focus to these weird but powerful novel items!","Fortunately, the cultivators wouldn’t be so crazy as to fight for warriors’ skill books. After bidding against the few warriors in the auction hall, Fang Qi bought the Flame Sword Technique Skill Books for 5,000 crystals.","By now, the people in the auction hall had gotten even more enthusiastic and heated.","“The next item is Ice Roar!”","Since the guests in the auction were mostly wizards and taoists, when the name ‘Ice Roar’ came out, the whole auction hall was filled with excited talks, and all the wizards turned their eager eyes toward the book which contained the ultimate technique for this profession!","“This spiritual spell can swiftly condense snow and create an ice storm to attack enemies. It can condense wind and snow in one area and form a tornado of countless icicles. No one can dodge the bone-chilling ice spikes!” The woman’s voice rose while she explained, “This spiritual spell doesn’t need any chants. No other simple spiritual spells can match this one. Its power is estimated to be no less than that of a middle-sized AoE spiritual spell!”","“The starting price is 8,000, and the smallest price increment is 500!”","“10,000!” Before she finished, Black Demon already yelled.","“12,000!” Xichi yelled immediately.","How come Master began bidding again. Sitting next to her, Mo Xian had a bitter expression on her face.","“It’s a level 35 skill. When can she learn it...” Liu Ningyun was considering if she should stop the Xichi Spiritual Master.","“Dad... Should we...” Before that boy who was about 12 to 13 years old of the Haoran Faction could finish his sentence, the grey-clothed cultivator sitting next to him had stood up. “15,000!”","“16,000!” Tang Yuan of the Yuanheng Pavilion yelled immediately!","Obviously, almost no one had ever seen anyone use this ultimate skill of wizards, which meant that anyone who got this Ice Roar Skill Book would be the No. 1 Wizard!","“20,000!” Xi Chenzhou was unwilling to admit defeat.","“25,000!” The wizard who was wearing a moon-white robe said with a wicked expression. “The throne of the No. 1 Wizard belongs to me, Zhuge Bai!”","“No.1 Wizard?”","“What’s that?!”","All the cultivators looked at each other in bafflement.","At the table of the Feng Family, the gloomy-faced middle-aged cultivator asked, “Do you know what they are talking about?”","The others at the table all shook their heads.","“Strange...” The cultivator of the Feng Family had a doubtful look on his face. “However powerful this spiritual spell is, what does it have to do with being No. 1? I wonder what secrets this city has that I don’t know about.”","The exorbitant price of 25,000 crystals went beyond the price limit of some of the cultivators who didn’t know what was happening. In the end, the Ice Roar Skill Book went to Zhuge Bai.","Then, the image on display turned into a slim and long staff in the shape of a beast bone. “As for the next three items on auction, I believe many of you know their values.”","“Bone Jade Staff! Magic: 2-6; Damage: 6-12. It’s a legendary godly weapon from a fantasy world,” the woman said, “This item was made from a bone of a devil dragon and possesses great spiritual energy. Although it’s my first time auctioning such a treasure, I believe many people here know its value! The starting price is 20,000 with increments of 1,000!”","“30,000!” At the first bid, Black Demon added 10,000!","“35,000!” The cultivator of the Feng Family joined in the bidding again.","“40,000!” These precious items from a ‘fantasy world’ had drawn the Xichi Spiritual Master’s attention. Since she would go and see the fantasy world sooner or later, she figured that she might as well get prepared and buy a few more treasures.","Of course, her disciples were now desperate.","Liu Ningyun thought, No... I can’t stop Master at all...","Mo Xian felt desperate. Anyone, please come and outbid Master...","As if heaven heard her prayer, Tang Yuan of the Yuanheng Pavilion yelled, “45,000!”","“50,000!” Haoran Faction couldn’t remain silent anymore.","“60,000!” Zhuge Bai of the White Dragon Office gritted his teeth and added 10,000!","At the level of 60,000 crystals, many bidders began to hesitate.","After all, it was a virtual item, and its use was indirect since it couldn’t be used in the real world. The virtual items could help them kill other players and obtain treasures in the game with great efficiency, but they couldn’t increase people’s strength as directly and quickly as the skill books did.","At this moment, only the Yuanheng Pavilion increased the price by 1,000 crystals.","The golden-robed cultivator who bought a Magic Shield Spell Skill Book increased the price by another 1,000 crystals.","Finally, the Yuanheng Pavilion increased the price by another 1,000, making the offered price as high as 63,000. Then, no one else placed a higher bid. In the end, the first Bone Jade Staff of the server went to Yuanheng Pavilion!","Then, the second Summon Godly Beast Skill Book was bought by Xue Shuilong of the White Dragon Office for 70,000!","Finally, they came to the last virtual item from the Legend of Mir 2 – Enchanting Light.","“The next item probably is the best one in this auction since I’m also tempted by it,” the woman said with a chuckle.","“Next, we’ll ask Ms. Xi Yue of Coil Dragon Office to assist me with a small experiment.” At her order, some cultivators pushed a huge iron cage into the hall. In the cage was a huge one-meter-long eagle whose plumage emitted a metallic luster!","This huge eagle was untamed, and it looked ferocious even in the cage.","On the other side, Xi Yue walked up, and a big black vulture that was as tall as a meter flew up, rubbing its head against her hair endearingly.","“This huge eagle is an Iron Feather Eagle that our Heaven-Hiding Pavilion transported from the Beast Field for this auction. Its strength is equivalent to that of an early stage True Lake Realm cultivator,” the woman introduced, “However, the vulture beside Ms. Xi Yue only has the strength of a middle stage Spiritual River Realm cultivator.”","With a charming smile, she asked, “Can you guess what will happen if the two demon beasts fight each other?”","“What else can happen? How can a Spiritual River Realm demon beast block the attacks from a True Lake Realm demon beast?”","“Do you have a spiritual spell like the Magic Shield Spell that can help the Spiritual River Realm demon beast block the attack of the True Lake Realm demon beast?!”","With a faint smile, the woman opened the door of the iron cage and removed the restraining spell on it.","At this moment, the vulture flew over and landed before the iron cage.","With a hoarse shriek, the huge Iron Feather Eagle viciously charged toward the Spiritual River Realm black vulture!","However, in the next instant, the black vulture’s aura shot up, and its black feathers almost stood on end. It slammed out its right wing!","Boom!","It slammed down viciously as if a huge prehistoric beast clawed down.","The huge Iron Feather Eagle had no time to dodge, and its whole body seemed to have been crushed by a locomotive! Its iron-like feathers shattered, and blood oozed from its nose and head. Falling to the floor, it twitched a few times and then turned motionless!","“Impossible!”","Seeing this scene, the cultivators all stood up uncontrollably and roared in their heads."]},{"number":311,"title":"Chapter 311 - The Whole Place Was in An Uproar!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","If the existence of Half City itself was a taboo in the Morning Star Sea Realm, then in Half City, there was a taboo inside the taboo!","It was Demonic Woman Ning Bi.","It was said that this was a name that she gave herself, and her real name was like a curse that would bring catastrophes if it was pronounced. Even the cultivators in Half City didn’t dare to mention it, and it eventually disappeared in the long history.","Some said that she was the descendant of devils and demons, and some said that the ruined half of Half City had been destroyed by her.","Of course, due to the great length of history, no one could prove the rumor. Some evidence even showed that she had actually appeared in Half City many years after that catastrophe, but nothing could change the fact that the people in Half City feared demons.","The Demon Clan was different from ordinary devils and demons. The members of the Demon Clan referred to a special species which could transform at will. They had high-level intelligence at birth and had evolved from ignorant wild beasts.","According to Fang Qi’s understanding, it was similar to the process in which apes evolved into humans. Although their strength didn’t increase that much during the process, their intelligence had grown tremendously, which was a consensus among the scientists.","According to the legends, the devil and demons were turned from evil and wicked energies of nature. At birth, the devils and demons were connected to the laws of nature and represented a certain kind of laws themselves. They were so powerful that no ordinary cultivators were their match!","Each time a devil or a demon was born, they would cause a bloody storm in the cultivation world!","This was why the existence of this woman, who was rumored to be the descendant of a devil or a demon, was a taboo in the whole cultivation world of the Morning Star Sea Realm!","...","Ning Bi thought that this was the most interesting auction that she had ever had in the Heaven-Hiding Pavilion.","The virtual items that she had never heard of could sell for tens of thousands of crystals, which was unprecedented in the history of the whole cultivation world!","This auction pretty much redefined the meaning of treasures for all the cultivators!","With the previous items sold for exorbitant prices, she had begun to understand these weird items’ values.","Meanwhile, the whole auction hall was in an uproar!","“How could a Spiritual River Realm demon beast be killed by a True Lake Realm demon beast?!”","“Could it be that the Iron Feather Eagle was weakened from the beginning?”","“Impossible! Even if it was weakened, its iron feathers are not fake. Protected by the iron feathers, how could it be killed by a vulture?!”","– At the Haoran Faction’s table –","“Master...” The female disciples looked toward the grey-clothed cultivator in disbelief. “What happened?”","At the Yimu Daoist Palace’s table, the expressions of the disciples who were wearing black-and-white Daoist robes changed drastically, and they asked in shock. “Master... Did you see what happened?”","Meanwhile, the cultivators of the Feng Family, the forces of the inner city, and some powerful independent cultivators all fell into deep thought.","The vulture looks to be at the Spiritual River Realm, but its aura is very powerful. Not only did its strength and speed increase, but its combat style looked closer to that of the prehistoric rare beasts! The ordinary demon beasts are absolutely not its match! The Xichi Spiritual Master was also in deep thought. I wonder if the following item is a method of cultivating demon beasts and turning them into rare beasts.","The others in the auction hall shared her thoughts.","“Enchanting Light.” The image of another small yellow book appeared before Ning Bi.","“Hehehe...” When she was introducing this spiritual spell, her body shook as she laughed, and bright light flashed in her green eyes. “I even admire the human who created this spiritual spell! By reversing the demonic light that devils and demons use to enchant humans, this person created the method of enchanting demon beasts to fight for him or her. It’s very interesting!”","“What?!”","Hearing her introduction, all the cultivators felt as if a heavy hammer had hit their heads while her words kept ringing in their ears!","Everyone knew that enchant was a synonym for devils and demons. It could make humans fall into boundless darkness. The ability to enchant seemed to be the gift that heaven gave to the devils and demons. But if what Ning Bi had said was true, then enchanting was no longer the privilege of the devils and demons!","“But...” Soon, a very powerful independent cultivator in a dark red robe discovered something and said, “Was that vulture enchanted by someone? How did it become stronger than the True Lake Realm Iron Feather Eagle?”","This cultivator was Red Wing Daoist. He had inherited techniques from an ancient relic, and his cultivation strength was probably higher than any of the cultivators in the hall since he had almost reached the pinnacle stage of the Divine Ocean Realm. With his high strength, he enjoyed a high-level reception even in the inner city of Half City.","“Have you ever heard of stories where devils and demons passed some of their power to humans?” Ning Bi smiled charmingly. “Perhaps the Enchanting Light has the same ability.”","The moment she said it, the whole place was stunned!","“Is it true?!” a cultivator asked in a shaky voice.","The eyes of that leading cultivator of the Feng Family turned red. “Our Feng Family must get this spell!”","The independent cultivator named Red Wing Daoist also turned short-breathed, and so were the cultivators of the big forces in and outside Half City.","“Does this spell have any side effects?” the Xichi Spiritual Master calmed down a bit and asked.","“Of course!” Ning Bi pointed out its shortcoming without any hesitation. “The more powerful the subordinate is, the more difficult it will be to control. To prevent the enchanted demon beast from rebelling, please don’t turn off the spell since the enchanted demon beasts might be more powerful than the master. If you let it be for a long time, the chanted demon beast might rebel and kill its master! It will be hard for anyone to escape death.”","All the people fell silent.","After seeing how the Spiritual River Realm demon beast killed the early stage True Lake Realm demon beast with one strike, they knew what would happen to the master if the demon beast rebelled!","Of course, there were solutions. This issue could be solved by releasing it in a remote place and leaving it to be.","The demon beast wouldn’t harbor too much hatred for the master after rebelling, so it wouldn’t hunt down its former master from tens of thousands of kilometers away.","The only thing was that the master’s previous efforts would be wasted if the enchanted demon beasts were let go.","The Xichi Spiritual Master was satisfied with this answer, knowing that such a powerful spiritual spell couldn’t be without any shortcomings.","However, this shortcoming was obviously within the cultivators’ acceptable range. It didn’t dampen their enthusiasm for this spell since they felt like it was reasonable.","All the cultivators were rubbing their hands, determined to get the Enchanting Light Spell even if it meant that they wouldn’t be able to get anything else after buying this item!","“The starting price is 50,000 with minimal increments of 5,000!” Ning Bi said, “Now, please place your bids.”"]},{"number":312,"title":"Chapter 312 - The Horrifying High Prices and An Imminent Blood Storm!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How come it’s so expensive?” Liu Ningyun didn’t know what to say. When she played the game, there was nothing so expensive! She was a little wizard who was over level 20, and she got skills such as the Fire Wall as gifts from Ruan Ning.","However, now...","She felt like she wouldn’t be able to afford the skills such as Ice Roar or even Magic Shield!","As for the Enchanting Light Skill Book, the exorbitant price was only the beginning!","“80,000!” Zhuge Bai of the White Dragon Office quickly placed his bid.","People gasped, surprised that the price was increased by 30,000 in the very beginning.","However, it wasn’t the end. The moment that Zhuge Bai placed his bid, Black Demon offered, “100,000!”","“120,000!” Undaunted, the Yuanheng Pavilion increased the price by 20,000!","“130,000!” Xichi Spiritual Master offered. Although she brought a lot of money with her, she had a mission to accomplish. When the Haoran Faction increased the price to 140,000, she had to give up.","“150,000!” The old Daoist of the Yimu Daoist Palace was undaunted!","The price shot up, and it soon exceeded the mark of 200,000!","If it were only an auction among the players of the Legend of Mir 2, the price wouldn’t have been so high. After all, it didn’t matter how precious the item was, they might be able to get one when they kill a big boss or the event where monsters besieged the city happened again.","However, for the cultivators who didn’t play the game, they thought it was worth it for its price. After all, money couldn’t do anything for them unless it was converted to their strength.","Driven by this atmosphere, many players of the Legend of Mir 2 joined the bidding in desperation!","“210,000!” Black Demon placed his second bid with a totally different look on his face.","“220,000!” The White Dragon Office wasn’t willing to be pushed out.","“225,000!” Xi Chenzhou frowned. Obviously, the price was a bit too high for him.","“250,000!” Red-eyed, the leading cultivator of the Feng Family clutched the edge of the table as if everyone else in the room was his mortal enemy. He increased the price by 25,000!","“I want to see who can offer a higher price than mine!” The middle-aged cultivator of the Feng Family looked around him with his narrow eyes.","Indeed, many of them had come prepared for the supreme treasures that were going to be auctioned near the end, so they had brought a lot of crystals with them.","Although no one wanted to give up the supreme treasures, many of them also wanted the Enchanting Light Skill Book.","If they spent money on this item, they wouldn’t have enough funds to bid for the supreme treasures!","Many of them were weighing the options, and the cultivator of the Feng Family had obviously opted for the Enchanting Light.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have dared to increase the price to 250,000 in one go.","“260,000!” At this moment, Red Wing Daoist, the independent cultivator in a dark red robe, opened his mouth and made an offer.","That wasn’t the end.","Soon, the Xichi Spiritual Master offered, “280,000!”","“Master!” Liu Ningyun was shocked! Aren’t we here to reclaim the supreme treasure that our faction lost a long time ago!?","With a snort, the Xichi Spiritual Master explained, “Right now, these people still have a lot of crystals with them. It is clear that they came here wanting that supreme treasure. We can increase the price of this item so that we’ll have one less rival later!”","“Ugh...” Mo Xian said immediately, “Master, you’re wise!”","No one had expected that a stormy battle begun even before the last few items were auctioned!","Although the Morning Star Sea Realm’s cultivators were much wealthier than the people in Dajin, Fang Qi was still surprised by how wealthy they were! They spent hundreds of thousands of crystals without blinking!","Of course, many people intended to buy this spiritual spell as the ultimate treasure of their factions, which explained their willingness to spend an exorbitant amount of money.","For the individuals including the Xichi Spiritual Master, this price was very high, and few of them could afford it with their own funds.","However, with the funds of the whole factions and forces behind them, this price wasn’t too high.","Therefore, the price continued to increase!","When it rose to 300,000, the players of the Legend of Mir 2 were squeezed out. For them, this price was too high. On the other hand, the players of the Legend of Mir 2 here in the auction were all presidents of the big guilds, and they intended to kill some bosses and get another Enchanting Light Skill Book that way.","With their influence in the game, it was not a problem to kill several bosses. With this thought in mind, they gradually quitted bidding.","The bidders now were non-players.","The non-players didn’t know that the Enchanting Light Skill Books could be obtained by killing bosses even though the chance of that happening was extremely low.","“310,000!” The Feng Family offered 310,000 crystals!","Many people hesitated at the price.","Almost all the players of the Legend of Mir 2 thought that this price was too high, but others didn’t think so, and the bidding continued.","“315,000!” The grey-clothed cultivator of the Haoran Faction yelled.","“320,000!” The cultivator of the Feng Family appeared to be a little desperate.","“360,000!” At this moment, a voice sounded.","It was from Red Wing Daoist, the independent cultivator in the dark red robe!","Obviously, he knew that he had no chance of getting that supreme treasure and thus put all his money on this spiritual spell!","The middle-aged cultivator of the Feng Family stared at Red Wing Daoist with narrow eyes, his expression unreadable.","When the price was already this high, no one wanted to increase it further.","Meanwhile, Ruan Ning said to Fang Qi who sat next to her, “Guild President, pinch me! I want to know if this is a dream or not!”","The happiness came too abruptly that her mind turned blank; she almost fainted as a result of this.","Then, a shriek sounded, “Ahhh!”","Ruan Ning shrieked in pain before looking down; she saw that her white and tender arm was almost bruised. While rubbing it with tears in her eyes, she complained, “Couldn’t you do it more gently?”","“I didn’t know that you cultivators are so soft and tender!”","“You’re just jealous that I’m rich!” Ruan Ning glared at him and said angrily, “I was planning to give you a big red envelope, but now... Humph!”","[TL Note: In Chinese and other East Asian and Southeast Asian societies, a red envelope or a red packet is a monetary gift which is given during holidays or special occasions.]","“Wow! You even know to take care of the Guild President! You’ve improved!” Mr. Fang seemed surprised.","“Humph!”","After a long time, there were no more bids for the item. As the hammer slammed down, the highest bidder was Red Wing Daoist, who offered 360,000 crystals!","For the players of the Legend of Mir 2, this was a high price beyond their imagination!","Sitting beside them, Xi Yue looked stunned. “I suddenly feel like I’m so rich.”","“Sister Xi Yue, you must be careful...” Ruan Ning looked her up and down and said, “You might be kidnapped when you go out!”","After all, she was the only cultivator who had mastered Enchanting Light currently!","Beside them, Mo Tianxing chuckled. “I hope the buyers don’t think that this is the end of the whole thing!”","“Senior Mo, what do you mean?’ Ruan Ning was surprised.","She looked in the direction of his gaze and saw the cultivators of the Feng Family staring at the cultivators who had successfully bought treasures!"]},{"number":313,"title":"Chapter 313 - Only Masters Deserve to Enter the Internet Café","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Go to the Origins Internet Club in the 36th Block with this token and trade it for the item with the worker at Computer No. 36?”","After the auction ended, Red Wing Daoist’s face fell when he heard this information. “What tricks are you playing?!”","After all, he had spent more than 300,000 crystals on this spiritual spell, and he wouldn’t allow any accidents to happen to it!","But now, they are asking me to get this spell at a place called Origins Internet Club? What is happening?","Why can’t they give it to me directly?!","“Are you sure that you’re not playing me?!” Red Wing Daoist had a dark expression on his face.","“Sir, do you think my Heaven-Hiding Pavilion will do such a thing for merely 300,000 crystals?” A cold voice sounded behind him; it was from Ning Bi.","Red Wing Daoist’s heart lurched. Remembering the rumors about her, his expression changed several times, and he finally said, “Then, I’ll go to the Origin Internet Club!”","Then, he left in a huff!","“Is the auction really a good one?” Fang Qi frowned with displeasure. “I’ve waited for so long but didn’t see anything useful.”","He looked up while he spoke, and he saw Ning Bi’s green eyes gazing at him.","The people beside him instantly felt chills running down their spines as if they were being stared at by a viper!","“Little Brother, name the things that you want but didn’t find in the auction.” She sized up Fang Qi with interest since no one had ever dared to talk like this in the Heaven-Hiding Pavilion.","“Tell me what you want. If I have them, maybe Big Sister will give them to you as gifts.”","“You’re so nice!” Fang Qi’s eyes lit up, and he said blithely, “Spiritual Marrow, the Bone of a Master, Deep Ocean Black Iron, and a Blood Soul Crystal. I sat here for half a day but didn’t see any of them. Do you have them?”","Before he could finish speaking, he felt someone pinching the love handles on his waist. He turned his head and stared at Xi Yue. “Why did you pinch me?”","Xi Yue’s pretty face turned dark, not knowing if Fang Qi was truly dumb or was just playing dumb.","After all, no one in the whole Morning Star Sea Realm could take this demonic woman’s stuff for free!","...","Meanwhile, fearing that he wouldn’t be able to find a seat for the finishing deals, Jin Wu had gone to the Origin Internet Club and took a computer. With eight hours of game time, he had enough time to wait for the end of the auction.","Red Wing Daoist strode out of Heaven-Hiding Pavilion, knowing that the 36th Block was a busy area not far from the inner city. I’ll go and see what tricks you are playing!","While he walked out of Heaven-Hiding Pavilion, several figures that were hiding in the dark followed him noiselessly!","They came from more than one force!","“Target is out. He should have the item with him!” A black figure hiding in a dark corner said.","“Follow him! Attack him the moment he’s out of the inner city!”","...","“Ugh?” The moment he walked out of the inner city, Red Wing Daoist found that something wasn’t right.","The dark clouds in the sky suddenly turned darker, and the air around him became so gloomy that it seemed like water would ooze out from it!","“Is it going to rain?”","He strode forward. But instead of raindrops, a trace of cold murderous spirit greeted him!","“Hehe!” Red Wing Daoist sneered, and his weathered face that had many marks on it became cold. “Come out! I knew that the way to the Origin Internet Club wouldn’t be peaceful!”","“Arrogant!”","“You are seeking death!”","Gloomy winds howled as if tens of thousands of ghosts were screaming.","With deep roars, a streak of black light shot toward Red Wing Daoist silently like a black snake!","Red Wing Daoist injected spiritual essence into his feet, and a red spiritual flame spread suddenly outward from the ground beneath his feet!","The spiritual flames looked like red glass, and it didn’t flicker in the wind.","The ‘black snake’ that rushed over retreated in horror as if it had encountered something extremely scary.","Suddenly, Red Wing Daoist chanted in a low voice, and the spiritual flames shot up and turned everything around him into a red inferno!","Only screams and shrills were left in the fire.","“You overestimated yourself!” While he thought that, more cultivators swarmed toward him!","The fire quickly condensed and turned into a bright red flame bird, landing on his shoulder.","“Kill!” Many spiritual treasures released their spiritual light which crashed toward him like colorful fireworks from all directions.","“Chirp!” With a clear chirp, the flame bird spread its red wings and turned into a horrifying wave of flames, crashing down on the spiritual treasures with a much more powerful aura!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Many spiritual treasures exploded in the flames while their owners were swallowed by this wave of flames!","The road to the 36th Block wasn’t long, but many greedy people who craved for treasures made it much, much longer!","With fiery eyes, Red Wing Daoist killed his way to the Origin Internet Club in blood and fire!","Boom!","With a huge rumble of thunder, a lightning snake flew down the sky, turning everything in the world white.","Close. He was getting closer and closer to the Origin Internet Club.","In the howling winds, a few ghost-like figures stood on the road before him.","The leader had a long and narrow face, knife-shaped eyes, and a vicious expression. He was the cultivator of the Feng Family who had bid against him.","Obviously, he had his eye on the Enchanting Light. “Red Wing Daoist, your reputation is well-deserved. But I’m afraid that the battles have consumed lots of your spiritual essence. Hand over the token. I will go to the Origin Internet Club for you, or you’ll die here!”","“The Feng Family?” Red Wing Daoist sneered. “Feng Gui, you are only an elder of the Feng Family. Do you think you qualify to go to the Origin Internet Club for me?! Even Feng Zhengyi, the Master of the Feng Family, doesn’t dare to say this to me!”","Another rumble of thunder resonated in the sky, and a streak of lightning flashed.","A pair of green jade-like eyes stared at the battlefield.","“Master, should we just let them be?” a voice asked her from the side.","Her red lips curled up, revealing a charming smile.","Drip.","A cold raindrop fell. The cultivator of the Feng Family said viciously, “It seems like even heaven isn’t on your side!”","“I’ll see how powerful your Red Fire Spell is!” With a shrill, many howling souls poured out from his body like the endless pitch-black river that connected to hell!","In the river, many sulky souls struggled up and then were dragged down by the pitch-black water. The moment the black river appeared, the whole world turned gloomy and lifeless!","“This is my Ghost-Sealing Death Energy. I want to see how you handle it while most of your spiritual essence is gone!” Feng Gui smirked and said, “If you can’t block it, I advise you to surrender to me and let me go to the Origin Internet Club for you instead!”","“Bullsh*t!” Red Wing Daoist roared hoarsely, and many flames exploded from his body! The sky behind him seemed to have been dyed red by these flames!","“Don’t reserve your strengths! Kill him!” Feng Gui roared furiously, and the several cultivators of the Feng Family behind him attacked simultaneously!","“Sealing Technique!” They attacked together, and the whole sky seemed to be dyed black by ink!","This darkness seemed to seal a part of Red Wing Daoist’s spiritual essence; his surging red flames abated!","A stunning battle began between a powerful independent cultivator whose reputation had spread all over the Morning Star Sea Realm and the elite cultivators led by an elder of the Feng Family; they fought for the right to enter the Origin Internet Club!","“You are seeking your deaths!” Red Wing Daoist roared in fury, “Sky-Swallowing Fire!”","Many flames condensed into a huge fire dragon before flying into the sky.","Meanwhile, the black river that looked like the River Styx crashed toward him!","“You dare to burn the Sealing Technique of our Feng Family with your red flames. I’ll see how you block my Ghost-Sealing Death Energy!”","When the death energy crashed onto him, Red Wing Daoist’s face paled.","He spat out a mouthful of black blood. Meanwhile, the thick ink-like energy in the sky was torn open, and Red Wing Daoist’s spiritual essence rose sharply!","The spiritual essence turned into many flames which poured out of his body, and the horrifying high temperature almost burned up the surrounding air, melting a huge crater into the smooth road.","While the Divine Ocean Realm masters fought, the surrounding trees and houses were shattered by this storm which was a mix of red and black!","For both parties, this was a hard battle.","Sometime later, the black color receded while the red color swallowed the black color like ocean waves.","A drop of sweat fell on the smooth ground.","The dark clouds scattered, and sunlight shone through. Golden light dashed through the transparent glass wall and door and entered the shop.","Zou Mo looked up in surprise and saw a cultivator wearing a tattered red robe at the door. “Welcome to the Origin Internet Club. How can I help you?”","“Is this the Origin Internet Club?! Hahahaha! I have finally arrived!” While wiping the sweat off his forehead, Red Wing Daoist laughed and said, “Only grandmasters like me deserve to enter this place!”","Zou Mo watched while the Daoist walked in and said with a hearty laugh, “I’ll see who else dares to stop me from entering Origin Internet Club!”","Zou Mo was at a loss for words when he saw this.","The players who were eating instant noodles in the shop were also at a loss for words.","Now, Mr. Fang slowly walked back into the shop with other players. Looking at Red Wing Daoist who was covered in wounds and wearing a tattered robe, he murmured to himself, “You have to suffer so much just to get online?”"]},{"number":314,"title":"Chapter 314 - The Battle for the Royal City – Winner Becomes King and the New Grand Theft Auto","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Duyou Holiness still sat by the lake, and his deep eyes stared at the surface of the lake as if they were trying to pierce through the water and reach the depths of the lake.","Suddenly, ripples appeared in the water; it seemed like a huge monster was going to emerge from the center of the lake.","The schools of fish swimming in the lake seemed to have sensed the danger and tried to escape. At this moment, huge waves surged up, and a vicious dragon swallowed lots of fish in one instant!","Duyou Holiness’s face turned cold.","As the master of the whole lake, he couldn’t go into the lake in person and fight with this evil dragon.","It was beneath him. If he did that, it would be harming his reputation.","Besides, the Three Saint Gates had rarely moved in the mortal world and didn’t usually mind worldly business. If he moved rashly, people would think that the Three Saint Gates were coming out of their hermit lifestyle.","He thought that it was not time to break the rule which had governed the Three Saint Gates for thousands of years.","“Lightning strikes?” Of course, he wouldn’t believe the rumors as his disciples did, but...","His eyes and expression were unreadable while he was in deep thought.","Then, he stood up on the side of the lake.","However, since the rumors couldn’t be proven to be false, there was the chance that they could be real!","“Hehe!” He snickered. “Although this rumor is not believable, it sure reminded me of something!”","Internet addiction might not exist, but I can just make it real. When more people hear of the rumors and pass them around, they will become the truth.","He didn’t believe that lightning strikes could cure internet addiction, but with more people hearing the rumor, it would become the truth, and people would believe it. That was enough for him.","...","“I got to say, that Sister is really helpful and passionate!” Mr. Fang was pleased since...","[New task: Be Prepared (Completed)","Task Description: Prepare the materials for the prizes of the first Sand City Master Event","Sand City Master prizes: Wilma Cornett, Bone Jade Scepter, Judgement Staff, and Dragon Mark Sword","Task Explanation: The weapons are enhanced mimics; the Cornett is a one-to-one exact reproduction","Task Rewards: Godly Weapon Fragment *1; one day access to Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room; Sword God (Proficiency)]","[New Task: Battle of Sand City","Task Description: Act as the referee of this Battle of Sand City. The participating guilds have three days to register and four days to prepare","Task Reward: Grand Theft Auto 5 (GTA5); one day access to Game Cultivation Room","Task Explanation: Only the kings can obtain the three godly weapons","Reward explanation: This will be a vast learning opportunity]","Yes, with the Bone of a Master and Deep Ocean Black Iron that Ning Bi gave to him, Fang Qi had finished this task and even gotten his rewards!","“Sir, you don’t really think that you can take her things for free?” The girls looked at him in disdain.","“I can’t?” Mr. Fang waved his hand and said, “You’re right... since I benefited from her, I must give her something back. Maybe I’ll take her to level up or something.”","They were all at a loss for words.","“Maybe I’ll give her a set of items. It will be enough, right?”","They all felt embarrassed for him.","“Since the shop owner says so, I’m quite satisfied.” At this moment, a charming voice sounded from behind Fang Qi. “I’ll appreciate your guidance.”","“No problem!”","Since Red Wing Daoist was eager to put his hands on the treasure, he walked ahead of the others and killed all the people with ill intentions. Therefore, the others who had walked down the road after him didn’t experience any turbulence.","The Xichi Spiritual Master, cultivators of the Haoran Faction and Yimu Daoist Palace, some independent cultivators who had bought items, and even a few cultivators who hadn’t bought things walked into the shop one after another.","“Ugh? How come there’s a beggar here? Such bad luck!” Duan Lan, the person who hated Fang Qi for stealing his thunder, saw Red Wing Daoist, who was in his tattered robes, sitting in front of a computer by the door.","The moment he said it, a chilling gaze turned to him. “Kid, who are you talking about?!”","All the cultivators looked at Red Wing Daoist who had just turned his head, and they were a little speechless.","The grey-clothed cultivator’s face turned dark, and he slammed his hand on the back of Duan Lan’s head. “Apologize!”","With cold sweat popping out on his head, Duan Lan immediately apologized and fled.","Who would expect a grand cultivator at the peak stage of the Divine Ocean Realm to dress like this?! He was unlucky!","Then he saw a familiar figure. Standing before Mr. Fang, he sneered, “You again? What a coincidence!”","I will vent my frustration on this kid!","With his hands on his waist, he said viciously, “Damn kid, do you still remember me?”","“Sir, who’s this guy?” The girls were baffled.","On the other side, Jin Wu glanced at the people coming into the shop and said, “If you’re here to get items or skill books, go and ask Mr. Fang to get you a computer and activate the game!”","Duan Lan was still sneering on the side. “You’re really forgetful. Aren’t you...”","Before he could finish, he felt a chilly glance turning to him.","A palm slammed him on the back of his head.","“Who hit me again?!” Duan Lan screamed and looked back, and he saw that the grey-clothed cultivator’s face was as dark as the bottom of a burned pot!","Jin Wu had just told the people to go to the shop owner first before getting the items and the skill books, but Duan Lan was insulting the shop owner right now!","“Are you a moron?!” He slammed his palm on the back of Duan Lan’s head again and said, “Apologize!”","“Ok...”","Duan Lan sulkily apologized and stood by the door, feeling bitter inside.","Meanwhile Mr. Fang walked to the small blackboard and erased the introduction of the Legend of Mir 2 on the top of the board before writing eight big words: Battle for the Royal City; Winner Becomes King!","“Battle for the Royal City; winner becomes king?” The Xi Chi Spiritual Master and the masters of the major forces looked at the big words in bafflement.","Confused, people like Black Demon asked, “Sir, what’s this?”","“You have three days to register for the competition and four days to prepare for the Battle for the Royal City. The winner will be the King!” Fang Qi said, “The Battle for Sand City will begin in the Legend of Mir 2.”","By now, the main battlefield of the adventurers had shifted from Biqi Province to Mengchong Province. Since the Zuma Temple was near Sand City, the latter had become the gathering and resting place for the adventurers. Anyone who could take Sand City would become the king of the whole world!","It was the so-called Battle for the Royal City!","Obviously, it would bring great benefits to the players, giving great convenience for the players to level up and obtain treasures. Now, the winner of the battle will get more rewards: the three real godly weapons and the Wilma Cornett!","“The three real godly weapons?” Hearing Fang Qi’s introduction, people began to digest the information.","“Sir,” Tang Yuan of Yuanheng Pavilion tried to repeat the most important part of all that information. “Do you mean that the Bone Jade Staff I bought isn’t just a virtual item. It exists in the real world, and the way to obtain it is through this event, ‘Battle for the Royal City; winner becomes King’?!”","“The three godly weapons are real items!?”","They all looked stunned.","Each of the three godly weapons had a unique background. Take the Dragon Mark Sword as an example. This sword was made by the ‘Dragon Smith’, and the symbolic green dragon patterns represented extreme Yang Energy, spreading all over the shimmering sword body.","According to the legends, the Taoist who first gets his or her hands on the Dragon Mark Sword could drip blood on the dragon pattern on the end of the sword handle. If the blood traveled all the way along the dragon pattern to the tip of the sword, the sword wouldn’t be afraid of any evil energy. If the owner of the sword were cursed, the person who planted the curse would be injured by the backlash instead.","Each of the three godly weapons had its own unique and powerful ability, and everyone knew what it meant if they could get the real items!"]},{"number":315,"title":"Chapter 315 - Mr. Fang Showing Off his skills in KOF Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You mean I’ll have to kill monsters and increase my level to level 13 before I can learn Enchanting Light?” Red Wing Daoist was still dazed, not expecting that he would have to learn this spiritual spell in this special way!","Usually, people recorded spiritual spells on jade slips, and others could withdraw the information from the jade slip with spiritual energy. But now...","“I’ll give you a friendly reminder,” Jin Wu told him and the other cultivators who were waiting to pick up their items, “If your levels are not high enough, remember to store your stuff in your warehouse after picking up the item you bought. Otherwise, if you are killed in this virtual world, your items might drop out of your bag. Don’t blame me for not warning you if you lose your stuff!”","“It sounds very unsafe. What if someone robs my warehouse?” Red Wing Daoist complained.","“The warehouse zone in this village is a safe zone of this world, and no one can attack it. You don’t have to worry about that.”","“Do you mean that only the owner can take the things from the warehouse?! No one else can do anything to get access?” The cultivators who were waiting in line to pick up their items looked surprised!","Hearing this information, the cultivators who were still planning to rob Red Wing Daoist were instantly deflated. They couldn’t take this spiritual spell even if they killed Red Wing Daoist unless they could rob this shop!","The cultivators who had been worried about being robbed felt relieved, and the ones who complained about this method were also satisfied.","“This shop is amazing...”","“I’m surprised that Half City has such a shop...”","While the cultivators talked among themselves, Ruan Ning walked over with an armful of bowls of instant noodles and boxes of spicy sticks before she said, “The bill please!”","“Hey, you can’t do whatever you want even if you are rich!” Fang Qi said in disapproval, “Each person can only buy one bowl of instant noodles and one box of spicy sticks!”","“I will buy them for you guys!” Ruan Ning said proudly, “From today on, I will treat you all to instant noodles for one month!”","“Pu!” Mr. Fang almost spat out the Coke that he had been sipping.","“Where’s Xiaoyue? I’ll tell Xiaoyue through QQ that she has her share too! Haha!” Ruan Ning waved her hand generously and paid the bill!","“Hehe! This girl became a rich lady in just one day!” Mo Tianxing lamented while he looked at Ruan Ning who went to open QQ.","“She did it under my good guidance!” Mr. Fang said.","Of course, some people were happy while others were not. For example, Red Wing Daoist who had spent over 300,000 crystals was now working hard to level up after being hunted down all the way to the shop. After the red-clothed girl handed him a bowl of instant noodles, he gobbled it down in his tattered robe, feeling as if his heart were bleeding.","“Hey! Xiaoyue has money too!” After all, while Ruan Ning made a fortune playing the game with Mr. Fang, Xiaoyue had earned her own share in the process.","...","“Master... Do you really think that you must lower yourself to try the games in this place?” A black-robed old man with white hair, a white beard, and a slightly hunched back stood behind Ning Bi.","“That little guy is interesting,” she said. “Didn’t you notice that he doesn’t seem to be afraid of me.”","“From my point of view, that kid is just dumb,” the old man said in a cold voice.","“Hahaha...” Hearing the old man’s words, Ning Bi covered her mouth and giggled. “If an idiot could open such a shop in Half City and survive for so long, how lucky must he be!”","“An old guy in the inner city shows great interest in this little guy and his shop!” Ning Bi said with a chuckle, “However, he hasn’t showed his hand yet. Just think about why he’s still waiting!”","“Anyway, I’m bored in the inner city.” If she went out of Half City, all the major forces in the Morning Star Sea Realm would probably get wary and treat it as that the Demonic Woman came out of her hermit-like lifestyle. Ning Bi yawned in boredom and said, “Those old guys in the inner city spend all day in seclusion cultivation or scheming! They are a bunch of disgusting old man!”","The old man walking behind her was at a loss for words.","“Why can’t I come and see this novel thing?”","“Miss, your... your instant noodles are ready...” Zou Mo was still shivering right now; this was his first time seeing a non-human!","Of course, his reaction was normal in the eyes of the old man behind her.","“You... are going to eat this thing?!” The old man’s eyes almost popped out when Ning Bi took the bowl of instant noodles.","“I like the smell, so I decided to try it.” Since her taste buds were different from those of humans, she didn’t find the delicacies in the human world to her liking, which explained why the old man asked.","However, the moment she took a bit of the instant noodles, her green, jade-like eyes instantly brightened.","She didn’t know that the System only provided the best of the best. Even though her taste buds were different from those of humans, the food could still give her an unusual and fascinating experience!","“Can... you eat it?” Dumbfounded, the old man watched Ning Bi slurp a mouthful of noodles into her mouth.","“What do you mean? Why can’t I eat it?” Ning Bi said unclearly with food in her mouth, “If I can’t eat this, then all the food in your Half City is for pigs!”","“Ugh...”","“Little Shop Owner.”","Fang Qi watched as Ning Bi walked over with a bowl of instant noodles in her hand. If it were someone else, this act would have looked ridiculous, but Ning Bi seemed to have transformed from a lofty seductive demonic woman into a pretty and cute sister next door.","“Aren’t you going to introduce the good stuff in your shop to me?”","“Okay.” For the sake of the Bone of a Master and Deep Ocean Black Iron that she had given him, Mr. Fang agreed.","“Little Mo, you keep an eye on the shop while I show this sister around.”","[TL Note: In China, calling other people brothers or sisters is a friendly way of addressing them.]","So, another regular visitor appeared on the seat before the joystick for the King of Fighters in Mr. Fang’s Qzone.","In Mr. Fang’s Qzone, a demonic woman with brown hair and green eyes shouted and used the joystick while Kyo Kusanagi shouted his lines. On the screen, Kyo Kusanagi leaped into the air with flames engulfing his body.","Desperation Move – ‘Mu Shiki’ was extremely powerful and dashing!","“No! No!” Song Qingfeng and other King of Fighters players shook their heads while they watched the game from behind and said as experienced players, “This move is powerful, but it is easy to be blocked!”","Sure enough, Mr. Fang blocked the attack and controlled his Kyo Kusanagi to charge forward. Engulfed in flames, Kyo Kusanagi shot out the flames, and his combos looked quite dashing.","“A lifetime of loss and struggle; believing in one’s ability to change the future ...” This time, Mr. Fang hummed the tunes of the song, the Glorious Years by Beyond. It perfectly matched with Kyo Kusanagi’s victory animation where he held flames in his hand on the screen, creating a dashing sight."]},{"number":316,"title":"Chapter 316 - Love Curse","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Just like Plants vs Zombies, one’s progression in the King of Fighters was also shared on their Friend Circle.","[TL Note: The Friend Circle is more like Facebook where people could share posts and stuff.]","The number of players who played the little games was still growing, but the majority of players went to Plants vs Zombies.","It was only because not many people could afford the King of Fighters.","By now, the task target was more than halfway, which was 152/200. It meant that it wouldn’t be long before the arrival of Harry Potter I.","Compared with the original version of King of Fighters, which one could clear stage with only one token, this version was extremely difficult. Even Fang Qi couldn’t clear stage with only one token.","The condition for unlocking the moves and skills in King of Fighters was that the players had to defeat enemies in story mode. After defeating one team of enemies, the players could learn the training methods for some of the skills of the characters that they used in the fight. If they wanted to learn the Desperation Moves, they had to defeat Orochi by clearing the stage with one token.","With 20 gold coins for one token, Fang Qi had spent a lot of his gold coins that he had gained through stealing other people’s vegetables, but he still hadn’t seen Orochi yet, let alone defeat it.","It was quite embarrassing.","Mr. Fang defeated all the other players of King of Fighters and was unrivaled in the whole internet café. He used he combos smoothly and could even play well with one hand.","However, on the second day, Mr. Fang didn’t play the King of Fighters.","“It’s time to watch Wind and Clouds and Jade Dynasty!” Now, everyone turned to the TV Series at this time of the week without Fang Qi’s reminder.","“Come here! Anyone who wants to watch it together come here!” Since the appearance of Qzone, they could watch the TV Series together. Today, Mr. Fang’s viewing group had some new members, including Mo Tianxing, Huangpu Tao, Liu Ningyun, and Mo Xian.","The Xichi Spiritual Master and other players who had just visited the shop yesterday were still watching the previous episodes, trying to catch up. It was clear that they didn’t get to the newest episodes yet.","“Ugh? Sir, where’s the girl who played the King of Fighters with you?” Song Qingfeng looked around, surprised that the regular visitor of Mr. Fang’s Qzone wasn’t in the group.","“He is actually hanging out with that demonic woman!” Mo Xian and her friends were gossiping.","“I hope he won’t be charmed by that demonic woman!”","“Fortunately, she isn’t here. I don’t want to watch the TV Series with that demonic woman...”","Mr. Fang explained, “She’s still watching the previous episodes and hasn’t gotten this far yet.”","“Hey! Kid Fang has made many new friends over there!” While looking at the new faces, Nalan Hongwu said while laughing, “Why don’t you introduce us?”","“Huangpu Tao!”","“I’m Mo Tianxing of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild!”","“...”","Although the two regions always fought in the Legend of Mir 2, the people here today weren’t like Black Demon. After Fang Qi introduced them, they got along well. People like Song Qingfeng, who were regular visitors of Fang Qi’s Qzone, were quite familiar with the new people. “The woman in white is a super genius of the Morning Star Sea Realm. Despite her young age, she has reached the True Lake Realm...”","“So strong? Is she a more talented genius than Ms. Nalan?”","“...”","Meanwhile, Nalan Mingxue looked sulky, and her beautiful eyes shot out sparks. The atmosphere was intense.","“You’re still young...” Sensing her mood, Mr. Fang comforted her quietly, “You’re not even 17 yet; you still have time.”","“Humph!”","People like Xue Daolv, Mo Tianxing, and the others got along better.","“Not bad! Not bad!” Huangpu Tao said, “We have different customs and inheritances; I believe your Daoist techniques and understanding must have some unique features.","“Thank you! Thank you!” They began to compliment each other professionally, “I heard that the Morning Star Sea Realm is a world full of cultivators; True Lake Realm cultivators are everywhere, and Divine Ocean Realm cultivators can be frequently seen. I’m sure your Daoist techniques and understanding are very profound as well!”","“Thank you!”","“When you guys have time, we can sit down to have tea and talk about Dao!”","At this moment, the scene around them changed, and Jade Dynasty began.","In the last episode, the Demon Cult had begun attacking Green Cloud Faction, which was why they were so eager to watch the new episodes.","In the back mountain of Green Cloud Faction, Lin Jingyu was on the verge of dying, and the old man whose job was to sweep the floor used the Seven Tribulation Dragon-Slaying Spell, which was a long-lost spell of the Green Cloud Faction. The mountain-like green light appeared, amazing all the people there.","“Wan? Wan what?!”","The viewers talked among themselves. “This sword control technique is horrifyingly powerful!”","“Wan...” Nalan Mingxue said thoughtfully, “Is he Senior Brother Wan, whom they had mentioned?”","After watching the dazzling re-emergence of Wan Jianyi, they watched the appearance of the ancient Immortal-Slaying Sword!","[A mysterious old man residing at the Founder Shrine. He used to be in a relationship with You Ji, but they could not be together as they were from opposing sects. Later, he becomes Lin Jingyu’s teacher.]","The customers of Fang Qi’s shop didn’t know why this TV Series was named Jade Dynasty, but they finally understood why when they saw the appearance of the Immortal-Slaying Sword.","[TL Note: the name of the TV Series is Zhu Xian in Chinese, meaning immortal slayer. But it was translated into Jade Dynasty and other names.]","The entire Green Cloud Mountain was shaking.","On Heaven-Reaching Peak, the sky which had been clear for more than 1,000 years began to dim.","In the Fantasy Moon Cave Abode, a purple aura rose majestically!","Six beams of radiant mystic yellow, indigo, red, green, orange, and blue lights merged with the purple light, and the seven beams of light condensed on the radiant ancient Immortal-Slaying Sword in Daoxuan’s hand.","The sky and the earth changed colors, and rumbles of thunder boomed.","“The Immortal-Slaying Sword Array?!” While looking at the endless seven beams of mystic light that were in seven different colors flashing in the sky and condensing into a huge horrifying sword energy, all the people in the audience were stunned!","The sword energies fell like the raindrops in a storm! Seeing many cultivators of the Demon Cult getting knocked into the ground by the sword energies without the ability to fight back, the rain of blood and flesh, and the hell-like scene, the cultivators in the audience were at a loss for words toward the power of this sword.","More shockingly, the huge seven-colored sword was still in the sky! The Immortal-Slaying Sword Array had just released a small trace of its power!","They were so excited that their faces told it all, and they held onto their breaths subconsciously.","“I’m surprised that Green Cloud Faction’s guarding array is so powerful!” Liu Ningyun lamented, “If our Nanhua Faction had such a guarding array, we wouldn’t have suffered such severe damage in the catastrophe at the hands of the devils and demons 1,000 years ago.”","“Green Leaf Ancestral Master is an amazing genius!”","However, it wasn’t the end of the climax of the episode yet. When they watched Daoxuan Spiritual Master demand Zhang Xiaofan to reveal the secret behind his fast increase in cultivation strength, their hearts jumped into their throats.","Then, bedlam broke loose when they learned that the villagers in Grass Temple Village had been slaughtered by Puzhi, who had saved both Zhang Xiaofan and Lin Jingyu!","“What’s orthodox? What’s justice?” When they heard the shout, no one knew how to answer the questions.","Then, the Immortal-Slaying Sword that was in the sky crashed toward Zhang Xiaofan, who was demonized and holding Swallowing Soul, the staff, in his hand.","Almost all the viewers lost the ability to think.","Seeing the huge, horrifying seven-colored sword crashing down, the viewers’ minds had become dark and chaotic!","There was neither sounds or light between the sky and the earth!","They felt the endless desperation as if they were there.","At this moment, they heard the faint and crisp sounds of a bell.","“Gloomy souls in Hell and demons and gods in Heaven, I’ll sacrifice my body to you and fall...” someone chanted incantations of the blood curse which many people looked at in disdain and almost no one thought would ever be cast.","Love Curse!","Then, they saw that gentle and beautiful girl being pushed into the sky by a gale, dashing toward the huge sword which was engulfed in flowing seven-colored light!","It was the only light in the dark abyss of endless despair!"]},{"number":317,"title":"Chapter 317 - A Grey Week","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Dazed, all the people watched the violent gale transform into an endless vortex around the figure in the sky while she crashed onto the huge, horrifying seven-colored sword!","In the next moment, only a dazzling light was left between the sky and the earth! The restless spiritual light swept across the world, and the eye-piercing light made people unable to open their eyes.","A huge noise sounded as if the earth had been broken open, and the unstoppable Immortal-Slaying Sword was sent flying backward!","The Heaven-Reaching Peak shook violently, and it was cracked open in the middle as if it were the end of the world!","“She blocked it?!” All the people stared at the sky in a daze with disbelief in their eyes.","She indeed blocked it?!","The power of the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array was horrifying.","However, the power of the Love Curse was even more shocking! The viewers didn’t know how to express their feelings.","At this moment, they began to understand why this extremely vicious and demonic curse was called the Love Curse.","In the world, perhaps only the people with deep love could cast this vicious blood curse even though it meant that they would stay in Hell forever!","Looking at the green, forlorn figure fall from the sky like a broken doll, the viewers felt like something clutched their hearts.","It hurt so much that it felt like someone stabbed a knife into their hearts and twisted it.","“How could this happen?! Waah...” Jiang Xiaoyue had been in a great mood after making a lot of money by playing the Legend of Mir 2, but she now wept in heartbreak, “Xiaofan finally got someone who loves him so much, how can it end this way!”","“Waa... Bi Yao, don’t die...” Mo Xian and the other disciples of the Nanhua Faction were already crying their hearts out.","The young people of Lingyun Academy felt like their minds were blank as if something was lost.","“Master... Xiaofan and Bi Yao are so pitiable...” Fenghua and Yuexin wept and said unclearly while wiping their tears with their sleeves.","“Nothing in the world is constant, and it leaves so many regrets...” As the Palace Master, Xue Daolv understood Daoxuan’s act, but he heaved a heavy sigh of helplessness as a viewer.","“...”","In this messy and chaotic world, people only thought of profits and gains, and no one would sacrifice themselves and stay in Hell forever in exchange for someone else’s life.","For cultivators, they were too rational to do anything like destroying their cultivation strength which they had accumulated for hundreds of years.","No one in the audience could imagine themselves doing such a thing, which explained why they were so sure that no one would cast the Love Curse.","Since it was something that they could never do, this scene was even more shocking to them.","They lamented about Zhang Xiaofan’s youthful ignorance, Bi Yao’s deep love for him, and this excruciatingly painful scene.","Most of the high-level cultivators here in Fang Qi’s Qzone had spent their best youthful years in endless cultivation and fighting, and these beautiful and sad feelings were something that they could never experience in their lives.","All the people watched sadly while Xiaofan roared in fury as if the whole world had collapsed!","After this episode, they fell silent for a long time.","Sometime later, Su Tianji glanced around coldly as if she were looking for a fitting saber. “Where’s the shop owner?”","“Sir! Come out!” Dong Qingli, Shen Qingqing, and the others who were fans for the TV Series had murderous spirit in their eyes.","The most important question for them was— what was going to happen in the next episode?!","Can Bi Yao be resurrected? What will happen to Xiaofan!! Tell me!!!","Liu Ningyun had never felt so frustrated before.","As the Castellan of Black Dragon City, Huangpu Tao had never felt this frustrated before as well; he felt as if he had fallen into a huge bottomless hole, and he couldn’t even find his way out!","More importantly, a group of new viewers including the Xichi Spiritual Master were racing toward this huge hole one after another!","“Sir, can’t you release more episodes?!” Even people like Mo Tianxing couldn’t remain calm, let alone the people who came with him, such as the old and chubby Yu Cangshan. He said anxiously, “I can’t bear this suspense!”","“Kid Fang, come out!” Obviously, Mr. Fang had anticipated this situation and had gone out before the episode ended. Not able to find him, they looked around viciously with suppressed murderous intent. If Mr. Fang had hidden in the ground, they would have dug him out.","In fact, Mr. Fang had smartly exited from the virtual reality world. Putting down the virtual reality headset, he lounged on the computer chair and looked at the people who were searching for him on the scene. While sipping Coke, he thought, If you can, come through the cable and get me.","Suddenly, the atmosphere around him turned heavy as if a storm were brewing.","Puzzled, Mr. Fang looked around.","Liu Ningyun was standing behind him with cold, frosty eyes!","Huangpu Tao’s expression was dark!","Red-eyed, Ruan Ning and the other girls looked at Fang Qi with gritted teeth.","“What are you going to do?!” Mr. Fang suddenly had a bad feeling, and he said in a solemn voice, “I warn you! If you hit me, you’ll be treated as trouble makers!”","“I’m so angry!” Ruan Ning and the others felt like they were going to explode with fury.","At this moment, QQ beeped.","New Snow, [Tickle him, and you won’t be taken as trouble makers. Tickle him for us too!]","It was a gift from the friends of Dajin!","Then...","“Hahahahaha... are you crazy... Hahahaha... I’ll kick you out if you don’t stop...”","...","In the end, Mr. Fang used his privilege as the owner and issued the punishment. Nalan Mingxue, the person who led the trouble makers, was prohibited from touching the computer for three days and buying snacks for one week!","All the other participants were also banned for one day!","Finally, he showed them his power as the shop owner, but he couldn’t stop them from cussing at him as the scummy shop owner behind his back.","However, this little incident couldn’t alleviate people’s melancholy. Many of them felt lost and empty inside after watching these new episodes of Jade Dynasty.","It felt as if something important in their hearts had gone missing.","Meanwhile, the big guilds were preparing for the Battle for the Sand City accordingly. However, some people still felt melancholic; it couldn’t be avoided.","In a long time, many people couldn’t get rid of the sorrow from their hearts, and it was more obvious after the Xichi Spiritual Master and the others finished watching the newest episodes.","“Do humans really have such deep love?” In Qzone, Ning Bi asked while she controlled Chizuru Kagura to make moves; she had just finished watching the newest episode of Jade Dynasty.","“Maybe...” With a cigarette that he had bought from the store in Qzone dangling from his mouth, Fang Qi said while moving the joystick, “Who knows?”"]},{"number":318,"title":"Chapter 318 - Mr. Fang Who Challenged Orochi","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir... I’ll take a bottle of Coke!” Sitting on the couch red-eyed in the morning, Ruan Ning had a melancholic expression on her face. The other girls with her looked almost the same.","They looked as hopeless as young girls who had just broken up with their boyfriends.","“My Bi Yao... What a fine girl! How can her life be so pathetic?” Sitting on the couch, she mumbled and then bit into the spicy sticks with vengeance.","“Sir, is that just a story or something that really happened?” Ruan Ning asked indignantly while she gobbled down the food and snacks.","“Of course, it’s just a story,” Mr. Fang said blithely while eating instant noodles. Different from the others, he had read the story more than ten years ago, and the plot in the TV Series couldn’t cause such a big emotional stir in him.","“If it’s just a story, who created it?” The girls gazed at Fang Qi solemnly as if they were considering if they should send a few boxes of knives to the author. “Why did the author give my Bi Yao such a fate?! It’s despicable!”","This... hehehe... Mr. Fang thought, I also want to mail the author some knives if I can.","Since he couldn’t do it before he traveled through space and time, it was certainly even more difficult to do it here.","Fortunately, Mr. Fang never gave people spoilers, so they didn’t know that Bi Yao wouldn’t be resurrected even at the end of the story. Otherwise, these girls would have lost their minds and hacked at Mr. Fang with sabers.","Meanwhile, in the Nanhua Faction, things had also changed.","“Master, do you think Xiaofan can resurrect Bi Yao?” A few disciples surrounded the Xichi Spiritual Master.","Usually, when they had the opportunity to talk to their masters, they would ask some questions about the difficulties that they had encountered during cultivation. But now, things were different.","“As for that...” Usually, if they asked questions irrelevant to cultivation, they would be reprimanded by the serious Xichi Spiritual Master. But now, she just sighed heavily and said, “Heaven helps good people; you guys don’t have to worry about it.”","“The orthodox and unorthodox factions and forces in the TV Series look the same to me,” Mo Xian said with a snort.","Besides people at these two places, the others who had watched the latest episodes of Jade Dynasty were also talking about the development of the plot in other places all over the Morning Star Sea Realm.","However, another group of people in the internet café were trying to put away their melancholy; they were preparing for the battle and thus had no time to feel sad.","“What do you think? Should we combine our forces?”","“Do you think that we can beat the forces of Dajin if we are divided?”","The big forces of the Morning Star Sea Realm were making plans for the Battle of the Sand City next week. Any individual force was no match for the Royal Clan Guild, not even the alliance of the Yuanheng Pavilion and the Huang Family, who had entered the game the earliest, nor Black Demon and the Coiled Dragon Office.","They were now discussing if they should establish an alliance.","With the battle drawing near, the high-level members of Dajin’s Royal Family were also busy making strategies to best take over the Sand City.","...","Liu Ningyun had been giving Fang Qi the cold shoulder; her pretty eyes looked so chilly, as if Mr. Fang owed her tens of millions of crystals and wasn’t paying back.","However, since she didn’t have the intention to befriend other people in Half City, she only got along with Ruan Ning and her friends.","It meant that she had to bear Mr. Fang and see his ‘despicable face’ everyday.","In short, if she wanted to stay in the internet café, she had to endure everything and deal with Mr. Fang, even though she had the urge to beat him senseless.","“Morning!” Fang Qi looked up and saw a figure in white, so he greeted her casually.","“Morning.” Liu Ningyun poured hot water into a bowl of instant noodles and then sat on the couch close to Ruan Ning while she waited for the instant noodles to be ready.","Then, she saw a pretty figure sitting down beside her.","In fact, the pretty figure sat down beside Mr. Fang. But the couch was only that big, so the distance between her and Liu Ningyun got very close. “It’s great that I can eat instant noodles again!”","Liu Ningyun suddenly got really nervous for some reason, and her hair had stood up on end.","It was a feeling that she had never experienced before. Just imagine the scenario where an angel and a demon were sitting together and eating instant noodles together peacefully; it was what the scene looked like.","“Little Sister, why are you staring at me?” Ning Bi said with a chuckle, “If you don’t eat, your noodles will get cold.”","“...”","“Little Shop Owner.” She lounged on the couch lazily. “I came so early to patronize your shop. Can’t I have an extra bowl of instant noodles?”","Fang Qi drank up the soup in the bowl and said, “Have you seen me eating a second bowl?”","Are you kidding me? Even I can’t have a second bowl in a day!","“Stingy!” She wasn’t angry though. After opening the lid of the bowl, she stirred the noodles with a pair of chopsticks. Each of her moves had a unique charm.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi got up to play games, leaving her his back to look at.","“...”","Since everyone else was listless due to the latest episodes of Jade Dynasty, Mr. Fang spent most of his time on playing the King of Fighters himself, trying to clear stage with one token.","The three characters he chose was Iori Yagami, Kyo Kusanagi, and Chizuru Kagura, the classic team of the three main characters. Although Kyo Kusanagi had obvious shortcomings in the King of Fighters ’97, Fang Qi had to choose him to unlock the fist skills and unique moves in the store.","After getting familiar with the game, Fang Qi’s skills in the King of Fighters had improved greatly. With his smooth moves and plays, Iori Yagami successfully defeated the three enemies in the first team in Story Mode on his own.","Soon, the second team came up.","“Is the shop owner playing the King of Fighters again?” Ruan Ning finally figured out what he was doing. “Should we go and watch him play?”","After all, Mr. Fang’s smooth combos and nimble plays were enjoyable to watch.","Right now, they needed something to distract them from their melancholic thoughts.","“Is he challenging that so-called Orochi again?” Ning Bi looked interested. In fact, she had never seen Orochi before; she only heard from Mr. Fang words that it was an extremely powerful existence.","In the world of King of Fighters, Orochi had existed since the ancient times, and it had been guarding the Earth. It was a spirit without a physical body, and it was manifested through floating emotions and substances of nature. It was called Gaia’s Will (Earth’s Will) and was the chief of the Orochi Clan.","Orochi and its clan were not gods but one branch out of many ‘Gaia’s Will’. Despite all this, it still possessed horrifying and god-like power!","In the King of Fighters World, the fighters could battle with the horrifying existence such as ‘Gaia’s Will’, which interested not only Ning Bi but Liu Ningyun as well.","That was why Liu Ningyun ‘reluctantly’ went to Mr. Fang’s Qzone to watch him play, and she had to watch it with a certain demonic woman."]},{"number":319,"title":"Chapter 319 - The Battle with Orochi; Startled by the Interlude Animation","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! You are going to use Chizuru Kagura?” Song Qingfeng was surprised since Mr. Fang usually used Kyo Kusanagi and Iori Yagami, but rarely Chizuru Kagura.","At this moment, Fang Qi had just finished the first round, and Chizuru Kagura still had more than half of her HP. The situation looked good.","“Ugh? Chizuru Kagura?” Nanhua Heavenly Fairy Liu Ningyun was also puzzled. “Can he fight to the end with this character?”","Since Chizuru had no long-range moves and seemed to not have great combos, they had played her for a while before giving up.","“Oh! You’re playing the King of Fighters?” Still eating instant noodles, Huangpu Tao pulled over a bench and sat behind Fang Qi to watch him play.","It was time for breakfast, and Mo Tianxing and the others also stood behind to watch the game while eating instant noodles.","“What’s that?” Even the aloof Xichi Spiritual Master came over curiously and watched him play.","Soon, Fang Qi was surrounded by a group of people both in his Qzone and in the internet café.","At this moment, Fang Qi’s opponent was Chin Genzai, the Drunken Fist Master. At the beginning, they fought cautiously since the characters in the second team were already quite powerful.","However, in the next instant, Fang Qi squatted and dodged his opponent’s light kick in the air, and his opponent landed behind him and received two light punches from him.","This scene might be ordinary to others, but light suddenly appeared in Fang Qi’s Chizuru Kagura’s hands.","Desperation Move – Sui Chou no Mai!","On the screen, Chizuru turned into many blurry shadows, and she punched quickly. After her desperate move was over, she continued to attack with light punches in mid-air before launching light kicks and light punches while squatting.","Fang Qi’s controls were smooth and swift. The character on the screen moved fast while punching and kicking; the moves were so fast that they became blurry shadows!","“F*ck! A combo of 27 moves?!” Seeing this scene, Song Qingfeng’s eyes almost popped out.","“So dashing!” Lin Shao wished that he could do it too.","After the combo, Fang Qi’s opponent turned from having a full bar of HP to a sliver that was as thin as a thumb on the screen.","Also, his opponent had been stunned!","“We can play her like this?!”","“When striking from behind, a combo of 27 moves is not unusual,” Mr. Fang explained to them, “But it’s hard to find an opportunity. With a good opportunity, I can even launch a combo of 28 moves.”","“So awesome!”","“How come I couldn’t do it when I played her?” Liu Ningyun was dazed.","Sometime later, the picture on the screen changed from the battle stage of the competition to a huge altar!","The atmosphere turned grim when they saw the purple light shooting into the sky; it was a scene that they had never seen before!","There was only one opponent. When Fang Qi lined up his characters in the order of play, others saw that his opponent team had only one black figure.","“What’s happening?” Ruan Ning and the others were baffled.","The audience standing behind Fang Qi and eating noodles also had grim expressions on their faces since they could sense an extremely oppressive aura, even if they were two screens away.","When Chris of the Orochi Team revealed his snake eyes, lightning flashed while thunder rumbled on the screen. While the lightning flashes illuminated the area, the short white hair of that huge figure fluttered in the air, and a ring-shaped tattoo that looked like a radiant sun appeared on his chest.","As if it were disregarding the rules of the world, it hovered in the air.","Its body emitted a god-like aura!","“Orochi?!”","“Is this person Orochi?!”","The King of Fighters recreated by the System looked more real and thus gave people a stronger shock.","Behind Fang Qi, people exclaimed in surprise.","The moment they opened their mouths, Orochi’s body shifted and vanished!","In the next moment, it appeared behind Fang Qi’s Kyo Kusanagi!","“Translocation?!”","It was like teleportation without warning; it didn’t need time to cast like the teleportation skill of wizards.","Then, Orochi shot out a black spherical energy projectile, hitting the center of Kyo Kusanagi’s back. After that, it spread its arms above its head as if they were wings.","Many sparks flew down from the sky, and there was no place to dodge. The whole screen turned white.","Only after two moves, people saw that Fang Qi’s Kyo Kusanagi had turned from full HP to a tiny amount.","The moment Kyo Kusanagi stood up, Orochi shot up a beam of radiant spiritual essence from the ground with his will.","Kyo Kusanagi was killed instantly!","“So powerful!” Song Qingfeng gaped at the sight and forgot to close his mouth.","From his appearance until now, he had killed his opponent with only three moves!","“I didn’t play it well! I didn’t play it well!” Fang Qi shook his hands and inhaled deeply. Obviously, he was dazed by this defeat.","Soon, Iori Yagami stepped up. This time, Fang Qi was more cautious. The moment his opponent disappeared, he made a prediction and rolled. When Orochi appeared behind him, he had dodged again and moved behind Orochi.","Light punch plus Kuzu Kaze, then strong punch plus the Shiki Aoi Hana three repeat. This combo dropped Orochi’s HP by one-third!","“This prediction was awesome!”","“Very accurate!”","The people in the audience exclaimed.","The moment Orochi fell, Iori Yagami moved close to it swiftly. While the former stood up and raised his hand to release a black spherical energy projectile, Fang Qi moved up subconsciously and dodged this energy projectile at the perfect moment.","Fang Qi moved his hands calmly and used another combo in a flash.","Orochi could use combos as well, and it used them even more smoothly than Fang Qi.","The audience was at a loss for words while they watched the dazing combos, and they were surprised that this little game in Qzone could be so fascinating!","Fang Qi used the last character Chizuru Kagura to clear stage narrowly with the last bit of HP. Everyone thought that it was the end of the game, but the next scene...","Orochi couldn’t be killed so easily. Now, it was the turn to battle the real Orochi who had been sealed by the three sacred treasures for many years!","The resurrected Orochi descended on land like a god. In the interlude animation, it was no longer restricted by the frame of the game, so it could better showcase its power.","With violent gales and flashes of lightning around it, Orochi hovered in the air like a god. It easily activated the Blood of Orochi in Iori Yagami’s body and controlled Iori Yagami to charge toward Chizuru Kagura and Kyo Kusanagi.","Its horrifying strength swept across the whole world.","All the people watching the game were stunned and were at a loss for words!","Even through the screen, they could sense this great power. Since the players could buy and learn the stuff that they unlocked through playing games, it meant that this power was real!","At this moment, people saw that Iori Yagami was red-eyed with restlessness, and he was struggling violently. No one could control Iori Yagami, not even Orochi, who was a god-like existence. To everyone’s surprise, Wild Iori used his last trace of sanity and attacked Orochi.","His powerful and sharp claws clutched Orochi’s neck, and the horrifying purple flames shot up into the sky, piercing a hole in the dark clouds!","“Sir,” Song Qingfeng said in a shaky voice, “Can we learn this one!!??”","He was so excited that he shook all over.","On the other side, red flames shot up, and the terrifying flames almost burned everything around them into ashes.","“This is the Ultimate Desperation Move ‘Mu Shiki’?!” Song Qingfeng and the others cried out.","They might be able to learn this move.","In the thick fire beam, a figure engulfed in flames turned into a red light. It moved so fast that blurry shadows appeared behind it.","Strong punch!","The whole world was turned fiery red!"]},{"number":320,"title":"Chapter 320 - The Second Movie Emerges","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This is the Ultimate Desperation Move ‘Totsuka-no-Tsurugi’, the advanced version of ‘Mu Shiki’.” Having finally cleared the stage, Fang Qi was in a good mood. Therefore, he lit a cigarette and watched the ending animation with a relaxed expression, giving the audience an explanation.","[TL Note: We couldn’t find any reference to the term in the game, so we used the best estimate and translated it as Totsuka-no-Tsurugi.]","“Ugh...” The cultivators who had been eating noodles looked baffled.","The King of Fighters’ plot was not continuous, and the animations didn’t come until the players met the Orochi Team. However, people could still guess the general plot of the King of Fighters.","But they all began to wonder, If warriors can be so powerful, why am I still training to become a cultivator?!","Fortunately, they had read a volume of the Heavenly Book in Jade Dynasty. Otherwise, they would have wanted to become warriors after watching this game.","Anyway, they were amazed by Orochi’s powerful abilities, which made it look like both a warrior and a cultivator. The highly effective close-range combat techniques and the powerful AoE spells such as Desperation Move – Marukare (Orochi Divine Light) stunned them.","“Sir, can we learn Orochi’s spiritual spells?” Wide-eyed, Huangpu Tao asked unclearly with a mouthful of instant noodles that he hadn’t swallowed.","Even the ordinary spiritual pillar, reflective shield, and shockwave had horrifying power, let alone the desperation moves.","By now, the animation for clearing the stage had finished playing.","[A magnificent victory! Congratulations to you for sealing Orochi again, and you have won a golden trophy. Do you want to share it in the Friend Circle on QQ?]","Mr. Fang shared it casually.","Soon, all of Mr. Fang’s friends received a message from Friend Circle, and an exquisite golden trophy appeared behind his avatar; it looked dashing and cool.","“F*ck! Awesome!”","“How did the shop owner get that?”","Su Tianji, who had been playing Plants vs Zombies, almost fainted. I’ve been playing Plants vs Zombies every day and haven’t cleared the stage yet. How come this kid is so fast?! He even won a trophy?!","At this moment, in the store at Qzone, all the moves, including the desperation moves used by Kyo Kusanagi, Iori Yagami, and Chizuru Kagura in the King of Fighters ’97 had been unlocked; they could now be bought.","Of course, Fang Qi still couldn’t afford the training and practice methods for the desperation moves.","Even if he could afford them, it would take a long time for him to reach the level of the three main characters.","But still, people were envious of Fang Qi for having access to these moves.","These cultivators all craved Orochi’s spiritual spells, but they were baffled at the same time. “Sir, can warriors be as strong as these people?!”","“You should ask the warriors of Dajin,” Fang Qi said in earnest, “They are learning Sword 23 now.”","Then, he explained to them what Sword 23 was.","These cultivators began to realize that warriors could be very powerful; the only problem was that they hadn’t met any warrior who was that powerful yet!","...","Meanwhile, the spiritual artifact masters in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance of Dajin were still studying runewords and spiritual spells.","Obviously, they were successful in copying these things, but it was difficult to truly understand the theories of another knowledge system from the base.","Soon, they encountered a bottleneck since they could observe the items and their power but couldn’t understand why that was the case. However, they were reluctant to give it up because this novel and special stuff could complement the current spiritual-artifact-making process. If they could add the new theories into their current knowledge system, the system in the end would become better and more complete.","“How was it?” Jun Yangzi felt frustrated.","“Not good.” Li Haoran also looked sulky. “In Diablo, a lot of basic knowledge is lost. We can copy the methods, but it will be difficult to create new stuff...”","Meanwhile, many neighboring forces saw the silent withdrawal of the Yundian Upper Realm after it got defeated, and they began to swarm into Jiuhua City of Dajin to find the reason.","However, the situation changed almost overnight.","“I heard a plague named Internet Addiction appeared in Jiuhua City. Is it true?” On Jade Hill Mountain in the ocean, a green-robed old man asked with a cup of tea in his hand. He was gazing at a man wearing a white robe with golden patterns, the latter being Feng Xi.","“Elder Xu, do your disciples often sneak out of the faction and skip the morning lesson? Are there a lot of disciples missing from the elders’ classes?” Feng Xi asked in all seriousness.","The green-robed elder with the surname of Xu looked grim. “Yes, we have a few of such disciples!”","“That’s it!” Feng Xi said while nodding, “Their laziness, obsession with useless things, and even disrespect to seniors and elders are all symptoms of the Internet Addiction poison! If you’re not careful, this disease will spread all over the faction. You must treat it with care!”","Elder Xu’s face twitched. If all the disciples in the faction were like this, none of them could be entrusted with great responsibilities!","He asked immediately, “Is there any cure for them?”","“Don’t worry.” Feng Qi said with a trace of sympathy on his face. “Our Three Saint Gates have predicted this disaster in the cultivation world and found a solution to the problem. I’m here to deliver it.”","“Then... Thank you! Messenger Feng” Elder Xu was elated. “The Three Saint Gates are living in seclusion, but you are still concerned about the safety of the cultivation world! It’s a blessing for all of us! Messenger Feng, tell me your plan, and we’ll do our best to work with you!”","“Good.” Feng Xi nodded and said, “Since our Three Saint Gate don’t have enough manpower, you can send the disciples who have been poisoned to our factions, and we’ll cure them together.”","“It is the great fortune of these unruly disciples!” Elder Xu was even more pleased. “However, this is the issue of our faction; we don’t want to cause you trouble.”","“This issue concerns the safety of the whole cultivation world,” Feng Xi said, “Your faction isn’t the only one that is involved.”","“Okay!” Elder Xu finally agreed. “I’ll have these disciples sent to your factions immediately to remove this poison... Thank you for your effort!”","In the Taixi Faction, Duyou Holiness was sitting on the bank of the lake in a white robe.","A black-robed old man chuckled while stroking his beard, “With this plan, we can easily combine major forces to work against them without getting ourselves involved. Your plan is excellent, Duyou Holiness.”","“Hahahaha...” The white-robed old man said with a laugh, “The people who are involved with worldly affairs tend to lose their heads whenever they gain some power. They don’t know that we can overturn them with one hand.”","...","“&¥*%#...” In Qzone, Song Qingfeng mimicked Kyo’s Kusanagi and copied the movement of ‘Mu Shiki’, thinking that he was dashing while doing it.","By now, many players had begun playing the King of Fighters after watching Mr. Fang. Even Nalan Mingxue visited Mr. Fang’s Qzone and played Joe Higashi, using Hurricane Upper to send out small tornadoes, but her character was beaten senseless by Mr. Fang.","Then, he received a prompt from the System:","[The number of players who is playing games in Qzone has reached 200; Task “A fresh wind in the online games era” is completed.","Task Reward: Movie – Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone; one day access to the Game Cultivation Room.]"]},{"number":321,"title":"Chapter 321 - The Group Tour to the Fantasy World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","No one knew or cared about what was happening outside. The entirety of Dajin was like a peaceful haven floating in a heavy storm. Another night passed peacefully after the warm and cozy candlelight was blown out.","However, in the distant Nanhua Faction at the Morning Star Sea Realm, it was a stormy night.","The disappearance of many disciples had alerted the high-level cultivators of the Nanhua Faction. However, no one noticed that something was slowly growing in the faction’s most sacred location, the Forbidden Place where no one dared to enter.","“Not enough... this is not enough...” In the darkness came a husky and deep voice. It was speaking the human language, but it sounded like the growls of a wild beast. “Go and find more for me, and I’ll give you more power!","“Let more people submit to me...”","“The people of the Nanhua Faction are on guard and are prepared for us. Now, the high-level cultivators of the faction are alerted. It’s not wise to continue,” another voice said. “I need to go out of the faction and recruit more powerful cultivators for you.”","“Go... I’ll give them the power they crave for!”","...","Half City was the most mixed place in the Morning Star Sea Realm; it gathered people from all kinds of forces in the region. Origins Internet Club was like a miniature version of that.","However, nowhere was livelier and friendlier than this place.","“Sir, a bottle of Coke!”","“A bowl of instant noodles and a sausage!”","“A box of spicy sticks!”","“...”","These were the main sounds during the morning every day. At this moment, a voice quite different from the others said, “Little Shop Owner, what’s this Harry Potter that you wrote on the blackboard?”","If it were a name like Jade Dynasty, some people would ask about it. But Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone?","[TL Note: Also known as Harry Potter and the Philosopher’s Stone in some places].","Even though Mr. Fang put the weird name on the top of the other announcements on the small blackboard, more eye-catching than the announcement of [Battle of the Royal City; winner becomes king], few people cared to ask about it.","Fang Qi looked at the gorgeous face before him. With her red lips curled into a cute and teasing smile, she gazed at him intensely with her charming eyes.","As usual, the place quieted down, and the female disciples of the Nanhua Faction glared at her angrily but didn’t dare to do anything disrespectful.","Mo Xian whispered, “That demonic woman again...”","“How come she comes here every day. It’s so bothersome...”","“Careful; don’t let her hear you.”","“...”","A weird chill rose in the air.","“You can beat them after they go out of the shop; but don’t do it inside.” Mr. Fang pointed at the rules of the shop, showing that even he had heard the whispered words. There was no way that this demonic woman didn’t hear them.","“Giggle...” She chuckled and said, “I’ve never beaten humans before.”","With a twitch on his face, Fang Qi wondered if she only killed humans.","“Forget it. I’m in a good mood today and don’t want to mind those little girls. I will just pretend that I didn’t hear them. You still haven’t told me what on earth is Harry Potter and what a movie is.”","“You can take it as a short TV Series, because one episode tells one story,” Mr. Fang explained this new stuff. “It’s about the strange things happening to a group of cultivators named wizards...”","Meanwhile in the Jiuhua City Shop, Jiang Xiaoyue was also giving a short explanation to the customers who wanted to know about the new movie. Of course, she got the information from Mr. Fang.","“Wizards?”","The players who had played Diablo in Dajin might be able to understand this a little, but for the cultivators in the Morning Star Sea Realm, it was a new idea.","Although no one else asked about it, people were all listening to the explanation attentively while they had breakfast. Obviously, they didn’t want to waste time on something that had a name which was uninteresting to them.","However, many of them were still curious.","“What good is this thing?” Ruan Ning only heard about it in the Legend of Mir 2, but she wasn’t too interested in this movie. In fact, she looked contemptuous.","[TL Note: In the raw, it said that Ruan Ning had never heard about it before. It is because the wizards in the Legend of Mir 2 and Harry Potter have slightly different names in Chinese, but the translation is the same in English. Therefore, we have to alter the text a little for it to make sense.]","“I’m going to gather a group to watch the movie. Do any of you want to watch it?” Then, Mr. Fang sent the same message in a chat group named [Mr. Fang’s Group Tour].","Lan Mo: [I want to watch it!]","Li Haoran: [Me! Me! Me!]","Jun Yangzi: [Wizards? Is it about magic? Count me in.]","Duan Buyi: [Daoist Brother Jun Yanzi will watch it? Count me in!]","Ye Songtao: [Why are you so interested in weird things? (Husky’s puzzled face)]","Xue Daolv: [Faction Master Ye, this meme of yours <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\">]","Ye Xiaoye: [He got it from me.]","“...”","An Cheng: [Don’t get distracted! Why are you so eager to watch it? Tell us! (Akita Inu’s dirty smile)]","Jun Yangzi: [We encountered a bottleneck recently in our study. We want to watch similar things to get some inspiration.]","Nalan Mingxue: [We warriors don’t need to watch it. You guys go ahead first.]","However, people like Dong Qingli and Shen Qingqing, who loved stories, and Xu Zixin, who loved new things, naturally joined the group.","“...”","Not as eager as with Jade Dynasty, many people still gathered to watch the new movie.","“So many people?” Ruan Ning read the many messages in the group. They were mostly from the people of Dajin, but she seemed to have sensed something.","She was more curious about it. “Maybe... maybe I’ll watch it too?”","“All set? I’ll begin the tour!” In his Qzone, Fang Qi glanced around the audience and said.","Compared with last time, Mr. Fang’s group today had only one stranger, and no one made a big deal of it.","On the other hand, Ning Bi was surprised since she was always the focus of everyone wherever she went, even though it was in a negative way.","In contrast, Xu Zixin and the others, who often came to Mr. Fang’s Qzone to play the King of Fighters, greeted her in a friendly manner, which surprised her even more.","“Hey! Sir! Wait!” Ruan Ning who had just finished paying hurried in.","[Your friend Ruan Ning is onboard.]","[Xi Yue, Su Zhi, and Su Yao are onboard.]","“I’ll start the tour now!”","As Mr. Fang clicked [Start], the scene before them changed. It was dark, and it seemed to be the night.","The buildings on the street seemed to come from one century ago. It was midnight, but the cat sitting on the wall of the garden was wide awake. It sat there motionlessly like a statue, staring at the distant street corner without blinking.","A man appeared on the corner that the cat had been staring at, appearing so suddenly and silently that it seemed like he just popped out of the ground. The cat’s tail twitched, and its eyes narrowed.","“So strange.” The audience stared at the old man who had silver hair and a silver beard, since no one could see how he appeared here.","Flight? No, he seemed to have arrived instantly. It was more like – teleportation."]},{"number":322,"title":"Chapter 322 - The Wizard World that Amazed the Cultivators","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The old man’s silver hair and silver beard were long enough to tuck into his belt. He wore a long robe and a purple cloak that swept the ground, and his bright blue eyes sparkled behind his half-moon spectacles.","His attire and appearance didn’t look like a cultivator. Instead, he looked like an old-time, gentle scholar.","Yes. A scholar was the first impression that this old man gave to everyone.","Albus Dumbledore was the headmaster of the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry.","“I didn’t expect to see you here, Professor McGonagall.”","He smiled at the cat.","The cat disappeared, turning into a rather serious-looking woman who was wearing square glasses that had the patterns exactly the same as the patterns around the cat’s eyes.","“This transfiguration spell is so strange...” Everyone had thought that it was really a cat either from its look or its aura, and they were surprised when it turned into a person.","It was different from the usual illusion spell; it seemed to have changed the human’s physical structure completely.","“Is this the Shapeshifting Spell?” Bu Che, who was with Young Castellan An and played Druid in Diablo 2, found this spell familiar.","“Shapeshifting Spell?” All the people looked at him in surprise.","“It’s a spiritual spell that can change one’s own structure into that of another species,” Bu Che explained.","“Is that so?”","From the characters in the movie, the cultivators didn’t sense horrifying cultivation strength but rather saw many strange but effective spiritual spells and items. For example, Dumbledore used a strange item like a light extinguisher to turn off the streetlights silently.","If the cultivators had to do something like this, they might explode the streetlights with their spiritual essence, but it would obviously cause an upheaval and attract unnecessary attention.","They might also use arrays to block the surrounding area, but it seemed like overkill.","“Interesting small spells.” Ning Bi was interested.","With a fluffy and cute stuffed Pikachu in her arms, Dong Qingli joined the discussion, “There is such a special feeling.”","“Is he a wizard that the shop owner mentioned before?”","“He indeed looks like a cultivator, but, um, he has a special look...”","At the beginning of the movie, the characters were talking about Voldemort’s murder of Harry Potter’s parents and the plan to send Harry Potter to the mortal world. By now, the audience also learned a new word—muggles.","It was the name used by the wizards to address the talentless ordinary people.","Suddenly, they remembered that the shop owner occasionally called them ‘a group of muggles’, and someone had even naively asked him what muggles were. Now, they glared at the shop owner with gritted teeth.","Soon, they had no time to glare at Mr. Fang since they found that this world was very special. For example, the Diagon Alley that was hidden in the mortal world. Also, the wizards obviously lived in the same place as the ordinary people, but they separated themselves from muggles with spells. In addition, there were even goblins which looked like humans but were ugly and shorter, more so than even the little Harry Potter.","The pictures were interesting. Dumbledore’s photo seemed to have a life of its own; he could vanish from it when he didn’t want to stay, and when he came back, he even greeted Harry Potter with a smile.","It was more interesting when Harry Potter arrived at Hogwarts with the other boys and girls and began the sorting process.","“Master! Look! That hat can even sing!” Fenghua and Yuexin called out to Su Tianji.","On the stool in the great hall was a pointed wizard’s hat. This hat was patched and frayed and extremely dirty.","At this moment, the rip near the brim opened wide like a mouth, and the hat began to sing,","“Oh, you may not think I’m pretty, but don’t judge on what you see. I’ll eat myself if you can find a smarter hat than me...”","“Haha! This hat is so funny!” Jiang Xiaoyue laughed so much that her belly hurt.","“Giggle...” Ning Bi covered her red lips, obviously finding the hat very funny. “How do they do that?”","Obviously, even she couldn’t understand why the hat possessed a spirit like a living being and had high intelligence; it could sing and sort new students into different houses according to their personalities and talents.","Meanwhile, Jun Yangzi and the others were in deep thought. After all, the supreme treasures got their name because they had some spirit in them.","However, in this world, even a little picture that was just for young wizard students to play with could be instilled with spirits, which was unimaginable to the viewers.","By now, the wizards hadn’t showed any great powers yet, but the scenes that the viewers watched were fun, and they continued watching with great interest.","Compared with Jade Dynasty, that they had watched before, this movie had a healing effect.","Even these grand cultivators with high cultivation strength found this world novel and amazing, let alone the little Harry Potter.","Following Harry Potter, they saw many magical items and weird things and watched him make new friends in his house. Also, they witnessed all kinds of fun or embarrassing incidents and interesting characters, like the prank-loving ghost that he met when he was almost late for class and the spell professor who was short and could only reach the desk by standing on a stack of books.","Instead of heavy burdens and suppression, the place was full of interesting surprises and laughs; everyone felt light-hearted while they watched it.","“This place seems fun...” Fenghua whispered.","Yuexin said, “I want to study in this place too...”","“Look! That professor turned the desk into a pig!” At this moment, a serious-looking female professor was teaching the class, and the pig that had been a desk ran around the classroom aimlessly. Obviously, she not only changed its looks but gave it a pig’s vitality and thinking abilities!","Soon, the pig was changed back.","Ning Bi was even more interested, and she said with a chuckle, “This spiritual spell is very interesting. If anyone dares to be rude to me, I’ll turn them into pigs!”","Mo Xian and the others who had been eating spicy sticks suddenly shivered.","While the students were stunned by the witch’s Transfiguration Spell, the cultivators were eager to learn this spell. They might be thinking of turning their opponents or the opponents’ spiritual artifacts into a pig.","At this moment, as if she had heard their wish, the female professor began to teach the students how to use the Transfiguration Spell, including the incantation and casting method.","They were very complicated. Despite the many notes that the students had taken, they could only practice turning a match into a needle.","At this moment, Shen Qingqing and other girls were smart, and they took out paper and pens that they had purchased in their Qzones and began taking notes.","“We can really learn it?!” Many people exclaimed in elation, and they copied the girls and bought notebooks to take notes.","“These words seem to be the basics and foundation of runewords!” Jun Yangzi said in astonishment.","The other artifact masters’ eyes lit up!"]},{"number":323,"title":"Chapter 323 - The Grand Cultivators Playing with Magic","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Obviously, many basic magic theories and foundations in the world of Harry Potter were similar to those in Diablo 2.","In fact, the two classes that used magic in Diablo had more official names. The necromancers were also called wizards while sorceresses were called witches (In the original version, there were only sorceresses and no sorcerers).","Although the two worlds had lots of differences, the basics and foundations were similar.","Even the materials for making magic wands were similar. In Diablo, necromancers usually used yew wands. Likewise, in Harry potter, yew wood was the main material in many magic wands.","Clearly, people had found that these two worlds were structured on the same system, which was why Jun Yangzi and the other artifact masters tried to obtain inspirations about the basic magic theories by watching this movie.","The amazing fantasy world, which was totally different from that of Diablo, was an extra bonus for them, let alone the fact that they could learn a lot of basic knowledge of magic and alchemy while enjoying the movie.","“Look! They fly by riding on brooms! Hahaha! It’s funny!”","“Sir, how come people fly this way.” While walking behind Mr. Fang, Jiang Xiaoyue burst into laughter.","All in all, Harry Potter and the Philosopher’s Stone gave them a cheerful and lively mood. Harry Potter’s journey to Hogwarts to study magic with friends and the many adventures in this fantasy world were fun to watch. Even when Harry Potter fought Professor Quirrell, who was controlled by Voldemort, the viewers felt anxious but not depressed.","In their eyes, although the wizards and witches also used spiritual spells, could fly, and had long lifespans, they were not like cultivators.","While the cultivators aimed at going beyond their limit and achieving Dao, the wizard and witches were more like scholars who aimed to expand their knowledge and better understand the truth of the world by increasing their lifespan.","That was why they had schools, professors, and researchers. They also had different departments and houses with different systems of knowledge.","The whole movie didn’t make them show any extremely powerful strength, but it wasn’t important. Since they had deep knowledge, the items and things that they were researching greatly benefited these powerful cultivators; that was enough,","While they were expectant of young Harry Potter’s growth, they wondered what other magical things would appear. For example, at the beginning of the movie, the old headmaster seemed to have used a spell that achieved teleportation. If the Philosopher’s Stone could extend one’s life and even give people eternal life, they wondered if the stone could be created in the real world.","After finishing the movie, they were all eager to watch the sequels.","Without them noticing it, the pleasant tour in the fantasy world ended in cheers and laughter, and many people felt like their moods were lifted.","“How was it?”","“Is the movie good?”","The moment they finished watching the movie, they found many questions in [Mr. Fang’s Group Tour] group chat in QQ. Obviously, the others estimated that they would be done by this time and now came out with questions.","Liu Ningyun: [Were you all watching it? Can you tell us how it is? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f601.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F601;\">]","Mo Xian: [The name alone sounds weird. Is it good?]","Song Qingfeng: [While the shop owner was out watching the movie, I took this opportunity to play the King of Fighters (Akita Inu’s fawning smile). It’s cool.]","Nalan Hongwu, [Can anyone tell me about it? I plan to watch it later.]","Huangpu Tao was a bit late today, and he was puzzled while he read these messages. What is it? What are you talking about? What is good?","“...”","Seeing the messages jumping in the group chat, the people who had just finished watching the movie were surprised. “So many messages?”","[This movie is super fun! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f601.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F601;\"> There is a spiritual spell which can turn any object into a pig. There are also a group of wizards who fly on brooms. It’s super fun! (Husky’s cute face)] Jiang Xiaoyue posted her comment soon.","[There are many interesting spiritual spells!] Yuexin added, [I highly recommend it.]","[Anyway, I didn’t see any powerful spiritual spells yet, but their study and understanding on some of the things are deeper than ours.] Xue Daolv’s comment was to the point. [If you want to try it, you won’t be disappointed.]","[Superb! It’s super fun!] Ye Xiaoye was the most active one in the group chat.","Jun Yangzi: [I recommend this movie to all the artifact masters who are studying runewords and magic instillation and cultivators who want to dive deeper into the magic system. There are lots of fundamental stuff, and it’s explained in detail.]","Of course, it was detailed. After all, the professors taught the knowledge in the classroom!","[Anyone who’s interested in longevity can watch it.] Ning Bi joined the fun. [It’s said that the Philosopher’s Stone can give people permanent youth.]","[It doesn’t mean you won’t die though.] Mr. Fang gave them a friendly reminder. [They can still be killed. <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f923.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F923;\">]","[They have such a thing?!] Nalan Hongwu had cold sweat on him. [Is there anyone who is going to study it? I want to extend my life by dozens of years longer...]","Mr. Fang: “...”","[The movie doesn’t explain the creation process of the Sorcerer’s Stone.] Su Tianji reminded them. [Besides, it needs unicorn’s blood. Since we don’t have this creature in our world, I’m afraid that we can’t make it.]","[Ugh...]","[Can we use horned horses?] Someone asked tentatively.","[Sad. I’m concerned for this species in our world.]","Jun Yangzi: [We can still try it. The unicorn blood can extend life, but anyone who touches it will be cursed. Obviously, the Sorcerer’s Stone doesn’t curse people, so I guess it wasn’t made of unicorn blood.]","Mo Xian: [After hearing your discussion, I have the urge to watch it...]","Ruan Ning: [I recommend people to watch it, if you don’t want to be turned into a pig.]","“Master.” Liu Ningyun was helping her master, the Xichi Spiritual Master, to level up, and she asked, “Should we go and watch Harry Potter?”","“Harry what?!” The Xichi Spiritual Master looked baffled. Obviously, her age made it hard for her to catch up to the new things. Jade Dynasty was easy to understand for her since that world was similar to the real world.","“It’s about a wonderful world of magic,” Liu Ningyun explained.","“Really?”","“Master, should we go and watch Harry Potter together?” Mo Xian asked her at this moment.","“Master, should we go and watch Harry Potter?” another disciple asked.","“...”","“Why are you all asking me to watch Harry Potter?” Nonplussed, the Xichi Spiritual Master was pulled to watch the movie by her disciples...","Meanwhile, some cultivators who had just finished the movie held onto small sticks that they took from the counter. “Transfiguration!”","Nothing happened."]},{"number":324,"title":"Chapter 324 - The Imminent Battle of the Royal City","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, Mr. Fang received a new task.","[New task: The Otherworldly Journey Starting from Harry Potter","Target for Completion: the activation number for Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone reaches 300","Task Reward: Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets; The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey","Task description: This is a full-scale educational tour of the other worlds]","“What’s wrong?” They chanted the incantation again, but still, nothing happened.","“Obviously, your tones and rhythm when chanting the incantation were wrong. Besides, the injection of spiritual essence wasn’t right either.” In a good mood, Ning Bi surprisingly opened her mouth and explained to them, “In addition, even a wizard can’t cast spells without the assistance of a magic wand, let alone a bunch of beginners like you.”","At this stage, it was still difficult for them to change one object into another, let alone changing people.","The only good news was that, different from the cultivators’ spiritual spells which had to match their corresponding cultivation techniques, the wizards’ spells could be cast with similar energy. Since wizards from different houses and branches could learn and use the transfiguration spell, cultivators certainly could do the same.","Ning Bi narrowed her pretty eyes. “Sir, how do we make magic wands?”","The magic wands were the catalysts of magic spells. Although they were all grandmasters in the system of cultivators, they were only beginners in the new magic system.","Even though they might learn the spells faster than others, they couldn’t skip the beginning stage; no one could start running before learning how to walk.","Besides, the transfiguration spell was the most complicated and most dangerous spell in all the courses of Hogwarts.","“You can take this question to the cultivators of Dajin,” Fang Qi said. “They had begun research long ago.”","The artifact masters of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance in Dajin hadn’t been idle, and they had borne many fruits from their research. For example, they had improved the gun powder with cultivation materials, as well as improved the shell materials and increased the air pressure of gun powder combustion with arrays.","Although they encountered a bottleneck in magic instillation, they could now mimic the basic magic instillation and even had several options for materials and ratios.","As for the wands... After Wang Tai won the third place of the individual competition for Diablo, he had gotten a sorcerer’s blue short wand.","...","Due to the many good comments from the members of [Mr. Fang’s Group Tour], many people began watching Harry Potter. For example, led by her disciples, the Xichi Spiritual Master formed a Nanhua group to watch the movie.","“Master! Look! The buildings and the people’s attire here are so strange...”","“Their spells are weird but are quite interesting.”","“Look! This is the hat that can sing. It looks even more intelligent than the supreme treasures in our faction!”","“Hahaha! So funny!”","“Is the Philosopher’s Stone that they treasure so much the one they mentioned in the group chat? They said it could make people forever young and immortal!”","“Is it really that powerful?”","“...”","Overall, this was a pleasant experience. More importantly, it had been a long time since the whole faction organized a group activity, and the two groups of her disciples were getting along very well.","The Xichi Spiritual Master still looked cold, but she was in fact very happy.","They also saw the magic which was totally different from their current spiritual spell system and learned a lot from it. Soon, Liu Ningyun began recommending it in the chat group. [The movie has a weird name, but it’s pretty good overall.]","Mo Xian: [Agreed. My master, junior sisters, and I enjoyed it very much!]","Yue Yan, a female disciple of the Nanhua Faction: [I just don’t know if there will be more powerful spells. Am I a bit greedy?]","Soon, the members in [Mr. Fang’s Group Tour] who hadn’t watched the movie and were spectating went to watch it from their recommendations.","However, by now, the people who had the leisure to watch the movie were mostly independent players. The core members of the major guilds were busy preparing for the event, Battle of the Royal City; Winner Becomes King. It was about to begin.","It concerned not only their interest in the game; the three real godly weapons were waiting for the Sand City Master. This throne represented not only glory but strength as well!","To ensure that they could take Sand City and obtain the three real godly weapons, the major guilds in the Morning Star Sea Realm had combined forces and established the Morning Star Sea Cultivator Alliance. They planned to take the Royal City together and then share the godly weapons among them.","To prepare for this battle, the Morning Star Sea Cultivator Alliance had recruited the few fighters in this shop. Together with the Taoist troop which was filled with skeletons, they were the vanguard.","This time, Dajin didn’t underestimate their rival. They combined the main forces of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and Jiuhua Army, determined to win the throne of the Sand City.","At this moment, all the players of the Legend of Mir 2 in the Origins Internet Club entered battle mode!","The scale of this battle was obviously several times bigger than the previous internet café competitions. It was the grandest event of all time!","To ensure that other players could watch the Battle for the Royal City, the shops in both region would broadcast it live on the big screens.","The participating players would enter the specified guild battle map to fight. Each side could bring 500 elites, and the back-up could enter the battle after the members of the main forces died.","After entering the map, each kill was one point. If it was a draw and both sides lived on, the team with the higher points would be the winner.","The Battle of the Sand City would begin at seven in the evening. On this day, all the participating players got online hours before the scheduled time and caused a storm even before the battle began!","“Kill! Kill them all!” At the Morning Star Sea Cultivator Alliance channel, the leaders of the major guilds were roaring, “Today, no Taoists are permitted to practice skeletons! We must keep our skeletons at level 7; the skeletons of the Royal Clan Guild are only at level 3!”","“All the Taoists, hurry up and level up the skeletons! Level them up as high as you can!”","At the big places for leveling up, such as Zuma Temple, Wilma Temple, and Stone Tome Array, all the Taoists who were leveling up were instantly killed, so were the wizards and fighters who received collateral damage.","“Fight back! Fight back for me!” Voices roared in the Dajin Royal Clan Guild channel in QQ.","Instantly, the atmosphere in the game got explosive and combative."]},{"number":325,"title":"Chapter 325 - Entering the Royal City","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The food around here sucks!” Mr. Fang stretched and then lounged on his computer chair.","He had had instant noodles for breakfast. As for his lunch and dinner...","Suddenly, Mr. Fang missed Xiaoyue’s cooking skills, which were way better than Zou Mo’s. Mr. Fang had to buy his meals from restaurants.","“If you’re tired of the food places close by, you can try another restaurant,” Xi Yu said, “Besides the ones around the corners, there are other places that provide good food. I know one restaurant in the 18th Block that’s really good, but it’s a bit far from here...”","“Oh...” Mr. Fang thought for a moment. “Then, I won’t go...”","Then, he beckoned at Zou Mo and dug out a handful of crystals. “Little Mo! Take these and buy yourself some food from the 18th Block and bring some back for me!”","“...”","“Sir! You have no conscience!” After a pause, Xi Yue exploded with indignation, and her roars almost deafened Mr. Fang.","“You want to eat but order him to go so far to get you food!” She mumbled in indignation.","Mr. Fang said with a serious expression, “There are so many customers in the shop. Can I leave it unattended?”","...","“Come to Zuma Temple to kill the members of the Royal Clan Guild!”","“Wilma Temple! Send reinforcement to Wilma Temple!”","People yelled in the internet café while they began the fierce skirmishes.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang felt no sense of urgency before the big battle since he was the referee.","Leisurely, he played some rounds of the King of Fighters and Plants vs Zombies.","“Thud!” A meal box was placed on Mr. Fang’s desk with force. Fang Qi looked back and saw a red-clothed girl with fierce eyes.","“Ms. Ruan, why are you glaring at me?” Fang Qi looked at her curiously. “How come you got my food? Where’s Little Mo?”","“Shame on you!” With her hands on her waist, Ruan Ning glared at Mr. Fang like a tigress. “If I didn’t stumble on the scene, Little Mo would have been robbed! You know his cultivation strength isn’t high, yet you still sent him to a faraway place for errands!”","“I’m sorry, Boss!” With a bruise on his face, Zou Mo looked apologetic.","“Someone dared to rob a member of our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?” Mr. Fang looked surprised. “Is your injury serious? If not, ask Su Yao to cast the healing spell on you, and you’ll be fine.”","“I stopped them in time. Of course, his injury isn’t serious!” Ruan Ning said with a snort.","Zou Mo scratched his head and looked sorry.","...","This small incident seemed to pass quickly, and no one paid much attention to it.","Zou Mo’s injury healed quickly with the healing spell. After eating, Mr. Fang saw that there was still time before the Battle of the Royal City, so he went upstairs to cultivate.","From the previous task, he had gained access to the Game Cultivation Room.","“In the guild battle map, it seems like our items won’t drop even when we die!” Someone yelled in the internet café.","Obviously, the players could enter the guild battle map early right now, but the battle hadn’t begun.","Instantly, Black Demon and the others who had been hesitating if they should use their best items immediately changed to their best gear. Meanwhile, the players whose items were not the best and still had rooms for improvement all went to borrow good ones from their friends.","– When it was almost 7 PM –","Many players from Dajin and the Morning Star Sea Realm brought their ultimate items. Tang Yan, the Master of the Yuanheng Pavilion, even took out his Bone Jade Staff.","Of course, Ji Wu had taken out his Judgement Staff!","In the 500-people phalanx of Dajin, the front rows were high-level warriors who were wearing war-god armors with the Moon in Well in their hands. The wizards and Taoists stood in the back rows, ready to battle.","On the side of the Morning Star Sea Realm Cultivator Alliance, rows of skeletons stood in the front, and many of them emitted dangerous dark blue light.","“They began fighting outside!” Before the battle began, Ji Wu received the message. In the guild battle map, each party had 500 people, but the back-up troops of more than 1,000 gathered at the entrance. The place outside the guild battle map wasn’t in the safe zone, and players could kill each other and potentially drop their items. When the two back-up troops met, they instantly began fighting!","It would be better if they could stop the other party from entering the map.","“All the players outside the guild battle map, jump to the second channel! Centralize orders! Listen to orders!”","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang already announced that the battle began!","In the Jiuhua City Shop, many players who didn’t play the Legend of Mir 2 were watching the battle in front of the big screens.","Some of them even came early and grabbed good spots on the couches just to watch the magnificent battle between Dajin and the Morning Star Sea Realm!","“Gongzi Xiao, what do you think of the Battle of the Sand City?” Mu Donglai was one of the people who had come very early and took the best spots on the couches. He asked Xiao Yulv with his eyes glued on the big screen while eating spicy sticks.","At this moment, many people glanced at them.","While sipping the spiritual wine that he bought from Wind and Moon Pavilion, Xiao Yulv waved his folding fan and analyzed calmly, “Both parties each has 500 people. From this perspective, no one has the upper-hand. However, our Dajin is better than the opponent in other aspects, such as skills.”","Mu Donglai asked immediately, “Do you mean that Dajin’s Royal Clan Guild will win?”","Obviously, Xiao Yulv had learned his lesson. “The situation on the battlefield changes each second, so I can’t predict the result. Let’s just watch the competition.”","Mu Donglai said, “You’re right, Gongzi Xiao. However, as citizens of Dajin, we must root for the Royal Clan Guild, right? After all, the Royal Clan Guild has better odds to win.”","“Of course.” Xiao Yulv said while nodding, “As a citizen of Dajin, I support the Royal Clan Guild.”","“How come the skeletons of the Morning Star Sea Realm are blue? What tricks are they playing?” At this moment, someone mumbled.","Soon, the skeleton phalanxes of both parties collided with each other, and rune notes and magic light beams whistled in the air. In the sea of flames, Dajin’s skeletons fell in waves while the Morning Star Sea Realm’s level 7 skeletons, deep blue in color, broke the defense of Dajin’s skeleton phalanx and came before the warriors!","At this moment, the spiritual spells from the wizards from the back rows crashed forward in waves, knocking down many of Dajin’s tough warriors.","“Hold on!” Ji Wu roared in the channel on QQ, “Where’s the back-up from outside?! Come in and fill in the positions!”","Meanwhile, the battle at the entrance of the guild battle map was a fiercer one compared to the one inside. About 3,000 people were jammed at the entrance of the map while flames and sword energies danced wildly, and lightning bolts and corpses flew around. The entrance had become the target of all kinds of AoE attacks. Anyone who dared to get close to this area would be swallowed by lots of long-range attacks!","In the Jiuhua City Shop, all the people saw that the Royal Clan Troop was at the disadvantage, but the reinforcements was nowhere to be seen.","“Where is the back-up?!”","“Focus on the entrance!” In the Morning Star Sea Realm Cultivator Alliance channel, they had opened a new chat room to direct the players outside the map. “Kill anyone who dares to get close to it!”","“People outside of the map! Don’t be afraid! Throw Fire Walls and Explosion Flames forward! Don’t be afraid of death!”","Even if some people dared to dash into the entrance, they would be turned into corpses; they would be the legendary flying corpses.","Back-up? Impossible.","Inside the guild battle map, a level 7 godly beast led an army of level 7 skeletons and tore through the defensive line of the warriors of Dajin. The wizards aimed their magic spells at the back rows of Dajin’s Royal Clan Guild, and the battle was coming to an end.","The elites fighting outside the map had died many times. For the elites from both the Morning Star Sea Realm and Dajin, it seemed like the place outside the map was the real battlefield; they fought tirelessly and didn’t even have time to pick up the items which had been dropped all over the ground!","While the people in the map got fewer, and the reinforcement couldn’t come in, all the people watched dazedly while the elites of Dajin’s Royal Clan Guild decreased gradually until none was left!","Finally, the cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm stepped up and got to the watchtower on the defense wall of the Royal City. When they looked down on the fires and the crowds, they felt dizzy with blood surging up their spines into their brains.","“We’re awesome!”","“The Morning Star Sea Realm Cultivator Alliance is unrivaled!”","In the game, many players who were still fighting outside the guild battle map didn’t care that their rivals their sabers on their bodies. They exited from the virtual reality mode and cheered in wild elation.","“Hahahaha!” Tang Yuan of the Yuanheng Pavilion put down his virtual reality headset, looked at his character that stood proudly on the city tower, and laughed heartily.","At this moment, they felt like they were truly the king who had won the world!"]},{"number":326,"title":"Chapter 326 - Taking the Risk","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Boss, you’re so strong!”","In a remote alley stood a long-faced cultivator with a bandage on his face. He was flanked by two young cultivators with bruised faces. The three men didn’t have high cultivation strengths.","Before them, there was a robust black-cloaked cultivator, who looked like an iron tower, emitting a gloomy and chilly evil aura. In his hand was a big bag made of human skin; it was obviously a good spiritual artifact.","“This girl interrupted our business and even beat us!” The cultivators with a bandage on his face sneered, “Luckily, we have you, Boss!”","“Hehehe...” The others rubbed their hands and laughed coldly. “Boss, your Soul-Binding Bag is indeed powerful. This girl got hit before she had time to react!”","“Right! The bag just engulfed her instantly!” The cultivator with bandage said, “She even didn’t have time to scream! Hahahaha!”","The black-cloaked cultivator moved his fingers slightly, and the human-skin bag opened automatically, revealing a red-clothed girl. The saber-shaped token on the chest of her blouse was very eye-catching.","The big guy wearing the black cloak seemed to recognize the token, and his face turned weird. “Is this... the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?!”","“The Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?” The other cultivators snickered. “Boss, what’s that?”","One of them suddenly shivered. “I heard that Qin Honglin and his group were destroyed because they messed with a force named the Heaven-Defying Something Guild. Is she from that guild?”","They suddenly had chills running down their spines. “Boss, what should we do now? Should we release her?”","“Release her?” The cultivator in black smiled while he stared at Ruan Ning; he seemed to have made a decision. “Do you know how much this woman is worth? Do you know how much money this woman made on the auction at the Heaven-Hiding Pavilion?!”","“How much?”","“360,000! Crystals!”","The others widened their eyes, and they stared at the girl before them as if they were staring at an ultimate treasure!","“Then, we are going to be rich!” 360,000 crystals was a fortune that they wouldn’t be able to earn in several lifetimes!","They shivered in excitement.","“But...” one of them asked, “She isn’t so dumb as to walk around with so much money on her.”","“I have a way to make her hand over the money willingly!” The cultivator with the black cloak said contemptuously.","Hearing his words, all the other cultivators panted with excitement. All they could think of was 360,000 crystals, which seemed to be a mountain of crystals in front of them. They felt like if they reached out their hands, they could get it!","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was holding the award ceremony. The three godly weapons were in three exquisite black ebony gift boxes, and the Wilma Cornett was on the side.","All the people were cheering.","The cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm passed the three godly weapons around. They eagerly looked at the heavy and thick Judgement Staff, the holy-looking and exquisite Dragon Mark Sword, and the legendary Bone Jade Staff.","Mr. Fang was relieved that he had finished another big event since the opening of this shop. However, he felt like something was missing.","At this moment, Ruan Ning walked in. She looked more reserved than usual and greeted people politely, congratulating the Morning Star Sea Realm cultivators on gaining control of the Sand City.","“Sorry for being late...”","Xi Yue had a weird feeling, but she couldn’t tell why. Her presence showed that she was indeed Ruan Ning. As her long-time friend, Xi Yue would certainly see through if she were an imposter.","At this moment, others who were familiar with her also looked her way.","Zou Mo also felt weird, and his eyes opened wider involuntarily.","A strong light entered his pupils. While his cultivation strength grew, he rarely dared to look at the world with wide-open eyes as there were a lot of bright light sources that were eye-piercing to him.","“Ugh?” Ning Bi seemed to notice the situation here and saw the mysterious flowing light in Zou Mo’s eyes.","“Bo...” Zou Mo seemed like he was going to call out to his boss, but at this moment, Ruan Ning walked over. Her seemingly calm face had a sheen of sweat; it was unnoticeable if one didn’t look at her closely.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi finished handing out the prizes.","Suddenly, his communication jade blinked. [Boss, Sister Ruan Ning looks weird... She seems to be missing one of her spiritual souls and one of her physical souls.]","[TL Note: In Daoism, it is believed that a complete soul of humans is made up of three spiritual souls which represented Yang Energy and seven physical souls that represented Yin Energy.]","It was a message from Zou Mo.","“!!??” Fang Qi’s smile instantly turned grim.","[How did you find out?] Fang Qi asked through the communication jade.","Zou Mo, [I don’t know... I felt the blinding light in my eyes, and then I just saw it...”","Fang Qi, [Got it. Don’t make a rash move. Satisfy all her demands.]","“Ningning looks strange today...” Xi Yue murmured to herself and was going to walk up but was pulled back by Fang Qi who shook his head at her.","“What...”","Meanwhile, Ruan Ning took out the over 300,000 crystals that she had deposited in the shop. Without getting online or buying snacks, she walked out of the door as if nothing had happened.","[What happened?] The shrewd Mo Tianxing had found that something was strange, and he sent a message to Fang Qi immediately.","Meanwhile in a house about ten streets away, a few cultivators were cheering in celebration. “Hahahah! Boss, you’re so powerful. That group of pigs obviously haven’t realized what is going on!”","With a chilly smile on his face, the black-cloaked cultivator’s presence turned gloomier as if he had come from Hell.","[Trouble?] Another message came, [Do you need Big Sister’s help?]","Fang Qi looked up and saw the charming smile on Ning Bi’s gorgeous face.","[That little guy has special eyes. Did he see something?]","“Do you know anything about souls?” Fang Qi’s reply was concise.","“It’s about souls? It’s troublesome then.”","Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “Name your price.”","[I want a computer too. That thing named Alienware in the shop in Qzone looks good.] Her eyes squinted with a smile, looking like a fox spirit which could charm any man she wanted.","Fang Qi’s face twitched and knew that he had to give up all the fortune he made through stealing vegetables.","[I’ll buy it for you!]","[I also want the King of Fighters 97 and the joystick setup!]","[Okay, okay. You will get them!]","[Can I learn Orochi’s spiritual spells?] This was what she wanted the most.","Mr. Fang sat down before his computer in Qzone and shook the joystick violently. He chose Chris of the Flames of Destiny and then heavily pressed several buttons. The character suddenly changed into a black shadow!","It was the black figure when Orochi appeared!","“What do you think?”","Ning Bi pointed at Zou Mo with her snow-white finger and said, “That little guy should be able to lead me to that little girl’s spiritual soul and physical soul. However, it’s not convenient for me to show my hand, so I can only guard her spiritual soul and physical soul for a while. The rest is on you.”","Fang Qi exhaled heavily. “That’s enough.”","Zou Mo was still in a daze. Fang Qi patted him on the head and asked, “Can you find it?”","“I...” Zou Mo looked fearful.","“Little Mo, how did you Sister Ruan Ning treat you?” Fang Qi asked.","“She is like my real older sister!” Zou Mo gritted his teeth and said in a loud voice, “I know what I should do, Boss! I’ll do my best!”","Fang Qi patted his shoulder and said with a nod, “Just take this sister with you, and we’ll come later.”","...","After Zou Mo was gone with Ning Bi, Fang Qi glanced around the room. “It seems our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild is not famous enough. How come someone still dares to conspire against us? I plan to go out and do some business. Do you want to go with me?”","Mo Tianxing understood Fang Qi’s meaning. “We old guys will go!”","“Do business?” The leaders of the forces such as the Yuanheng Pavilion and the Coiled Dragon Office had just won the Battle of the Sand City, and they were eager to engage in a fight to test their newly obtained god-tier items, such as the Bone Jade Staff and the Dragon Mark Sword. “Sir, can you take us with you?”","“I’ll go too!” After playing the Legend of Mir 2 for a while, Red Wing Daoist had found that he couldn’t go far if he remained an independent player. Since he didn’t want to lower himself and stay below people, he decided to join the neutral and chill Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild. After leveling up and getting treasures with the help of the guild for a while, he felt like he had to do something when he could help.","“So many people?” Fang Qi was surprised; he had only planned to bring some of the members of his own guild.","Tang Yuan clutched the Bone Jade Staff tightly. “Hahahaha! Let me test the power of the Bone Jade Staff!”","“What are you going to do? I want some blood on my Dragon Mark Sword! If you don’t take us with you, we’ll follow you anyway!”","Fang Qi’s face twitched, surprised that these guys would try to help him without him asking!"]},{"number":327,"title":"Chapter 327 - It’s Overkill","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Then, come along...” Mr. Fang was surprised that people would beg to come with him.","He said with a little contempt, “Then, come along...”","After he tossed his board sword with runewords out the door, the Innumerable Sword Scroll instantly split this sword into dozens of flight swords, and they hovered in the air before the shop.","Mr. Fang beckoned at them. “Come on and get on board if you want to come with me.”","Everyone’s eyes almost popped out. They thought, We are just learning the sword control technique! Isn’t this too much?","On the other side, Zou Mo stood on a spiritual boat with strange light flowing in his eyes. Soon, he had to close his eyes due to the excruciating pain.","“We can’t continue like this, little guy.” Ning Bi shook her head and said with a slight sigh. “If you delay it, those guys who kidnapped your Sister Ruan will probably kill her after getting her money.”","Zou Mo shivered all over when he thought of this. With a furious roar, he opened his eyes wide!","He felt a wave of strong light pierced his eyes. Even in the gloomy Half City, the light seemed as piercing as if he were gazing directly at the burning sun!","However, after the wave of blinding white light was gone, the whole world and everything in it looked different to him.","“I wonder why that kid has such good luck...” Ning Bi crossed her arms before her chest and murmured, “I want to steal people from him...”","“Big Sister! I see it!” Zou Mo yelled in surprise and excitement.","Ning Bi cast a spiritual spell leisurely, and the whole spiritual boat vanished in the sky as if it had turned invisible.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang received the message, [We found it.]","The 18th Block looked less orderly than Fang Qi’s organized 36th Block.","At the end of the street was a three-story, tower-shaped building. The cultivator with a bandage on his face was looking at the pedestrians on the street.","“She is coming! Here she comes!” he yelled in elation.","“We’re rich from now on!”","“I seem to see myself lying on a mountain of crystals!”","“After this robbery, I’ll leave this damn place with money and start my life again in a better place.”","“Hahahahaha!”","...","Meanwhile, in a hidden corner behind the three-story tower building, two figures landed silently.","“Are you okay? Can you last”","“No... No problem,” Zou Mo answered immediately.","The strange light flashed quicker and quicker in his eyes as if they were overloading machines. “It’s under the ground, and two guys are guarding it.”","“Tell me the exact location as well,” Ning Bi said with a smile.","Under the ground stood two guys who were wearing black cloaks. Different from the hooligans with bandages, they had higher cultivation strengths.","They appeared alert while they watched the area around them cautiously. On the desk between them was a pitch-black clay pot, and it was sealed by two rune notes that had runes written in blood. It was a strange scene.","At this moment, a gush of invisible wind blew on the rune notes.","“What’s happening?!” With glints in their eyes, the two guys hurried over to check on the pot.","They didn’t find anything strange.","“It’s done,” Ning Bi said, “In a short while, no one can do anything to the girl’s spiritual soul and physical soul.”","[Little shop owner, the mission is completed!] Fang Qi received the message on his communication jade. [Don’t forget the reward you promised me.]","Fang Qi was at a loss for words.","Meanwhile, Ruan Ning had walked to the gate of the first floor with crystals, and the cultivators had greedy light in their eyes.","Suddenly, they heard a booming explosion!","A lightning bolt viciously crashed on the roof, instantly creating a huge hole in it.","Then, someone yelled, “Listen up! The people inside the building, you have ten seconds to put down weapons, surrender, and hand over the hostage. Otherwise, you’ll bear the consequences.”","Hearing the voice, they shivered and looked out of the window, seeing dozens of cultivators standing on flying swords and surrounding the tower. “Boss, how did they find us?!”","The expression of the burly cultivator wearing the black cloak changed, and he sneered and shouted at the sky, “I advise you to stay away. Otherwise, your friend will die!”","“Right!” The panicking cultivators were emboldened, and they said with wicked smiles, “Boss is right! We still have the hostage!”","“Don’t move! Otherwise, we can instantly kill this girl! Do you not believe me?”","“Sir, are these little hooligans the trouble makers?” Tang Yuan said in disdain.","“Let me deal with them! Let me!” Zhuge Bai was a middle-aged cultivator wearing a moon-white robe. With his tender skin, he looked like a fragile scholar, but he had a hot temper. After grabbing the Bone Jade Staff from Tang Yuan, he pointed it forward.","Extremely chilly energy condensed into solid icicles and violent winds whistled, instantly turning the whole building into ashes in the blink of an eye.","With perfect timing, Mo Tainxing swept Ruan Ning out with his big sleeve.","“Ahh!” Ruan Ning screamed and almost fainted in fear!","“Hahahaha!” Zhuge Bai laughed wildly, “The Bone Jade Staff deserves its fame!”","“You’re seeking your deaths!” With a dark expression, the cultivator wearing the black cloak issued an order, and many black-robed cultivators swarmed out!","“Let me try it!” Xi Chenzhou took the staff from Zhuge Bai before the latter could warm it up. Meanwhile, over ten black-cloaked cultivators surrounded them from all directions.","While waving the Bone Jade Staff, Xi Chenzhou chanted in a low voice, and a lot of black essence condensed into a huge dragon which soared up into the sky!","“Roar!”","With a thunderous roar, it instantly swallowed all the black-robed cultivators around it!","Dumbfounded, Xi Chenzhou looked at the Bone Jade Staff in his hand. “Godly weapon! It’s indeed a godly weapon! It’s superb! I feel like the power of my spiritual spells and my control over them have increased greatly!”","“Look at this, summon Godly Beast!” Xue Shuilong waved the Dagon Mark Sword, and a huge dog that looked like a Fire Kirin quickly expanded. It spat out flames, and the cultivators dashing toward it were engulfed by the flames; they all shrilled in pain!","Although the godly beast’s growth potential would decrease in the later stages, the godly beast summoned by the grand Taoist was still very powerful. Besides, the Dragon Mark Sword itself could increase the power of the godly beasts.","After the Holy Armor Spell and Ghost Spiritual Shield Spell were cast on the godly beast, the latter was like a huge war beast whose flames destroyed all the houses they touched. Xue Shuilong cast a Wind Control Spell and sent the godly beast into the sky. The fleeing cultivators who had just flown up were all turned into fireballs before falling to the ground!","“Very good! I’m very satisfied with the Dragon Mark Sword!”"]},{"number":328,"title":"Chapter 328 - The Construction Site of Excavators","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Look at my Judgement Staff!” A warrior dashed up with a black iron staff and tremendous warrior qi gushed out, shattering the skulls of several cultivators and even the whole building!","“Impossible! Who are these guys?!” The face of the cultivator in black was livid. “Isn’t it just the owner of the Origins Internet Club! How come there are so many masters with him?!”","“No... Don’t kill me!” The arrogant cultivator who had a bandage on his face and his two bruised hooligans dropped to the ground in fear and howled in fear while the unpleasant smell of urine floated up from their pants.","However, in the next moment, they were swallowed by the power of waves of spiritual spells before they could scream more.","“You really don’t care about this girl’s life?!” The burly cultivator in black roared and condensed spiritual essence in his hand, instantly shattering a blood rune note.","“Don’t! Ahhh!” Ruan Ning was so scared that she felt like her heart was going to pop out.","Meanwhile in a secret underground chamber, Fang Qi sent a message, asking, [Are you sure it is here?]","[I’m sure.]","The spiritual light flashed around the room, and the defensive array was instantly broken. The two black-robed cultivators who were guarding the chamber had their chests pierced!","[They activated the blood rune note. Save her quickly!] Mr. Fang received another message.","In the underground chamber, the blood rune on the rune notes was so red that it looked like actual blood was going to ooze out. However, it was stopped by a strange force, making the whole black pot shake violently.","One minute later, Fang Qi handed the black pot in his arm to Ning Bi. After a spiritual spell was casted, the curse on the pot was broken.","Ning Bi sent out a mass of spiritual essence and trapped the two vague light dots that were floating in the pot. “It’s done.”","One second.","Two seconds.","Three seconds.","Ruan Ning, who was in Xi Yue’s arms, opened her eyes. “I’m still alive?”","Mr. Fang flew over at this moment and pointed at the two spiritual light dots beside him, saying, “Don’t be afraid. Everything will be fine after we pop them back into you. You’ll just feel listless for a few days.”","“Why didn’t you tell me earlier?!” Almost scared to death, Ran Ning roared, “Also, one of my spiritual souls and physical souls were drawn out, and you are putting it so lightly. Pop them back? Why don’t you take out your soul and pop it back?!”","She was on the verge of exploding in anger.","“Damn! I never saw anyone without a complete soul yelling so loud,” Mr. Fang mumbled to himself.","Ruan Ning’s face turned dark, and she felt like killing a certain someone.","The people around them were torn, not knowing if they should laugh or cry. However, they were relieved that the problem was perfectly solved.","“Oh. You must thank this little guy.” Mr. Fang pulled Zou Mo over and said, “If Little Mo didn’t see that something was wrong with you, I would be praying for you and telling you to rest in peace.”","“Oh...” Ruan Ning immediately said, “Little Mo, thank you.”","At this moment, Fang Qi suddenly saw a black shadow quickly fleeing into the distant.","Mr. Fang arched his eyebrows slightly. Then, dumping the others, he turned into a light beam and followed the black shadow at a measured pace.","About half an hour later, they arrived at a rotten forest close to the ruins at the edge of the city.","In the rotten forest was a huge graveyard with tombstones messily lying around.","In the pitch-black mud, Fang Qi even saw chunks of white bone sticking out.","“Who dares to break into the Netherworld Underground Palace?!” While Fang Qi was considering if he should enter, several black-robed cultivators surrounded him.","Then, several powerful auras engulfed the place.","“Soul-Drawing Messenger!”","“Soul-Hooking Messenger!”","“Soul-Taking Messenger!”","“With us three messengers here, who dares to come and mess with the Netherworld Underground Palace?!” Three black clouds flew around in the air like evil ghosts.","Then, an even more powerful aura came behind them while a huge ghost face rose into the air. “We were thinking of how to draw you here, but you came to us on your own!”","“Since you offered yourself to us and want to go to hell, I, the Soul-Robbing Elder, will take your head and offer it to the Palace Master!”","“Soul-Robbing Elder?!” The black-robed cultivator who had fled here looked elated.","He had kidnapped Ruan Ning, who was a member of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild, not only for crystals but for drawing out Fang Qi as well. He would be well-rewarded for it if he succeeded.","The huge ghost face got closer and closer, almost blocking the sun and the sky as it hovered in front of Fang Qi. “You dare to come here alone?! Are you stupid or just ignorant? Don’t worry. We’ll make you into a puppet without a soul before we let you return to your shop. We are going to get all the secrets of your little shop!”","A horrifying aura crashed down and blocked almost all of Fang Qi’s escape routes. The surrounding area was turned into a heavenly tomb of innumerable ghosts!","Many ghost shadows rushed out from the underground while many souls woke up as if they were startled by something. Then, they swarmed up as if they had smelled the scent of fresh blood.","In the blink of an eye, many sulky souls and fierce ghosts surrounded Fang Qi!","“The big fish is absent; there are only a few small fish?” Fang Qi frowned. “Your Palace Master doesn’t seem to be here.”","“You don’t deserve the special treatment of our Palace Master.” The ghost face laughed creepily, “You are seeking death; don’t blame me for being cruel!”","The Soul-Drawing Messenger said, “I’ll cut off your skin inch by inch.”","The Soul-Hooking Messenger flew in circles in a mist-form and laughed, “It has been a long time since I last tasted the soul of a cultivator of your kind...”","The Soul-Taking Messenger glanced at the burly, black-robed cultivator who had been severely wounded and said, “Wen Kui, you did well. I’ll reward you with a piece of flesh later.”","“Cackle... Ugh?!” The laughter suddenly stopped.","Behind Fang Qi rose a giant and horrifying shadow.","Meanwhile, swords flew all over the sky! They were so dense that they blocked out the sun!","It was Sword God, the most powerful sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction!","The Soul-Robbing Elder Soul was at a loss for words, and so were the three messengers.","By now, Ruan Ning and the others had returned to the shop.","“What’s happening?”","“Is it an earthquake?!”","“Look over there!” Suddenly, someone yelled in alarm and pointed to the distant sky.","Dark clouds gathered in the distant sky, and a huge and horrifying shadow suppressed the sky and land like a giant ancient god!","Even from the distance, they could sense the scary aura.","The sky above that area was covered by dense flying swords. With heavenly lightning bolts flashing and thunder booming, flying swords dashed down like a falling river from the ninth heaven!","...","Three minutes later, a young man sat on a large stretch of ruins and blew out a puff of smoke. After grinding the butt of the cigarette on the ground with his sole, he wrote several big words with his sword.","Hours later, the night became cold while a breeze moved the withered branches.","“I’m honored to attend the banquet hosted by the Reincarnation King today!” Several black shadows landed like swift light beams.","“Congratulations to you, Palace Master! I’m sure that you’ll climb higher in the future, Palace Master! Ugh...”","The voice suddenly stopped.","“Where’s the Netherworld Underground Palace?!” Their eyes almost popped out.","“Where’s my Netherworld Underground Palace?!” The Netherworld Palace Master’s face turned livid, and he roared in a fury, “Who was so audacious as to destroy my Netherworld Underground Palace?! I’ll chop you into pieces!”","“Lanxiang Academy?! The Lanxiang Academy did it!” A subordinate said in a chilly voice, “Palace Master, look at the words left on the ground: The Construction Site Excavators from Lanxiang Academy!”","The Netherworld Palace Master: “!!??”"]},{"number":329,"title":"Chapter 329 - GTA5 Begins","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Little Mo, I’ll treat you to Jade Dynasty!”","“Um...” Zou Mo looked bashful.","Having finally came back, Ruan Ning felt like she had experienced the first big event in her life. Since she wasn’t a sensitive or fragile person, she felt better on the next day. As if she had just woken from a nightmare, she felt alright except that she was a bit weaker than usual and she had minor anxiety attacks occasionally.","Everything seemed peaceful and life returned to normal now.","“Sir, get me a bowl of instant noodles with a sausage.”","Ruan Ning yawned while speaking; she felt a bit lazy and listless.","“I told you that it will be fine. You look good,” Mr. Fang said casually while getting himself a bowl of instant noodles as well.","“How can you say that?! I had nightmares all night! All damn night!” Instantly, she jumped up fiercely, looking more animated and energetic than her former lazy self.","“Ugh?” Suddenly, she pointed at the small black blackboard and asked, “New game: Grand Theft Auto 5. What’s that?”","She found that the shop had released a new game!","The price of the game was super expensive: 45 crystals for the activation of the offline mode, and 10 crystals per week for playing the online mode. It was almost as expensive as Diablo 2.","The players of this shop only heard about Diablo from the players of Dajin.","In other words, this was the second formal game in the Half City Shop beside the small games in Qzone.","“We have a new game today?!” Ruan Ning’s eyes lit up, and she looked energetic.","After playing the Legend of Mir 2 for a long time, the main group of players was now fixed, and they were members of the big guilds. Since Ruan Ning neither fought for the title of the Master of Sand City nor competed for No. 1 Place in that world, she didn’t have to spend all day on that game. All she needed to do was keep her items and strength above the average level.","This was why some players had time to play the King of Fighters and other stuff in Mr. Fang’s Qzone.","“A new game?” Liu Ningyun walked into the shop. She hadn’t been a fan of the Legend of Mir 2, but ever since her master bought the Magic Shield Spell Skill Book, she had to take her master to level up every day. Her master was like a big baby who knew nothing of the game, and she had to be gentle and respectful toward her master while showing her how to play the game. After all, she was the Xichi Spiritual Master’s disciple.","Her gaming experience was almost negative.","Therefore, getting a new game in the shop was very beneficial to her.","“Grand Theft Auto 5?” Her beautiful eyes looked at the name, and then her face fell. “Sir, do you want us to steal stuff?”","Mr. Fang said with a serious face, “If you want to steal, no one is stopping you.”","“Pooh! It’s you who want to steal stuff!”","“Yun’er!” At this moment, the Xichi Spiritual Master’s gentle voice came from behind her. “Can you take me to level up for a bit?”","Liu Ningyun shivered after hearing that, as if she had been chilled by a gust of autumn wind. “Master, should we try the new game first?”","“Okay... it’s quite boring to level up and hunt for treasures every day.” The Xichi Spiritual Master said with a nod, “We can take a break by trying the new game, but this Grand Theft Auto 5...”","She gazed at Fang Qi with her cold eyes. She understood what ‘grand theft’ meant, but with the word ‘auto’ added, it sounded quite suspicious.","“Sir, we can learn all kinds of spiritual spells in the Legend of Mir 2, but in this game, do we learn how to become a thief?!” She snorted and said, “If so, I will never try it.”","“Do you think my shop would release such a boring game?” Mr. Fang said solemnly, “It is a game for you to experience life.”","“Experience... life?”","The people around him all looked confused.","In Grand Theft Auto 5, the characters that people could play were usually not thieves.","“Then I’ll try it first.” Ruan Ning was the first one who offered to try the game. After all, all the products in Mr. Fang’s shop, from the Legend of Mir 2 to the movies and TV Series to the little games, were all trustworthy and excellent.","Since this game was very expensive, she guessed it must have things that were worthy of her time and investment.","People such as Ruan Ning and the Xichi Spiritual Master were the first group of players who paid to try the game. After all, it was worthwhile to spend crystals on the new stuff in the shop.","Soon, they activated the game. When the game began, blurry pictures appeared on the screen. Colorful dream-like neon lights blinked, and loud honking of cars, police sirens, and faint gunshots could be heard.","While the main characters in many other games were heroes, this game was the opposite and had more realistic characters.","The location was North Yankton, and the time was nine years ago.","The players were now indifferent to the strangeness of the name of this place after watching Harry Potter, which was also a story set in the modern world where people spoke the same strange language.","For them, this was like another civilization in another corner of the world, or it could be the outer world as recorded in the ancient books. Who knows?","Perhaps it was an imaginary world, and it was possible that such a world had never existed.","After all, it was a world in virtual reality.","Many people stood behind them to watch the game. Some people had bowls of instant noodles in their hands, such as Mo Tianxing, and some were leisurely sipping on bottles of Coke with straws, such as Ning Bi. Even Black Demon, who was eating breakfast, also came up to watch.","Gunfire lit up the darkness, and then a scene appeared on the screen. “Okay! Do what we say, and no one will be hurt.”","Before them was a guy who was wearing a black ski mask and holding a submachine gun. If the players of Jiuhua City were here, they would find this outfit was quite similar to that of the terrorists in Counter Strike.","However, the players of Half City were confused about the situation. Right now, they were controlling the robbers.","The bank robbery was ongoing.","Baffled, the Xichi Spiritual Master looked at the submachine gun in her hands. “What’s this thing for?”","At this moment, the game gave them a prompt, urging them to aim the gun at the hostages to force them to leave the bank.","She looked at the trigger. “It seems like I must press this?”","Dadadadada...","“Ahh... Ouch!” Screams sounded.","The hostages died.","She widened her eyes in confusion.","Obviously, robbery was a technical job.","..."]},{"number":330,"title":"Chapter 330 - Mortal’s civilization","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ugh... What now?!” Although they were used to robbing and killing in the Legend of Mir 2, this game seemed different since the people that they faced appeared to be defenseless ordinary people, even though they didn’t know the situation.","They didn’t even know what their characters were doing.","“Sir, is this a so-called role-playing game?” Ruan Ning obviously got this term from the players of Jiuhua City. In the Legend of Mir 2, the characters that the players controlled represented themselves. However, in role-playing games, the characters that players controlled had their own lives and backgrounds.","In other words, the players would experience other people’s lives.","“Why is this so weird?” She remembered that role-playing games were very classical, such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and Resident Evil, but those games were not released in this shop yet.","On the other side, after killing the hostages by accident, the Xichi Spiritual Master heard her teammate murmur some cussing words and then reminded her, “Detonate the bomb!”","Obviously, this was a tutorial since another prompt appeared on the screen. [Please use your cell phone to detonate the bomb.]","After digging out the cell phone from her pocket, she saw a number for detonation and dialed it...","The explosive device set at the entrance of the vault of the bank was quickly activated.","Then, they went into the vault with teammates and took hundreds of thousands of dollars.","“Huh?” The more they played, the stranger they felt.","“Yun’er...” The Xichi Spiritual Master clicked on the external communication option and yelled, “How come this world is even stranger than the one in Harry Potter?”","“Yeah.” Liu Ningyun killed a guard with her gun and said, “I have the same feeling. Are they robbing stuff? And they even killed several guards.”","Watching from behind, Ning Bi said, “Little Girl, aren’t you doing the same?”","“I would have died if I didn’t do it!” Liu Ningyun controlled Michael to hide in a corner and yelled, “Ah! There are so many of them. What’s this game really about?!”","She still didn’t know much about the situation except that this scene happened nine years ago, which meant that this might be the memory of one of the characters.","“How come the weapons in the world of Muggles are so powerful?” Ruan Ning murmured to herself while she dashed out, shooting with her submachine gun. She laughed wildly, “Hahaha! This weapon is fun to play with! I’ll kill my way out!”","“This girl is almost out...” Liu Ningyun tried to catch up. Obviously, this was a scene from someone’s memory, and she couldn’t change the plot. Therefore, she could only follow the instructions.","Although her marksmanship was bad, her teammates were good at this, so the plot continued slowly.","Obviously, this was a bank robbery, and the characters that they played were robbers. However, the plan wasn’t successful. Also, someone had leaked the information to the police, and many police cars raced over to the bank.","After the tutorial, most of the robbers died or were wounded, except two guys which were two of the three main characters in the game, Michael and Trevor.","When they saw Michael stay at the scene after faking a gun wound, they understood who had leaked the information.","This was the end of the memory.","The offline portion of GTA 5 was like an American movie that the players could control. Nine years later, Michael obviously had gained lots of benefits by tipping off the police. Trevor, on the other hand, had escaped with a hostage. People were quite curious as to what would happen after that.","At this moment, the players had two options. One was to continue playing in the offline mode, and the other one was playing online with other players.","After putting down her virtual reality headset, the Xichi Spiritual Master, who had never played such a game before, had many questions to ask","Mr. Fang explained things such as guns and the worldview in detail.","“Do you mean that the purpose of this role-playing game is for us to experience another person’s life with our own perspective?” The Xichi Spiritual Master asked in surprise, “Is it something like going through reincarnation and cleansing one’s mind in the mortal world?”","“Going through reincarnation and cleansing one’s mind in the mortal world, one would experience the mystery of a fetus and all kinds of trials and tribulations in the mortal world.” Ning Bi stared at the screen intensely and said. “But we can exit from this game at any time. Besides, as for the stuff named technology that the shop owner mentioned, are the people of Dajin really studying it now?”","“Sir, can we do whatever we want in the game?” Black Demon, who was planning to go online to play The Legend of Mir 2, looked over.","Liu Ningyun started at Fang Qi fiercely. In the Legend of Mir 2, players could kill and take treasures from others, but the general worldview and values were acceptable.","However, why do the characters in this game look like evil criminals?","“Do you want us to experience the lives of these people?” Liu Ningyun was not pleased. After all, she was the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy, and it was beneath her to do such evil deeds.","She felt like she had just participated in a robbery.","At this moment, Ruan Ning suddenly exclaimed, “How come I’ve changed to myself? I can adjust my own looks? Isn’t it a role-playing game?”","Fang Qi explained, “Now, you can choose the online mode or offline mode. You’ve just experienced the offline mode. As for the online mode, you can enter this world as yourself, and you can decide on what you’re going to do.”","“Ugh?” Liu Ningyun’s contempt expression disappeared. “I can do this!”","Meanwhile, Ruan Ning had just entered the game.","On the screen was a bird view of a huge city which was many times bigger than any city that they had ever seen. They couldn’t even see the end of it.","The skyscrapers soared into the clouds, and helicopters were flying in the sky under the setting sun. All kinds of cars were driving on the wide roads orderly, and rows of fancy houses lined the coastline with coconut trees in their front lawns. Since these houses were on the beach, people could see the blue ocean. Compared with the remote and hermit-like lives in Qzone, this was a luxurious sight.","In fact, they had seen some views of the modern world in Harry Potter, but this place was obviously cleaner, neater, and more advanced than the one in Harry Potter.","In Harry Potter, they were amused by the ignorant and incompetent mortals in the same world. But now, they saw that these talentless ordinary people, who were the muggles despised by the wizards and witches in Harry Potter, had created a great civilization!","In the grand and fancy car dealer shops were all kinds of modern, metallic, and luxurious cars. The rich people were playing all kinds of sports, such as golf and tennis, and huge, snow-white passenger planes flew fast in the sky. Through the windows, they could see passengers who were sitting orderly inside.","When the whole world was presented to them like a huge picture, a shocking sensation rose in them silently.","This was the world created by the ordinary people in their eyes.","Spiritual boats? They had planes.","Demon beast carriages? They had cars.","Not to mention all kinds of mysterious and weird-looking weapons.","They were stunned to find that even these ordinary people had created a civilization no less advanced than their own."]},{"number":331,"title":"Chapter 331 - Godly Driver of Mount Haruna","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I want to try this.” Liu Ningyun was eager to try the so-called online mode in which she could enter this mystical world as herself.","She immediately returned to her seat and entered the game.","“Ugh? Do we wear these clothes?” On the character-creation interface, there were many modern clothes to choose from. Of course, they were the cheap ones.","The starting clothes that she chose were a short white T-shirt and a pair of tight-fitting jeans.","After choosing the clothes, she changed into them automatically. After all, it was a game, and it was easy to do this task.","Soon, a vibrant beauty who had a ponytail and was wearing a white T-shirt, jeans, and canvas shoes appeared in the game.","The gaming experience was... very... very novel.","The moment that the character in the game walked out of the airport, a black pick-up truck drove over, and the driver was a tall, thin black guy. Obviously, he was here to pick her up. “You’ve finally decided to have a look at this damn place?”","The black guy got out of the car, and his voice was very energetic. “Good! Come and say hello to your old friend, Baby. We finally meet each other.”","From their conversation, Liu Ningyun learned that they had known each other through an online chat. It was the background set by the game.","Liu Ningyun was baffled. The beauty with a ponytail glanced around in embarrassment. “Sir, what’s happening?”","I just entered the game, and a stranger is greeting me?!","“Just treat it as a beginner’s guide.”","When entering a new world, people would need proper identities, and they would have acquaintances who were not necessarily their friends; they might be partners in business or people that they might have dealings with in the future.","The most important thing was that the players needed someone to teach them how to live in this world.","“Welcome to Los Santos.” The black guy handed her a handgun with pride. “They can’t track this one’s source...”","Bam!","The black guy suddenly stopped talking.","Liu Ningyun remembered that she could activate the gun by pulling the trigger, but she had only passed the tutorial earlier with the help of her teammate and hadn’t really used the gun yet.","After she pulled the trigger, she was shocked as she looked at the black guy who had a bullet hole in his forehead.","Bam! The corpse dropped to the ground, and this man’s face looked puzzled.","“Ahhh!”","“Murder!”","The crowds scattered in fear and only Liu Ningyun stood there in confusion.","“Hahahahaha!” Beside Fang Qi, a demonic woman looked at Liu Ningyun’s screen and laughed so hard that she almost had tears in her eyes.","Mr. Fang touched his forehead and said, “That is why I said... can you mess around in offline mode before playing the online mode?”","“What do we do now?” Liu Ningyun felt like crying. This guy gave her a good weapon the moment they met, which meant that he was a good guy. However, she had just killed him with a bullet!","“Exit and start again.” Mr. Fang felt like this group of people would be a disaster in a modern city.","On the other side, Ruan Ning obviously did better since she didn’t kill anyone. When the night fell, she sat in the car and looked at the city that was illuminated by neon lights, which gave the world a dreamy color. In this moonless night, the headlights of the cars, the neon lights in front of stores, and the lights in the distant skyscrapers which looked to be touching the sky created the colors of the whole city; they decorated the night like sparkling stars.","Big cities were dazzling at night, and Los Santos, which was based on Los Angeles, was even more so. Ancient cities were absolutely no match for them in terms of their fascinating night scenes.","The players who stood behind and watched the game all looked surprised. “Such a beautiful city!”","“Sir, this guy gave me a car and asked me to enter a race. Should I do it?” Ruan Ning’s eyes were bright. Obviously, she was eager to try this exquisite and modern transportation tool.","“You can try it...”","The black guy taught her how to start the car.","– In the next moment –","Boom!","The car rammed into someone’s house, and the front of the car entered the living room. Also, she killed two pedestrians in the process.","Seeing the terrible situation, the black guy abandoned her and fled.","Soon, police cars surrounded her.","Ruan Ning whined, “This game is so difficult to play.”","“You’re bad, but you are eager to play; how can it not be hard?” Mr. Fang touched his forehead.","“I have to step on the gas peddle and turn the steering wheel at the same time. How can it be easy?”","Mr. Fang said in disdain, “All in all, you’re just bad.”","“Then come and play it yourself if you’re so good.”","Liu Ningyun also looked doubtful. “I don’t believe that you can also drive this thing.”","Mr. Fang shrugged. “I’m like the Car God of Mount Haruna. There’s nothing that I can’t drive.”","“Just try it if you dare!”","“No problem.”","Then, he entered the game. After the prologue, he entered online mode with the name ‘Fujiwara Takumi’.","[TL Note: Fujiwara Takumi is the main character of Initial D.]","Next, he entered the street race.","At this stage, there weren’t many models to choose from, and Mr. Fang picked a Karin Asterope.","It was white, which was an important feature.","Since Fang Qi had driven cars before he traveled through space and time, his driving skills weren’t bad.","Hearing the roaring of the engine, he started the car steadily and drove it at 80 kilometers per hour. Then, he turned on the music with one hand and played himself a tune while controlling the steering wheel with the other.","The people watching from behind were at a loss for words.","Controlling the car with one hand?!","Although the players were all ordinary people in the game, Fang Qi now had high cultivation strength and strengthened abilities after taking the T-Virus, such as increased brain functions. Feeling like 80 kilometers per hour was quite easy, he accelerated the car to 100 kilometers per hour.","Like a nimble fish, Mr. Fang’s car streamed through the other cars repeatedly.","At this moment, his speed had reached 120 kilometers per hour.","If it was before he traveled through space and time, Mr. Fang wouldn’t have dared to race in the center of a city like this, even if there weren’t many cars on the road.","But now, he didn’t care since he wasn’t afraid of dying.","Mr. Fang was quite high while he drove. “Now, I’ll show you the drifting skills of an old driver!”","Mr. Fang operated the car with some swift and crazy moves, and the front wheels rolled and braked. Then, the white car slid horizontally with sharp screeching sounds as the tires were grinding on the ground. Next, with a huge boom, it bumped off the car that was making a turn before him.","At this moment, Mr. Fang’s car drifted around the street corner.","Then, it turned and got onto the other street perfectly!","“We can drive like this?!” Watching the car drifting, they were all dumbfounded.","“Sir! Did you just kill someone?!”","“Don’t mind these minor details!” Mr. Fang’s face turned dark while he continued driving."]},{"number":332,"title":"Chapter 332 - Playing Robin Hood","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the online mode of GTA 5, the players earned money and leveled up through all kinds of missions and jobs.","Right, the characters in GTA 5 had levels. Usually, with higher levels, the players could have more money, better privileges, and more weapons. After all, the GTA 5 remake created by the System didn’t allow players to have multiple accounts.","The jobs could be the basic jobs the game created or the jobs that the players created themselves.","Right now, Mr. Fang was doing one of the jobs – a car race.","Soon, Mr. Fang raced to the finishing line before the black guy. Since he had made a bet with the black guy before the race, he earned more than 1,000 dollars and over 1,000 experience points. Obviously, Mr. Fang’s result in the race was quite good, and he quickly leveled up to level 2.","At the same time, Mr. Fang’s cultivation strength also increased with his level, even though the process was a bit slower than playing the Legend of Mir 2 when he was focusing on killing monsters and wasn’t distracted by malicious attacks of other players.","“You just leveled up like this?” Ruan Ning blinked in surprise since in the Legend of Mir 2, the players only leveled up by killing monsters.","“You can also level up by killing police officers,” Mr. Fang said. “If you’re not afraid of being killed, that is.”","Remembering the scene where many police cars surrounded her after she killed people in that car crash, Ruan Ning was a little afraid. She asked, “I don’t know how to drive; what can I do?”","Obviously, other people also had this problem.","“Go and play offline mode.” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at her and said. “Anyway, the characters you control all know how to drive a car.”","“No!” Liu Ningyun didn’t agree. “I think I can find other ways. After all, we can’t die in this game, and we can practice our driving skills in it.”","“Sir, what’re you doing?!” Ruan Ning suddenly yelled in alarm when she saw Mr. Fang stopping his car before a store.","Then, he jumped off and walked in before pointing the gun at a shop clerk.","While shivering in fear, the shop clerk took out money from the cash register.","“Huh?” All the people watching from behind looked at each other in bafflement.","“I’m robbing the rich and giving it to the poor,” Mr. Fang said casually, “In this city, there are many rich but heartless people, and I must take each opportunity to rob from them and give it to the poor.”","“Is this shop rich and heartless?” The Xichi Spiritual Master looked at the screen in confusion, feeling like something was not right.","“Sir, why are you wearing a mask?”","They saw Mr. Fang putting some money in his pocket before walking out the door with the bag of money that the clerk handed to him and getting back into his car.","Then, they watched as Mr. Fang deposited the money into his own bank account.","Although they didn’t know about modern banks, there were similar businesses in their world where they could store money.","“Sir, didn’t you say that you are helping the poor?!” Liu Ningyun immediately realized that something was wrong.","Mr. Fang explained, “I only have a few thousand dollars on me, so I’m a poor guy. Do you see anyone poorer than me on the way here?”","All the people fell silent since they found his argument to be indisputable!","At this moment, they saw that Mr. Fang leveled up again.","“Sir!” Liu Ningyun had a bad feeling. “Do the players have to level up by robbing others?!”","“Of course not,” Fang Qi said. “In this world, people can live another life. You can choose to be a good person or a bad one, and you can choose to do whatever you want or discipline yourself and others. It’s your own choice.","“Even if you are a grand philanthropist in the real world, you can try to be an extremely evil person and live a life of luxury and lust,” Fang Qi explained, “When the game ends, you will still be you in the real world, and everything in the game will just be like a dream.”","“You won’t obtain any credit if you play a good person, and you won’t be punished even if you do evil deeds,” Ning Bi stared at the screen and said. “I’m surprised that Grand Theft Auto 5 is such a game!”","“Does it mean that I can do anything I want in the game?” Black Demon looked eager to try the game.","“As long as you are not afraid of being killed,” Mr. Fang said in earnest.","He had just tried the game and found that the virtual reality version of GTA 5 was much more difficult than the original version. Although the difficulty of the game didn’t increase on purpose, everything was more realistic, and that posed more challenges.","For example, in the original game, the players could run swiftly with grenade launchers, sniper rifles, and other guns.","But in the virtual reality version, the players didn’t have spatial storage items, so bringing weapons and ammunition presented a problem.","Another change was that the players’ vitalities in the remake version of the game was more fragile than in the original version. In the virtual reality mode, the players wouldn’t remain alive after taking several shots to the chest.","Besides, the pedestrians in the remake version had the intelligence of the normal people, and the whole game was quite similar to a real modern world, which meant that players would encounter more difficulties and restrictions compared to the original version.","On the other hand, the players could experience anything that a city could offer in this remake version while the original version provided a limited range of options for players.","In this game, the players would live like real modern people!","Mr. Fang drove back to the place where the game started. “If you’re interested, you can race with other players, do other jobs. After all, the methods of making money in the beginner’s guide are easy and quick. Of course, if you can’t even do these things, I’m afraid that you can’t continue the game since the later missions are much more difficult.”","“I still don’t want to play the offline mode...” Liu Ningyun frowned.","“You think too much!” Ning Bi found a seat and sat down. “It’s good to have an opportunity to experience another person’s life!”","“You outside cultivators have too many burdens on your mind,” Black Demon said with a snicker. “I’m interested in this game.”","“Ugh...” Mr. Fang said awkwardly, “Come on, it’s just a game. There aren’t many problems.”","Indeed, just as Fang Qi said, it was just a game. Some people were hesitant at first but eventually entered the game as well.","Since they were still not familiar with the control of the game, they began with the offline mode.","However, in Jiuhua City, the people had a different response to this game.","[Sir, the guns in this shop are expensive. Where do we earn money?] Song Qingfeng sent him a message.","[There are so many new weapons in this game?] Li Haoran immediately sent a message to Mr. Fang on QQ. [Sir, tell me how to earn some quick money.]","Su Tianji: [Sir, I want to buy guns! Tell me how to make money!]","[You guys all know how to use guns, right?]","[Of course! We’ve played Counter Strike and Resident Evil for a long time.]","[Then, come, come, come! Come and do some missions with me. I, an old driver, will take you to rob from the rich and give it to the poor.]"]},{"number":333,"title":"Chapter 333 - The Road Killers","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! What are you doing? Didn’t you say that you would take us to rob from the rich and give to the poor?” Song Qingfeng and the others had been sent to play the offline mode, and they had waited for a long time, but Fang Qi still didn’t say anything.","“You guys play some more, and I’ll be ready in a moment.” Obviously, Mr. Fang was still doing missions to level up since he couldn’t organize a job until he was at level 12.","However, the game’s offline mode was also enjoyable. After the incident nine years ago, Michael, who sold out his teammates, didn’t have a good life.","At the beginning of the game, he yelled at his psychiatrist, “I have a big house, a useless kid, and I’m stuck talking to you because no one wants to talk to me!”","It was the typical scene of midlife crisis.","However, the offline mode was obviously simpler than the online mode since the main characters knew how to drive and use guns. The players could just follow their moves and learn the basic knowledge and skills.","In the mansion zone by the beach, the players didn’t have much trouble on their mind, and it was enjoyable to sit on the bench and gaze at the blue ocean.","The third main character in the offline mode would appear soon.","“Listen, we’re not here to steal cars. This is legal business.” Two black guys were arguing on the street behind the bench, and the taller one was Lamar, the black guy who gave guns to the players in the online mode.","“Legal? Oh, yeah. The damn retirement benefits and tax refunds, etc.” The brawny black guy was the third main character Franklin. They cussed while they walked, and their tones seemed like they would break into a fight at any moment.","They opened the lock and entered the courtyard of a townhouse on the beach, and then they each drove out in a race car.","“What do you think? The cars are fancy, right?”","“He should have paid his debt properly! Hahaha!”","“Seriously, we wouldn’t have taken them if he paid what he owed.”","They were taking back the cars by force since the owner hadn’t paid the loans.","Liu Ningyun was also playing the offline mode. Franklin knew how to drive, and his driving skills included knowledge of traffic rules, what he could do, and what he couldn’t do. This was the basic knowledge that was in his memory. Although it was a bit overwhelming for the players who were new to this world at the beginning, they were doing better than before.","As a new driver, Liu Ningyun drove an orange race car while she murmured silently, I didn’t do it.","It was comforting to hear these words since she didn’t feel like a criminal now.","On the other side, the Xichi Spiritual Master drove a white race car wriggly and soon knocked down a pedestrian. With a dark expression, she sped up and fled the scene before the pedestrian could yell.","The gaming world was easy to understand, and the players were more chill. If she did such a disgraceful thing in the real world, she would have wanted to kill all the people around to keep the secret!","The cultivators usually moved around by riding demon beasts or taking spiritual boats, and they had never seen such novel transportation tools which could move without food or spiritual essence.","More importantly, the race cars looked very dashing with their streamlined bodies. They could put the roofs into the trunk, which made it easier for them to enjoy the views on the side of the street. Right now, they were driving along the coastline, and it was enjoyable to cruise in a race car through this scenery.","“Wow!” Ruan Ning yelled in elation. “This race car is so fun!”","“Ningning! What are you playing?” At this moment, Xi Yue and the other girls came into the shop and saw Ruan Ning driving a dashing race car through the city, which instantly kindled their interest. “What’s this? We want to play it too!”","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","“Hahahaha!” Song Qingfeng sped up his race car in the city. “I saw such things in the movies but never tried it before. It’s fun to drive!”","“Master! Master! The car is almost as fast as a demon beast! How can it be so fast?” While watching the game behind Su Tianji, Fenghua and Yuexin were excited that this heavy-looking iron block could move so fast.","“It seems that I can drive even faster.” Su Tianji stepped harder on the gas peddle and raced to 200 kilometers per hour.","“See? Even demon beasts don’t dare to run so fast in Jiuhua City!” This speed looked very cool.","Su Tianji squinted in the strong winds and then heard a yell, “Master! You’re crashing into something!”","“Brake! Brake!” Su Tianji frantically stepped on the ‘brake’, but the whole car roared and crashed forward at a greater speed!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Fenghua and Yuexin gaped while a figure flew out of the car, almost being launched into outer space.","“...”","The small semi-truck in front of her was already shattered!","In the sky, Su Tianji waved her arms and legs subconsciously.","The girls covered their faces at a loss for words.","...","By now, the players of GTA 5 were all racing on the roads of Los Santos.","The scenes were too ‘beautiful’ to watch, making many people look away. For example, some of them crashed into pedestrians, and blood sprayed all over their faces.","The shop was filled with yells and gasps.","The three main characters in the offline mode were almost ordinary people.","The only good news was that their special abilities were maintained, but the effects were not obvious when the players were at low-levels.","– In the Half City shop –","The players who had been racing were surprised when they received the prompts from the game. “Did you guys see that? This guy seems to have a special ability!”","“It seems like he can slow down the time around him. Sir, can we...”","Franklin’s special ability was similar to Michael’s special ability, Bullet Time. Franklin’s special ability was Driving Focus, and he could slow down time to steer the car when it was too fast to control, which made the game less difficult for players.","“I don’t know! I thought you all didn’t want to play!” Mr. Fang was impatient.","After all, this thing wasn’t a spiritual spell or a combat technique, so he didn’t know if it could be learned.","“Quickly tell us!” Ruan Ning was ferocious beside him.","Now that they had entered the game, he wasn’t going to tell them anything?","It was infuriating.","While the players in both shops were enjoying themselves, Mr. Fang had almost finished all the missions.","Digging out the smartphone from his pocket, he received a call from Lester, which meant that he could start the multi-player online mission.","[Sir, are you done?] Song Qingfeng had finished several offline missions and was more familiar with the whole game.","[I’m ready!]"]},{"number":334,"title":"Chapter 334 - Robbing is a technical job","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I’ll take one of you to do something big first! Who wants to come?” The Fleeca Job was a must-do job, but it only needed two players.","“Only one?” Song Qingfeng looked sulky.","“I’ll come!” Su Tianji was eager to play.","“Go ahead with Sister Su,” Song Qingfeng said, “I’ll practice my driving skills first.”","After Mr. Fang invited Su Tianji to join his group, Lester came into Mr. Fang’s new house, and the job began.","Lester was a fat guy who looked like a fat penguin with his round glasses and a walking cane.","No one would think that he was a super hacker and a cunning fox who not only masterminded all kinds of special jobs for the online players and the offline players, but also staged that incident nine years ago.","The Fleeca Job was a basic job in the online mode and didn’t need the players to make plans. From the very beginning of the job, Lester brought a detailed plan with him.","It was just as he said, “There’s no risk unless you are caught or shot down.”","“Sir, what are we going to do?” Su Tianji was a bit confused about the situation.","“We’ll rob from the rich and give to the poor,” Mr. Fang said, “Let’s go; just follow the fat guy.”","A blue car was parked outside.","The moment Su Tianji saw the car, she got behind the wheel and declared boldly, “I’ll drive!”","“Can you do it?” Mr. Fang looked doubtful.","“I can’t do it?!” Su Tianji stepped on the gas pedal, and the car shot out. “Open your eyes wide and watch!”","“Hey! Damn it! I’m still here!” Lester had just opened the car door and almost stumbled when the car suddenly shot out.","Looking at the car that was dashing away, he almost cussed out loudly.","“Hey, can you be more careful!” With cold sweat on his face, Mr. Fang watched as Su Tianji backed the car to the house and picked up the cussing Lester.","“Sir, where are we going?” While driving, Su Tianji still didn’t know where they were going.","“Use the GPS of the cellphone!” Mr. Fang looked disdainful. “Have you played the offline mode? Do you know how to use the GPS on the cellphone? Open the GPS, search Fleeca Bank, and follow the instructions.”","Mr. Fang had to teach this grand cultivator, who didn’t know anything, how to use the GPS.","“We can do this?” Su Tianji took out a black smartphone from her pocket in amazement. After clicking open the GPS App, she saw that the route to the destination was planned automatically.","“What are you playing?” As an old player, Nalan Hongwu would occasionally watch his old friends play. Now, he found that they were playing a weird game.","“Grand Theft Auto 5.” Su Tianji waved the smartphone in her hand. “The shop owner is taking me to rob from the rich and give to the poor.”","“Shop Owner?”","“Take you to rob from the rich and give to the poor?”","Hearing her words, some people walked over to watch her play.","Nalan Hongwu stood behind her and watched. He wasn’t in a hurry today since he hadn’t gone online yet.","“Sir, why aren’t you playing the offline mode?” Liu Ningyun looked over with a frown and saw Mr. Fang had created his own characters instead of using the three main characters. Also, a great beauty with long hair sat beside him.","“Because I’m an old driver.” Mr. Fang was smug.","Although Mr. Fang was an experienced driver, he was now sitting in a car driven by Su Tianji, a new driver. Shortly, a horrifying thing happened; the car shot out of a huge downhill road.","“Ahh!” He had been fine while he played the game with keyboard and mouse. But now, his heart was in his throat while he experienced the sensation of weightlessness. “Can you drive or not?!”","Fortunately, there was another road below them, and the car landed.","Boom!","The car windows were almost all shattered, and they would have died if they hadn’t buckled up.","Sitting in the backseat, Lester had white foam floating out of his mouth.","The people watching the game from behind were all at a loss for words.","They started again and finally arrived at Fleeca Bank with some hiccups.","Lester said, “I’ve just entered their security camera system with my cellphone. You guys look at it.”","“It’s a small place, and the security isn’t very tight,” he said jokingly, “The employees won’t mind us, and the customers should be thinking about how to make this scene into a movie script.”","“How come I feel like this is a... bank?” Su Tianji asked, “Sir, are we here to rob from the rich and give to the poor?”","“Have you seen a place that has more money than a bank?” Mr. Fang asked back.","Su Tianji froze for a second and asked, “Then, who are we helping with the money we...”","Mr. Fang said in contempt, “Look at your cheap T-shirt and jeans; you have no car or house, and you only have a little change in your pocket. Don’t you think that you’re poor?”","“Hahahahaha!” Nalan Hongwu laughed so hard that he almost choked. “Elder Su is being lured by Kid Fang to rob a bank?”","“Is this called robbing from the rich and giving to the poor? Hahahaha!” An Huwei also walked over to watch it.","“What are you laughing about?!” Su Tianji said with a snort. “It’s just a bank; it’s not a big deal. Just tell me how much I can get?”","Mr. Fang said in disdain, “You almost killed the mastermind in that car crash; how much do you think you can get? If we’re in the real world, and I had a teammate like you, the team would be dead.” Mr. Fang spread his hands and shrugged. “After all, robbing is a technical job!”","Mr. Fang’s words were hurtful, and Su Tianji was determined to show him her abilities later.","Soon, Lester hacked into the security camera system and got all the images and videos from the cameras in his cellphone. “The safes are behind a security door. We are taking the box with the number 167.”","It was an extremely detailed plan.","Lester wrote out each step and provided great technical support. “I wrote a very interesting program, and it can help you deal with most of the problems.”","Then, he taught his two teammates how to use the hacking software which was the most important part of this heist. Without the help of Lester, Mr. Fang couldn’t do such a big robbery on his own.","The software was more complicated than the one in the original game, but it wasn’t difficult for Mr. Fang.","After doing the inspection, Lester’s assistant Page did the small work and the preparation of items. Meanwhile, Mr. Fang and Su Tianji did the tough manual work and had to rob a car, which wasa Kuruma model.","This was a very useful bullet-proof vehicle, and it was necessary. Without it, they couldn’t make it out alive with only Mr. Fang and Su Tianji doing the fighting.","“Why not take one from the troublesome Korean gangster? We can leave some clues that lead to them, so they could take the blame.” Obviously, Lester had even made plans for how to get rid of police after the heist; it was a well-thought scheme.","“Do you have a gun?” Mr. Fang asked","“Of course.” Su Tianji showed him a small pistol. “That black guy gave it to me.”","“Buy some ammunition.” Mr. Fang looked heroic. “We need to take on a whole group with two pistols. Do you have the confidence?”","Su Tianji was at a loss for words."]},{"number":335,"title":"Chapter 335 - Everyone, Come and Rob","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Two pistols?!”","“What can they do with two pistols?”","The surrounding audience looked baffled, wondering how they could deal with about 20 people with only two pistols.","After all, the characters that they played were only ordinary people.","“You’ll know later. Buckle up.” Mr. Fang drove to the address that Lester gave him. It was a multi-story parking lot, and Mr. Fang drove directly to the platform on the top of the building. He saw about ten gang members on the top platform in groups of three or two, and he stepped on the gas peddle and charged at them!","“Lower your head!”","“Ahh!” Shrills sounded while Mr. Fang bumped several gangster members and sent them flying. Then, he drove the car over the bodies and killed anyone who hadn’t been killed by the previous hit.","All the others looked at Mr. Fang in a daze.","“Clear this side first!”","Su Tianji’s had good marksmanship, and Mr. Fang didn’t miss a shot. Soon, under the cover of the car, they killed three enemies on one side.","Like leaves that were being blown by the wind, before the gangsters could react, they had lost their numbers advantage. They scrambled and gathered in small groups of two to three to fight back.","“Amazing!” Song Qingfeng looked at the screen with wide eyes.","Robing the Kuruma was obviously the difficult part in the whole plan, but under Mr. Fang’s leadership, the crew of two completed the mission with only a few scratches.","“Was it smooth?” Mr. Fang drove the Kuruma and left the building with Su Tianji.","“Good! Very good!”","“We can play like this? Damn! Good stuff!”","Of course, some people disagreed. For example, Ruan Ning said, “He’s too smug. It’s simple, and I can do it as well.”","The police in Los Santos noticed the large-scale gun fight on the roof, but the black race car had great horsepower and strong armor. Mr. Fang drove the Kuruma on the streets of the city at a fast speed, leading the police on a wild goose chase and experiencing the thrill and speed of GTA5.","The surrounding scenes flew backward, and Mr. Fang took the opportunity to drift and turn, which was obviously done better than the last time. After some smooth moves, the Kuruma dumped the police cars after getting onto another street.","The communication and surveillance system was soon restricted by Lester, and Fang Qi didn’t have to worry about the police’s chase after dumping those police cars. Besides, they only needed to use this car once. After they drove it into the abandoned factory, this part of the plan was finished.","“This car is awesome!”","“It’s fast, steady, and bullet-proof!” As cultivators, they didn’t know how to precisely describe this kind of modern technology, since they lacked the vocabulary.","Even Black Demon, the Xichi Spiritual Master, and Liu Ningyun came over to watch the game.","“Sir,” Ruan Ning asked. “Can you keep the car?”","“Yeah, you can keep it if you’re not afraid of death.”","“What do you mean?” Ruan Ning said in disdain, “You’ve got it; how dangerous can it be? Will that fat guy turn against you?”","“After they use this car to rob the bank, the police can track them down through the car.” Obviously, Ning Bi gave more thought to this situation.","When everything was ready, Lester would call them again.","For new players, this job was easy and friendly since Lester got everything covered. Besides, Fleeca Bank wasn’t big and didn’t have a large security force. In fact, this force was even weaker than the gang that Fang Qi and Su Tianji had fought earlier.","“Just like this, the defensive arrays are turned off?!” They watched Mr. Fang activate the hacker software that Lester gave him on the smartphone.","To the cultivators, it felt like Fang Qi had walked inside a faction’s grand defensive array and then disabled it by sending two messages through the communication jade.","After pulling on ski masks, they walked into Fleeca Bank as if they owned it. Mr. Fang made a beeline for the safe room and drilled open safe No. 167 while Su Tianji broke the cameras. Working as a team, they soon got back in the Kuruma and sped away.","Then, it was showtime for Fang Qi who was an old driver. He drove the Kuruma on the streets at a fast speed and broke through the blockade.","“How come this car is so tough?!” Mr. Fang sent many cars flying, but his Kuruma was still intact.","“The guards are chasing them!” someone yelled in alarm. “There are so many of them!”","Sparks flew on the Kuruma, but Mr. Fang drove the car as if nothing happened. While humming a song, he drove the car to the bridge according to the plan.","A transportation helicopter was hovering in the air above the bridge. At this moment, people finally understood what a crazy plan this was.","A huge magnet dangled down the transportation helicopter, and it sucked the Kuruma up into the sky!","Obviously, even if it was possible to block the path with force before, it was impossible to stop them now. Once they were out of the sight of the police, they would dump the Kuruma in a remote place, and the troublesome Korean Gang, according to Lester, would be their scapegoat. It was a plan designed to kill two birds with one stone.","Obviously, some people would like to take this opportunity to get rid of a troublesome gang.","“So simple?!” Su Tianji was surprised that she had leveled up twice, and Lester deposited tens of thousands of dollars into her account. “I earned tens of thousands of dollars just like this? I can use the money to buy a gun now?”","“What else do you think?” Fang Qi frowned while he looked at the money which was only half of the amount compared to the original game. He mumbled in contempt, “So little? Do I really have to dump the old fox Lester and do things alone?”","In the system remade version of the game, the players could design their own plans that were suitable and actionable. However, Mr. Fang didn’t have an armored car or hacking technology and hadn’t participated in any big jobs yet. Therefore, he had to be patient and do things from the beginning.","This might be one of the interesting things about online mode. Players could either gather their friends and make money in teams with the support of a mastermind who would make plans, or they could engage in battles of wits and courage and try to make money and do stuff on their own.","After finishing the jobs, players could level up and buy things with money that they earned. For example, they could buy race cars, guns, and even items more advanced than those in Counter Strike and Resident Evil.","By now, people began to understand. If this game was like a chess game, the characters they played were only either the black or the white pieces. At this thought, their previous worries and concerns began to evaporate.","“This game is interesting,” Nalan Hongwu said, “I plan to play it. Is there anyone who wants to join me?”","“Guild President, can you take me to rob this bank too?” Ruan Ning was eager to try.","“Can’t you take more people with you?” Ning Bi seemed to want to join in on the fun as well.","Mo Tianxing asked, “Can I try it?”","Black Demon commented, “This is very interesting.”","He mainly played the Legend of Mir 2, but he could play one or two rounds of this game each day. Obviously, this game was quite different from the Legend of Mir 2.","Even the low-level players could play this game together since levels were not very important here, which meant that the players of other games could use a part of their time to try this game.","The people of Nanhua Faction looked at each other and wondered, Are we really going to rob the bank as well?!"]},{"number":336,"title":"Chapter 336 - Accidents of New Drivers in the Otherworld","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Seeing Mr. Fang playing the game so well, many people began to play the online mode and do jobs after getting to know the game better through playing the offline mode.","However, Mr. Fang could only bring one player with him to do the Fleeca Bank Job.","Then, Mr. Fang took Song Qingfeng and the others to do the job. Since Song Qingfeng had watched Fang Qi and Su Tianji do the job and had more offline experience than Su Tianji, he did better in the game. By the end of the day, Mr. Fang had taken many of them to do the job, and his own fortune grew gradually; he could even afford a Kuruma now.","On the next day, Su Tianji also started the Fleeca Bank Job, rubbing her hands and ready to take her disciples to rob the bank.","“Fenghua! Yuexin! Come here when you finish eating instant noodles.” Su Tianji beckoned at Fenghua and Yuexin who were still eating instant noodles. “This old driver will take you to play the game!”","She looked experienced, and it was clear that she was referring to herself as the old driver.","“Coming! Coming!”","Obviously, Su Tianji was more experienced than yesterday. After the job began, she opened the GPS on her smartphone and drove the car steadily with familiarly.","“Master, how come you’re so good today?”","“Your driving is very steady today!”","“Of course!” Su Tianji said in satisfaction, “How can such a simple thing be difficult for me? When I was a disciple, even the previous faction master praised me! I could master the high-level spiritual spells of Liuyun Daoist Palace in only a few days; this skill is just a piece of cake for me!”","They were now sitting in the driver’s seat and the passenger seat; Lester was babbling something in the back seat.","“Master, can you drift around the corner like how Mr. Fang did it?”","“It’s not difficult!” Su Tianji immediately sped up, and the vintage car dashed out with the speed of a race car. She turned the steering wheel and stepped on the brakes!","Her movements were smooth and beautiful!","Then, ear-piercing noises of tires grinding on the ground sounded.","Screech!","The whole car drifted horizontally at great speed and entered the other street. However, the car kept on drifting until it shot out of the road.","Under the road, the ocean waves crashed on the rocks, and then a black shadow shot down from above.","“Ahhh!”","Boom!","A red cloud surged up into the sky. This time, they died together with Lester!","On the other side, Liu Ningyun and the Xichi Spiritual Master were also trying to do the Fleeca Bank Job in the online mode. Obviously, they were more cautious than Su Tianji since they were new drivers and didn’t dare to try things that were risky.","When they finally drove the car to Fleeca Bank, the sapphire-colored car became so damaged that only a few shards of glass were left on the windows while Lester, who was sitting on the passenger seat, was cussing furiously with blood all over his head and face.","Even Nalan Mingxue and Lan Yan had begun to practice driving skills in the offline mode.","At this moment, Song Qingfeng and Lin Shao already formed a team to do the job. Xu Luo was left alone, but he soon found that he could recruit other players online to do the job together. He decided to try it.","Black Demon was also looking for a teammate, and he immediately responded when he saw the post titled, [Old driver will take you flying.]","“Black Lord?” Surprised that someone responded to his post, Xu Luo said immediately, “Do you know how to play the game? If not, I’ll do the directing.”","Black Demon had watched Mr. Fang do this job several times yesterday and thought, How hard can it be? We aren’t doing anything but driving and fighting.","To show his professionalism more, he said, “I’m an old driver. It will be fine if you know your stuff.”","So professional?! Xu Luo brightened up. After all, only the people who knew the process of the job knew that a good driver was more important than a fighter since driving was the most important skill for this job.","Xu Luo was pleased, and then a thought occurred to him when he remembered that Mr. Fang was now in the Morning Star Sea Realm Shop.","Did Mr. Fang give them a private lesson? Maybe that is why this guy is so confident in himself.","Black Demon now seemed a bit disdainful. “A beginner? Don’t worry, just follow my instructions, and we will get it done easily.”","After all, he had watched Mr. Fang play it yesterday, even though he hadn’t tried it himself yet.","“Hurry up! What are you waiting for?” Black Demon urged him.","Maybe he’s a master at this game? At this thought, Xu Luo immediately activated the job.","“Young Master Xu, aren’t you playing offline mode? How come you are playing the online mode by yourself?” Lin Luo glanced at Xu Luo’s screen curiously.","Xu Luo said smugly, “I’m going to try it. This guy seems to be a master!”","“A master?”","“Yeah!” Xu Luo said, “I’ll play a couple of rounds, and I might make some money.”","With that said, he got into the passenger seat while Black Demon drove the car.","Having played the offline mode for a while, Black Demon knew the basics of driving a car, but Xu Luo suddenly had a bad feeling about it since the car shot out like a wild horse.","A group of pedestrians who were waiting for the green light had no time to dodge when the car crashed into them, killing and wounding many of them!","“Can you drive or not?!” Xu Luo was stupefied.","“I told you that I’m an old driver!” After running over many pedestrians, Black Demon turned the stirring wheel casually and hit another. Then, he crashed into lamp posts, blockades, and almost everything else on the road while he drove forward.","Finally, the car crashed into a convenience shop by the road.","“Mistake! It was just a mistake!”","– Half an hour later –","They passed the first step, but in the second step of driving upstairs to hit people, Black Demon looked at the narrow path and said, “Maybe we should just run up and fight them?”","“Didn’t you say you are an old driver?!”","“As an old driver, I find it’s beneath me to hit them with the car; it is a dirty method!” Black Demon smirked.","Then, he led the way and dashed up to the top floor.","They saw more than ten guns pointing at them.","“...”","– The second time –","“Should we run up again?”","“Drive up!” Xu Luo said with a dark expression.","Three minutes later, a severely damaged car finally broke through a wall beside the staircase and dashed out.","“Ahh!”","Their screens dimmed.","The third time...","The fourth time...","– One hour later –","“Damn it! Let me drive.” Xu Luo exploded in fury.","Finally bumping all the way up to the platform on the roof, Xu Luo dug out his gun and shot at the gangsters wildly.","“Ugh? Where’s the other gun?” After a while, he found that he was the only one shooting at the gangsters. He looked toward Black Demon and saw a middle-aged man lying in the passenger seat, dead long ago!","“Didn’t you say you were an old driver?!”","“I am! But who knew that a bullet would happen to shoot into my head!”","“Get out! F*cking noob!” Xu Luo couldn’t bear it anymore. After looking at the time, he realized that one and a half hours had passed, and he hadn’t even robbed the Kuruma yet."]},{"number":337,"title":"Chapter 337 - New Job","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For the jobs at the earlier stage, Mr. Fang didn’t have to play the offline mode. However, the Fleeca Bank Job was more like a tutorial job and was quite easy. In the following jobs, the players needed to operate all kinds of tools, including piloting planes and helicopters frequently on top of cars, and he had to master all kinds of skills.","So, even Mr. Fang had to go to the offline mode to obtain the knowledge and skills.","For example, in the Prison Break and the Humane Lab Raid, the players had to fly the Hydra VTOL Jet and the Valkyrie Helicopter, which required the players to be able to drive or all kinds of machines on the road or in the air.","By now, Mr. Fang could only drive cars, and he needed practice before he could operate other machines.","Of course, there were other ways to make money in the online mode. If they were interested, they could even speculate in the stock market, purchase properties, and hold illegal racing competitions, etc.","Speculation in the stock market not only was related to the players’ economic statuses, the economic activities of the players will also affect the ups and downs of the stock prices.","In terms of purchasing properties, the players could be a landlord and earn rent, or they could buy a deserted factory or airplane hangar to be arms dealers. They could do whatever they wanted with their properties.","In fact, in the system remake version of the game, the players had more freedom than they could ever imagine. For example, they could buy a shop and do some legal business, and they could even shoot movies and become movie stars.","For example, Michael, one of the three main characters in the game, was a producer in a movie.","Of course, they had to have enough funds to do these things and must make sure that they wouldn’t lose all their money in the process.","Only the special jobs that Mr. Fang was doing were the most stable.","After all, one could start again after death in the game, but one couldn’t get back their money after they lost it.","To make sure that he could fly in the air in the online mode, Mr. Fang began his journey in the offline mode.","The three characters in the offline mode each had their own dramatic personality.","It was a story of three guys and one dog. There was the sensitive and loyal Trevor, who had escaped from the incident nine years ago, Michael, who was trapped in a midlife crisis, and Franklin, who was sent to do minor missions such as stealing cars and taking back collateral on defaulted loans but wanted to make something of himself; Franklin always took a Rottweiler with him.","When the three dramatic figures came together, it was clear that dramatic things would happen.","For example, when Franklin went to Michael’s home to confiscate the car from Michael’s son, he stumbled onto the affair between Michael’s wife and her tennis coach.","That was the dramatic meeting between the old fox Michael and the dramatic Franklin.","After knowing about the affair, the furious Michael destroyed a mansion belonging to a leader of a gang by mistake.","Then, in order to stop his daughter from doing indecent stuff, he broke onto a luxurious yacht all by himself.","Afterwards, it was the reconciliation of Trevor and Michael.","These strange things happened to these dramatic figures, and they provided the players with very special perspectives to see the world.","While Mr. Fang was doing these missions and jobs, the number of players of this game grew gradually, including the fans of Counter Strike and Resident Evil, let alone the artifact masters such as Li Haoran and Jun Yangzi who had begun researching guns.","Since the difference in level wasn’t a big factor in this game, many Legend of Mir 2 players would come and play it occasionally.","Every woman loved to be beautiful. After making some money, most of the female players spent the money on dressing themselves instead of activating more missions.","For example, Su Tianji had not only bought a submachine gun but purchased several outfits as well.","Fang Qi felt like it was inevitable for these players to buy one or two sets of designer outfits if they had enough money.","However, they preferred long-sleeved blouses and long skirts even when they chose from the modern attires.","“Master! Look at the clothes in this shop! Which one is prettier?” It was easy to spend money that they got from robbery. Right now, Su Tianji was doing shopping with her two disciples.","For people like Liu Ningyun, after earning some money with great effort, she liked driving her first car to enjoy the seaside views in a long green floral skirt, a white blouse, and a pair of big sunglasses.","In the game, it was enjoyable to drive around and see the sights of this gaming world that didn’t exist in their real world in between jobs and missions. In fact, they purely enjoy the views and relax in the game.","Sometimes, she would race with Mo Xian and her other junior and senior sisters in the faction. It was also another way of playing the game.","They lived one kind of life in the real world and a totally different one in the game, which was quite fresh and fun for them.","More importantly, the characters in the game could increase their attributes such as strength, stamina, and skills in driving and flying, which would reflect on the players.","Although the increases in the strength of their mortal characters were little in the eyes of the cultivators, they were better than nothing, especially the increase in their physique strength and proficiencies of the skills, such as flying.","The Xichi Spiritual Master wanted to have a deeper understanding of everything, especially after she heard that the cultivators of Wuwei Daoist Alliance had begun to study these things and even gained some results in the combinations of metal machines and runes and arrays.","If not for the trouble in the faction, she would have pulled some grandmasters of the Nanhua Faction to play the game.","While the girls were shopping and sightseeing and the male cultivators were studying the weapons, Mr. Fang had bought a Kuruma from a car dealer.","By now, he could drive all kinds of machines. “Is there anyone who wants to do a new job?”","“New job?”","“What’s that?!”","After all, many players in the two shops were still struggling with the Fleeca Bank Job and thus were surprised to hear the shop owner yell that he was going to do a new job.","Liu Ningyun probably wanted to buy a race car, so she had to make more money when she could.","In fact, she had reached the condition of doing a new job. “I received a new job and have activated it with my master and senior and junior sisters. You can find another person to do it with you.”","Today, she was sitting near Mr. Fang, and she took his invitation lightly.","“The four of you are going to do the new job?”","“Yeah!” Liu Ningyun said casually, “We’re all old drivers now and can do the Fleeca Bank Job with ease. Is there any problem with that?”","It must be noted that the Fleeca Bank Job was Lester’s tutorial job for beginners, which was why it was so easy to do.","Mr. Fang asked tentatively, “How about starting again?”","“Why? We’re almost there.” Liu Ningyun glared at Mr. Fang. “Do you think we can’t do it?”","Mr. Fang shrugged since he saw their mission already – the Velum Heist.","There was a plane which could accommodate five people. Obviously, the plane couldn’t be carried with a car. Without a doubt, their mission was flying this plane to another place."]},{"number":338,"title":"Chapter 338 - Driving A Ground Plane","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The McKenzie Field Hangar wasn’t one of those large commercial airports that could be seen in almost every city; it was a private hangar for small planes.","It wasn’t in the center of the city but located in the rural area of the city surrounded by low hills. Like a huge factory in the country, there were several big cargo containers lying on the ground while gangsters walked around in groups of two and threes. It almost looked like the countryside.","Velum was the private plane of the Vagos Gang.","When the four of them drove to the McKenzie Field Hangar, they saw that two gang members were chatting to each other while they walked on the path leading to the gate of the hangar.","Didi! Xichi Spiritual Master was driving the car. Obviously, the cultivators were quick learners, and she could drive the car well now.","She honked the horn, but the guys before them didn’t show any intention of giving way to the car.","“Make way! Make way for us!”","Liu Ningyun yelled in alarm, “Master, turn the wheel!”","Mo Xian yelled, “You’re going to hit them!”","“Ahh!”","The girls in the car yelled, but the fat guy in the front was sent flying by the car.","“Master, didn’t you say that you could drive well now?” Mo Xian complained in a low voice.","“I honked, but they ignored me and didn’t do anything.” The Xichi Spiritual Master drove forward with a cold expression, and gunshots rose around them.","Obviously, they had attracted the attention of all the gangsters before they could see the plane. It was the territory of the Vagos Gang, and it would take a long time for policemen to race to this rural place.","“There are many of them!” Mo Xian yelled in alarm.","Bang!","The front window was shattered, and the Xichi Spiritual Master’s car zigzagged in the crowd, making a path that no one understood.","Dadada...","The girls had changed from their usual dresses into neat black T-shirt and jeans. They picked up the guns and fired wildly.","“Auch!” Hearing a shrill from the back seat, Mo Xian looked back and saw blood on a snow-white shirt; the disciple named Yue Yan was shot.","“Junior Sister, what is going on? Can you hold on?!”","“Senior Sister... I... am dying!” She lay on the back seat with tears in her eyes. “You... must... avenge me!”","Mo Xian dug out a grenade, bit on the firing pin, and pulled it out before tossing it out. “All of you, go to hell!”","Boom!","The grenade explosion sent several gangsters flying, and then she fired wildly with her submachine gun.","When she looked back, she saw Yue Yan reaching out her hand, saying, “Senior Sister...”","“Huh! You are still alive?” Mo Xia gaped when she saw Yue Yan, who was covered in blood, was still alive.","“I just checked, and I still have one sliver of HP left... I can be saved...”","The others fell silent.","“Master! There’s a plane over there! It must be the one!” Sharp-eyed Liu Ningyun saw the plane parked in the hangar. While firing at the gangsters, she said, “Let’s get onboard! Master, hurry up and fly the plane!”","The four of them scrambled onto the plane with the Xichi Spiritual Master sitting in the cockpit and the others sitting behind her. After a long while, the girls asked, “Master, why aren’t you driving it?”","They looked at the Xichi Spiritual Master who was sitting before them in bafflement.","“This thing seems different from cars?!” Sitting in the cockpit, the Xichi Spiritual Master felt confused while she looked at the complicated buttons on the panel.","“Master! Drive it!”","“Drive it!”","“They are coming!”","“Ahh!”","After all, they were ordinary people in the game and thus couldn’t cast spiritual spells or fly. Looking at the flying bullets around them, the girls shrieked in panic.","“Ahh! Junior Sister is dying! Master, please drive now!” Mo Xian yelled.","“This spiritual artifact is too complicated; I don’t know how to drive it!” With a cold expression, the Xichi Spiritual Master pressed blindly on the buttons.","Finally, the plane moved, and the propeller in the front began to spin.","“It’s moving! It’s moving!”","“Can it fly?” Liu Ningyun and the others were obviously very curious about the plane, which could fly without spiritual essence. “Can it fly by itself like this?”","“How come it’s not flying!” The plane was now out of the hangar, but it was just moving on the ground; it didn’t show any signs that it would fly.","“Quickly fly! Why isn’t it flying?!” The gangsters in the area were firing wildly at them, and they ducked under the windows in fear.","“I don’t know how to fly it!” The Xichi Spiritual Master was still pressing blindly on the buttons.","“How come other people’s planes can fly, but ours is just rolling on the ground? Is it a ground plane?” Yue Yan said curiously.","Mo Xian yelled, “Should we inject some spiritual essence into it?”","“Hahahaha! Senior Sister, my belly hurts! Do you have any spiritual essence right now?” Sitting in the back of the plane, Yue Yan’s belly hurt from laughing while shedding blood. “Maybe we should put some spiritual stones in it?”","“Master! We’re surrounded!” Liu Ningyun yelled while she fired her submachine gun.","“We’re crashing into it! Turn! Turn! Quick!”","Boom!","The plane crashed into a huge cargo container, and a wing was torn off.","“Can the plane fly with only one wing?” Mo Xian looked confused.","“Stop yelling!” The Xichi Spiritual Master couldn’t bear it anymore. At this moment, the plane was wildly crashing into cargo containers in many ways, spinning and turning out of control. It now even lost the propeller.","“Now, it’s like a bald chicken.” Yue Yan had tears on her face.","“Hey! Why are you still alive?” Mo Xian looked at Yue Yan who was still talking weakly in a puddle of blood on the ground.","“Help me up, Senior Sister. I still can kill a couple of them!” Lying in the plane, Yue Yan said bravely while eating snacks.","“...”","Boom!","The plane exploded.","Soon, the joyous team of four for the Prison Break Job sent the message, [The team for the new job, Prison Break, needs an old driver who can fly planes! Three waiting on one!]","“Senior Sister, why can’t I go with you?’","Mo Xian said, “Junior Sister, you are bad! What can you do except lie there and eat snacks?”","“Master can’t fly the plane! It’s not my fault!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master: “...”","“Junior Sister, you are bad; how dare you blame our master! Are you tired of living?!”","Then, Mo Xian came to Mr. Fang’s seat and asked, “Sir, do you know how to fly planes?”","“Of course.” Mr. Fang pointed at the screen. “The new job, Prison Break, needs someone who can after all. We have three and are waiting on one!”","“You have three people already?” Looking at the screen, Mo Xian saw Mr. Fang indeed had two teammates now. One was a white-clothed girl who was about 16 years old; she looked cold, and her ID was ‘Nalan’.","The other was...","Looking at the curvy female who was in tight-fitting clothes and had exquisite brown hair and green eyes, she cussed in her head, “Demonic woman!”","“Senior Sister, are you coming?” Liu Ningyun called out.","“You guys go ahead. I’ll play one with Mr. Fang and learn how to fly planes!”","“You’re going to play with Mr. Fang?!”","Yue Yan chirped, “How can you dump us?!”","She stared at Mr. Fang’s screen and murmured, “You even play with this...”","She murmured to herself after returning to her seat, “You even play with this demonic woman!”","“Nonsense! I’m just playing with Mr. Fang!”","“Mr. Fang is going to do the new job?” Liu Ningyun frowned. “Should we go and watch him play it?”","The Xichi Spiritual Master said while nodding, “Is it possible that Mr. Fang knows how to fly a plane?”","Yue Yan chimed in, “Then, I’ll go and watch as well.”"]},{"number":339,"title":"Chapter 339 - The Armored Car Will Take You Flying","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[New task: Booming Sales","Task Target: Number of GTA 5 players reaches 3,000","Task Reward: Gaming Prize Wheel (Can win a game on the wheel), one lucky treasure chest","Task Description: It should be a piece of cake for this game to reach the sales target of 3,000, right?]","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words after seeing this.","In fact, including the customers who didn’t come each day, the two shops now had about 10,000 customers, and it was a booming business. To make it easy for Jiang Xiaoyue, Mr. Fang allowed her to move a computer to the counter so that she didn’t have to run to the counter every time to take payment.","Fortunately, many of the players came to develop their forces in the Legend of Mir 2, such as members of the Jiuhua Army, the Royal Guard, and the Black Demon Guard.","The members of the same force came and went together and even paid as a group; everything was in order. Otherwise, Jiang Xiaoyue and Zou Mo would have had been overwhelmed and exhausted even though they had cultivation strengths and thus were more nimble than ordinary people.","Right now, there were many players of Grand Theft Auto 5. Now that the forces in the Legend of Mir 2 were established, and the fights among them couldn’t easily change the current situation, the people of Black Demon, the Coiled Dragon Office, and the Yuanheng Pavilion would go and play the new game whenever they had time.","After all, a portion of stuff in the game was very useful to them.","The Yuanheng Pavilion was a shop selling all kinds of treasures. If it could place one or two machine-like weapons in the shop, different from the spiritual artifacts, it would be very eye-catching.","The players in the shop in Jiuhua City were even more enthusiastic about this game.","“Let’s turn on the livestream,” Mr. Fang said. “Now, get into the car.”","Three people gathered in Mr. Fang’s house. Then, the door opened, and Mo Xian walked in wearing a white long-sleeved floral T-shirt, a black vest, and a pair of big sunglasses.","“Are you a big celebrity now? You are even wearing a pair of sunglasses to do this job?” Now, the teammates were all here.","“Ugh? The shop owner turned on the livestream again?” Many players looked toward the big screens in surprise since it was usually only turned on for the weekly TV Series.","“Grand Theft Auto 5 online mode?” There were many new players now, and they were pleasantly surprised that they could watch Mr. Fang’s livestream.","Many of them were very confused with the online mode. They couldn’t earn money but didn’t dare to enter others’ teams in fear of being called noobs. Therefore, they were forced to play the offline mode. But obviously, it was more fun to drive and play with other players, and they could earn more money there as well.","Many disciples of Xiyi Academy and Shengjing Academy sat down on the couches to watch. Liang Shi and his friends also joined in. They had earned their first pot of gold in their lives in the Origins Internet Club, and they had great interests in the mechanisms of guns and cars, so they got offline and watched the livestream on the couches while sipping Coke.","“Today, I’ll broadcast the new job,” Mr. Fang explained, “I brought two friends from Half City and one from Jiuhua City. Friends of Jiuhua City must all know Ms. Nalan who is the champion of the Counter Strike group competition, and I’m confident in her marksmanship. As for the two teammates from Half City whose IDs are ‘Black Fairy’ and ‘Smoky Rain in Green’, they are new players.”","“Sir! I’m an old driver!” Mo Xian was not pleased with this introduction.","Ning Bi smiled charmingly, “I’m a new player, and I appreciate your future guidance!”","Bullet messages soon flooded the screen.","[So, there are beauties in the Morning Star Sea Realm!]","[I thought people over there are all fierce-looking, fat, and have at least eight scars on their faces.]","[I thought the cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm are all gloomy, vicious, and murderous-looking...]","[You guys obviously have some damn misconceptions about our Morning Star Sea Realm, uh?] Obviously, a displeased cultivator of the Morning Star Sea Realm sent this message.","[The two girls are so beautiful!]","[Hello! Beauties from the Morning Star Sea Realm.]","...","“So, Lester said that you might be able to help us.” The mastermind who planned this mission was a guy with a crewcut. After the Fleeca Bank Job, Lester obviously thought that Mr. Fang was a good partner and had introduced a new job to him. “Ugh, in fact, it isn’t me who is seeking your help. I’m not involved in your business.”","“We don’t mean to recruit you; it’s just an opportunity,” the guy said to the players. “Professor Maxim Rashkovsky was a top scientist in the military.”","“He has three doctorate degrees and knows a lot, but he is also a vain sociopath, control freak, weapon developer, engineer... He’s definitely not an ordinary person.”","“He’s a god-damn traitor. I mean he’s a rat and got imprisoned for crimes...”","Just from the introduction, the job was obviously not on the same level as the previous ones. The players’ target was this professor.","This wasn’t an ordinary job anymore; it was more like a scene one could only see in TV Series or movies.","In short, it could be described with only two words – big deal.","“However, we’ll need to do some preparations which are quite easy. It’s just a standard operation to break into the government’s organizations, if you know what I mean.”","The plane was the first heist setup for the Prison Break, which was robbing the plane; it was what Mo Xian and her team had tried to do before.","After getting downstairs, Mr. Fang drove his black armored Kuruma out of his garage. It wasn’t the first time that they saw the thick and heavy car, but it was still an impressive sight.","“Kuruma?! The shop owner already bought a Kuruma?!”","“From the looks of it, it’s bullet-proof!”","The whole car was bullet-proof and equipped to the windows, and the windows were much smaller than the usual ones surrounded by heavy and thick bullet-proof plates. If the people in the car wanted to shoot, they could just stick out the guns through the narrow windows. They were almost inside a moving fortress.","Ordinary guns would present little threat to such a bullet-proof vehicle.","“I guess you must have emptied the bank, right?” Nalan Mingxue looked at Mr. Fang’s smug face.","After all, the Kuruma was very expensive.","“Don’t waste time. Get in the car, and the armored car will take you flying,” Mr. Fang said heroically.","He ignored their identities as fairies and a demonic woman; he got them onto the car, and they were going to rob the plane.","“Can I drive it? It’s far from here.” Seeing Mr. Fang’s luxurious car, Mo Xian was eager to drive it.","“No! I can do it!” With one hand on the steering wheel, Mr. Fang pulled out a song list. The music that players purchased in Qzone or songs that they recorded themselves could all be stored in Grand Theft Auto 5.","Soon, the familiar music rose in the car.","“Jung sing heung hei gwai ga dik seun hou, joi ta sang meng leui, fong fat dai dim hei heui ...”","[TL Note: meaning – The clock bell chimes the signal to go home. In his life, there seems to carry a small sigh of regret.]","While he drove, the song came to the climax, “Gam tin ji yau chan lau dik keui hok, ying jip gwong fai seui yuet.”","[TL Note: meaning – Today there is only the remains of a shell, to welcome the glorious years.]","Then, female voices sang along, “fung yue jung pou gan ji yau...”","[TL Note: meaning – Holding fast to freedom in the wind and rain. Since this was a Cantonese song, it sounds different in Mandarin. It would be misinterpreted as ‘banging a gay friend in the wind and rain’.]","Mr. Fang turned to look at Ning Bi and Mo Xian, at a loss for words.","“Little Shop Owner, why are you stare at me like that?” Ning Bi asked in bafflement.","Mo Xian said, “We sang it correctly...”"]},{"number":340,"title":"Chapter 340 - Mr. Fang’s Off-Road Vehicle","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Since the livestream was turned on, everyone could hear the song playing in Mr. Fang’s car.","They also heard the female singing voices.","“What’s the song that Mr. Fang’s playing in his car?”","“What are they singing?”","They were confused.","At this moment, Fang Qi turned on the GPS on his phone.","To reach the rural area as soon as they could, Mr. Fang told them, “Please buckle up.”","Then, he began to speed up.","Different from other cars, the Kuruma was difficult to damage, and Mr. Fang accelerated without caring.","“Sir! What are you doing? Why are you driving off of the road?” Mo Xian yelled from behind him.","“Sir, what’re you doing?” Nalan Mingxue was also puzzled.","When the car was out of the city and close to the rural area, Mr. Fang glanced at the GPS and drove the car off of the road onto a slope, turning the normal driving to an off-road experience. The car zigged and zagged on the uneven ground while dodging all kinds of bushes and trees, yet its speed was still fast.","“It’s a short cut.” Mr. Fang was very calm. “I’m an old driver, and you have nothing to worry about. Haven’t you seen an off-road vehicle?”","Mr. Fang drove the Kuruma through a fence. Due to the high speed and the uneven ground, the whole car stood on one side and then rolled back and readjusted itself. Then, Mr. Fang continued to drive across the farm calmly.","“The Shop Owner is awesome!”","“He drove the car from a perpendicular angle...”","“Can you drive it the normal way?” Nalan Mingxue was dizzy. “If not, let me drive the car!”","Mr. Fang ignored her while racing down the hilly slope.","Thud!","Sometime later, the front wheels bumped into something, and the car shot up into the air and flipped two times before landing on a nearby path.","While feeling dizzy, Nalan Mingxue and Mo Xie almost spat out blood.","The audience watched the scene at a loss for words.","“Sir, can you drive or not?!” Mo Xian yelled wildly.","“We’ve saved about ten minutes.” Mr. Fang wasn’t a bit sorry and continued to race the car on the uneven terrain.","“I want to get out!” Mo Xian couldn’t bear it anymore; she had the urge to throw up.","“I’ve locked the doors,” Mr. Fang said apologetically. “You can’t get out once you get on my car.”","“Hahahaha! Sir! I admire you for it!”","“Dashing!”","“Sir, how can you do this?”","“I’m going to learn this driving skill. Is there anyone who isn’t afraid of death and dares to try it with me?”","The people of the Nanhua Faction looked awkward. “We’re lucky that we’re not in the car.”","Despite Mr. Fang’s wild driving, the Kuruma was still intact. Even if it were damaged, Mr. Fang, a figure who was focused on doing big deals, could afford to pay for the repair.","About 30 minutes later, they arrived at the field hangar. Mr. Fang drove straight in and ran over two gangsters who were walking around without looking. Soon, yells, cusses, and gunshots rose.","With one hand on the steering wheel, Mr. Fang stuck his gun through the small window which was only wide enough for a few guns to fit through and offer a little vision to the shooters. Obviously, it was very difficult for the people outside to shoot into the car from the distance.","He killed two with his pistol while Nalan Mingxue copied him and killed three gangsters with a submachine gun with one bullet at a time.","“Good aim!”","“Awesome!”","The players from the Morning Star Sea Realm were dumbfounded. “Mr. Fang’s aim is so good! So is the girl named Nalan!”","Black Demon said with a nod, “She headshot them with all three shots.”","Meanwhile, Mo Xian fired wildly with a submachine gun, killing one and wounding one.","Ning Bi found that it wasn’t necessary for her to shoot.","“Should we get out of the car?” Nalan Mingxue asked.","“Not necessary.” Mr. Fang fired while driving the car. “Clean up the people nearly. Be careful and don’t kill!”","“We have killed more than ten of them!”","[Mr. Fang is awesome!]","[This Nalan has good aim!]","[The two in the back seats are indeed new players!]","Mo Xian: “...”","Ning Bi watched the battle curiously. At the same time, she told everyone that she was a new player.","“Clean the ones hiding in the corners!”","Nalan Mingxue made the gesture that meant ‘roger’ before shooting all of them with the submachine gun.","“Get out the car,” Mr. Fang said. “Drive the car back for me. I’ll take the new players to fly the plane.”","“Take me and do this again.” Nalan Mingxue wouldn’t do it for free.","Mr. Fang made an ‘okay’ hand gesture.","“Get out of the car and board the plane!” At this moment, they had killed almost all the gangsters, but more members of the Vagos Gang were on the way.","They coordinated well. While Mr. Fang went to fly the plane with two teammates, Nalan Mingxue drove Mr. Fang’s car back.","“Now, I’ll explain the key points in flying a plane. If you find it’s hard to follow, I suggest you learn it in the offline mode.” Under Mr. Fang’s control, the Velum five-seater soon charged out of the hangar and accelerated on the runway before gradually taking off.","“It’s flying?!” The Xichi Spiritual Master was surprised while she watched the ‘spiritual artifact’ fly up. After all, she had tried her best to get it up but failed miserably.","“This plane is awesome!”","“This thing can really fly?” Liang Shi and his friends looked incredulous while they gazed at the screen. Isn’t it just a block of metal?","Standing before the big screen or behind Mr. Fang’s computer, they watched as Mr. Fang calmly controlled the plane and flew into the sky. It was their first time seeing a metal block fly in the sky like a spiritual boat without spiritual essence, and they were full of curiosity.","The bird’s eye view of a modern city was quite different from that of an ancient city. A big city like Los Santos looked well organized with its skyscrapers, residential buildings, airports, harbors, and the downtown area which was even bigger than that of an entire ancient city.","“How come this city has no walls?”","“Yeah, it has no walls!”","“How do they defend themselves? What do they build?”","“Aren’t they afraid about the invasion of their enemies?”","The cultivators were used to cities with defensive walls, city-defense arrays, and restriction arrays, and it was hard for them to understand or imagine things such as radars, satellite scanning, and missile tracking and interception. After all, they came from a totally different civilization.","Sitting in the plane, Mo Xian and Ning Bi looked out through the windows at the blue sky and the well-organized city with wonder.","Gazing forward with her bright eyes, Ning Bi asked, “How does it fly? Does it depend on the spinning thingy on the nose?”","“It can only take the plane up in the air,” Mo Xian asked, “How can it turn and get up and down in the air?”","Mr. Fang answered their questions while he flew the plane to the designated place.","The plane drew an elegant arc before landing on the designated airfield.","“Is it done?” Mo Xian was dazed. “It didn’t feel difficult!”","“Of course! I did all the difficult work.” After all, Mr. Fang brought with him an armored car which was like a moving fortress and took the team into the hanger.","Everyone knew that flying a plane wasn’t an easy task, and even Mr. Fang had to practice for a long while in the offline mode before he dared to try it in the online mode.","[The Shop Owner is indeed the Boss!]","[Old driver, old driver!]","[Very steady!]","The audience snapped out of their daze and began flooding the screen with messages."]},{"number":341,"title":"Chapter 341 - The collision of the two civilizations, the peace before the storm","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After finishing the job, Mr. Fang taught his three teammates the basics of controlling the plane before letting them try flying it. They didn’t have to fly like a professional; it was enough for them to know how to take off, land, and turn.","After all, playing in the gaming world was different from flying the plane in the real world. In the real world, even a small mistake might cause the destruction of the plane and death of the people on it, so the pilot must be extremely cautious. However, in the game, the players only needed to make the plane successfully take off and land once in two to three tries.","Everything went on smoothly as planned.","The next job for them was to intercept the transportation bus of the Bolingbroke Prison which was used to move prisoners to the prison, and then they had to dump the cops.","This job was obviously more complicated than the previous ones. After taking the prison bus, they had to take back Professor Rashkovsky’s private car and get the police’s schedule.","Through the job of the assassination of the lawyer of a plaintiff, the players experienced the regular use of a sniper rifle. Obviously, the technology in GTA 5 was much more advanced than that in Fang Qi’s world before he traveled through space and time, and the sniper rifles that were precise, stable, and could shoot repeatedly and rocket-propelled grenade launchers (RPG) which could launch tracking missiles gave a thrilling and impressive ‘spiritual artifact’ using experience to the players.","“The prison bus is carrying an X-rated criminal. The cops will think that we want to help him break out, and that thought will distract them from what we do. Do you know what I mean?” Instructions came from the radio. Under Mr. Fang’s leadership, the plan was carried out smoothly; when they got everything ready, the job came to the final step.","The crew split into two groups. One of them would intercept the prison bus returning to the prison, and this task was led by Mr. Fang. The other group was led by Nalan Mingxue, and they would drive the prison bus they had robbed previously into the prison.","Of course, they didn’t expect that they would deceive the prison for long. In fact, they were only hoping to enter the prison peacefully. Only then could they drive the Kuruma into the prison. With so many enemies, only the Kuruma, a moving fortress, could help them kill their way in and out since their enemies didn’t have RPGs.","On the screen, bullets flew while both parties engaged in a fierce fight with modern technology.","At this moment, not only Nalan Mingxue, but the two new players fired wildly through the narrow openings on the windows. The bright gunfire presented the audience with a scene of modern warfare and allowed them to have a good look.","Soon, Nalan Mingxue followed the instructions and found Professor Rashkovsky. Then, she drove the Kuruma out of the prison and flew him out of the country in the Velum.","When everyone thought that the job was going to end, white fighter jets soared into the sky one after another.","“We have a problem, the air traffic control tracked down the plane and will send jets after it!” When Mr. Fang received the information, a completely black chopper slowly ascended into the air under his control.","He was carrying out the next step of the plan – going to the airfield near the prison to take this Buzzard Chopper.","Obviously, the planner had predicted this situation. Besides, the prison had made a mistake in judgment and had put its attention on the criminal who had been broken out, thus neglecting some important issues.","When the chopper was air-born, the air blockade obviously failed.","On the screen of Fang Qi’s chopper, several red target boxes locked onto the jets that were soaring in the sky, and he pressed the missile launch button!","Swoosh! Swoosh!","With long flame tails, two missiles drew thick arcs in the air.","Boom! Boom! With two huge explosions, the two jets which had been flying swiftly were instantly exploded!","Mr. Fang’s chopper flew behind the Velum and guarded it. Obviously, the Buzzard Chopper that Fang Qi robbed had the highest-level of offensive abilities in the air, and its precision-guided missiles made the fast speed of the jets look like a joke. In contrast, the jets’ missiles obviously were not as accurate, and they couldn’t shoot Fang Qi’s chopper as he maneuvered in the air!","“How come his aim is so accurate?!” The players in front of the livestream were dazed. They watched the red target boxes locking onto the jets which were only small dots in the distant sky. Then, the chopper launched missiles, turning these jets into fireballs and making them crash.","More jets chased after, and Mr. Fang controlled the Buzzard Chopper to shoot them down one by one so that they wouldn’t get close to the Velum, which was transporting the professor out of the country.","Before the jets could get close, they exploded like dazzling fireballs in the distant sky.","In the battle, Fang Qi didn’t use any of the cultivators’ dazzling spiritual spells or borrow power from heaven and earth or even activate his own energy. All Mr. Fang did was press buttons to launch missiles while staring at the screen.","This method was much simpler than battling with spiritual spells and combat techniques, but it could effectively strike the enemies who were several times stronger!","“It’s so powerful!”","The cultivators found it unbelievable that one could show such a great combat force without relying on spiritual essence, especially when this combat method was even superior in some ways.","This was the collision between two civilizations, and they witnessed the products of the wisdom of another civilization.","When they played Resident Evil and Counter Strike, they had seen all kinds of guns, and they had only a cursory glance of this flight spiritual artifact when they cleared the stage in Resident Evil.","But they had never imagined that this flight spiritual artifact could be so powerful!","If they could engrave arrays and runes on it, they would create a super spiritual artifact that no one had ever seen before. Anyway, they were thinking about how to make such artifacts.","It was clear that they were excited already just thinking about the prospect alone.","After Fang Qi and Nalan Mingxue on the Velum got rid of the air blockade of the jets and all the other enemies who chased after them, Fang Qi landed the Buzzard Chopper on a remote beach. Meanwhile, three parachutes floated down from the Velum while the professor whom they saved from prison flew the plane out of the country.","“This is super fun!” After landing on the ground, Mo Xian was exhilarated.","“It was fun to fly the plane.” Nalan Mingxue intensely stared at the Buzzard Chopper that Fang Qi parked on the side. “Can we try this one?”","“I want to try it too!” Mo Xian said eagerly.","Obviously, this job came to an end, and they only had to return safely.","While they were enjoying the game, the intense ominous aura thickened in the Forbidden Place of the Nanhua Faction."]},{"number":342,"title":"Chapter 342 - Do you crave for strength? (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the surface, the whole Nanhua Faction looked the same as before with everything going on smoothly.","“Feng Family Master, what brings you to our faction?” In the Thousand-Light Hall of the Nanhua Faction, they were receiving the Feng Family Master of the Morning Star Sea Realm. Due to the great strength of the Feng Family, even the Nanhua Faction must show respect to the Feng Family Master who came to visit.","“Not much; I just ended my seclusion cultivation and came out to visit my old friends. I know your faction cultivates ultimate immortal techniques. When your Heavenly Light comes out, it will repel all demons and devils. What I’ve seen today shows that your faction well-deserves your reputation!” A grey-robed, celestial-looking old man with white hair and a white beard was sitting on the chair on the left.","Anyone who didn’t know him would think that he was a respected Daoist from some famous mountain.","“Bring up the presents!’ The old man waved his hand and ordered the members of the Feng Family.","...","“Well! I still want to play Grand Theft Auto, but we have to return.” A group of disciples walked into the square of the Nanhua Faction in groups of three to five.","They enjoyed themselves in the game and had been reluctant to leave.","“I wonder when we can fly that spiritual artifact called the Buzzard Chopper.”","“The spiritual artifact named the Kuruma is good. After we make some more money, we can afford it!”","“Eight hours of computer time passed so fast. I wonder if that despicable shop owner made the clock go faster,” Yue Yan complained.","“We should have someone watch him to prevent him from making adjustments to the clock behind our backs!”","“Right!” Mo Xian agreed. “Do you agree, Junior Sister Liu?”","“Ugh? Master, what’s wrong?” Liu Ningyun found it strange that the Xichi Spiritual Master had remained silent.","“Nothing.” Xichi Spiritual Master shook her head; she had just sensed a trace of a strange presence. Maybe it was an illusion.","“I’ll go back to my residence. You can go on with your chatting and remember to do your cultivation.” Still feeling like something was off, she shook her head and told her disciples.","“Got it, Master!”","“What do you think of my performance today?” Mo Xian was proud that she joined Mr. Fang’s livestream, and she looked smug. “Wasn’t my aim great? I made our factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm proud, right? Today, even the cultivators from the other shop watched the livestream!”","“Senior Sister, you’re awesome!”","“Senior Sister, you’re an old driver now!”","Mo Xian said smugly, “Junior Sister Liu, do you want this old driver to take you to fly the plane tomorrow? I flew it today with Mr. Fang and have totally mastered the control of this spiritual artifact.”","“Thank you, Senior Sister,” Liu Ningyun said, “But tomorrow, I must take some junior sisters who are new to the game to do the Fleeca Bank Job.”","“The Fleeca Bank Job is very simple; Junior Sister Yue Yan can take them!” Mo Xian said, “It’s settled then. Tomorrow, we must finish the Prison Break Job with our master!”","“Ugh... But Senior Sister, I don’t know how to fly the plane...” Obviously, Liu Ningyun hadn’t completely learned how to fly the plane by watching the livestream.","“Don’t worry! I’ll teach you!” Mo Xian promised. “We must do well in front of our master. We all support you, Junior Sister Liu!”","Liu Ningyun was a little at a loss for words.","While they were talking animatedly, no one noticed that a pair of gloomy eyes were watching them from the darkness.","“Did you hear that the missing disciples have come back,” two passing disciples of the Nanhua Faction were talking about the incident.","“They came back?!” another disciple said with a laugh, “I told you that they would be fine!”","“Yeah. It’s said that they did sneak out the faction and encountered some danger. They came back in low spirits but are fine otherwise.”","While Mo Xian and the others talked among themselves on the square, other disciples were talking about the incidents happening in the faction lately.","At this moment, the eyes hiding in the darkness seemed to be searching for something.","Soon, they seemed to have found a target.","“With your low strength, you dare to ask to join us and do missions out of the faction?’","“Look at your poor talent! I wonder how Master made such a mistake and took this wastrel in!”","“Yeah. In every examination and spiritual spell competition, she always pulls down our group performance!”","“Get out of here!”","“Cry? Do you know anything other than crying!”","Conflicts were inevitable in any place with people, and it was true that in this big faction, it wasn’t so peaceful and loving internally. At this moment, some male disciples were yelling at a fragile-looking girl wearing an elementary disciple robe, “Get out! Don’t let us see you again!”","Xu Jing’s talent wasn’t very good, which was fine in a small faction. But in the Nanhua Faction, her talent was almost the poorest, and she was always looked down by her senior brothers and sisters.","At this moment, a voice seemed to rise from the bottom of her heart.","The voice was deep and hoarse as if it were a murmur from her heart; it sounded as if a devil was trying to lure her. “Are you dissatisfied? Are you lost? Do you want to gain greater power?","“Do you hate them? Follow the hunger in your heart! Come!”","“Who is it?!” It sounded like a voice was calling to her from her heart. Feeling uneasy, she looked around but saw no one.","“Follow the desire in your heart, and you will see what you want to see and get what you want to have...”","Her gaze turned sharp, and the previous fragile look was gone. “Yes... I hate my poor talent. I want to be stronger!”","Seeming to have made a decision, she began to walk to a certain direction.","Meanwhile, the gaze lurking in the darkness vanished in satisfaction.","“What’s with Senior Sister Mo lately?” Liu Ningyun was relieved that she finally got rid of Mo Xian and was about to head to her residence with a few junior sisters.","“Ugh? Junior Sister Xu?” This fragile-looking junior sister was red-eyed, and they wondered if she had just cried.","“Senior Sister Chen?” The female disciple’s steps faltered in alarm as if she were guilty of something.","“She came from my town.” A blue-clothed female disciple walked from behind Liu Ningyun and said, “What’s wrong? Did your senior brothers and sisters bully you again?”","“No... No...” Xu Jing shook her head repeatedly as if she was afraid that they would see the truth.","The girl with surname Chen picked up her hand and said in earnest, “Junior Sister Xu, listen to me!”","“Do you think that your talent is poorer than others’?","“Are you scolded by your senior brothers? Are you confused?”","Xu Jing widened her eyes. “Ugh?”","Chen Lin asked, “Do you want to gain greater strength?”","Nonplussed, Xu Jin felt like these words were familiar. “Eh?”","Chen Lin asked again, “Tell me, do you want it?”","After a long while, Xu Jing said in a small voice, “I... do!”","“Good! Go and drive cars with us! I, an old driver, will take you flying!”","“Let’s go! Today, I’ll tell you how to play it. Tomorrow, we’ll take you to rob Fleeca Bank!”","Xu Jing was dumbfounded.","Chen Lin was pleased that she could act like an old driver in front of a newbie.","...","Meanwhile in the Ethereal Cave Abode in the back mountain of Nanhua Faction, an old man with grey hair and a grey beard was cultivating in seclusion.","However, after circulating his essence all over his body for one entire cycle, his face suddenly flashed between red and white; then, he spat out a mouthful of blood.","“I still can’t do it after cultivating hard for dozens of years! What mistake did I make? Where did I go wrong? Why?! Why am I still stuck here after so many years?! Even my fourth junior brother has surpassed me!”","The Ethereal Spiritual Master was the Third Elder of Nanhua Faction and the Xichi Spiritual Master’s junior brother, but his cultivation strength could no longer rank the third place in the faction.","“Are you dissatisfied?” At this moment, he suddenly seemed to hear a voice from the bottom of his heart."]},{"number":343,"title":"Chapter 343 - Do you crave for strength? (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ugh?” The Ethereal Spiritual Master suspected that he had an auditory hallucination due to his mistake in cultivation.","“What is it?!” With narrowed eyes, he glanced around coldly. Although he was inside the Nanhua Faction, and it was unlikely that demons and devils sneaked in, he was a grand cultivator who had been cultivating for a long time. Therefore, he was more cautious and aware of his surroundings due to his old age and life experience.","It was almost evening, but it was weirdly quiet outside.","A flurry of chilly energy seemed to float in through the gate of the cave abode.","It was as silent and undetectable as a gloomy soul.","“Are you dissatisfied?” That voice seemed to come from all directions. But at the same time, it seemed to come from the depths of his heart.","“You cultivated hard for so many years but got no returns. Soon, not only your fourth junior brother but the other elders whom are all below you will surpass you one by one.”","“What on earth are you?!” The Ethereal Spiritual Master’s handsome face turned wicked while he glanced around coldly.","“Your talent is better than most of the other elders, but due to this mysterious bottleneck, you’ve been stuck for more than a dozen years. Do you hate it?”","“How do you know?” The Ethereal Spiritual Master’s face turned even chiller.","“Because I... am you!” the voice sneered, “I share your thoughts and your mind. I was born in your heart.”","“Nonsense!” The Ethereal Spiritual Master’s face turned cold while the murderous spirit in his eyes intensified. Instantly, waves of horrifying wind blades swept out from his body!","“Die!”","The tables, chairs, bowls, and cabinets around him were shattered by many sharp blades, and the whole room was turned into a ruin in the blink of an eye!","Silence.","The Ethereal Spiritual Master exhaled a mouthful of turbid qi. He had hurt himself due to the small accident in his cultivation, and he forced himself to use spiritual essence, adding salt to his injury.","He let out a cold laugh, thinking that the devil who tried to lure him must have been killed by him.","However, in the next moment, that voice whispered at his ear again, “You can’t kill me because we share the same body.”","“How can it be?!” The Ethereal Spiritual Master’s heart sank. “What kind of devil are you?!”","“Didn’t I tell you? I’m you...”","The atmosphere in the area got even gloomier while endless pitch-black thick mist gushed into the cave abode like waves.","“No! What on earth are you?! How did you slip through the restriction array around my cave abode?!”","“I’m your deepest desire, and I know all you know.” Endless pitch-black thick mist engulfed the Ethereal Spiritual Master like ocean waves!","“Come... Come with me... You’ll get what you want to have...” That voice got deeper and chillier.","Engulfed by the black mist, the Ethereal Spiritual Master’s eyes turned red and then became pitch-black as if thick ink had been injected into them. However, his eyes showed that he was still struggling.","“You can’t do it!” His eyes looked furious. “You’re evil, so don’t even think about controlling me!”","With a furious roar, the Ethereal Spiritual Master viciously unleashed all his cultivation strength toward the mass of black mist while the spiritual light in his eyes turned dim and bright, alternating repeatedly.","Then, the blackness in his eyes obviously gained the upper hand and pressed down his spiritual essence!","Sometime later, the Ethereal Spiritual Master’s eyes turned almost completely dark, and the clearness was totally suppressed.","...","As an elder and master of many disciples, the Xichi Spiritual Master found it not right to enter and play in the Origins Internet Club with a group of disciples, even though she had a good time with them.","She was afraid that she would be influenced by her disciples if the situation continued!","She knew that she should invite several other elders who were at her own realm to team up with her, but the other elders were either busy with duties or cultivating in seclusion.","She thought for a while and remembered that her Junior Brother Ye Tang, the Ethereal Spiritual Master, had been cultivating in seclusion for a long time, and it was about time for him to come out.","At this thought, she came to the Ethereal Spiritual Master’s cave abode.","Two Daoist kids at the gate immediately came up to greet her and said, “Our master... is still cultivating in seclusion.”","[TL Note: In Daoism, it is common for Daoists to take kids as apprentices since they are better at learning things.]","“Who said that I’m still cultivating in seclusion?!”","A man wearing a black robe appeared in front of the cave abode instantly, and his aura appeared thicker than before. But at the same time, the aura also seemed deeper and unreadable.","However, his manners and behavior were still the same.","“Congratulations for gaining progress in your cultivation strength, Junior Brother! Are you, um, out of your seclusion cultivation?” The Xichi Spiritual Master asked happily.","“I am!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master sensed his cultivation strength and said in surprise, “Junior Brother, your cultivation strength has progressed so fast! Congratulations!”","“Of course,” The Ethereal Spiritual Master said proudly, “With my current speed, I guess I’ll soon surpass the Fourth Elder again and might even surpass you, Senior Sister, if you don’t mind my saying so!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master was surprised. “It seems that you have obtained lots of inspirations during your years of seclusion cultivation?”","“Besides that...” Suddenly, a trace of a struggle appeared in the Ethereal Spiritual Master’s eyes as if he were reluctant to do something and was struggling with something in his mind. But soon, he recovered and said, “It’s because I found a very special cultivation method. Senior Sister, if you’re interested, you can join me at midnight tonight!”","“Oh?” The Xichi Spiritual Master frowned. “In fact, I also found a method which can increase cultivation strength fast. If you’re interested, you can come with me now.”","“Ugh?!” The Ethereal Spiritual Master’s eyes were unreadable while he said with a laugh, “Senior Sister, you must be joking. I’m afraid that your method can’t be better than mine.”","The Xichi Spiritual Master was displeased, wondering how his method could be better than watching Jade Dynasty and playing the Legend of Mir 2 and Grand Theft Auto 5.","She said, “Junior Brother, stop kidding. My method probably has the best effects in the world.”","“Oh?” The Ethereal Spiritual Master snickered and said, “Please don’t tease me, Senior Sister. I think my method is absolutely not worse than yours.”","“Are you sure?” The Xichi Spiritual Master said with a smile, “You’re very confident of yourself, Junior Brother. Is it possible that you’ve also watched Jade Dynasty?”","“No. I haven’t!” The Ethereal Spiritual Master said while shaking his head.","The Xichi Spiritual Master continued, “Have you played the Legend of Mir 2?”","The Ethereal Spiritual Master was a little miffed. “What’s that? I haven’t!”","“Do you know about the Heavenly Book?!” The Xichi Spiritual Master recited one sentence, “At the beginning of the world, the chaos filled the space with the sun and the moon concealing their light and the heaven and the earth blurring their boundaries. Then, they began to take shape, and the pure and turbid began to separate...”","Each sentence sounded as resonant as a huge bell, and the ultimate truth the words contained stunned the Ethereal Spiritual Master. Meanwhile, his gaze recovered a trace of clearness, and he asked, “Senior Sister, what did you just chant?!”","“The Heavenly Book!” the Xichi Spiritual Master said, “Today, I’ll take you to experience it in the Origins Internet Club. Do you want to go?!”","“I do!” After recovering a trace of clearness in his eyes, the Ethereal Spiritual Master quickly yelled.","Meanwhile, Yue Yan was looking at a young cultivator curiously. “Senior Brother Long Yi, you mean you have a special method which can increase the cultivation strength? You’re sure that you can surpass the Faction Master’s disciple, Senior Brother Li, in this year’s faction competition?","“I’m sorry, but I don’t want to go. I have to go to bed early because I need to get up early to drive cars...”","She was the seventh junior sister that he had approached, and every one of them said that they would go and drive cars tomorrow. While suppressing his anger, he asked, “What on earth is driving cars?”"]},{"number":344,"title":"Chapter 344 - How come there are less people?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Driving cars?” Yue Yan thought for a moment and then said, “Okay. Senior Brother Long, how about I take you to experience this special method for increasing cultivation strength today. Besides, you can learn lots of stuff that you can’t learn in your daily life. I guarantee that you can defeat Faction Chief’s disciple, Senior Brother Li in this year’s competition in the faction!”","“If you want, I can take you to experience it now. What do you think?” The idea suddenly occurred to Yue Yan. After all, every time she drove, she was reprimanded by Mo Xian for her poor skills, and she didn’t feel superior at all. Besides, her junior sisters now were all old drivers and didn’t need her guidance.","By taking this new player into the game, she could teach him and pretend to be an old driver. She could show him all the games and movies and then dazzle him with her excellent driving skills!","After all, the Fleeca Bank Job needed only two players and was quite easy; she could show him the whole process without him doing anything.","“Ugh...” Long Yi’s expression changed while he thought, What’s happening? Is it possible that Junior Sister had also accepted that lord’s power?!","However, that lord explicitly told me to go there at 11 PM... Long Yi was confused. How come Junior Sister can go there now? Did I do anything wrong?","“Okay!” Long Yi said with a nod, “Then, I’ll go with you and have a look!”","Anyway, there was still a long time before 11 PM, and he could take the time to find out what she had been talking about!","...","Sometime later, Long Yi asked in bafflement, “Junior Sister, are you taking the right path?”","“I am sure.” Yue Yan said, “Just follow me. How can there be another path?”","“Go out?” Nonplussed, Long Yi thought, Aren’t we going to the Forbidden Place in the back mountain? How come we’re going out?","They had reached Nanhua Square by now.","“Hey! Senior Sister Yue Yan?” Two female disciples each led a couple of other disciples while they walked out of the faction.","“Junior Sister An Yan? Junior Sister Jiang Yan?” Yue Yan looked surprised. “Are you... going out too?”","The two girls had four other disciples behind them.","“Yeah,” the female disciple named An Yan said in surprise, “Senior Sister, are you taking Senior Brother Long out of the faction as well?”","She said with a chuckle, “Should we go there together?”","“Ugh? You too?!” Long Yi looked at them in confusion and said in a low voice, “Do you think it is wise to talk about it openly?”","“What are you afraid of?” The female disciple named An Yan said, “We went there with our master and Senior Sister Mo. If anything happens, we won’t be taking the majority of the consequences.”","“You mean even Aunt-Master Xichi...” Long Yi was astonished. I didn’t know that Aunt-Master Xichi joined their camp too... That lord is indeed powerful!","He had been worried that he had walked onto the path of evil to increase his strength, but now he was relieved that so many people had done the same.","Soon, they got onboard a spiritual boat and went to Half City.","...","– On the other side –","“Senior Sister Chen Lin...” Xu Jing was uneasy while she looked at Half City, which stood in the ocean like a demon beast with fangs. “Do we really need to go to this place?”","“Of course!” Chen Lin encouraged her. “Be brave. If you’re afraid of such tiny things, how can you increase your cultivation strength?”","“Okay!” Xu Jing remembered the voice that told her to follow the desire in her heart. Now, she decided to do whatever she could to increase her strength!","In front of the Origins Internet Club at the 36th Block.","“Senior Sister, is this the place?” The Ethereal Spiritual Master looked disdainful since this place looked to be an ordinary shop.","“Junior Brother Ye Tang,” the Xichi Spiritual Master shook her head and said, “You will know once you go in and have a look.”","He pushed open the door and entered, instantly seeing a huge space before him. Seeing his astonishment, the Xichi Spiritual Master explained in satisfaction, “The interior has the most advanced spatial array in the whole cultivation world. On the shelves over are the most delicious delicacies in the whole cultivation world. The instant noodles, Coke, and spicy sticks not only can increase your cultivation strength and refresh your mind but can purify the spiritual essence in your body as well.”","“Where is the Heavenly Book you mentioned?”","“You’ll see.” Xichi Spiritual Master took Ye Tang to the counter. “Little Mo, activate all the stuff for my junior brother. Are there still seats for us?”","“Yes!” While taking the crystals, Zou Mo said immediately, “Over there! The people at No. 103 and No. 104 computer just got offline, and no one has taken them yet.”","“Huh?” The Ethereal Spiritual Master was confused. “What is he talking about?!”","At the Xichi Spiritual Master’s guidance, the Ethereal Spiritual Master sat before a computer and began watching Jade Dynasty.","“To read the Heavenly Book, you must click open the 12th episode of Jade Dynasty; there’s also a scroll of the Heavenly Book in the Heavenly Emperor’s Treasure House in the 28th episode,” Xichi Spiritual Master explained, “However, if you want to understand all the content of the Heavenly Book, you’d better watch from the beginning!”","The Ethereal Spiritual Master clicked open the first episode in which Green Leaf Ancestral Master came out of seclusion. “So... powerful! Is he a true immortal on land?!”","“I can even stand here to watch and understand his spiritual spells and sword techniques! Awesome!”","...","Meanwhile, the fragile-looking female disciple named Xu Jing also walked into the internet café with the others.","“Senior Sister, what do we do in this place?”","“This place can provide you with the fastest method to increase your cultivation strength!” Chen Lin showed her how to enter the game and said proudly, “Here, I’ll show you how to do this job. You’ll gain lots of experience points.”","“Experience? Why do I want that?”","On the other side, Long Yi was already playing. He yelled, “So much experience! I feel it! I feel the increase in my cultivation strength! It increased so much in such a short time!”","“In this way, I’m sure that I can defeat Senior Brother Li in the next competition! Excellent! It’s excellent! Hahahaha!”","While he enjoyed the game, he seemed to have forgotten about some things. For example, he didn’t notice that it was already 11 PM.","In fact, it was almost 12 AM at midnight.","In the Forbidden Place of the Nanhua Faction.","“Feng Family Master, have you finished the task that the Lord asked you to do?” In the moonless night, a demonic woman with white hair and red lips asked.","“Of course.” The grey-robed, celestial-looking cultivator said benignly, “I hope that the Lord won’t forget about my rewards!”","Many disciples of the Nanhua Faction came to this place one by one.","“Of course!” The woman glanced around. “How come there are fewer people?”","She frowned. After all, it took her great efforts to lure and gather these people from under the nose of the Nanhua Faction.","However, there were fewer people here today. Besides, she had gone to take down the Ethereal Spiritual Master herself, and the latter was going to become her powerful assistant. But now, he wasn’t here!!","She had told them to come here at 11 PM. Did I tell them the wrong time?!","At this moment, Long Yi who had just walked out of the internet café suddenly realized something, and his expression changed. “No! What time is it now?!”"]},{"number":345,"title":"Chapter 345 - What Do You Want to Do?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– In the Forbidden Place at the back mountain of the Nanhua Faction –","While looking at Feng Family Master who was walking away, a huge ghost-like shadow appeared from the void.","The gaze was greedy, cruel, and blood-thirsty; it was absolutely not a human gaze.","“Is it done?”","“It’s done.” The woman’s voice had no trace of warmth in it. “However, this old guy is greedy! Shall we...”","A chilly murderous spirit flashed in her eyes.","“Don’t mind him.” The voice was as gloomy as if it were from the abyss of hell. “Once I regain my freedom, everything and everyone will be our slave. There will be no division. By that time, he will be ours as well.”","A gloomy laugh sounded from the depths of the darkness.","“How’s the situation in the Nanhua Faction?” that voice asked.","“Many disciples joined us,” the woman said with a cold smile. “I’m afraid that my good junior sisters and junior brothers are still oblivious to this.”","“Very good!”","“However,” the woman said in bafflement as a light flashed in her eyes. “My Junior Brother Ye Tang should be under my control, but for some reason, he hasn’t shown up. I wonder what happened. Has an accident occur?”","“Don’t worry!” the voice in the darkness said, “He will join us sooner or later! He can no longer control the desire in him. Since he has made the decision to join us, we don’t need to worry about him.”","“Right. This should be a small accident.”","The voice hiding in the darkness said, “Get more disciples of the Nanhua Faction to join our force, so I can come out of this damn place! By then, you will become the Nanhua Faction Master!”","“Nanhua Faction Master.” The woman licked her blood-red lips with her red tongue.","...","It was past midnight, and it would take Long Yi more than one hour to get to the Nanhua Faction from Half City.","“No!” Long Yi’s expression turned dark.","“What’s wrong?” Yue Yan and others asked him curiously.","“I missed something big while I played games and watched the TV Series!” Long Yi looked angry.","“What can be more important than playing games and watching TV Series?”","Long Yi thought to himself, In the Origins Internet Club, I can increase my cultivation strength, learn all kinds of ultimate spells, and even trade for all kinds of precious elixir recipes and other materials and documents by growing vegetables. What else can I ask for?","While he had some time, he even read some parts of the Heavenly Book and gained a deeper understanding of the cultivation technique and spiritual spells of the Nanhua Faction.","Even he, a cultivator with moderate cultivation strength, could sense the laws of the world and ultimate truth contained in the book!","With a clearer mind, he scratched his head. “I think you’re right.”","Then, sudden understanding dawned on him, and he patted his forehead in excitement. “Right! I was acting like a moron! If I can cultivate in this place for one hundred years, I can even surpass the Faction Master, let alone the Faction Master’s disciple, our Senior Brother Li!”","Excited, he immediately asked, “Junior Sister, the shop opens at 8 AM tomorrow, right?”","“Yeah!”","“Then, let’s continue tomorrow!”","“But... that lord eh...” Long Yi suddenly shook his head. “What lord? Do I know a powerful figure? How come I don’t remember it clearly now?”","But he distinctly remembered that a very powerful person seemed have told him something.","Those things that happened were as vague as a dream now. Now, he felt like he woke up from his sleep, and he couldn’t remember much. It was weird.","...","In front of the shop, someone roared again and again as if he were releasing all the pent-up frustrations.","“I broke through! I can’t believe that I broke through this way after dozens of years of hard cultivation!”","“Stop screaming like a ghost!” Instantly, a cuss came from the shop. “Don’t think that I’ll tolerate your misbehavior after the shop is closed! If you yell again, don’t come back tomorrow!”","A Daoist shrunk his neck involuntarily and immediately left shamefacedly.","“Well! Senior Sister, the plane is just an iron block and doesn’t use spiritual essence; I wonder how it flies up. Also, how does the transfiguration spell change an object into a living thing? The Heavenly Book is so awesome, and I wonder who wrote it...”","The Daoist who babbled all the way back to the faction was no other but the Ethereal Spiritual Master.","At this moment, he showed not the slightest trace of qi deviation and existence of an inner demon. Instead, he looked energetic and refreshed. “It is amazing that a bowl of instant noodles turned the messy spiritual essence in my body into the purest spiritual essence. After reading the two scrolls of the Heavenly Book, I realized that I had a misunderstanding about our cultivation technique. The incredible thing is, the Heavenly Book guided me to create a brand-new way by using my mistake!”","Obviously, the breakthrough and the correction of his mistake in terms of cultivation were nothing compared to the fact that he had created his own cultivation method by gaining a breakthrough through his mistake.","“The Heavenly Book contains the ultimate truth of the world.” Evidently, the Xichi Spiritual Master’s understanding of the Heavenly Book was deeper than his. “Even the road you think is mistaken is a part of the world; it might be wrong for us, but for the Heavenly Dao, the mistakes have their reasons to exist in the world.”","“You’re right, Senior Sister.” The Ethereal Spiritual Master nodded repeatedly.","“In my opinion, we must let more disciples know about this cultivation method,” the Ethereal Spiritual Master said, “At least, we can let the elite disciples of our Nanhua Faction cultivate in that place. In one hundred years, our Nanhua Faction will be full of masters.”","“You have a point,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said, “But Faction Master and the other elders are busy, and we better not make a big deal out of it. Otherwise, they might misunderstand the situation and prohibit us from going. We can inform them of it when the effects are evident. Right now, I’ll tell some disciples to bring their friends to the internet café.”","“You’re right with your considerations, Senior Sister.”","– Meanwhile in the Forbidden Place of the Nanhua Faction –","“More ordinary disciples do not have much use to me. I think the elite disciples and elders of the Nanhua Faction must have been desiring for stronger power for a long time now,” the voice in the darkness said, “Anyone who has this desire and drive will become our servants and salves. Go and summon them!”","The night in the Nanhua Faction looked darker as if the whole sky were covered by a layer of thick ink.","It was midnight. The lazy disciples had all gone to bed while the diligent ones were still cultivating.","Gusts of gloomy wind blew in the darkness as if countless ghosts and demons were sweeping across the human world.","The Nanhua Faction had always looked celestial-like, but tonight, it was chilly with a ghost-like dark presence.","Several cultivating disciples seemed to have sensed something, and they opened their eyes abruptly.","“What’s this damn thing?!”","“Who are you?”","“Do you want to grow stronger?” A luring voice seemed to rise from their hearts.","“Do you want to obtain greater power? Do you desire to be stronger? Don’t refuse; follow your heart...”","...","Soon, they heard footsteps outside the door.","Knock! Knock! Knock! Someone knocked on the door. “Senior Sister/Senior Brother, open the door! I’ll take you to a good place! I can ensure you that your cultivation strength will grow greatly after you visit this place!”","“!!??”","Hearing this, all the disciples jumped up from their seats, wondering what was going on!"]},{"number":346,"title":"Chapter 346 - Having to do it in person","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After Mr. Fang’s livestream, more players turned their eyes to this novel and fun game.","As the number of customers increased in the shop, the effect of Mr. Fang’s livestream was much better than the previous ones.","After watching the Buzzard Chopper’s thrilling battle in the air, many players showed great interest in this wondrous thing and wanted to fly it in person.","Unlike other single-player games, Grand Theft Auto 5 offered the online mode, and the players in the game relied less on levels compared to the Legend of Mir 2 and Diablo. With these key features, Grand Theft Auto 5 soon went popular in the shops, and the sales soon reached 1,000 with the number still growing.","Meanwhile, the sales of Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone were also growing steadily. Although Mr. Fang didn’t put it on the livestream, the number of its activations was still rising and soon reached the target of 300. It was clear that this novel movie was popular with the cultivators. As a result, when the sequel ‘Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets’ came out, its sales also grew steadily.","By now, the customers in Mr. Fang’s shops could do many things besides playing online games, and the experience became more varied.","There were a few new customers brought by cultivators of the Haoran Faction and the Yimu Daoist Palace who entered the shop after buying the items at the auction. Therefore, the new customers from the Nanhua Faction stood out amongst people.","In the early morning when Mr. Fang opened the door, he saw about 30 white-robed disciples of the Nanhua Faction standing outside.","Among them, at least ten were new faces!","“How come you have brought so many new people with you?!” Mr. Fang was not used to seeing this many people so early in the morning, so his drowsiness disappeared by this unusual sight.","The Xichi Spiritual Master asked Mo Xian with a frown, “Didn’t I tell you not to make a big deal of it and just bring some senior and junior brothers and sisters who are close?”","“Ugh...” Mo Xian explained, “Master, we had over a dozen people yesterday. With each of us bringing only one other person...”","Xichi Spiritual Master didn’t realize until now that the number of players of the faction had grown this big without her noticing.","In the Forbidden Place in the back mountain of Nanhua Faction this night.","“What’s happening?!”","After the decrease in the number of disciples yesterday, this mysterious woman had tried hard to lure those elite disciples of the Nanhua Faction to this place. However, the attendance tonight was only half of yesterday’s!","“Strange... how come these disciples got so strong-willed?”","“What happened?” The voice hiding in the darkness was obviously displeased.","“A minor accident,” the white-haired woman said mildly, “I can handle it. Don’t worry!”","However, on the next day, when Mr. Fang opened the shop, he woke up completely at the sight before him. “How come so many of you came again?”","There were about 50 people waiting outside, and they were all disciples of the Nanhua Faction!","It must be noted that the shop was in Half City, and even the players of the local forces, such as the Yuanheng Pavilion and Black Demon didn’t come to the shop this early. However, the disciples of the Nanhua Faction, who lived far outside Half City, had come here even before the shop opened. From the looks of it, they had been waiting outside for a while now.","“I don’t know...” Yue Yan said with sleepy eyes. She had been woken up by her senior brothers and junior sisters before dawn, and they insisted on coming here with her. In fact, the door of her residence was almost broken down. “What can I do?!”","“Sir! We want to get online now!” Before Yue Yan could finish her explanation, the other disciples of the Nanhua Faction hustled into the shop. Different from Yue Yan and Mo Xian who would eat instant noodles leisurely before going online aimlessly, these disciples looked eager and energetic.","“What’s wrong with these people?” Mr. Fang looked baffled.","At midnight in the Forbidden Place at the back mountain of Nanhua Faction, the woman looked at the few disciples of Nanhua Faction before her, and her eyes got so red that it looked like blood would ooze from them.","“Impossible!” Her pale fingers clenched into fists, and her sharp fingernails pierced the skin on his palm; bright red blood began to drip from her fists.","Today, she had put much more efforts in her work, but the result was...","“Didn’t you say that you could handle it?” The voice hiding in the darkness sounded disappointed, s if it was suppressing its anger.","“Impossible...” the woman murmured, “I deepened their inner desire compared to usual, and it is impossible for them to resist me!”","“I will give you one more day!” The gloomy voice sounded angry.","“Got it...” The woman’s voice oozed fatigue, bafflement, and endless anger when she said in determination, “Tomorrow... I’ll go in person and bring them here!”","Rumors were circulating inside the Nanhua Faction.","It said that some elite disciples were brought to a very mysterious place to cultivate by the Ethereal Spiritual Master and the Xichi Spiritual Master, and these disciples’ cultivation strengths had increased drastically even after only one day’s cultivation.","Other disciples were envious of them.","Some even said that there were signs before the two elders took the disciples to cultivate in that mysterious place; for example, there would be a voice asking them if they wanted to grow stronger, etc.","Of course, these rumors were not believable, and even the two elders denied them.","However, some people still believed them, and Li Luoxi was one of them. After all, where there was smoke, there was fire. Tonight, he sensed something unusual.","It’s coming... It was said that many of the senior brothers and sisters had sensed something unusual before they were called to that mysterious place to cultivate. Now, he sensed this strangeness as well, so he wondered if he got lucky today!","He watched his surroundings carefully and asked tentatively, “Do... you crave for strength?”","I still don’t hear the question! Come on! Li Luoxi was so anxious that he began to sweat while yelling in his mind, I crave for strength too... I want to grow stronger! Quickly come here...","Suddenly, darkness engulfed him.","“It’s here! It’s here!” Li Luoxi was ecstatic.","– In the next moment –","“Go to hell!”","As if a heavy blow hit his head, he was unconscious the next moment.","“...”","When he woke up, he saw forbidden stone tablets around him, and his heart lurched, realizing that he hadn’t been brought to somewhere to increase his cultivation strength! Everything seemed too strange!","Soon, he heard a female voice sneering, “I don’t believe that we’ll have fewer people tonight!”","“Do you think so?!” In his dizziness, Li Luoxi heard an extremely gloomy voice.","There had been about 100 disciples last night in the Forbidden Place, but only about 70 of them returned tonight. Together with the new captives today, there were only about 90 people, which was about 10 fewer than yesterday."]},{"number":347,"title":"Chapter 347 - Shu Mountain","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The person who was qualified to guard the Forbidden Place was always the previous Nanhua Heavenly Fairy. Abandoning the world’s reverence for them and glories of life, they spent their whole lives sitting in this deserted graveyard in the Forbidden Place to guard the soul of an ultimate devil which had caused the horrifying catastrophe 1,000 years ago!","It was said that devils were born by the heaven and the earth, and they couldn’t be destroyed as long as the heaven and the earth existed. Each devil had extremely horrifying power, and once it was out, it would cause a devilish catastrophe in the whole world!","About 1,000 years ago, the Morning Star Sea Realm was at its peak of prosperity with many talented cultivators.","Just in the Nanhua Faction, there were three rare geniuses who had never been seen in the past 1,000 years. Their cultivation strength and understanding of techniques far surpassed the others, and the Faction Master at the time possessed the highest cultivation strength among all faction masters in the history of Nanhua Faction. When he was in charge of the faction, he had been at the middle stage of the Divine Palace Realm!","Besides the Nanhua Faction, other major factions such as the Yimu Daoist Palace and the Haoran Faction were also fraught with talented cultivators, and the ultimate geniuses were as bright as the stars in the sky.","However, it was also the darkest time in the whole Morning Star Sea Realm’s history, and no one wanted to talk about it even now. It was said that the group of talented cultivators fell like shooting stars in the devilish catastrophe in which the high-level cultivators of all the major factions died, and it was such a big blow to these factions that they had almost disappeared after the catastrophe since they had a hard time passing down their teachings and techniques.","In the end, they finally trapped the devil and spent 100 days to separate its flesh, bones, and soul and put them in three different places. The devil’s soul was suppressed in the Nanhua Faction!","It was said the devil soul was very cunning, and it excelled in luring people and was thus the most dangerous part!","At that time, many cultivators from different factions were lured to fight against their own before the battles, which caused heavy casualties to the whole cultivator army of the Morning Star Sea Realm.","Shui Xianyun was the previous Nanhua Heavenly Fairy and the person in the faction with the highest talent next to the Faction Master. She was also the First Elder with ultimate cultivation strength, guarding the Forbidden Place of Nanhua Faction.","While wearing white clothes, she had white hair and bloodless, snow-white skin, looking more like a devil rather than a human in this Forbidden Place which had been transformed into a devilish land.","With her white hair fluttered in the nightly wind, she had intense shame and fury in her eyes, looking like a prehistoric rare beast that had been fooled by its prey while on the hunt!","“What... really is happening?!” In theory, these disciples had been lured into her trap and couldn’t escape from her after their desires were intensified. Soon, these people would all become their slaves who wouldn’t object to anything.","However, things didn’t happen as she had expected.","She had summoned them here to further intensify their desires and suppress their own will using a secret technique, which would take only a few days. But something happened during these short few days!","“I was too careless...” Shui Xianyun said in hatred.","“It’s not your fault,” the voice in the depths of the darkness said with an endless chill. “It seems like someone is working against us!”","“Impossible! If someone is trying to work against us, it means that they have discovered us. Why wouldn’t this person report it to the faction instead of using this method...”","Obviously, if someone discovered the truth, the more solid next step would be reporting it to the faction.","Is it possible that another existence of the same level has been born? Shui Xianyun thought with a heavy mind since this was the only explanation for the transformations of the disciples who she had lured.","“I’ll investigate this issue!” she said in a deep voice, “I’ll get rid of everything that stands between you and your re-emergence!”","“Go,” the voice in the darkness said viciously, “When I re-emerge, everyone working against us will be turned into ashes!”","...","On the other side, with the popularity of Grand Theft Auto 5 and Harry Potter, the cultivators, especially the artifact masters in Wuwei Daoist Alliance, began to mimic some of the easy and effective spiritual artifacts shown in the game and the movie.","For example, the research institute led by Li Haoran had begun a new research project while they continued to improve the guns for cultivators.","At this moment, Li Haoran was looking at the artifact masters of the Blue Flame Pavilion around him with a top-quality communication jade in his hand.","“I think you know why I gathered you here.” Li Haoran waved the communication jade in his hand and said, “This is the best communication jade in our Blue Flame Pavilion, but what do you think of its functions?”","In fact, few of them had played Resident Evil, and many things in the game weren’t shown that well in detail. However, in Grand Theft Auto 5, the players enjoyed much more freedom, and the normal-day items’ functions began to show in full.","One cultivator answered, “Its functions are indeed too basic. In contrast, the communication tools in the game can take pictures, save screenshots, and even provide the map of the whole world and routes to specific destinations; they can even pay fees and transfer money using their communication tools.”","The differences were obvious by comparison.","Li Haoran said, “I gathered you here to make a brand-new communication jade which can not only deliver messages thousands of kilometers away but allow us to communicate with people who are thousands of miles away through video and audio. These are what we must achieve in the near future. I’ve just talked to Mr. Fang, and he promised that we will be able to connect our communication jades to QQ for free, which will enable us to talk in all the QQ group chats with communication jades even when our daily computer time is up.”","“Ugh... this...” They looked at each other in surprise, wondering how this was possible.","It must be noted that they had been teaming with the cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm to do jobs in the online mode of Grand Theft Auto 5. Many of them had established group chats, and they would talk and discuss the special features in their cultivation methods, spiritual spells, and spiritual artifacts on QQ aside from awkward daily conversations. They often chatted deep into the night and wished that they could spend the whole night talking.","However, they couldn’t do it since Mr. Fang set the hard limit on computer time.","“Do you have the confidence?”","“Yes, we can!” If they succeeded, they would be able to continue talking with communication jades despite the limit on computer time!","The Half City Shop was where almost all the cultivators in the city gathered. As for the movies and TV Series, the TV Series such as Jade Dynasty, which was in the Xianxia Genre, became very popular in the Half City Shop without Mr. Fang doing much promotion.","While the movies such as Harry Potter and Resident Evil opened the door to a broader world for the cultivators and warriors, showing them lots of stuff that they had never imagined before, the world of Xianxia, like the one in Jade Dynasty, gave the cultivators a deeper understanding of the cultivation system.","In fact, the number of activations for each episode of Jade Dynasty had reached 1,000 in the Half City Shop.","At this moment, Mr. Fang got a message from the System, [The sales of all the Xianxia and Immortal related items have gone over 1,000 on average, achieving the accomplishment ‘First Glance at Xianxia’. The movie ‘Shu Mountain’ is unlocked, and you will receive an accomplishment gift bag.]"]},{"number":348,"title":"Chapter 348 - Mr. Fang’s Group Tour Starts Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The movies in Fang Qi’s shop had been acclaimed be to rare treasures which allowed people to inherit combat techniques, spiritual spells, and improve their understanding of Dao. Although this claim was a bit one-sided, the movies and inheritance treasures had similarities.","For example, although the system’s version of Jade Dynasty hid some Easter eggs in it, and Fang Qi had mastered the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell by watching Water Moon Master teach it to Lu Xueqi, one didn’t have to watch the teaching sessions to learn all kinds of spiritual spells and techniques showed in Jade Dynasty and other TV Series.","Each viewer could clearly understand and feel the casting process of these sword techniques and spiritual spells while watching the TV Series; they could even gain a deeper understanding of the structure of items and their usages, which was why each viewer carefully watched how Green Leaf Ancestral Master cast his spiritual spells and sword techniques at the beginning of the TV Series.","Of course, one could learn them faster if they were taught in detail, which was why Fang Qi had mastered the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell before the others.","By now, Ruan Ning, Liu Ningyun, and the others who were among the first viewers of the TV Series could now cast some of the basic sword control technique of the Green Cloud Faction.","Mr. Fang looked up and saw several figures moving in front of the shop.","“Hahahaha! Come and watch my sword control technique!” Since she was now a rich girl, Ruan Ning had bought the spiritual sword which she was stepping on; it was quite expensive.","While stepping on the sword, she had been unstable at first, but the flying sword soon soared up and carried her on it. Unlike Zhang Xiaofan who didn’t have enough spiritual essence, she turned and swirled in the sky after the flight sword carried her up into the air.","“Why so smug?” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at her. “Fairy Liu flew here in the early morning with the sword control technique. You’re still learning it.”","Liu Ningyun now had a Dragon-Slaying Saber token on her chest. Having taken her master to play the Legend of Mir 2, she had been pulled into the guild by Ruan Ning half by force since this wasn’t her original plan. After all, she had been beaten senseless by others while fighting for monsters in the game, so it was necessary to join a guild.","She didn’t care about being killed in the game, but it would look bad if her master was killed repeatedly in the game.","Now, while she flew on her sword, no one dared to stop her due to the token on her chest.","“I’m not that good yet.” Liu Ningyun shook her head and said with a smile, “I flew here after I reached the city. As a beginner, I still can’t fly all the way here from the Nanhua Faction on a sword.”","She was still not a fan of Mr. Fang, but she had joined his guild, and it wasn’t wise to give the Guild President the cold shoulder, which was why her tone was much milder today.","“She is the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy, and I’m only a civilian. How can you compare us like this?” Ruan Ning looked miffed. “You do nothing but mock me.”","Then, she mumbled in a low voice, “Scummy Guild President! Old Demon Fang!”","“What did you say?!” Old Demon Fang glared at her.","“Nothing!”","In Fang Qi’s mind, the only other Shu Mountain, besides the one in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, was the Shu Mountain Sword Heroes led by the Emei Faction.","By now, the customers had begun to get online one after another, and even the lazy ones who were lounging on the couches had finished their instant noodles, spicy sticks, and Coke, ready to get online to play games.","“Hey! Just a reminder: we have a new movie.” Mr. Fang knocked on the small blackboard and said to Ruan Ning and the others.","Since they were members of his guild, he would recommend this movie to them a little.","“You mean Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets? I’ve watched it already.” Ruan Ning looked confused.","“Shu Mountain?” Liu Ningyun had a bowl of instant noodles in her hand, and the soup was not drunk yet. She looked over while drinking a mouthful of soup, destroying her usual fairy image. “What movie is it? Does it tell the story about a mountain?”","“...”","Resigned, Mr. Fang posted a message in the group chat, [Pay and get onboard the group tour bus of the movie ‘Shu Mountain’. Anyone interested in getting on?]","Song Qingfeng: [Shu Mountain Faction?]","Nalan Mingxue: [Is it the Legend of the Sword and Fairy?]","Su Tianji: [Is it the sequel to Xiaoyao and Ling?]","Jiang Xiaoyue: [Boss, why didn’t you tell me that there’s a new movie? I haven’t written it on the blackboard yet!]","Soon, Jiang Xiaoyue put the announcement of the new movie ‘Shu Mountain’ on the small blackboard.","Instantly, many people who had been silent posted messages in Mr. Fang’s Group Tour.","Nalan Hongwu: [How come it’s Shu Mountain instead of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f914.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F914;\">]","Ye Songtao: [We are already learning the ultimate techniques of the Shu Mountain Faction; why should we watch this movie?]","Ye Xiaoye: [Just tell me if Ling will be resurrected! If not, I won’t watch it!]","She couldn’t forget Ling.","Mr. Fang: [No!]","Ye Xiaoye: [Then, I won’t watch it!]","Su Tianji: [I won’t watch it either!]","Lan Yan: [What good is this movie without Ling!]","“Suit yourself. If no one wants to watch it, I’ll start the tour myself!]","The Xichi Spiritual Master: [Wait!]","[People of Nanhua Faction want to watch it!]","Tang Yuan, the master of the Yuanheng Pavilion: [Can you take me on the tour?]","Black Demon: [What’s this good stuff? I haven’t learned anything yet! Count me in!]","Red Wing Daoist: [Count me in as well.]","Ning Bi: [Me too!]","At this moment, the group from the Haoran Faction had just entered the shop. “Sir, what is the movie named Shu Mountain about? 50 crystals! How come it’s so expensive!”","“Do you want to watch it or not?”","“Yes! I just don’t know what good stuff is in the movie that it costs so much money!” The grey-clothed cultivator of the Haoran Faction said while he paid for the movie.","“Hurry up then!” Mr. Fang didn’t stall, and he was going to start the tour the moment that the viewers arrived since he couldn’t wait to watch the movie himself.","At this moment, a large group of people swarmed into Mr. Fang’s Qzone in the blink of an eye.","Not only people of the Haoran Faction, but Su Tianji, Ye Xiaoye, and others who had claimed that they wouldn’t watch all came.","Even people like Ye Songtao, Nalan Hongwu, and Lan Mo sneaked in.","“Didn’t you say that you don’t want to watch it?!”","“After some consideration, we decided to watch it anyway!” Even though they said no, their bodies were honest.","“...”","The darkness gradually turned bright, and the scene before them changed. It seemed like they had arrived between the colorful clouds in the heavens.","When the moonlight dimmed, the vast starry, nightly sky hovered before them like a dazzling heavenly curtain.","“As the saying goes, there’s always mountains and heavens beyond the one you see. In the vast universe, the stars change every second, and there are countless of them.”","“In the area around Shu Mountain in the Sichuan Province of central China, the mountains wind their way in the surging ocean of clouds, and the spiritual essence of the sky and the earth gather in these mountains. According to legends, there were extraordinary immortals who absorbed the spiritual essence in the mountains and went beyond the limits of the mortal body; they could fly on swords and chase wind and moon and race among the stars.”","The scene before the viewers slowly moved forward, passing through the ocean of clouds and presenting them a large stretch of mountains which were so high that some of them almost touched the sky. Some big hills and mountains even hovered in the air without any support!","“Wow!” Above the ocean of clouds and the mortal world, the radiant sunlight shined in all directions, dyeing the mountains with colors. It looked like a paradise where celestial beings lived.","Many cultivators stood there in amazement and were reluctant to leave."]},{"number":349,"title":"Chapter 349 - The Towering Demonic Power","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Is this how the Shu Mountain Faction came into being?” Song Qingfeng asked in surprise, “Sir, how come this Shu Mountain looks different from the one we watched before?”","They were both called Shu Mountain, and both had hovering mountains and sword immortals, but many viewers saw that this Shu Mountain looked different from the one in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy in one glance!","“What are you talking about?” The viewers from the Morning Star Sea Realm looked at the mountains and islands hovering in the air in amazement. “What’s different? Do you mean there’s another faction with the same name?”","“Concentrate on the movie and don’t talk about irrelevant things,” Mr. Fang said, “Anyway, who said there’s only the Shu Mountain Faction on Shu Mountain? This is the Emei Faction which, let’s say, was established before the Shu Mountain Faction.”","It would take forever to explain to these people who lived in a different world that many worlds existed in the universe, so Mr. Fang thought about it and gave them a simple explanation.","“Oh...”","“Then, Ling isn’t dead now, right?” Ye Xiaoye asked immediately.","With a painful expression, Mr. Fang said, “She’s not born yet; how can she be dead?”","“Great!” Many viewers said in excitement, “Then we’ll continue watching Shu Mountain!”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","“Disciples of Emei Faction, you must remember that we cultivators have to be wary of greed and jealousy, which are the origins of all evil!” On Emei Mountain, a white-haired old man with long eyebrows was wearing a white cloak, and he sat in the center of a golden Eight-Trigram platform which hovered in the air. Around the Eight-Trigram platform were elite disciples who sat cross-legged, listening to the old man.","The white-clothed old man’s voice was resonant. “Lately, while I absorb the spiritual essence, I’ve sensed that a very powerful force is testing us, and I heard shrills full of murderous spirit in this force. It seems that the Demon Dao is trying to test and challenge our Orthodox Dao again! Emei Mountain is the head of all Mountains, and we must be cautious of their potential invasion!”","“Have you noticed that they like to divide things into Orthodox Dao and Demon Dao?” The members of Mr. Fang’s tour group whispered to each other while they looked at the interior of the Emei Faction.","The cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm and Wuwei Daoist Alliance never made such separations; only the evil cultivators who acted wildly or severely affected the cultivation of other cultivators would be looked down upon with censure.","“What’s the benefit of this division?” Mo Xian was puzzled. “Should we do it later on as well?”","“Then, we must stay away from those people...” Yue Yan whispered while pointing at Black Demon and his people, obviously classifying herself into the Orthodox Dao.","Black Demon and his people glared at her while their faces twitched a little.","Yue Yan and her friends shrunk their necks and hid behind the Xichi Spiritual Master.","While the Emei Mountain looked lively and prosperous, the opposite Kunlun Mountain looked quite barren and desolate.","As if they were riding on clouds, the viewers soon came to Kunlun Mountain, where a lone cliff stood among the celestial-looking peaks. There were only one master and one disciple living here; the man looked cold and extraordinary while the woman was beautiful and sedate like a celestial being.","“According to the tradition of our Kunlun Mountain, the sun and the moon correspond to Yang and Yin respectively,” the woman’s voice sounded ethereal. “Kunlun has a sun and a moon, so we have only one master and one disciple.”","“Why do I feel like this faction is powerful too?” Ye Xiaoye clicked her tongue and said, “Even though there are only two people in the faction...”","“The master and disciple have been together for 200 years, so they must be very close,” many viewers talked among themselves in low voices.","“This movie looks good.”","“Maybe it’s even better than Jade Dynasty...”","“I just can’t sense the realm of that ancestral master of the Emei Faction; he felt like an ordinary person...”","“You know nothing. That’s called concealed spiritual light; his cultivation strength must be unrivaled.”","“Shut up!”","The sky turned gloomy with dark clouds while lightning bolts flashed, and thunders rumbled. As if she knew she was going to die, the Lone Moon Master entrusted the Sun-Moon Essence Wheel to Xuan Tianzong and ordered him to leave the mountain; she was going to deal with the Demonic Tribulation alone.","From the depth of the gloomy darkness in the sky, many skeletons and fierce ghosts appeared; they came out of the blue as if they suddenly sprouted from the sky.","The heavenly lightning bolts cracked down as if the sky and the earth were trying to crush these evil things, creating loud waves of thunder.","In the vast sky, the many skeletons condensed into a form under the gloomy clouds. The many bones turned into a mountain-like skeleton face which was as black as ink!","The skeleton face went through the mountains swiftly, destroying the mountains and making huge booming noises. Many high peaks and cliffs on Kunlun Mountain collapsed with all the arrays, restriction spells, and other defense mechanisms looking like a piece of thin paper. Everything was destroyed in one instant!","“F*ck!” Only at the Master Warrior Realm, Song Qingfeng and his friends had never seen such a sight before, and they yelled in alarm.","Seeing the horrifying destruction, Ruan Ning and her friends were stupefied on spot as well.","Even the grand cultivators on and above the Divine Ocean Realm such as the Xichi Spiritual Master, Black Demon, and Mo Tianxing gaped at the sight and couldn’t utter a word.","The demonic shadow went through the body of the celestial-looking woman, and all the life energy left her body.","It was stunning to watch the mountains and the arrays collapse in one instant. Even the viewers could see that it wasn’t that the cultivator was too weak but that the demon was too powerful. They were so stunned that they began to wonder if their own factions could survive if such a demon appeared.","But to their horror, they realized that none of them could survive it!","What is this demon? How come it has such almighty power?!","When Xuan Tianzong rushed back to the faction, he only saw the Lone Moon Master turning into ashes.","All the viewers felt chills running down their spines.","However, things didn’t end there. They saw that 200 years later, this horrifying demonic shadow appeared outside the prosperous Emei Mountain.","“Youquan (TL Note: Meaning Dark Spring) destroyed Hua Mountain 500 years ago and then Kunlun Mountain 300 years ago. Now, it is now finally coming to our Emei.” Even the old man with white hair and white eyebrows who had been teaching his disciples looked grim.","The dark clouds gathered in the sky, signaling the imminent invasion. Instantly, all the viewers sensed the tense atmosphere before a storm.","“By now, Xuan Tianzong has 400-years of cultivation strength, right? With the assistance of Dan Chenzi of the Emei Faction, can they deal with this old demon?” Mo Xian asked anxiously, feeling chills running down her spine. When they witnessed that old demon crushing the mountains and destroying the Hua Mountain Faction instantly, they felt the suffocating suppression even through the screen.","It was clear that the towering demonic power was way more powerful if they were actually in the world.","“I’m afraid it will be difficult for them.” Then Xichi Spiritual Master’s expression also turned grim; the old demon suppressed everyone present.","A huge crack suddenly appeared in the gloomy clouds in the sky, and something combined from many dried bones crashed down like a surging long river from the sky!"]},{"number":350,"title":"Chapter 350 - The Battle Between Immortals","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Many skeletons broke out from underground like fierce ghosts from hell, and the long and wide river of bones crashed down like a black sky curtain!","“So powerful!” Song Qingfeng and the others gaped at the scene, and even the grand cultivators looked fearful while they watched the attack that seemed to have covered the entire world.","On the other side, many flying sabers condensed behind Dan Chenzi and formed a pair of huge wings made of steel. Then, they turned into spinning blades, blocking the charge of many skeletons and fierce ghosts.","The Golden Moon Wheel flew out of Xuan Tianzong’s hand, and its spinning blades blocked some of the river of horrifying skeletons.","However, more and more skeletons crashed down like a surging river. In a few breaths, the two men had to fly away in retreat!","At this moment, a huge face formed by many skeletons appeared before them and hovered in the air, as if it crawled out from space. It looked like a huge mountain engulfed in dark purple flames. Standing in front of it, the people felt like ants before a demonic god.","“What on earth is this damn thing?!” The Xichi Spiritual Master looked at it in horror.","“This demon is so powerful...” Even the grand cultivators in Half City, such as Black Demon and Tang Yuan, looked fearful in front of this demon.","“It wasn’t born by the sky and the earth. It has reached this stage purely by cultivation.” At this moment, even Ning Bi looked surprised while she stared at the mountain-like skeleton face.","“I’m not interested in fighting with you two kids.” A dark light shot out from the top of the skeleton face, and a figure looking like it was half-human and half-ghost appeared.","He waved his hands and condensed two human figures resembling Xuan Tianzong and Dan Chenzi.","The demonic versions of Dan Chenzi and Xuan Tianzong cast the same spiritual spells as the real ones. In fact, the demonic versions even had the same spiritual treasures which released the same power.","Four figures instantly battle in the sky!","With the Golden Sun Wheel and the Golden Moon Wheel in his hands, the demonic Xuan Tianzong used this pair of weapons proficiently. On the other side, the demonic Dan Chenzi turned flying sabers into wings which shot out many more sabers like a wild storm!","“This old ghost is almighty?!” Even Nalan Hongwu looked stunned. “It can even recreate the same spiritual spells and spiritual artifacts?! It can even use the same power?!”","Mo Tianxing and the others were also stunned. “How... how can they fight it?! Will the Emei Faction be destroyed too?”","Would this celestial-looking faction be destroyed so easily?","“Maybe they have a secret trump card.” Su Tianji gazed at Youquan intently with her beautiful eyes.","“So powerful. The movie is fascinating!” Although the cultivators of the Haoran Faction and the Yimu Daoist Palace didn’t stand beside Mr. Fang, they experienced the same astonishment, amazement, and gripping anxiety while they watched the movie.","In the next instant, the huge skeleton face slowly rose into the air and opened its huge mouth. Then, many horrifying purple flames condensed into hill-sized skeletons before they were shot out like huge cannonball or shooting stars with long tails. Undoubtedly, these attacks would cause the collapse of mountains and great casualties wherever they landed!","The viewers were stunned and at a loss for words.","However, in the next moment, the White Browed Spiritual Master who was sitting on the Eight-Trigram platform suddenly grew larger, and a huge spiritual body filled the space between the sky and the earth, instantly engulfing the whole Daoist palace.","The spiritual body waved his hand, and a translucent round spiritual mirror with engravings of ancient characters that looked like tadpoles, cloud dragons, and rare birds appeared in his hand. The spiritual mirror grew even bigger than the Daoist Palace and the hovering mountain that he guarded. When the huge skeletons crashed onto the mirror like meteorites, many sparks exploded on it with earth-shaking noises, but the mountain that was hovering in the air was intact!","“This... I think Emei Faction is even more powerful than the Shu Mountain Faction?!”","“What’s this spiritual treasure?!”","“The power is terrifying!”","Behind Mr. Fang, some viewers exclaimed in shock, but most of the cultivators and warriors were dazed by the scene and couldn’t even speak.","For the cultivators and warriors of Morning Star Sea Realm and Dajin, this was a battle between immortals! It was a horrifying sight!","“Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords, Seven in the Clouds, and 300 Qingcheng disciples, come to Panluo Valley with me to fight the demon!” At this moment, the White Browed Spiritual Master still concealed his spiritual light; he no longer had that immortal-like aura and didn’t look like the person who had just blocked the ultimate strike a moment ago.","However, no one dared to underestimate this white-haired old man anymore.","“Is he still a human?!” Ruan Ning’s eyes almost popped out in shock. “He is an immortal who descended to the mortal world, right?”","Of course, she didn’t know that her guess was on the mark since the White Browed Spiritual Master was indeed an old man who qualified to ascend to the Heavenly Realm long ago but still lingered in the mortal world.","The White Browed Spiritual Master flew out of the mountain with his hands clasped behind his back, and the disciples followed him closely while stepping on swords that flashed in the sky, drawing out many bright lines and creating a long silver river in the dark sky.","The enthralling and powerful battle of spiritual spells between ultimate masters with almighty cultivation strengths gripped the viewers’ attention. Like a white light beam, the White Brow Spiritual Master shot into the huge mountain of skeletons and dashed toward the true form of Youquan. The viewers watched it with their hearts in their throats.","However, the moment they battled, the result was evident. Like spiritual treasures, the White Browed Spiritual Master’s white hair and eyebrows trapped Youquan. The light shooting from the Heavenly Mirror crashed onto Youquan, who let out painful shrills. Trapped by the spiritual light, Youquan, who had looked invincible, now couldn’t even flee!","Youquan’s body turned into a puddle of blood and flesh at a visible speed!","Seeing this, the viewers didn’t know how to express their feelings. After all, they had never seen such a powerful master with this much horrifying power, let alone the awesome spiritual treasure. With such a spiritual treasure in hand, they believed that no demon would dare to do evil deeds in the world.","Then, they saw that Youquan didn’t die in this situation. Instead, he fled on the flying saber that Dan Chenzi had tried to kill him with.","“Impossible!” Even Black Demon exclaimed in shock, “How can this old demon escape when he got disintegrated and only has one drop of blood left under the light from the mirror?!”","All the cultivators of the big forces, such as the Nanhua Faction and Haoran Faction, were horrified when they saw that Youquan still had the strength to escape at this state!","Besides, his fleeing speed was even faster than the White Browed Spiritual Master, who chased after him with the Heavenly Mirror. This meant that he had reserved most of his strength. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to fly so fast.","Of course, Youquan had reserved most of his strength; he had faked this defeat so he that could use the White Browed Spiritual Master’s strength to open the legendary Demon Land ‘Chiyou Blood Cave’ to master his demonic technique!","[TL Note: Chiyou was a tribal leader of the Nine Li tribe in ancient China. He is best known as a king who lost against the future Yellow Emperor during the Three Sovereigns and Five Emperors era in Chinese mythology.]","On the other hand, all the spiritual veins of all factions intertwined in the Blood Cave. When Youquan turned into a drop of blood and hid in it, it was impossible to find him in the Blood Cave. On the other hand, the Blood Cave was like hell to the people of the Orthodox Dao, such as the White Browed Spiritual Master, and he couldn’t stay in there for long. Obviously, Youquan’s plan was a success. The White Brow Spiritual Master even lost the Heavenly Mirror in the Blood Cave to save Dan Chenzi and Xuan Tianzong, who had chased Youquan into the depths of the Blood Cave. Who would dare to venture into such a place again?!","“What can they do now?!”","“They can’t enter the Blood Cave, and the Heavenly Mirror is lost as well.”","The ups and downs of the story pulled the viewers in, and they began to worry about Emei’s future."]},{"number":351,"title":"Chapter 351 - The Final Battle (Part 1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Obviously, the system version of the movie had patched many loopholes in the original version. In the battles of spiritual spells, the movie presented the viewers with the rashness and competitiveness of Dan Chenzi and the steadiness of Xuan Tianzong and his longing of his master who passed away.","Meanwhile, the cultivators and warriors were fascinated by the mutual support and appreciation between the two geniuses in the young generation in the time of danger, and the two-lifetime relationships between Xuan Tianzong and the Emei Faction’s Li Yingqi, who was the reincarnation of the Lone Moon Master.","All kinds of horrifyingly powerful spiritual artifacts, masters with immortal-like strengths, spiritual mountains hovering in the air, and strange and dangerous places like the evil and creepy Chiyou Blood Cave formed a grand and vast Xianxia world before the viewing cultivators.","At this moment, it dawned on them that cultivators could reach such a high realm, and human strength could rival heavenly power!","As the eldest disciple of the Emei Faction, Dan Chenzi took the order to guard the outside of the Blood Cave.","On the other side, the White Browed Spiritual Master gathered and saved the strength of Shu Mountain. The Blood Cave was worthy of Youquan’s great efforts of entering. Like a natural chasm, no one could enter it even though they knew Youquan had been severely wounded, afraid that Youquan would use the power of the Blood Cave to fight back. If they died in the Blood Cave, they would increase their opponent’s power.","The tables were turned in one instant.","With the movie moving forward, the cultivators witnessed the powerful hidden strength of the Emei Faction while they sensed the huge pressure that Youquan brought to the major factions of Shu Mountain.","Apart from the Heavenly Mirror, the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords (Known as Purple Green Dual Swords in the original novel) were also ultimate treasures of Emei. The powerful dual swords represented Yin and Yang respectively and thus could cause destruction if they touched the other, since they countered and complimented each other. However, they must combine forces and merge Yin and Yang before they could unleash more terrifying power!","“Emei has such powerful ultimate treasures?!” The disciples and elders of the cultivation factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm were stunned.","Clouds surged on the mountains while the Emei Faction tried its best to combine the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords. They saw the green and purple sword lights shooting into the sky with overwhelming sword powers.","“How on earth did they create this kind of spiritual artifact?” People like Mo Xian clicked their tongues and said in surprise.","“With one Yin and the other Yang, one soft and the other hard, the dual swords contain extremely powerful strength. The most extraordinary thing is that there seem to be no engravings of arrays on these spiritual treasures.” Jun Yangzi, who had a deep understanding of artifact-making, looked serious. “Even the Heavenly Mirror that the White Browed Spiritual Master used previously doesn’t have engravings of arrays. Instead, the dragon and bird engravings seem to possess such great power as if...”","Jun Yangzi found it hard to find proper words to describe these treasures since there weren’t many words that could be used in this regard.","“As if they were demons born and raised by the heaven,” Ning Bi said with a focused expression.","“This lady gets it!” Jun Yangzi gave her a thumbs-up and said, “If we can copy a tiny part of it, we’ll gain unimaginable benefits in terms of artifact-making! However, these spiritual treasures have their own powerful spiritual essence before they were refined, and some of them are even the legendary rare treasures created by the heaven and earth. We’ll be extremely fortunate if we can have one of them!”","Then, they witnessed the failure of the combination of the Heavenly Strike Sword and Lightning Flame Sword. After the physical body of Changkong Wuji, the owner of the Lightning Flame Sword, was destroyed, the White Browed Spiritual Master used Emei Three Vital Palace and Changkong Wuji’s vital soul that was saved in Lightning Flame Sword to create another person.","“Is he really an immortal?!! How can he do that?!” People like Song Qingfeng yelled incredulously, and even Nalan Mingxue, who was always calm, looked shocked and alarmed.","The young people from Lingyun Academy, Shengjing Academy, and Xiyi Academy were stupefied since this scene went beyond their understandings and even their imaginations!","“When one reaches this realm, they can do whatever they want!” Nalan Hongwu exclaimed and then immediately reminded the others, “Carefully watch the creation process and the detailed re-structuring of the human meridians and blood veins. You’ll be well rewarded!”","“Hey! We haven’t finished watching the process yet!” Ruan Ning yelled. She was still enthralled by the structure of the human body, but the scene changed.","Right now, they arrived to the Blood Cave already.","“Still want to watch it?” Mr. Fang was merciless. “You can grab a pedestrian and strip him naked; you can look as long as you want.”","“Ahh! Do you want to die?!” Ruan Ning glared at Mr. Fang with embarrassment and fury, feeling like killing someone.","Many females in the group blushed. “Pooh!”","They all glared at Mr. Fang with embarrassment and fury, and they didn’t dare to bring up this topic again.","“Look! How come there’s a small demon here?” In front of the Blood Cave, all the viewers felt cold sweat break out on their backs when they saw that Dan Chenzi turned soft and let the fragile-looking, red-clothed female demon go, but his body was possessed by the latter, who was transformed from a red corpse.","“There are such things in the world?!” At the thought that their vital souls could be controlled by others if they were not careful, the viewers shivered in fear. Obviously, this world was full of dangers, and even Dan Chenzi, the eldest Emei disciple who had cultivated for hundreds of years, fell into the trap.","On the other side, the White Browed Spiritual Master was preparing the second method to deal with Youquan—the combination of three vitals.","After seeing the White Browed Spiritual Master ascending above the mortal world to find a weapon to deal with Youquan, the viewers suddenly understood the situation and exclaimed, “The White Browed Spiritual Master is really an immortal who can ascend to the Heavenly Realm!”","No wonder his cultivation strength and power were so horrifyingly high.","Meanwhile, the final battle was drawing near.","Obviously, the viewers had high hopes for the combined force of the three vitals described by the White Browed Spiritual Master and guessed that it must be a force beyond the mortal world. On the other hand, they were horrified by the Youquan Blood Demon’s towering demonic power and found that it was quite incredible that he reached this realm by cultivation!","Different from the previous TV Series and movies, Shu Mountain was fast-paced after the improvements made by the System. Each scene and every detail were enthralling and gripping.","During the whole time, the viewers intently watched with wide eyes, not wanting to miss any details. With their hearts in their throats, they watched the possessed Dan Chenzi attacking Emei and fighting with the Emei disciples; their blood boiled, and they couldn’t stop watching.","They watched in despair when Emei fell from prosperity to desolation, and the disciples fled in all directions.","Tears of excitement filled their eyes when blue light appeared in the sky, which was the signal that the White Browed Spiritual Master issued from beyond the mortal world, and Xuan Tianzong finally understood the combination of the three vitals and gained the Nanming Li Fire Sword.","At this moment, the final battle finally arrived."]},{"number":352,"title":"Chapter 352 - The Final Battle (Part Two)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The dazzling weird-shaped sword that was as blue as ancient ice crystals and emitting blue icy flames was the Nanming Li Fire Sword.","This sword’s power was obviously no less than the dual swords. In some aspects, it was more powerful.","All the cultivators on Shu Mountain, including the disciples of Wutai Mountain, Qingcheng Mountain, and Emei Mountain, gathered together to face the life-and-death issue concerning all of them!","At this moment, they had a daunting task before them—entering the Blood Cave and rescuing Li Yingqi, who had been kidnapped when the possessed Dan Chenzi destroyed Emei.","Since it was dangerous for physical bodies to enter the Chiyou Blood Cave, they decided that the best way was to enter it with their vital souls. However, this method presented another problem; Youquan might search for the physical bodies of the intruders and destroy them. If he succeeded, it would be a destructive blow to the forces of Shu Mountain.","Finally, they decided that only Xuan Tianzong and Lian Xing (the Reborn Changkong Wuji) would enter the Blood Cave with the Lightning Flame Sword to search for and rescue Li Yingqi and the Heavenly Strike Sword.","Meanwhile, their physical bodies would be hidden in Wutai Mountain, which would gather the whole force of its faction to guard them against the potential sneak-attack of the Blood Demon, trying their best to buy some time for the rescue mission.","The moment that the two of them entered the Blood Cave, it seemed like blood clouds were rushing over to envelop the area. It looked like a group of blood clouds, but it was actually a huge sea of blood that rose to the sky. It moved from the sky above the Blood Cave and crashed toward Shu Mountain.","The surging blood sea stunned everyone with the overwhelming and unrivaled power of Youquan Blood Demon, even forcing the White Browed Spiritual Master to ascend from the mortal world!","Standing beneath this blood sea and sensing the endless devil power that was even more immense than before, the legs of all the cultivators watching the scene turned into jelly.","“I’m afraid that even a true immortal wouldn’t be able to fight it!” The usually calm Xichi Spiritual Master looked alarmed and panicked.","“This Blood Cloud Major Array seems endless; even heavenly power is weak and fragile in front of it, not to mention humans,” Nalan Hongwu clicked his tongue and said. “I’m surprised that this demon has evolved to this realm after such a short time.”","Fear yet endless excitement filled the eyes of people like Black Demon and Red Wing Daoist. “I wonder what technique this Youquan Blood Demon cultivates; we would be able to greatly benefit if we can learn a tiny part of it!”","“Why do you want to learn this evil power and technique?” Of course, some people felt like it was beneath them to learn this. “We would benefit a lot if we can learn a part of Xuan Tianzong’s power, not to mention the power of the White Browed Spiritual Master.”","“However... I do feel bad for Dan Chenzi...” Lan Mo heaved a heavy sigh.","Although Xuan Tianzong had the Nanming Li Fire Sword, the demonized Dan Chengzi could borrow endless devil power from the Blood Cave. In the Chiyou Blood Cave, even with the help of the Nanming Li Fire Sword, Xuan Tianzong wasn’t at an advantage.","Many viewers sighed in disappointment while they watched Xuan Tianzong and Dan Chengzi, the former good friends, engage in a battle to the death.","“Look! Li Yingqi was rescued!”","“Now than Lian Xing has recovered his cultivation strength, he is powerful as well!”","“I wonder if the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords can combine their forces successfully or not...”","The viewers were gripped by anxiety since each move was like a step on a wire above a cliff; one mistake would put the entire Shu Mountain to destruction.","At this moment, the situations in the Blood Cave and Wutai Mountain were both dangerous. The endless blood sea covered the sky above Wutai Mountain while many disciples of Wutai Mountain chanted scriptures. However, even the most strong-willed disciples felt the panic and despair when they faced this doomsday-like scene.","Soon, even the Daluo Buddha Hand cast by Master Zunsheng, the Wutai Mountain Faction Master, only left two palm prints on the huge blood clouds before they were swallowed by the surging blood waves!","The mountain-like suppression almost suffocated the cultivators and warriors from the Half City Shop and the Jiuhua City Shop, who were watched the battle standing on Wutai Mountain.","Above the blood clouds, a mountain-like evil ghost head surged up from the endless blood sea and roared.","Instantly, Master Zunsheng, who stood on the mountain peak and was ready to battle, puked out a mouthful of blood, and the mountain beneath him collapsed, creating huge waves of debris!","This demonic roar shattered the mountains and cracked the land!","The monks of Wutai Mountain were either dead or severely injured. Just like Emei Mountain, most of the peaks on the prosperous Wutai collapsed almost instantly.","Mortals each had one vital soul and one physical body, and only cultivators of great cultivation strength could separate their vital souls from their physical bodies. However, in the sky, the mountain-like evil ghost head opened its mouth, and the tens of thousands of vital souls of the Youquan Blood Demon flew out.","“How can he have so many vital souls?!” The viewing cultivators couldn’t help yelling.","“This is not real! Impossible!”","“He has more than 10,000 vital souls! Who can kill this old demon?!”","“Even if he stands there without resisting, it would take forever to kill all of his vital souls!”","In the sky, Youquan Blood Demon’s vital souls shot into the ruined Wutai Mountain like a dense pack of locusts, searching for the physical bodies of Xuan Tianzong and Lian Xing.","The scenes sent goosebumps all over people’s bodies!","“Xuan Tianzong’s body got swallowed!”","“Where’s Li Yingqi?! Where’s Lian Xing?!”","“Can the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords handle the Blood Demon?!”","After a short silence, bedlam broke out in Mr. Fang’s tour group, and all the cultivators yelled at the same time.","“Hurry! Hurry up and save him!”","“Hurry and combine the Heavenly Lightning!”","“Will they fail again like last time?! They are finished if that happens!”","The impatient people like Ruan Ning had the urge to fly up and combine the two swords herself. “Come on! I’ll die in anxiety if you don’t do it now!”","Fortunately, different from Changkong Wuji in his previous life, Lian Xing was now pure-minded, and he merged himself into his sword!","The green and purple swords merged in the air like two rainbows. The moment that the two swords collided, they instantly disappeared!","By now, the two swords traveled at the speed of light and couldn’t be seen by the naked eye.","Of course, this was a remake movie produced by the System, and it made it possible for the viewers to see the dual swords after they successfully combined. When they saw the duals swords again, they could only spot a pale golden light beam. Then, almost at the same time, a wave of blood exploded out of the Blood Demon’s true form!","But obviously, it only killed one vital soul of the Blood Demon. Soon, the Youquan Blood Demon appeared again intact; he had only lost one of his vital souls.","In the other battlefield, Xuan Tianzong unleashed all of his power and tried to pull Dan Chenzi into mutual destruction while the Nanming Li Fire burned them.","In the flames, the red corpse had to ditch Dan Chenzi’s vital soul and flee. Without its control, Dan Chenzi regained his consciousness and grabbed the red corpse in the flames, giving Xuan Tianzong time to kill them both and survive the fire himself.","Finally, Dan Chenzi took the red corpse with him and died under Xuan Tianzong’s sword; both his physical body and vital soul were destroyed.","The viewers were filled with complicated feelings when the two best friends who had appreciated each other in the past 200 years ended up this way after a fierce battle.","Meanwhile, in the sky above Wutai Mountain, people began to see the true power of the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords.","Under the flashing sword lights of the combined swords, the endless blood clouds began to disintegrate continuously. In the blink of an eye, most of the blood sea disappeared.","After his vital soul returned to his physical body, Xuan Tianzong unleashed the great power of the Nanming Li Fire Sword into the mouth of the Blood Demon. Outside of the Blood Cave, this godly sword finally unleashed its horrifying power!","The remaining vital souls of Youquan were slaughtered by this wave of horrifying sword lights in one instant!","To prevent Youquan from fleeing as he had done before, Li Yingqi merged herself into the Heavenly Strike Sword and pierced into Youquan’s vital soul, pinned it down with her own vital soul.","Meanwhile, a blue light instantly shot into Youquan’s body!","Led by Mr. Fang, the cultivators and warriors in the tour group stood on the clouds and gazed at the clear sky and land.","They looked forward and watched the final destruction of Youquan under the combined forces of the Heavenly Strike Sword, Lightning Flame Sword, and Nanming Li Fire Sword!"]},{"number":353,"title":"Chapter 353 - Still Brewing","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The movie was over.","It didn’t matter if it were when Dan Chenzi said to Xuan Tianzong, “Even friends of hundred of years must part ways,” or when Li Yingqi suddenly recovered the memories of her previous life as she pinned down Youquan with her own vital soul while dying with it, and she said to Xuan Tianzong with love and regret, “Tianzong, I finally found you.” Something touched the softest part in the hearts of the cultivators and warriors who were watching the movie.","The first scene showed the helplessness of mortals in front of fate, and the second scene presented obsessions and the cycle in people’s past lives and current lives in a proper way. The emotions that it expressed were not as passionate as those in Jade Dynasty or the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, but the seemingly mild feelings hidden deep in the cultivators who were hundreds of years old lingered in the viewers’ minds like a cup of clear tea which tasted bland at first but was real and long-lasting.","The final battle with Youquan kindled the passion of the viewers like a flame. They had never imagined that a battle of spiritual spells between cultivators could be so fascinating.","After the improvements made by the System, the spiritual spells, spiritual treasures, and the deep meanings inside them were showcased better in the remake, and the scenes kept flashing back in people’s minds.","“I’m surprised there are such cultivators on Shu Mountain!” Even though the movie had ended, many people were reluctant to leave. Instead, they began to lament.","“The Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords, Nanming Li Fire, Youquan Blood Demon... This ultimate battle was extremely enjoyable!” Lan Mo, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance Master, started praising it.","“I obtained a lot of inspirations by watching the movie!” Tang Yuan said while nodding, “The Blood Demon’s ability to contain tens of thousands of vital souls, the battle of spiritual spells between Xuan Tianzong and Dan Chenzi, and the sword control technique of the Emei Faction inspired me greatly. Today, I must consider them carefully after I return home.”","“Watch my Heavenly Mirror!” Xu Luo suddenly whipped out his hand.","“Heavenly Mirror?” Lin Shao’s face twitched when he saw Xu Luo holding a mirror he bought from Qzone in his hand.","“...”","Some people who hadn’t watched the movie began to ask questions in the group chat, Mr. Fang’s Group Tour, in QQ.","Xi Chenzhou: [How was Shu Mountain? Is it worth watching?]","[It’s superb! You’ll regret it if you don’t watch it!]","[Awesome!]","[This movie is a must-watch!]","“...”","Soon, messages flooded the group chat.","Song Qingfeng: [The Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords are so powerful! They are godly weapons! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","Lin Shao: [Don’t you think that the Nanming Li Fire Sword is more powerful?]","Black Demon: [Nonsense. Youquan Blood Demon is the most powerful one. If not for the many godly weapons of the Emei Faction, this faction would have been destroyed long ago.]","The Xichi Spiritual Master: [After watching the movie, I changed my views regarding cultivators. You should definitely watch it if you are interested. I dare to say that the whole situation of the cultivator world will be different if we can learn a small part of the power shown in the movie.]","Jun Yangzi: [The spiritual artifacts and the creation methods are totally different from ours, and it’s a god-sent gift to artifact masters! Artifact masters must study the auspicious patterns and runes on the Heavenly Mirror.]","Duan Buyi: [Daoist Brother, when the Heavenly Mirror came out, it was engulfed by brilliant light, and its body kept spinning. I couldn’t even get a good look at it.]","Yun Yanzi: [Don’t you know how to press the pause button? I can not only see it but can go into the inside of the spiritual artifact to study the structure! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f644.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F644;\">]","Duan Buyi: [Daoisit Brother, you’re smart! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f613.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F613;\"> We can do that?!]","Tang Yuan: [Anyway, I plan to watch it again. Is there anyone who wants to join me?]","Nalan Hongwu: [I plan to watch it again.]","Ye Songtao: [Me too.]","The Xichi Spiritual Master: [I want to see it again.]","Red Wing Daoist: [The stuff we just watched is too deep for me. I have to watch it again!]","“...”","“This powerful?!” Some people who hadn’t planned to watch the movie went to watch it.","Many people did more than just watching it themselves. For example, after watching Shu Mountain four times, the Xichi Spiritual Master returned to the faction and said, “Junior Brother, should we introduce this movie to our Faction Master?”","The Ethereal Spiritual Master totally agreed to her suggestion. “We should indeed ask our senior brother, the Faction Master, to watch it. The faction in the movie has so many powerful spiritual treasures, including the Heavenly Mirror, the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords, and even the Nanming Li Fire Sword. Look at us! We are probably at the same level of Wutai Mountain. The Wutai Mountain Faction Master only had the time to cast Daluo Buddha Hand before the faction was destroyed by a demonic roar. I guess our whole faction would have the same fate after using the Nanhua Heavenly Light once. Forget it, I can’t keep belittling our faction and praising others.”","“You have a point,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said, “Our Nanhua Faction has a powerful supreme treasure which had been passed down for generations since the establishment of our faction, but compared with the Heavenly Mirror and the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords, it is...”","– Meanwhile in the Haoran Faction –","“Elder Duan!” A square-faced cultivator wearing a blue-trimmed white robe said solemnly, “You know how busy I am as the Faction Master. Instead of helping me, you are asking me to travel to the distant Half City! What is the point of going to that place?","“Upon your return, you keep talking about the great power of the Emei Faction on Shu Mountain, but I’ve never even heard of it before! Where is the faction named Emei in the world?! You are telling me that I will regret it if I don’t go there? I think I’ll regret it if I go there!”","– In the Yimu Daoist Palace –","A white-haired old Daoist said, “What White Browed Spiritual Master?! What Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords? Can they be more powerful than our Yimu True Flame? Junior Brother, you just want to read the cultivation method in the last scroll of Yimu True Flame, right? I told you many times that you can’t hasten the process. You haven’t even reached the highest realm of the ninth scroll yet.”","“Senior Brother, I think I don’t need to read the scroll.” It was clear that the speaker was the middle-aged Daoist who had taken some disciples to attend the auction in Half City. “I’ve taught myself the contents of the tenth scroll.”","“It’s best that you are not too ambitious with weak strength.” The old Daoist snorted and then looked over with widened eyes. “What did you just say?!”","“I said that I’ve taught myself the contents of the tenth scroll of Yimu True flame,” the middle-aged Daoist in the black-and-white Daoist robe said.","Then, with a wave of his hand, orange flames with pale blue edges floated in the air.","“This... is indeed the power of the level 10 Yimu True Flame!” The old Daoist gazed at the flames before him in doubt. “But the colors don’t look right. They should have white edges instead of blue edges... I never heard of them being orange with blue edges...”","“This is the improved Yimu True Flame after I read the Heavenly Book and studied the Nanming Li Fire; these flames are ten to 20 percent more powerful than the original ones.”","“What!!??” The old Daoist was stupefied while he looked at his junior brother with widened eyes."]},{"number":354,"title":"Chapter 354 - Who Is More Powerful","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Wang Lingxiao was the current Nanhua Faction Master.","Usually at this time, he was either handling the faction affairs in Tianhua Hall or cultivating in his own room.","However, today, he walked out of the faction with the Xichi Spiritual Master and the Ethereal Spiritual Master wearing a white robe that was for people lower than ordinary elders.","With him were a few elders with high positions and power in the Nanhua Faction.","“Hey, what is this thing that needs us to see in person? Can’t you bring it back to the faction?” an elder with white hair asked curiously.","“It’s said that the Xichi Spiritual Master discovered an ancient relic named, um, Emei, and there is someone named the Youquan Blood Demon. He is super powerful and needs our combined force to deal with.”","“I heard that it’s just a small shop?”","“How can it be a small shop? With my tight schedule, why would I come to visit a small shop?! It’s an ancient cave abode named the Blood-Dripping Cave, and there’s a Heavenly Book in there!”","“I heard that there are some extremely powerful treasures such as the Heavenly Mirror and Immortal-Slaying Sword?”","Hearing their discussions, the Xichi Spiritual Master and Ethereal Spiritual Master looked at each other and shook their heads in embarrassment.","“They really need to come out and experience the world...” The Ethereal Spiritual Master’s lips twitched.","If they hadn’t witnessed and experienced them in person, the people in this world wouldn’t have known what internet cafés, computers, virtual reality, TV Series, and games were! Since they couldn’t explain everything to them in detail in a short session, there were great differences between the explanation and what had been understood by these elders.","That was how things turned out to be.","Anyway, the Xichi Spiritual Master and Ethereal Spiritual Master didn’t care about what these elders had understood as long as they went to the internet café with them.","...","– Meanwhile in the Forbidden Place in the black mountain of the Nanhua Faction –","“These old guys found a large ancient relic! No... maybe more than one relic!” The person with white hair and chilly light in her eyes was the previous Nanhua Heaven Fairy and the guardian of the Forbidden Place.","Shui Xianyun narrowed her eyes. “These guys were indeed lucky to have found a group of ancient relics, and the effects... seem to be very good.”","“You’ve found out the cause?”","“Yes,” Shui Xianyun snickered and said, “It was a coincidence. It seems that the recent issues we are experiencing are caused by a force that controls a group of relics. We had lured a lot of disciples, but quite a few of them experienced increases in strength in these relics effectively. Also, a portion of the disciples of Nanhua who weren’t controlled by us yet were taken to that place.”","“So, it’s... just a coincidence? They are recruiting people into the relics and thus interfered with a lot of our businesses?”","Shui Xianyun said, “I’m afraid so.”","“Hahahaha!” that voice laughed wildly. “Relics? They are just a joke! In front of the power of my kind, humans are just like ants. If not for my carelessness, I wouldn’t have been trapped here after being sneak-attacked by those young cowards!”","“Now, those cowards all died due to their severe injuries, but my power has been growing non-stop!” His voice oozed fury and hatred. “When I come out, I’ll enslave all your disciples and grand disciples and kill anyone who disobeys me!”","“Congratulations for your growth of power, Saint Lord!” An evil smile appeared on Shui Xianyun’s face.","...","Meanwhile, the elders of the major factions had begun watching Jade Dynasty and Shu Mountain; some were even taken to check out the Legend of Mir 2, Grand Theft Auto 5, or Harry Potter, experiencing other unimaginable civilizations.","The players in the Half City Shop were mostly cultivators in the city. But now, the number of players from other places in the Morning Star Sea Realm began to grow.","In the lounge area of the shop, the masters and elders of major factions sat down after watching movies or playing games with a box of spicy sticks before them.","As a Faction Master, Wang Lingxiao slowly moved his head in circles and murmured with an old Daoist who was in a black-and-white Daoist robe sitting next to him, “At the beginning of the world, chaos filled the space with the sun and the moon concealing their light. The boundaries of heaven and earth were blurred. Then, they began to take shape, and the pure and turbid began to separate... The content of the Heavenly Book is indeed profound and mysterious. I’ve memorized the words, but the meaning is still hard to grasp!”","“It’s not that difficult,” the old Daoist beside him said with disdain, “It explains the complementary effects of opposite things, and it’s also demonstrated in Tai Chi Mystic Pure Dao which combines Yin and Yang and the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords which repel and assist each other.”","“Tianxu Daoist, I’m talking about the Heavenly Book in Jade Dynasty; how did you drag it to Shu Mountain. What Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords? If not for the Nanming Li Fire Sword, the owners of the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords would have died!”","“B*llshit!” Tianxu Daoist was instantly furious when he heard Wang Lingxiao say that the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords were no match for the Nanming Li Fire Sword. “The combination of the dual swords fits the idea that Yin and Yang represents everything in the world. How can the power of the heaven and the earth be weaker than the Nanming Li Fire Sword?!”","“What nonsense are you sprouting? What Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords? What Nanming Li Fire Sword?” Sitting near them was a middle-aged man wearing a sapphire Daoist robe, who was the Haoran Faction Master. “This movie talks about the Grand Orthodox Qi between the sky and the earth. Didn’t you hear the White Browed Spiritual Master repeatedly say that the Grand Orthodox Qi exists forever in the space between the sky and the earth?”","[TL Note: Haoran also means grand.]","While stroking his beard, the grey-clothed elder with the surname ‘Duan’ said, “Right. If our Haoran Faction could make use of this Grand Orthodox Qi, then our Heaven-Conforming Grand Sword would be able to unleash unimaginable power!”","“What are you talking about?!” The middle-aged Daoist from Yimu Daoist Palace was holding a mass of orange flames with blue edges in his hand. “If I didn’t sense the power of the Nanming Li Fire in Shu Mountain, I would probably have been stuck at level 9 of the Yimu True Flame. I’ve never sensed this power in other weapons! The Nanming Li Fire Sword is the most powerful!”","“Junior Brother! What are you talking about?!” Tianxu Daoist was furious that his junior brother stood with people outside of their faction against him!","“The Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords are unrivaled in the whole world! Nanming Li Fire Sword? It is probably not even half as powerful as that of the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array!”","“B*llshit!” Wang Lingxiao said with displeasure, “The Immortal-Slaying Sword Array is no match for one strike of the Nanming Li Fire Sword!”","The fans of Jade Dynasty were not pleased. “Why are you belittling our Immortal-Slaying Sword Array? I can explode the whole Emei Mountain with one sword strike!”","“How can you explode the Emei Mountain with one sword strike?” The fans of Shu Mountain were angry. “Do you think our Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords are so lame?”","Obviously, many of the old customers were fans of Jade Dynasty, and Red Wing Daoist was one of them. “If you’re so powerful, come and battle with me. I’ll use a spiritual spell I’ve improved after reading the Heavenly Book!”","“Do you think I’m afraid of you?!”","On the other side, Tianxu Daoist emitted black and white spiritual light. “You obtained some inspiration; do you think I got nothing?”","“Go outside if you want to fight!” Mr. Fang’s face turned dark.","“Let’s go outside! I just don’t believe that there’s anything more powerful than the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords!”","“You all got it wrong! The most powerful thing is the Grand Orthodox Qi! Can you block my Heaven-Conforming Grand Sword?!”","A group of combative people walked outside, ready to battle."]},{"number":355,"title":"Chapter 355 - Pirate Plan","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Compared to the combative atmosphere in the Half City Shop, the people in the Jiuhua City shop were much friendlier with each other.","By now, many of them had reached the limit of their daily computer time. Nalan Hongwu, Lan Mo, Xue Daolv, and the other grandmasters sat on the couch while the people from the academies and factions and even some independent warriors stood around them either with a bottle of Coke or a bowl of instant noodles in their hands.","“Okay, I’ll talk about the sword control technique.” While sipping Coke and picking up a spicy stick, Xue Daolv looked around him as if he was a great mentor. “The sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction, the Emei Faction, and the Green Cloud Faction each has its own merits. The talented people can try to learn the good parts of these techniques, and the people with less talent can focus on one faction’s technique. Now, I will share with you my inspirations from these three kinds of sword control technique.”","“Palace Master Xue!” Song Qingfeng was good at sword control technique and driving cars; he had often ridden with these grandmasters, so he wasn’t meek in front of them. He asked, “Although these sword control techniques each has its own merits, as warriors, we can only practice the sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction, right?”","“Good question,” Xue Daolv said with a smile, “I guess you must all have read the Heavenly Book, and it talks about a concept that all the techniques in the world lead to the same source. In theory, as long as your essence or qi is pure enough, the different methods don’t matter to you. However, it’s true in theory and I think for now, the sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction is more appropriate for warriors.”","Putting a spicy stick into his mouth, Xue Daolv continued, “As you all know, the key to the sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction is controlling sword with qi, which is either spiritual essence or warrior qi.”","“Instructor Mu, you’re here too?” Lan Yan was watching from the back while sipping Coke. Soon, she spotted a woman wearing a red leather vest.","“Yeah.” Mu Hongzhu nodded and said in earnest, “Otherwise, I’ll lag behind my own students.”","Although she still couldn’t fully understand some of the things that she had learned, she could teach the students the inspiration and understanding that she had obtained, including the improved versions of some combat techniques as well as her understanding of the sword techniques and cultivation techniques such as the sword control technique and Saint Spiritual Sword Technique, etc.","As an instructor, Mu Hongzhu was considering teaching the students some new stuff in the class.","Anyway, Lingyun Academy had been making big changes in the school. The instructors had to be familiar with at least one movie, one TV series, or a game to be qualified to become a high-level instructor.","As for the grandmasters such as Xue Daolv and Nalan Hongwu, they gained a deeper understanding than the low-leveled cultivators even though they watched the same shows and played the same games.","...","Outside the Half City shop, fire lights danced, and sword shadows swept in the air.","“Check out my Yimu True Flame!” Waves of flames danced outside the shop with their shadows.","“It’s nothing! Watch my Sky-Burning Red Flame!”","“Yimu Green Sun Scroll!”","“Seven Tribulation Dragon-Slaying Spell!” A wave of vague sword shadows flashed in front of the shop. Instantly, the sword shadows surged up like a mountain!","“Damn it! When did you get the chance to learn the Seven Tribulation Dragon-Slaying Spell?!” A Daoist wearing a black-and-white robe yelled in astonishment.","“Haha! Are you surprised? I’ve even begun learning the Ghost-God-Slaying Spell! After I master it, I can kill you with one sword strike!”","“Do you think you’re using Dual Flames?”","“They are all useless!” A black-robed cultivator entered the fray and cast a spiritual spell. Instantly, a gloomy and horrifying blood-colored shadow rose into the sky before them.","“Damn it! Youquan Old Demon?!”","“What do you want?!”","“Hahahaha!” Black Demon laughed wildly. “This is a spiritual spell that I copied from Youquan’s roar the other day which shattered the mountains and cracked the ground. Can you block my roar?! Even though it’s just a mimic, it is quite powerful!”","Suddenly, a red shadow quickly expanded in front of the shop until it was as high as a two-story building; it was a huge, two-horned rare beast that was emitting flames!","“Do you dare to roar at my dog?” Xue Shuilong had the Dragon Pattern Sword in his hand, and the huge godly beast before him obviously had reached level 7; it was a horrifying sight!","“Hahahaha!” On the side, Tang Yuan stroked his beard with a smile. “Daoist Xue, you summoned such a big dog; aren’t you afraid that I will cast the Holy Word Spell on it?”","“Don’t you dare...” Immediately, Xue Shuilong shrank his godly beast to its original size and hid it behind him. After all, it took him great efforts to train it to level 7, and it would be tragic if it were killed by a Holy Word Spell.","“Hahahaha!” Duan Yue, the grey-robed elder of the Haoran Faction walked out of the shop while laughing.","“Junior Brother, why are you so happy?” the Haoran Faction Master asked in surprise.","“Well! I just talked with the cultivators of Dajin on QQ and found that they have special skills in artifact making,” Duan Yue said, “Senior Brother, let’s go back now and prepare the materials. Maybe we can make mimic the Heavenly Mirror!”","“What?!”","All the arguments instantly stopped while everyone looked toward Duan Yue.","“What did you just say?!”","“Don’t look at me like that,” Duan Yue said, “Of course, we couldn’t mimic one that is as powerful as the original Heavenly Mirror. But if we can understand its structure and the engraved runes and auspicious patterns, we might be able to make a knock-off version of the Heavenly Mirror.”","After all, the cultivators in this world were not morons. With the original item placed before them for them to study, if they couldn’t figure something out of it, they would have wasted many years.","“Good! Good! Good!” The Haoran Faction Master said in exhilaration, “As long as you think it’s likely that we can achieve this, all the resources and manpower of the Haoran Faction are at your disposal!”","“Ugh... This...” Tianxu Daoist of the Yimu Daoist Palace came over and said while rubbing his hands. “It will take at least ten years for a couple of cultivators to obtain a total understanding of this thing. Why not...”","“The Wuwei Daoist Alliance suggested that we can build a group chat in QQ and share the results of our research.”","“Good idea!”","“Let’s go and create this group chat!”","“We can try to make a few super supreme treasures as those in the Emei Faction. Even if our disciples are not strong, they can destroy invaders with these treasures!”","“Hahaha! Right! We’d better make the kinds with high spiritual properties, so no one can use them even if they are taken from us!”","“After talking...” The masters of the major factions looked at each other and said, “Maybe we can put even more resources into this project.”"]},{"number":356,"title":"Chapter 356 - Scheduling Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Under the urgings from cultivators of the Jiuhua City Shop and Half City Shop, a group chat named High-level Artifact Masters Communication Group was established on QQ.","Jun Yangzi: [Hello! Daoist friends.]","Duan Yue: [Hello! Daoist Friends from Jiuhua City! I heard that you’re studying runes, magic, and technology? How is it going with your research?]","Li Haoran: [F*cking great!]","Duan Yue: [...]","Jun Yangzi: [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f620.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F620;\"> Mind your language! Okay? Don’t use the cuss words you learned from Grand Theft Auto!]","“It just slipped out...” Li Haoran looked embarrassed beside his master.","As the Master of the Yuanheng Pavilion, a shop selling all kinds of rare treasures, Tang Yuan was a high-level artifact master himself. “How are you planning to study it?”","Not only Tang Yuan, but many cultivators with high-level artifact-making skills in Half City joined the group as well. Even Gongyi Xiu of the Yundian Upper Realm took the opportunity to shamelessly slip into the group. There were many artifact masters in this group already.","Jun Yangzi: [We divided the research into three categories, which are life, warfare, and small-scale fights involving spiritual spells and treasures. We’re studying crystal energy cars, a new communication jade, magic spells in Harry Potter, etc. As for guns and magic instillation, we’ve produced some mature products.]","Obviously, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, which had entered these areas quite early, had begun some advanced research projects.","Looking at the long list that Jun Yanzi showed them, the artifact masters in the Half City Shop were very surprised. [Daoist Friend Jun Yangzi, how should we begin if we want to study the interior structure of the Heavenly Mirror or the Immortal-Slaying Sword Array?]","[I mean...] Duan Yue asked cautiously, [Many of our factions plan to put great resources into this research and want to make a high-quality imitation of the Heavenly Mirror. Do you think we can do it?]","Jun Yangzi: [You can learn the artifact-making method of the Shu Mountain Faction. According to my observations, these two factions have similar artifact-making methods, and you can get some inspiration from them.]","Duan Yue: [The problem is that the shop over here doesn’t have the Legend of the Sword and Fairy yet!]","Yun Yangzi: [I asked the Shop Owner, and he said that the game will be released soon in the shop in your city. Before it comes out, you can bring your questions to me.]","Duan Yue: [Thank you very much!]","Jun Yangzi chuckled and said, [Don’t mention it. Your skills in artifact-making are much higher than ours, and I hope you can help us in the future.]","“How did it go?” At this moment, the faction masters were all standing behind Duan Yue.","“Good!” Duan Yue leaned back on the computer chair and looked at the screen. “Despite the conflicts in the Legend of Mir 2 with us, these guys are quite nice and straightforward. We can share our research results and help each other, so I guess the research process won’t be too slow.”","After all, the two parties were far apart in real life, and they didn’t have any conflicts of interest excepting for fighting each other in the game. More importantly, some of the guys didn’t play the Legend of Mir 2, so the people from the two regions played and drove cars together in Grand Theft Auto 5.","“Good!” Tianxu Daoist clapped his hands in appreciation and said, “After the project is done, we will each have a Heavenly Mirror!”","Duan Yue’s face twitched as he said, “It’s only an imitation, and I’m sure it will cost lots of resources!”","“For such a f*cking good item, I don’t care about how much it will cost,” Wang Lingxiao said with a snort.","Then, he saw everyone staring at him.","Wang Lingxiao asked, “Why are you staring at me like that? Did I say something wrong?”","Everyone replied, “Faction Master Wang, you’re right. For such a f*cking good item, we shouldn’t worry about how many resources it will cost.”","They nodded repeatedly.","“Let’s join in the group chat in QQ and watch Shu Mountain again tomorrow!”","[Your computer time is up.]","Duan Yue stood up and dusted his butt, “Let’s go! Let’s go!”","“It’s disgusting that we are not given even one extra minute!”","...","As a warrior, Nalan Hongwu watched certain episodes of Wind and Cloud each day, such as the episode where the Sword Saint used Sword 23 and the two episodes where No Name (Wu Ming) recovered his cultivation strength and mastered the technique named “Innumerable Swords Returning to Root”.","In the courtyard of the Nalan Family, Nalan Hongwu pointed out his index and middle fingers, and a surge of overwhelming sword energy shot out from his body!","The big courtyard was filled by murderous spirit.","“The Heavenly Sword is too high and too mysterious, and I’m afraid that I can’t reach the realm of No Name, who can make tens of thousands of swords submit to him. As for Sword 23, it’s a bit too risky and dangerous to understand this sword technique since it’s something beyond the mortal world.”","The sharp sword energy swept across the courtyard and shattered the plants and trees into dust.","Sword One.","Sword Two.","Sword Three...","One by one, he cast the Saint Spiritual Sword Techniques smoothly.","As the sword energies moved faster, they almost knocked down all the walls around the courtyard and left many deep cuts in the ground.","...","Meanwhile in the Morning Star Sea Realm, the cultivators who were not artifact masters were also busy.","In the cloudy sky above the sea outside Half City, many cultivators hovered in the air.","“Tianxu Daoist!” Wang Lingxiao stood in the air with his hands clasped behind his back. “The previous battle is not finished yet. I must show you the truth as for which is more powerful, the Nanming Li Fire Sword or the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords!”","On the other side, the Haoran Faction Master also hovered in the air, coldly gazing at the cultivators of Half City. “You’re all learning the unorthodox evil spells. Which one of you rebuffed my claim and said that Grand Orthodox Qi is garbage and the Youquan Blood Demon is the f*cking greatest? Stand out!”","The cultivators of Half City were silent. After all, many of them had just reached the early or middle stage of Divine Ocean Realm and were not as powerful as the old monsters in the inner city; how could they rival the Haoran Faction Master?","Even Black Demon, the most active one among them who had even imitated some power of Youquan Blood Demon, now looked embarrassed.","At this moment, a soft chuckle came into their ears. “Faction Master Xie, it’s beneath you to bully the cultivators of the early and middle stage of the Divine Ocean Realm. Do you want to fight Big Sister instead? The elders of your Haoran Faction can join you and battle me together if you want.”","Xie Longchi, the Haoran Faction Master was surprised, and his face changed color. How come this demonic woman is here?","With someone more powerful supporting them, Black Demon and the others were emboldened. “I did say that Youquan is the most powerful. What now?”","...","– Two hours later –","The hair of people like Wang Lingxiao and Tianxu Daoist were disheveled with some missing, and their clothes were ripped and torn. “Daoist Friend... Wang! Wait.... until I recover my breath! Then, I will reason with you!”","How come this Daoist has such a deep understanding of the mysterious concept of Yin and Yang? Wang Lingxiao was also out of breath. “Humph! We’ll stop today with a draw. But it’s not because the Heavenly Lightning Dual Swords are more powerful; it is because I haven’t fully understood the essence of the Nanming Li Fire! I’ll fight you again after watching the movie tomorrow!”","On the other side, the disheveled Haoran Faction Master yelled, “The Grand Orthodox Qi exists forever!","“To...Tomorrow, if you dare, don’t run after you get offline! I haven’t fully comprehended the theory yet. The Grand Orthodox Qi didn’t lose to your unorthodox evil spells!”","Seeing the Haoran Faction Master fleeing with the elders, Ning Bi narrowed her eyes and instantly healed that one bloody scratch on her face with a brush of her hand; the others didn’t notice when it appeared.","“These little guys of Haoran Faction have improved a lot lately. Interesting.”","She murmured to herself, “It seems that I’ve got to work harder and obtain the secret skill scroll of the Divine Light of Orochi from the King of Fighters... Otherwise, I’ll disgrace myself by losing to these guys later on.”"]},{"number":357,"title":"Chapter 357 - Coming Out Soon","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While the masters and elders of the major factions of the Morning Star Sea Realm battled outside of Half City, the place in front of the shop became the practice field for the disciples and young cultivators.","The number of young cultivators had been growing in the shop. After watching Shu Mountain and Jade Dynasty, they soon gathered in the place before the shop.","Comparatively, the Emei and Green Cloud’s technique of flying on swords had higher skill thresholds than that of Shu Mountain Faction, but the learning process was simpler than the latter.","To learn the sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction, one didn’t have to use a sword made of high-quality material. When one mastered the use of qi, even flowers, leaves, or an ordinary wooden sword could be used to cast this technique; it meant that it had a high requirement for the control of qi.","However, to learn the sword control technique of Emei and Green Cloud, one must first acquire a spiritual sword with abundant spiritual essence or a better sword with a trace of spiritual properties to achieve the effect of merging oneself with the sword to achieve flight.","To encourage the elite disciples to master the sword control techniques, the forces had put lots of resources into it. For example, beneath Liu Ningyun’s feet was a long spiritual sword emitting pale blue crystal luster; it was made with the extremely precious deep-sea mystic jade.","At this moment, she flew out of the shop, and only a blue sword light could be seen; it was a celestial and elegant sight.","The female disciples with Mo Xian looked envious. “When can we do it as well as Junior Sister Liu?”","Shakily stepping on spiritual swords in front of the shop, they disdainfully looked at the cultivators who were still practicing the sword control technique.","Obviously, flying on the sword was much more difficult than the ordinary offensive moves of the sword control technique.","After all, while holding onto their own weight, they must make sure not to fall while moving swiftly. However, attacking with the sword control technique only required one to maneuver one sword properly. The degree of difficulty of the two skills were not on the same level.","...","– In the Wuwei Daoist Alliance –","“Master.” In the artifact-making room, Li Haoran stood with two middle-aged artifact masters, and they each held a platter covered by a silk handkerchief. “To imitate the Heavenly Mirror, we’ve finally chosen three precious materials for the body of this spiritual artifact.”","He pulled the cover on one platter and revealed a square jade box. When he opened the jade box, shiny crystal light came out. As the light faded away, a white, translucent crystal that was about the size of a grain of rice appeared.","Then, he revealed another platter, and there was a white and smooth stone on it. At a closer look, one could see faint spiritual patterns on it; it was quite mystical.","On the last platter was a rectangle box; inside was a palm-sized, flat object. It looked like neither gold nor jade; it was more like it had been made from bones.","“These boxes contain a 5,000-year-old dragon mystic crystal, a meteorite, and a bone from a prehistoric relic that has extremely good spiritual properties.”","Jun Yangzi nodded and said, “Thank you for your hard work. I’m surprised that we can only find three materials to make the imitation of the Heavenly Mirror with the power of the entire Wuwei Daoist Alliance. But this bone looks good with its abundant spiritual essence.”","“This bone comes from Yundian Upper Realm,” Li Haoran said, “They want to join our project.”","“What are they doing here?” Many artifact masters looked angry. “Aren’t they minions of the Three Saint Gates? Now that they saw that our Wuwei Daoist Alliance is prospering, they want to share the benefits?”","Jun Yangzi said with a smile, “Aren’t they still negotiating the compensation? Report to His Majesty and ask him to include this bone into their compensation. As for them joining our project...”","“We can allow one of them to enter the project, and we can take this opportunity to figure out their purpose.”","“What else could it be?” Duan Buyi said in disapproval, “Their purpose is obviously stealing knowledge from us after knowing that we started the research earlier than them.”","“Don’t worry about that,” Jun Yangzi said, “With Mr. Fang’s shop standing there, they will catch up sooner or later despite our early start. We can take this opportunity to learn the more advanced artifact-making knowledge from the Yundian Upper Realm as well.”","“Besides, I have a feeling that the Three Saint Gates are plotting something. Although our crisis is over, many big forces are looking at us with strange lights in their eyes,” Jun Yangzi said, “As a precaution, if we can bring Yundian Upper Realm onto our boat, that will alleviate the pressure on us.”","“You’re right, Daoist Brother Jun Yangzi!”","...","Besides the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, the major forces of the Morning Star Sea Realm were also busy with the research on imitating the spiritual artifacts. The artifact masters were enjoying the peak time of their careers since they could study the super supreme treasures that had horrifying power and was made using a totally strange method under the support of most of the major forces in the Morning Star Sea Realm. They could choose materials from piles of precious items, study the structures of super supreme treasures, and try to make a horribly powerful supreme treasure that they had never imagined before; they were in the best artifact-making environment of all time.","“Little Shop Owner, are the items in your shop really so powerful?” While controlling the joystick, Ning Bi asked doubtfully.","“Maybe not.” Mr. Fang controlled Iori Yagami and used the desperation move, Shiki Ya Otome, while he said with a poker face, “The stuff in my shop are all garbage.”","Ning Bi said, “Big Sister just wants to know if you’re afraid that someone will try to rob the exceptional stuff in your shop?”","“I am. Can you protect me, by the way?” Mr. Fang had just casually killed Ning Bi’s Athena with a combo; Ning Bi had never seen anyone say that they were scared with such a casual expression.","“How can you ask me to protect you while you are not even going easy on me?”","Obviously, Mr. Fang’s way of talking put an end to the conversation. In addition, he easily killed the three characters on Ning Bi’s team, showing no mercy at all.","Mr. Fang lit up a cigarette and said, “You must be nimble and clever to play the King of Fighters. If you continue playing it this way, you won’t defeat Orochi, let alone playing the character and unlocking Orochi’s spiritual spells.”","“We’ll continue tomorrow!” She needed a break!","With a wave of fragrance, she was gone.","Mr. Fang scratched his head. “Ugh? We were having a good time, right?”","...","Meanwhile, things continue to brew in the black mountain of the Nanhua Faction.","A gloomy voice sounded, and hatred which had been pent up for many years oozed out of it. “Hurry up! Tell the people of the Feng Family to speed up. I’ll soon break out from this damned restriction array!”"]},{"number":358,"title":"Chapter 358 - Crisis in the Nanhua Faction","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the bottom right corner of Jun Yanzi’s computer, the icon of the High-level Artifact Masters Communication Group had been jumping frequently; it jumped several times each second.","[TL Note: In QQ, the icon of a group chat will jump when someone sends a new message.]","[(Screenshot) How come these engravings can’t reach the ideal power level? Where did I go wrong? Is there anyone who has experience in this subject?]","Red Wing Daoist: [The Dragon-Slaying Sword in Jade Dynasty seems to be made of 10,000-year-old Green Crystal; any swords made with Green Crystal are sharper than anything else. I want to find a substitute with similar power. Do any of you have a good suggestion?]","Gongyi Xiu: [You can’t find a substitute since I’ve been looking for it as well and failed. Maybe you can try the Mystic Water Chilly Crystal. By increasing its sharp metal essence with the five-element derivative method, you might be able to mimic 70% of its power.]","Red Wing Daoist: [But it goes against my red flames attribute.]","Gongyi Xiu: [That’s easy. You can use Earth Vein Flame Gold.]","Red Wing Daoist: [Then, my Seven Tribulation Dragon-Slaying Spell would release red light instead of the original green light; it will feel weird.]","[How come I can’t imitate the flow of the spiritual essence in this part of the Heavenly Mirror? Can any of you explain why?]","[(Screenshot) The auspicious pattern of this part should be a phoenix, right? How come I can’t make it right?]","Duan Buyi, [I checked the texts on the Shu Mountain Faction and found that the auspicious bird is the Godly Bird Jiaoming of the South; it looks like a phoenix, but you’ll encounter problems if you engrave a phoenix on it.]","[There’s such a bird?]","[How come I’ve never heard of it before?]","Many people sent messages to show their appreciation after seeing this message.","Soon, Jun Yanzi asked in the group, [This spiritual artifact is hard to make. The difficulty lies in the control of the temperature. If we turn the temperature too low, the fire would be extinguished.]","Duan Yue: [But you still have the water method of making artifacts and the steaming method of getting essence, right?]","Jun Yangzi: [What’s that? I’ve never heard of it before (Husky’s puzzled face).]","Duan Yue: [Don’t you have these artifact-making methods over there? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f613.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F613;\">]","Jun Yangzi: [You have these good methods? Can you tell me about it? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f633.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F633;\">?]","[Wait a second.] Duan Yue glanced at his communication jade. [Some new artifact masters arrived, and I must make some arrangement for them.]","Jun Yangzi, [You’re all together <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f44d.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F44D;\">?]","“...”","The icon of the artifact masters group chat kept jumping all the time, and dozens of messages flooded the screen in a short moment.","A few days later in the artifact masters group chat.","Duan Yue: [The artifact masters of Wuwei Daoist Alliance are awesome <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f44d.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F44D;\">! With the information about auspicious creatures that you guys provided, we’ve successfully finished researching several of them. By the way, your Luotian Fire Refinery is interesting, and it’s about time for us to try making a prototype of the Heavenly Mirror.]","Duan Buyi: “Your water refinery method is also great, and it helped us solve the problem that we encountered earlier. It seems that we can begin on the first step of the mimicking project.]","...","Meanwhile, in the air above the sea outside Half City.","“Faction Master Wang, do you think that you can defeat me just because you gained the upper-hand yesterday?!” Tianxu Daoist raised his head and laughed smugly, “I thought level 10 was the highest level of the Yimu True Flame, but now I know how wrong I was! Now, I’ve understood the essence of level 11 of the True Flame. After some time of practice, I will surpass all my predecessors! Today, I’ll show you the power of the new Yimu True Flame!”","“Yang Flame! Go!” An orange-red flame shot out from his hand like a mini sun!","The moment that the flame was shot out, the whole space above the sea turned as hot as a huge stove!","Wang Lingxiao yelled in a weird tone, “What’s this damn thing?!”","“Hahaha! Are you afraid?”","“You think I’m afraid?” Spiritual light lit up in Wang Lingxiao’s hand. “Today, I’ll show you the true power of Heavenly Light!”","In the space above the sea outside Half City, flames shot up into the sky on the left while lightning bolts rolled on the right. Under the flashing sword energies and the crashing lightning, the ocean waves surged up, threatening to swallow the sky and the earth! It looked as if the sky would collapse at any moment now.","Meanwhile, all the cultivators who were entering or leaving Half City looked up at the sky as if they had seen a ghost; they keep a good distance from this area, afraid this fierce battle would hurt them.","...","“Junior Sister Liu, shall we have a sword control technique competition?” Mo Xian said proudly. She had recently mastered flying on swords and felt extremely good about herself. Right now, she was proudly standing on a black immortal sword in the air before the shop.","“Okay.”","Suddenly, Liu Ningyun’s expression changed.","“Junior Sister, what’s wrong?” Surprised, Mo Xian touched her own communication jade at her belt, and her expression changed as well.","“Senior Sister, you got the message as well?” Liu Ningyun asked grimly.","Mo Xian said with a nod, “Yeah. Something happened in the faction. We must return now!”","“What happened?!” Yue Yan asked in a low voice, “Everything was fine yesterday. How come we have an emergency today?”","“How should I know?” Mo Xian frowned. “But it’s an urgent summon; it wouldn’t be issued if there isn’t a crisis.”","...","– In the Forbidden Place in the black mountain of the Nanhua Faction –","A shrilling roar came from the Forbidden Place in the black mountain. It sounded like a booming thunder or the roar of a horrifying demon beast from ancient times. This roar shattered all the stone tablets in the black mountain and shook the mountains all over the Nanhua Faction as if an earthquake were happening!","“What’s happening?!”","“What happened?!”","The disciples of the Nanhua Faction looked terrified, and the elders who stayed in the faction looked ashen-faced. “Forbidden Place! It came from the Forbidden Place!?”","“Impossible!” After all, the elder guarding the Forbidden Place had a cultivation level as high as that of the Faction Master. “Isn’t that elder guarding the Forbidden Place?”","“Was the Forbidden Place broken into?!”","With several furious roars, a few figures flew to the Forbidden Place at the black mountain where thick dark-red clouds surged up in the sky, and violent winds howled, sending sand and rocks flying.","The entire Forbidden Place at the black mountain was engulfed by demonic clouds!","“A demon is coming out! These are the signs that the demon is coming out!” A white-haired elder pointed at the sky, looking terrified!","“Where’s the First Elder? Isn’t she guarding this place?” A few elders broke through the thick clouds and went into the Forbidden Place to investigate.","“Are you looking for me, Junior Brothers?” A white-haired woman looking to be somehow in her twenties sat on the stone cliff, looking at them with interest.","Red clouds swept up, and the elders vanished while screaming as if they had never existed in this world.","“It seems like those little guys of Feng Family have finished their work. Now, I only need to go to two places to get back my flesh and bones.” In the thick clouds, it seemed like a pair of evil eyes stared at the sky. “Even you guys couldn’t block one strike from me; I’ll see how your disciples and grand disciples will fight me!”"]},{"number":359,"title":"Chapter 359 - Catastrophe","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– In the High-Level Artifact Master Communication Group –","Li Haoran: [How come the group is much so quieter today?]","Jun Yangzi, [Most of the people over here are still online, but how come the artifact masters in Half City are so quiet today? @Duan Yue @Artifact Master Yanhua Spiritual Master @Shen Fengzi...]","Jun Yangzi used the symbol ‘@’ to try to contact them, but no one responded.","“Weird...”","“Maybe they are busy making artifacts.”","“They were making artifacts yesterday, and some of them were still in the group chat.”","– Meanwhile in the Heaven-Conforming Tower of the Haoran Faction –","This was the legendary place where a demon was suppressed.","In the past hundreds of years, the Heaven-Conforming Tower had been quiet and solid without any disturbances.","Seeing that they were alone, the elite disciples guarding the tower from the outside were either bored after standing for a long time or stretching their stiff bodies.","“Why are we guard this damn tower?” one of the disciples complained, “In my opinion, that demon must have died long ago after being suppressed under the Heaven-Conforming Tower for more than 1,000 years.”","“Yeah. It’s been so many years, and nothing happened. Maybe it died long ago.”","While these two disciples were complaining, red clouds suddenly appeared in the sky above the Heaven-Conforming Tower!","“What’s that?!” They looked up at the sky in horror; the blue sky had suddenly turned dark red.","The thick clouds covered the sky and hovered at a low altitude, and the previously clear sky instantly turned as dark as night!","“What... what’s that?!” Horrified, a disciple pointed at the sky when a huge horrifying face came out of the center of the thick clouds.","This face opened its mouth and sucked everything on the ground into the air, including the white treasure tower behind them; it looked like a hurricane had descended.","Beneath the treasure tower was a piece of an extremely big skeleton!","Then, the whole mountain cracked open with rocks and soil flying everywhere, revealing a huge, vicious skeleton with two horns and a wicked ghost-like face!","“No! The demon suppressed under the Heaven-Conforming Tower is coming out!”","Sensing the upheaval, many cultivators of the Haoran Faction including elders and elite cultivators flew up into the sky. In the blink of an eye, dozens of elite cultivators above the True Lake Realm and a few elders at the Divine Ocean Realm rushed to the site.","“Build the Major Heavenly Array!” a white-robed elder yelled!","The huge skeleton opened its mouth and roared!","The roar shook the sky and the earth. The cultivators flying toward it felt as if they were hit by a huge hammer on the chest and spat out blood with pale faces!","“You tiny fireflies dare to compete with the light from the bright moon?!”","Boom!","The skeleton lifted a claw bone and pressed down with its sharp boney fingertip. “A bunch of ants!”","The thick clouds seemed so near to the ground that the sky looked like it was crashing down!","A horrifying pressure crashed down viciously like Tai Mountain pressing down on an egg. The low-level cultivators were instantly exploded into clouds of bloody mist, and even the high-level elders at the Divine Ocean Realm had their meridians and bones broken while blood oozed out from their eyes, noses, ears, and mouth.","“You’re so weak!”","“Saint Lord, your superpower is unrivaled in the whole mortal world. How can we mortals be a match for you?” That old and genial Daoist with white hair fluttering in the wind stood in the sky with a fawning smile.","– Meanwhile in the distant Yimu Daoist Palace, which was at the very north of the Morning Star Sea Realm –","The mountain under a remote Daoist temple far from the main Yimu Daoist Palace buildings suddenly shook!","Then, the whole mountain let out booming noises as if someone were beating on a huge drum!","The ground cracked open as if something suppressed underground was being summoned out from beneath the mountain!","...","“How come the shop is so quiet today?” Mr. Fang looked around and found that at least one-third of the customers were missing.","Then, he heard people screaming in alarm outside the shop while pointing at the sky.","“Look over there!”","It was dark in the distant sky. In the darkness, it seemed like a horrifying demonic shadow was disturbing the winds and clouds, and its horrifying presence sent chills down people’s spines even from the distance!","“What’s that damn thing?” Mr. Fang frowned and felt that things weren’t that simple.","“From the looks of it, I’m afraid that a demon has come out.” Standing beside him, Mo Tianxing looked gloomy. “More than 1,000 years ago, a demonic catastrophe almost destroyed the cultivation world of the Morning Star Sea Realm. After 1,000 years, another catastrophe seems to be coming our way at a great speed!”","“So powerful?” Mr. Fang glanced at the cultivators around him in surprise. “What demon is it? Is it this powerful?”","“Our Mo Family lost all of our masters in that demonic catastrophe.” Mo Tianxing’s face dimmed at this memory. “Otherwise, if the Mo Family was still at its prime, I wouldn’t have been living like a refugee, hiding in Half City.”","...","– Meanwhile in the Nanhua Faction –","The whole Nanhua Faction was engulfed by dark clouds.","“Crazy! They are all crazy! My senior brother is crazy! He tried to kill me! So is my senior sister and my master! They are all mad!” A disciple of the Nanhua Faction hid in his room, shivering all over. “If the situation continues, I’ll go mad too!”","“No! They will probably kill me as well” Terror filled his face.","– In the Haoran Faction –","Faced with the horrifying demonic power, the cultivators could do nothing but flee. The slower ones were caught by red clouds, and they screamed in horror. Soon, other disciples were hunted by their senior brothers, elders, and masters who had been turned into fierce ghosts!","“Where is the Faction Master? Where is he?!” an elder roared in fury.","“He seemed to have gone to watch a movie with some elders,” another elder answered with a terrified expression.","“Watch?! Movie?!” the white-haired elder cussed immediately on the spot.","“All the disciples, retreat out of the mountain!”","“Retreat! Now! All of you, retreat!”","...","“After the destruction of the Nanhua Faction and the Haoran Faction, it’s now the Yimu Daoist Palace’s turn!” In the dark clouds, a huge demonic face seemed to be roaring in fury, “Anyone who obeys me will be rewarded; anyone who works against me will die!”","“Yes, Saint Lord!” Several cultivators of the Feng Family lowered their heads and said respectfully, “As for the rewards that the Saint Lord promised us...”","A blood-colored crystal suddenly appeared in the sky. “This contains a trace of my understanding of the laws of the world. You can take it and try to understand the power inside.”","The genial, celestial-looking old man was elated. “Thank you, Saint Lord!”","Meanwhile, many beams of light shot into the Nanhua Faction like shooting stars!","Wang Lingxiao’s eyes turned red as he looked at the ruins before him. “Nanhua Faction! How come my Nanhua Faction has turned into this state?!”","“Demon!” The Xichi Spiritual Master said in horror, “It looks exactly the same as the demon emergence described in the documents of our faction!”","Soon, they saw the damaged black mountain and found that the entire Forbidden Place had been razed to the ground!","“The Haoran Faction Master sent the message saying that Haoran Faction was ruined. That demon is on its way to Yimu Daoist Palace!”","“Tianxu Spiritual Master sent the message saying that the suppressed demon body has gotten out and probably has merged with that demon soul!”","Wang Lingxiao’s face paled. “It means that we’ll face a demon in its prime, just like in the demonic catastrophe 1,000 years ago?!”","In the blink of an eye, the emergence of the demon became a horrifying catastrophe, sweeping all over the world!"]},{"number":360,"title":"Chapter 360 - This is not Yimu True Flame","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ahh!” The blood-red crystal suddenly turned into many distorted tentacles, piercing into the eyes, nose, mouth, and ears of the Feng Family Master.","“Old Demon, what are you doing?!” one cultivator of the Feng Family beside him yelled and condensed his spiritual essence to hack toward the tentacles like a sharp blade.","“You want to kill us after using us?!”","“What are we doing?” On the side, Shui Xianyun showed a wicked smile. “Can’t you pay this little price for what you want?”","“Feng Jue, don’t move!” The old man’s white hair was swiftly turning black while his appearance gradually got younger until he looked to be only about 40 years old. The gloomy ghost-like aura that was well hidden grew tremendously strong!","“Family Master... You...” When Feng Zhengyi turned, that cultivator saw his eyes emitting evil light which didn’t belong to humans!","Feng Zhengyi opened his fingers, and a horrifying suction force came out of his palms. Then, a series of shrills sounded, and that cultivator soon turned into a dry corpse as if his bone marrow had been sucked out before falling from the sky.","“Hahahaha!” Sensing the surging strength in his body, Feng Zhengyi raised his head and laughed, “Nanhua Faction, Haoran Faction, and Yimu Daoist Faction! You’re all garbage! My lord, you don’t have to show your hand and waste energy; I think with my current strength, I can deal with these garbage factions for you!”","“Then, you can show us what realm your strength has reached, Feng Family Master.” Shui Xianyun licked her bright red lips like a seductive beautiful snake.","– In the Yimu Daoist Palace –","Tianxu Daoist stood at the foot of the mountain with some elders and elite disciples and watched the surging red clouds!","Tianxu Daoist looked grim. “The demon mountain of our Yimu Daoist Palace was destroyed; the Nanhua Faction and the Haoran Faction were both conquered as well, and their disciples and elders became this demon’s minions. The situation looks even worse than the catastrophe 1,000 years ago!”","“I’ve sent messages to the other factions and families. Despite the suddenness of this crisis, the core disciples and masters of Nanhua Faction and Haoran Faction have escaped intact. We can still rally and fight with this demon!” the middle-aged Daoist beside him said.","“Junior Brother, you’re right. Now, activate the grand protective array while we wait for the back-up!”","At his order, the central mountain of the Yimu Daoist Palace suddenly emitted a faint layer of golden light mingled with flowing flames. A gust of black mist crashed onto the golden light and turned into black smoke before vanishing with high-pitched hissing noises.","“Old Tianxu!” A voice resonated in the sky, “Do you think I can’t deal with you while you hide inside like a turtle?”","“Feng Zhengyi?!” Astonished, Tianxu Daoist looked at the guy standing in the sky with his black hair fluttering in the wind; the latter had lost his celestial look, and it was replaced with an intense gloomy and evil presence.","“Feng Family Master, even you were lured by them and became that demon’s minion?” Tianxu Daoist looked terrified since Feng Zhengyi had a high cultivation strength, and the Feng Family’s power was very close to that of the major factions.","“Lured?” Feng Zhengyi said with a sneer, “Don’t put me in the same category as those morons.”","With a shrilling roar, seven distorted pitch-black souls flew out of his body.","“Yin Demons?!” Tianxu Daoist’s expression changed drastically. “The rumor 200 years ago is true! Your Feng Family has indeed been refining Yin Demons by using the blood ritual!”","Feng Zhengyi raised his head and laughed wildly. “Only Yin Demons? Look carefully!”","With a roar, Feng Zhengyi’s body distorted and extended until his face no longer looked like a human’s, and two points on his forehead bulged slightly as if something was trying to get out.","With his face wicked like a ghost, Feng Zhengyi pointed his sharp and thin finger forward, and the Yimu Daoist Palace’s grand protective array was instantly pierced with a pitch-black crack!","Feng Zhengyi silently flew in and contemptuously looked at the cultivators gathering in the Daoist palace. “This is power. Do you see that?”","“This... isn’t your power!” Tianxu Daoist said in horror, “What power is this?!”","“It’s my power!” A horrifying demonic face appeared from the dark clouds in the sky. “The power of my kind is beyond your imagination, Ants! You can choose to submit to me just like him or you can choose to die!”","Tianxu Daoist laughed bitterly and said, “Longmu Ancestral Master, the senior of our Yimu Daoist Palace, suppressed demons like you at the price of his life. How can you expect me, Tianxu, to serve the demon?!”","“You are seeking death!” With a chilly light in his eyes, Feng Zhengyi waved his wide sleeve, and many horrifying corpses swarmed toward the remaining cultivators in Yimu Daoist Palace like ocean waves. At his order, the huge corpse army and the seven evil and distorted Yin Demons charged at the cultivators while roaring.","In the blink of an eye, the damaged array was totally destroyed, and the Daoist palace collapsed. Hundreds of cultivators inside the ruined palace looked fearful facing the army of demons.","Shortly, they were knocked down, and some of them even got turned into demons by the invasion of intense demonic energy under this suppressive atmosphere.","“Excellent!” Shui Xianyun clapped her hands and chuckled. “Feng Family Master’s strength is indeed great. Saint Lord will be pleased.”","Feng Zhengyi looked contemptuous. “They are just a group of mortals and can’t understand the holy power from the lord!”","“Now...” He directed the most powerful ones of his seven Yin Demons toward Tianxu Daoist. “Old Tianxu, since you don’t submit to us, you must go to hell!”","With horrifying screams, several distorted ghosts dashed toward Tianxu Daoist while roaring.","Meanwhile, a layer of black-and-white light lit up around Tianxu Daoist, blocking these powerful Yin Demons. However, Tianxu Daoist retreated several steps, and his face turned pale.","While stumbling back, Tianxu Daoist looked at Feng Zhengyi in horror. “Your strength has increased so greatly!”","“You won’t be so lucky next time!” Feng Zhengyi sneered and chanted a spell. Then, all the Yin Demons dashed toward Tianxu Daoist as if they had gone mad.","However, in the next moment, pale-faced Tianxu Daoist wiped off the blood by his mouth and said viciously, “I’ll fight you to the death!”","“Yimu True Flame! Level 11!” Tianxu Daoist yelled in fury.","“Level 11? You’re bluffing!” Feng Zhengyi snickered. “Yimu True Flame has only ten...”","Before he could finish, Tianxu Daoist gritted his teeth and activated his spiritual essence while his hands waved in the air. One, two, three... Suddenly, many orange-red flames appeared. “Yang Flame!”","The Yin Demons that Feng Zhengyi had refined and created with great efforts ran into the orange-red flames and instantly shrilled; they were covered in these flames!","The flames quickly spread out and engulfed Feng Zhengyi like a huge net!","Even the air in the net began to burn; the horrifying high temperature turned everything into ashes!","Even Feng Zhengyi’s horrifying demonic power that he sent out was melted continuously!","Feng Zhengyi’s expression changed while he yelled in horror, “This is not Yimu True Flame!”"]},{"number":361,"title":"Chapter 361 - Broaden your view","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ugh?” The eyes in the sky gazed at the surging flames that were engulfing the space like a huge net, sensing the horrifying high temperature even from far away.","Tianxu Daoist brought his hands together before his chest and instantly formed several true Dao stamps.","The burning flames condensed into a blinding hot sun in the sky!","The dense corpses on the ground began to burn on their own even before the mass of fire touched them.","The bright firelight repelled all the evil and death energy around it.","Inside the orange-red flames, a figure was struggling violently while black mist melted, evaporated, and turned into ashes under this horrifying heat energy.","Shui Xianyun, who had been watching the one-sided battle with interest was now shocked, and her expression changed drastically. “What’s this?!”","An extremely sharp blood light hacked open the burning flames with vicious force, and she found only a block of burned coal inside that no longer resembled a human.","Tianxu Daoist withdrew his spiritual essence with relief and some bafflement. “My Yimu True Flame couldn’t even break that old Wang Lingxiao’s Nanhua Heavenly Light but could easily kill Old Demon Feng, whose cultivation strength has underwent a tremendous growth?”","Lying before them, Feng Zhengyi had turned into a block of black coal, undoubtedly dead.","While her face twitched, murderous spirit appeared in Shui Xianyun’s eyes. “I’m surprised that Tianxu Daoist has such a trump card. Such a powerful technique! You sure are a good schemer!”","“However, this is the end of your triumph!” With a wave of her slim hand, endless blood mist swept over like waves. In the blink of an eye, it rose to the mountain top!","In this horrifying blood-colored mist lurked many figures whose gloomy and evil eyes gazed at the cultivators standing in the center of the Yimu Daoist Palace.","“Daoist, you’re really good,” Shui Xianyun chuckled and said, “However, do you want to burn them into black coal too?!”","A face flashed in the blood-colored mist.","“Junior Brother Daoyuan?!”","Tianxu Daoist was startled.","“Elder Yin of the Haoran Faction?!”","“Elder Xiao of the Nanhua Faction?!”","“How come... they are here?!”","The cultivators of the Yimu Daoist Palace found that the people in the blood mist were all elites and even elders from various factions!","Some of them were even their own peers in the Yimu Daoist Palace!","“Master! Uncle-Master Daoyuan has gone mad! He killed quite a few disciples!”","“These cultivators of the Nanhua Faction and Haoran Faction are also mad!”","“Hahaha!” Shui Xianyun raised her head and laughed. “Isn’t it good to watch them kill each other?!”","Tianxu Daoist was astonished. Not only was he stunned by the current situation, but he also found that the woman before him was quite familiar. “You...”","He pointed at the woman in the sky and shouted, “Are you Elder Shui?! Aren’t you the one who guards the Forbidden Place in the Nanhua Faction?! How come you are working with this demon?!","“What happened to these elders and disciples?!”","Shui Xianyun’s face turned cold. “I’ll tell you when you’re on your way to hell!”","Tianxu Daoist looked horrified. “The secret documents in the faction recorded that in the last demonic catastrophe, many cultivators jumped ship and helped the demon, causing great casualties to the cultivator world. What the documents recorded was true?!”","“It’s just a small spiritual spell of mine,” the huge face in the sky lowered itself and said. “However, considering that you gave me a small surprise just now, I will give you a second chance to choose your side.”","“Consider carefully. Your Longmu Ancestral Master spent all his life in hard cultivation but still ended in destruction. You guys are his disciples and grand disciples, and your lives are in my hands! I can let you live and kill you with a thought!”","Shui Xianyun said with a sneer, “Do you want to sacrifice yourselves in vain to try to do things that even your predecessors couldn’t achieve?”","“We’ll do the things that our ancestors couldn’t!” At this moment, a voice rose from the distant sky. “We’ll do the things that our ancestors couldn’t!”","Meanwhile, walls of blue light rose around the elders and disciples from different factions, and the cultivators who had been wildly attacking Tianxu Daoist and others were trapped in the circles of blue light; they couldn’t get out and spun inside the circle like headless flies!","Demon Trapping Curse!","“Who is it?!” Shui Xianyun’s face fell.","Everyone all looked toward the direction of the voice and saw silver light beams shooting out from the distant horizon like silver carps. Under the dark clouds, the sword lights were as bright as silver shooting stars that were flying across the sky.","The lightning-fast lights turned into a long silver river in the gloomy sky and came before them in the blink of an eye.","Now, they saw these lights were cultivators flying on swords.","“First Elder!” The Xichi Spiritual Master, who was usually a calm person, glared at the woman before her with fury and disbelief. “I can’t believe it’s you! How come even you have succumbed to the temptation of the demon.”","“Don’t get me wrong, my good junior sister!” Shui Xianyun sneered, “I wasn’t lured. Also, I feel extremely good now with my lifespan several times longer than ordinary humans and a great power that you mortals can’t even imagine!”","“I’ve never felt better in my whole life!” She said with a snicker, “However, you guys are going to follow the steps of those morons!”","“Don’t waste your time on them,” the huge face in the sky said in a deep voice. “You bunch of annoying cultivators gathered together again. But this time, I won’t be careless as I was the last time. Little guys, your cultivation strengths are so low; they are less than half of those of your predecessors!”","“That’s true in the perspective of cultivation strength,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said.","“However, if you judge our power only with our cultivation strength, you have a misconception about the structure of our power,” Wang Lingxiao said.","The distorted face in the sky turned even gloomier, and a violent wind howled in the sky like furious roars!","“You don’t have to show your hand,” Shui Xianyun said with a chuckle. “If you guys think that you can defeat me with the fledgling techniques like the one that Tianxu Daoist hadn’t even mastered, I’ll show you how naive you are!”","“Good!” That face said in a deep voice, “You’ve been with me for a long time. Show these ants the power of my kind!”"]},{"number":362,"title":"Chapter 362 - I’ve Read Four Scrolls of Heavenly Book","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Ordinary cultivators were no match for demons since each demon mastered the laws of nature of one place, and that was their innate ability.","The super spiritual spells derived from the laws of nature possessed horrifying power which was not on the same level as the ones cast by ordinary cultivators.","“That wastrel only got one trace of my power,” the huge face in the sky said in contempt. “But the woman standing before you is my masterpiece, so don’t compare her with that trash.”","With a crisp yell, Shui Xianyun emitted a level of demonic presence which was many times more powerful than the one Feng Zhengyi released, and her face turned wicked while ink-black scales grew between her eyebrows and on her arms and neck.","Her limbs turned into sharp claws, and a slim and long tail extended from her back; her white hair turned dark-red in the demonic presence and fluttered in the violent winds. The strong winds in the sky seemed to hear her summon and turned into many wind blades around her. Her whole body looked more like a demon than Feng Zhengyi had been!","The cultivators near her could feel the luring presence emitting from her and the many low demonic murmurs whispering at their ears; if they were not careful, they would lose their minds.","Seeing the cultivators’ horrified faces, Shui Xianyun’s extremely demonic face revealed an evil and exaggerated smile. “How do you feel? I just unleashed only a tiny bit of my power.”","“Master... such a horrifying aura!” Behind her master, Mo Xian’s pretty face paled since her cultivation strength was way lower than Shui Xianyun’s. The disciples like her found it hard to withstand this horrifying suppression.","“Hahahaha!” In the sky, Shui Xianyun laughed hysterically. “Now, I’ll show you what the true power of the heaven and the earth is like!”","Seeing Shui Xianyun’s aura violently expanded, the cultivators looked at each other.","The Xichi Spiritual Master flew over and said, “Senior Sister, I’ve obtained some inspirations about the laws governing the heaven and the earth lately, and I’d like to practice with you for a few rounds. If I lose, I have nothing to say. But if I luck out and defeat you...”","The Xichi Spiritual Master looked at the cultivators of various factions who had been trapped by Demon Trapping Curse but were still moving restlessly. “Senior Sister, can you release these people for the sake of our past friendship as peers and friends?”","“Junior Sister Xichi,” Shui Xianyun said with a sneer. “Ever since you entered the faction, you’ve never been my match. Now that I got endless holy power, how can you make a bet against me?”","Cold glints flashed in her eyes while she glanced at the cultivators around her. “If you are defeated, you must join me with all the cultivators in our faction. If you agree, I will fight with you.”","The expressions of Wang Lingxiao and others turned dark.","“What? You don’t dare to take the bet?” Shui Xianyun said with a sneer, “Then, all of you can come and fight me!”","Wang Lingxiao and the others began to discuss the matter. “Junior Sister, this is a battle on the mastery of laws governing the heaven and the earth. Are you sure that you can defeat her?”","The Xichi Spiritual Master said in a low voice, “If Senior Sister uses unorthodox evil techniques, we might not be able to deal with her. However, as for the understanding of the laws of nature, I’m quite confident since I’ve read four scrolls of Heavenly Book already.”","“Four...” The others looked at each other and asked, “Aren’t there only three scrolls? Where’s the fourth scroll?”","“Jade Dynasty released another scroll recently. Didn’t you watch it?”","“Ugh...” They looked embarrassed since they had forgotten to watch the TV Series while they spent all their time on competing outside Half City.","“Have you made a decision? Don’t stall!” Shui Xianyun looked impatient.","“Okay... Okay!” Wang Lingxiao immediately said, “We accept your condition!”","“Really?!” After all, humans’ understanding of the laws of nature was absolutely no match for the demons who were born with this knowledge. Shui Xianyun had gained a good understanding of the laws of nature. Now with the great demon power inside her, someone still dared to challenge her, which was indeed ridiculous in her eyes. “Then, I’ll see how much improvement Junior Sister Xichi has gained.”","Contemptuous, she waved her hand and formed a spell; many wind blades shot toward the Xichi Spiritual Master with whistling sounds.","“This is our faction’s Flowing Wind Spell,” Wang Lingxiao said in surprise.","“Is it very powerful?” Tianxu Daoist asked curiously, “How come I’ve never heard of it before?”","Wang Lingxiao looked grim. “It is only an ordinary spell in our faction, but with her understanding of the laws of nature, it has horrifying power in her hand!”","“I’ll show you the gap between us with the simplest spell!” Shui Xianyun waved her arm. “Go!”","Without an expression on her face, the Xichi Spiritual Master cast a spell with one hand gesturing before her chest.","Gentle breeze surrounded her. When the many wind blades came, they all sank into this layer of gentle breeze silently, like a mud doll melting in water.","“What’s... this spell?!” Shui Xianyun’s expression changed slightly.","“Breeze Spell,” the Xichi Spiritual Master answered.","Tianxu Daoist was even more puzzled. “Do you have such a powerful spell in the Nanhua Faction?”","“This is the Breeze Spell, an ordinary spell in our faction,” Wang Lingxiao said in a low voice while his face twitched. “I’m surprised that Junior Sister Xichi could cast it with such great power by putting her understanding of the ultimate Dao expressed in the Heavenly Book in the spell!”","Shui Xianyun had thought that her spell would at least force the Xichi Spiritual Master to be on a frantic defense if not defeating her. However, to her surprise, the Xichi Spiritual Master had easily blocked it!","“I didn’t know that you’ve been secretly cultivating this basic spell with great efforts! Good for you!” With a cold face, Shui Xianyun let out a shrill, and endless horrifying dark-red demonic mist gushed out from her body. The ink-black clouds in the sky merged with this horrifying demonic mist and condensed into a huge demon claw!","She looked like a demon, and demonic power was flowing in her body. She could now imitate the powerful techniques of demons. The huge claw crashed down from the sky with vicious force, and the Xichi Spiritual Master felt a horrifying pressure pressing down like a mountain, leaving her no time to dodge!","“I’ll see how you deal with this one!”","“Great heavenly power, turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword!” Suddenly, a streak of horrifying spiritual essence surged from the Xichi Spiritual Master while she pointed her index and middle finger into the sky and took steps according to the pattern of seven stars!","The sky suddenly opened with lightning bolts flashing and dark clouds rolling in a vortex; it looked as if a huge lightning eye appeared in the sky!","An extremely thick lightning bolt followed the sword energy and viciously crashed onto the horrifying demonic claw!","Boom!","With an explosion, the demonic claw broke under the horrifying force and smashed onto a nearby mountain!","It gradually disappeared after knocking down and collapsing the whole mountain.","At this moment, Shui Xianyun’s pale face turned to a scary white!","“Impossible!” Shui Xianyun said, “This isn’t the Nanhua Faction’s spiritual spell!”","“Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell?!” The cultivators from the major factions exclaimed in astonishment.","The Xichi Spiritual Master said to them, “I’ve just learned it, and I’m not too proficient with it yet. Sorry for my inexperience.”","Shui Xianyun was dumbfounded.","“What are you waiting for?! Use your full force!” A roar resonated in the sky as the huge demon yelled impatiently.","Shui Xianyun was furious that after gaining so much strength, she couldn’t even defeat her junior sister who had been no match for her in the past!","She let out a high-pitched roar while small scales spread all over her body. Her previous shape still resembled the human shape, but now she had turned into a monster."]},{"number":363,"title":"Chapter 363 - Where’s Old Demon Youquan? Come Out!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Seeing this sight, all the cultivators looked astonished.","“I can’t believe that the previous Nanhua Heavenly Fairy lowered herself to this state and turned herself into a monster,” some cultivators murmured to themselves.","Liu Ningyun had a complicated expression on her face while she yelled, “Aunt-Master, come back to us!”","“Go back?” Shui Xianyun’s blood-red vertical pupils had a cold, contemptuous glint in them. “What right do you have to make me go back?”","She concentrated her gaze at the Xichi Spiritual Master and said, “I’m surprised that you have gained so much strength. You’re qualified to see my greatest technique!”","Demonic presence expanded violently around her, and a huge and distorted demonic head condensed in the sky. This huge head had 70% resemblance of Shui Xianyu’s current look. Covered in scales, it looked demonic and wicked with a trace of a True Demon’s shape.","Even one glance at the evil face would strike endless terror into people.","The Xichi Spiritual Master looked very grim while she waved her hands and drew mysterious light arcs in the sky; spiritual lights danced on her fingertips while natural spiritual essence gathered around her.","Above her head, clouds surged up like huge waves in a dark and gloomy ocean during a storm.","Then, something horrifying seemed to be brewing in the center of the clouds and was about to gush out.","“Nanhua Heavenly Light?!” Shui Xianyun’s voice was sharp and chilly. “I’ve understood the trace of the Truth of Demon which can suppress all the spells and techniques in the world! How dare you block my attack with Nanhua Heavenly Light?!”","The huge demon face opened its big mouth, letting out invisible, soul-catching sounds which turned everyone dizzy as if their souls were about to leave their bodies.","Even the Xichi Spiritual Master turned pale and stumbled in the sky.","While the demonic sounds entered her head, the Xichi Spiritual Master felt so dizzy that she almost lost control of her spell.","“No!”","“If it continues, Xichi Spiritual Master might be defeated!”","A demonic smile appeared on Shui Xianyun’s face. “You can’t withstand it already? I haven’t unleashed my full power yet!”","The moment that she said it, the huge demonic face opened its mouth and let out an earth-shaking roar!","People all looked terrified. Xichi Spiritual Master had been on the brink of failure. Now that her rival doubled in power, how could she block it?!","However, at this moment, the Xichi Spiritual Master cast a spell with one hand and finished the spell which had almost been interrupted!","A pale golden spiritual pattern flowed past her fingertips.","“Nanhua Heavenly Light! Heaven Gate opens!”","At her loud shout, the surging dark clouds in the sky were suddenly ripped open!","Then, a beam of dazzling golden light shot down.","The Xichi Spiritual Master spat out a mouthful of blood while thick black smoke evaporated around Shui Xianyun who stood under the golden light beam.","The thick, pitch-black scales with metallic luster couldn’t block the light which seemed to be their natural enemy. Meanwhile, the demonic face that she had summoned quickly melted like snow under the sun!","In the golden light beam, a shrill sounded, and the scales on the demonic woman began to disappear, and she started to transform back into her human form.","Signs of a struggle appeared on Shui Xianyun’s face which looked celestial at one moment and then demonic and ghostly at another under the golden light.","Bathed in the golden light, Shui Xianyun cursed viciously and yelled in her high-pitch voice, “Impossible! How did you break my Heavenly Evil Demonic Siren!”","“I happened to witness some spiritual spells even more horrifying than this one,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said, “From that moment on, I’ve been thinking about how to deal with them. My solution can’t defeat Old Demon Youquan, but it’s more than enough to deal with your spiritual spell, Senior Sister.”","“Impossible!” Shui Xianyun howled in horror, “What is this?! Nanhua Heavenly Light doesn’t have this kind of power!”","As the previous Nanhua Heavenly Fairy, she certainly knew the power of Nanhua Heavenly Light.","“Impossible. It can’t release such a great power even if I cast it with my current strength!”","“Senior Sister,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said in earnest, “You put in so much effort and time but only received this little bit of power from this demon? If so, I will recommend a better place to you. Come back to us.”","“Yeah! Aunt-Master, come back to us. You haven’t read the Heavenly Book and thus are no match for our master!” Mo Xian and other female disciples of Nanhua yelled at the same time.","Yue Yan yelled, “Right! This old demon looks so much inferior to Old Demon Youquan. What future can you have by joining its camp!?”","“What are you talking about?!”","“Pu!” After spitting out a mouthful of blood, Shui Xianyun passed out, either due to her severe injuries or fury.","“Cackle...” A creepy laughter came from the sky. “I was wondering how you humans grew so strong and strange. Now, I know that you joined another of my kind?! Where is that old demon?!”","“Your kind?!” Mo Xian was emboldened by the repeated victories. “You mean Old Demon Youquan? It is much more powerful than you even though it can’t get out of the Origins Internet Club in Half City.”","“What? You want to make trouble for him?”","“I was wondering why my scheme was hindered repeatedly. It’s because another of my kind came out after 1,000 years!” It sensed for a little while and said, “Although this one isn’t pure, it indeed contains the presence of my kind.”","“However, it doesn’t show any respect to its senior! It took my subordinates from me and even sent people to rub it on my face!”","In the distant Half City, Ning Bi was playing the King of Fighters with Mr. Fang.","Suddenly, she was distracted, and her character was killed by Mr. Fang with a combo!","“How come you’re getting worse at the game?” Mr. Fang looked impatient.","“No...” Ning Bi said in a low voice, “That demon might come here.”","“Demon?” Mr. Fang said in puzzlement, “Why will it come here?”","“Little Shop Owner, don’t you know that two tigers can’t live on one mountain?” Ning Bi said, “Besides, if it swallows my power, it would become even more powerful, and no one would be able to stop it. If it knows that I’m here, it will certainly come for me!”","She said with a charming smile, “Since I’m honest with you, can you give me a hand?”","“No!”","“Ugh...” Ning Bi froze a moment and then stomped her foot at the quick refusal. “Do you have to refuse that directly?”","The dark clouds got thicker in the sky above Half City, and the entire sky changed color.","Duan Yue ran into the shop while laughing in elation. “Good news! Great news! Hahahaha!” With a translucent disk-looking item in his hand, he walked into the shop with several artifact masters. This item in his hand was as warm and smooth as jade.","“Ugh? Where’s everyone?” He glanced around and found that the customers were all people from Half City; none of them came from forces outside of the city!","Meanwhile, a huge demon face suddenly appeared from the thick dark clouds. It roared, and many houses collapsed alongside their defensive arrays!","“Where is Old Demon Youquan?! Come out this moment!”"]},{"number":364,"title":"Chapter 364 - Take My Heavenly Mirror!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the lounge area at the entrance of the internet café, Mo Tianxing was eating spicy sticks and sitting on the couch while arguing with a couple of cultivators in Half City as to which was better, Jade Dynasty or Shu Mountain. Right now, the argument was so intense that their faces were all red.","At this moment, a voice came from outside, “Where’s Old Demon Youquan?! Come out this instant!”","“Old Demon Youquan?”","“Come out?”","All the people inside looked at each other.","“How can Old Demon Youquan come out?”","“Has this guy gone mad after watching the movie?”","After walking out of the shop, they saw a huge and distorted demon face in the sky with a mountain-like black cloud trailing behind it as if the whole sky was being pulled down.","“This...”","“A demon came out?!”","“It’s the demon!”","“Why isn’t it attacking the Nanhua Faction or the Haoran Faction? Why is it here in our Half City?!”","From the looks of it, it isn’t a new-born demon; it is definitely a rare big demon with tremendous power! Such a demon can’t be blocked by human power, people thought.","Seeing this sight, many of the cultivators in Half City scrambled to flee, afraid that they would be killed in this catastrophe.","Some of the cultivators were knocked down by a tiny gust of wind from it.","Seeing this frantic scene, the demon showed some satisfaction. “Go and get your master! Otherwise, I’ll dismantle its den!”","“What... brings you here, Sir?” At this moment, an extremely powerful presence revealed itself in the inner city when a luxuriously dressed man wearing a purple robe and a purple-golden headpiece flew into the sky and hovered there.","“That is...”","“Reincarnation King!”","The cultivators in Half City were relieved, knowing that this purple-robed old man had reached the late stage of the Divine Ocean Realm long ago, and he was now probably a master of the Divine Palace Realm!","“It’s not you that I’m looking for! Get out of here!” The endless gloomy clouds suddenly transformed into a huge demon claw, and it slapped the purple-robed old man away as if he were a fly! This old man didn’t even have time to react!","The cultivators of Half City who were elated fell into silence.","“Run!”","Screams of alarm and angry cusses erupted in the whole city.","Meanwhile, in front of the Origins Internet Club, a large group of cultivators walked out and looked up at the sight in the sky in horror.","Duan Yue stood in front of the shop, still with the translucent disk in his hands. He said in horror, “How can this demon be so powerful? Even a Divine Palace Realm cultivator couldn’t block one attack from it!”","“No!” Mo Tianxing’s expression changed drastically. “It’s looking this way!”","The huge demon hand in the air reached for them, and the cultivators standing in front of the shop found, to their horror, that they couldn’t move a muscle!","It seemed as if an invisible force had pinned them down. At this moment, even the cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm or higher could do nothing but watch the demon do whatever it wanted.","They lost all ability to resist!","This was the power of the demon who was born with the knowledge of the laws of nature and thus could rule over all humans!","The huge arm swept up and caught several cultivators in its hand.","The huge pair of eyes that were high in the sky and looked like bloody moons gazed at the cultivators in its hand. “You have some traces of the aura of my kind. Tell me where Old Demon Youquan is hiding! Why doesn’t it dare to come out and face its kind?”","The captives had planned to explain and find a way to stay alive. However, they froze when they heard this question. They looked at each other, wondering how they could answer this damn question?!","“Refusing to answer?” the horrifying face in the sky sneered coldly. “Wastrels, go to hell!”","Its huge demon claws began to tighten. Soon, the cultivators’ bodies were squeezed like balloons that were going to burst at any moment.","“Guild President!” Mo Tianxing couldn’t watch it anymore.","However, Fang Qi didn’t move. Instead, he looked at the cultivators who were caught in the huge claws.","“F*ck you!” The grey-clothed cultivator who was caught by the huge claws cussed at the wicked-looking demon head in the sky, “How can you play with us this way?! We don’t have Old Demon Youquan, but I have a Heavenly Mirror! Do you want it?!”","“Take my Heavenly Mirror!” Furious, Duan Yue injected all his spiritual essence into this translucent round mirror, not caring if his cultivation strength was or wasn’t enough for it.","Golden clouds flowed on the surface of the mirror with faint, changing scenes of wind, clouds, water, and fire. A clear light beam shot out from the mirror!","In the blink of an eye, Duan Yue’s body was emptied of spiritual essence. “Hurry up! Give me a hand if you want to get out of his grasp!”","Immediately, the other cultivators beside him transferred their spiritual essence into his body!","First, the clear light shined on the demon hand. Then, the range of the clear light beam expanded, covering the arm and eventually the huge face in the sky as well.","“What’s this thing?!”","The huge distorted face turned and found a clear light beam shining on it.","At first, it only felt a bit uncomfortable at the clear light. It wanted to turn its head away but found that its soul seemed to be trapped in the clear light, and it lost the strength to move its head!","In the sky, the huge demon face shined on by the clear light roared in horror and fury; it had never encountered such a situation in the past thousands of years!","Born with the knowledge of the laws of nature and able to cause catastrophes in the cultivation world whenever it emerged, this big demon was now trapped by an ordinary-looking spiritual artifact and couldn’t get itself out!","It was even more terrified when it felt tearing pains in the parts of its body that were shined on by the light, feeling as if its arms and head were being torn apart by an invisible force, turning into flesh. In fact, it felt as if even its soul was being torn apart!","At this excruciating pain, it began to howl shrilly!","“More people! Come and help us!” The cultivators who had been transferring their spiritual essence into Duan Yue felt a horrifying suction force which had emptied the spiritual essence of about ten Divine Ocean Realm cultivators in the blink of an eye. It was like a bottomless hole!","The Divine Ocean Realm artifact masters who had come with Duan Yue immediately put in their spiritual essence.","The clear light was about to disappear, but now it grew strong again!","“What on earth is this thing?!” Alarmed roars sounded from the clear light. The overbearing big demon was now being disintegrated into masses of blood and flesh under this clear light.","The voice oozed endless panic. Obviously, it was feeling this emotion for the first time since its birth!","Its body struggled desperately, and the horrifying force created tornadoes and shook the ground; it looked as if the sky would crack open at any moment!","The clear light blinked as if it couldn’t suppress this demon anymore.","“All of you, come! Don’t let it get away!” Duan Yue roared in fury.","Obviously, most of the cultivators didn’t want to see this demon run wild, knowing that they must lend a helping hand if they didn’t want to be destroyed.","Besides, all they needed to do was transfer some spiritual essence into this spiritual artifact.","Soon, about 1,000 cultivators joined the group in front of the Origins Internet Club and began transferring spiritual essence into the mirror!","The clear light emitting from the round mirror intensified; this time, the clear light engulfed the whole body of the demon!","Engulfed by the clear light, the demon struggled more violently!","“Impossible! Old Demon Youquan, what power did you give to these cultivators?!” It yelled in alarm, “Don’t you want to stay alive yourself?!”","“Old Demon Youquan isn’t involved in this!” Duan Ye yelled, “Even Old Demon Youquan is no match for the Heavenly Mirror. Old ghost, stop yelling!”","“What?!”","“Impossible! How can the power of you humans threaten my kind? It’s impossible!” it yelled in terror.","“Old Demon, you hid for 1,000 years, and now it’s time for you to experience the world!” Watching the scene, Ning Bi laughed while sipping Coke. “Hahahahaha... Burp!”","“Ugh...” She immediately covered her lips in embarrassment.","Crack!","Meanwhile, a tiny crack appeared on the mirror.","Screaming, the furious demon took this opportunity to smash its head onto the mirror with vicious force!","“Boom!” The whole Heavenly Mirror shattered at this moment.","Many cultivators were knocked away while spitting blood, and this big demon escaped into the sky","“Hahahaha!” In the dark clouds, a figure laughed wildly. “I have escaped! Now, you ants, die!”","“What did you say?!” Many cultivators surrounded it, and they looked like giants since the demon had shrunk to the size of a palm.","“What’s wrong?!”","Then, it seemed to realize something.","“Where’s my demon body?!” Instantly, a scream of terror rose."]},{"number":365,"title":"Chapter 365 - The Teleportation Array Is Made","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“No! Don’t let it get away!”","Yells and cusses rose in the sky while a cloud of red and black mist flew from the crowd at a great speed and shot into the dark clouds. Like a black light beam, it shot into the distance.","“I was careless! I didn’t know that you ants had made such a treasure! But the treasure has been shattered by me! After I recover...”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","While it was thinking, several swift sword lights whistled toward it. Before it could get away, a net of swords was formed in the sky!","Then, a sharp sword covered by lightning energy shot toward the center of the cloud of mist!","The two eyes that looked like red jewels showed astonishment but not fear. Instead, it showed a gloomy smile.","“Don’t kill it!” Ning Bi instantly stopped Mr. Fang.","“Why?” At the critical moment, Mr. Fang’s sword hovered in front of the mass of black and red mist.","“There’s no way that you can kill a demon completely,” Ning Bi explained, “After it’s killed, it will soon resurrect in another place, and it will be hard to catch it again.”","“Little Girl, how dare you plot against me!” A yell of alarm came from the cloud of black and red mist, and its expression turned from smugness to intense horror.","In the sky, many sword lights came down like shooting stars.","Tianxu Daoist asked, “Sir, where’s the demon?!”","Wang Lingxiao warned in a loud voice, “That demon is extremely sly; don’t get tricked by it!”","Mr. Fang pointed at the mass of red and black mist that was surrounded by the sword energies. “Do you mean that thing?”","A chilly voice came from the cloud of mist, “You ants can never kill me. Don’t let me recover my strength! If I do, I’ll kill you all!”","While struggling violently, it was brought by the sword beams to Mr. Fang like a chicken.","“Are you looking for... this thing?” Mr. Fang asked.","Tianxu Daoist: “...”","Wang Lingxiao: “...”","All the other cultivators: “...”","“What happened?!”","They all looked astonished.","They were just one step late, and the almighty big demon had been reduced to this tiny size?!","At this moment, Duan Yue came up with several artifact masters and said with a chuckle, “Faction Masters, we’ve successfully made the Heavenly Mirror, and it showed its great power by shattering this demon’s physical body and separating its soul. This is what became of this demon!”","“Oh?!” Wang Lingxiao and Tianxu Daoist’s eyes brightened with elation, and they laughed in exhilaration, saying, “After we put most of the resources of our factions into the project, you finally made a copy of this treasure!”","The Haoran Faction Master said with a nod, “Junior Brother Duan, where’s the Heavenly Mirror now?”","After all, it was the ultimate treasure that could suppress a horrifying big demon!","All of them looked at Duan Yue eagerly.","“Hahahaha!” At this moment, wild laughter came from the cloud of dark mist. “Your treasure was shattered by me! You couldn’t trap me for long!”","“Shattered...” Wang Lingxiao gaped at Duan Yue. “Shattered?!”","It must be noted that the mirror had taken most of the resources of the whole Morning Star Sea Realm to make.","However, it had been shattered even before these Faction Masters could see it!","“It’s not my fault...” Duan Yue pointed at the demon and said, “It’s this thing that shattered the mirror! You must blame it!”","“Are you angry?” The voice came the cloud of black mist, “Do you dare to kill me?!”","Angry that the demon still dared to taunt him after being reduced into this state, he strode over to kill it.","But quickly, Tianxu Daoist pulled him back and said, “Faction Master Wang, don’t forget this creature’s identity! If you kill it, it will be like helping it escape!”","Wang Lingxiao was immediately deflated. “We can’t kill it. What can we do then?!”","Seeing that no one dared to kill it, the creature had smugness in its evil red eyes.","What can you do with me? it snickered silently. These stupid ants don’t even dare to kill me to vent their anger!","At this moment, Ning Bi said, “I have an idea.”","The others looked at her suspiciously.","She said, “Now that this old demon lost most of its power and thus is no match for you guys, you can give it a good beating to vent your anger even though you can’t kill it.”","“Good idea!”","“We will spare your life, but you can’t escape from our punishments!” Wang Lingxiao clapped his hands and agreed, “Do you think we can’t do anything to you since we don’t dare to kill you?!”","“Take my Punitive Lightning!”","“Take my Yimu Tribulation Fire!”","“...”","Immediately, lightning and fires crashed in front of Mr. Fang’s shop mingling with shrilling screams, “Damn you, old demonic woman! How can you treat your kind this way?! How dare you plot against me?!”","“When I get away, I’ll make you... Wu...”","A sword handle was stuffed into its mouth.","“It’s still yelling! Hit it harder!”","Mo Tianxing gritted his teeth. “The scriptures that I learned from Heaven Sound Temple are most effective in dealing with this kind of evil thing!”","“Ahh! Stop chanting!”","...","After venting their anger for destroying their factions, the Faction Masters and the other cultivators gathered together to discuss how to handle this demon.","“How about giving it to me?” With demonic blood in her body, Ning Bi seemed to know how to handle it.","“No!”","“We can’t hand it to this demonic woman!”","Obviously, no one from outside Half City agreed to her proposal.","“How about... giving it to me?” Mr. Fang said.","They all looked at Mr. Fang. “Sir, do you have a way to handle it?”","Obviously, they trusted Mr. Fang.","Fang Qi said with a nod, “I ensure you that it will never harm you again.”","Tianxu Daoist replied, “Good!”","Wang Lingxiao added, “I trust Mr. Fang!”","All the people here nodded in agreement.","[Beep! You got a Blood Soul Crystal and the Spiritual Marrow.]","With essence from his body, Fang Qi moved the cloud of listless red and black mist to him. He saw that its demonic energy had scattered, revealing a dark-red crystal inside.","The Blood Soul Crystal was the crystal core inside a demon, and it contained not only horrifying energy but a law of nature.","It was the core part of demons.","This demon was born between heaven and earth. If it was destroyed, it will return to nature before condensing and resurrecting after a period of incubation.","That was why mortals couldn’t kill these big demons born from nature.","However, Mr. Fang just tossed it into the shop and asked, “Don’t you have something called Spiritual Marrow on you? Where is it?”","“Do you think I will tell you that?”","“What did you do to me?!”","“What are you going to do?!”","“How come the sky is dark?!”","The System Interface showed the following: “The task is accomplished. The Teleportation array will be created tomorrow.”"]},{"number":366,"title":"Chapter 366 - A Talking Teleportation Array","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! A demon is here!” The moment Zou Mo opened his door in the early morning, he was so startled that he almost dropped to the ground.","A cloud of black mist floated in the corridor, roaring shrilly, “Hahahaha! I can never die; how can you deal with me with your weak trick?!”","Fang Qi opened his door with sleepy eyes. “What’s this noise outside?”","A door-shaped engraving appeared on the wall at the end of the corridor between Fang Qi’s room and Zou Mo’s room.","However, this door didn’t have a handle, which meant that it couldn’t be opened from the outside.","The complicated patterns around the door frame showed that this door was actually an array.","A dark-red cloud floated in the corridor with a faint mist connecting it to the center of the wooden door covered by complicated patterns and an engraving of a pale golden demon face.","“S... Sir, what’s this?!” As a minor cultivator whose cultivation strength was lower than the customers, Zou Mo was still scared when he remembered yesterday’s battle. Seeing Mr. Fang walking out of his room, he immediately hid behind his boss.","“You mean this thing?” Mr. Fang looked at the door and then at the cloud of mist as big as a washing basin. “You’re still alive?”","“Of course!” The crimson eyes in the cloud of mist looked smug. “Besides, I recovered a lot of my strength! You’re a little guy at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm, and I can blow you guys away with one breath!”","With that said, the cloud of mist opened its mouth and sucked in all the nearby spiritual essence.","Its body expanded to twice of its size while a chilly power gathered in its body.","“Gulp.” With a strange sound, a big surge of spiritual essence flowed from its body into the door through the tail-like misty thread connecting its body and the engraved door.","“Hu!”","It blew out a breath, and Mr. Fang felt a breeze on his face; even Zou Mo felt nothing but a breeze.","Instantly, Fang Qi saw the number of usages of the teleportation array turned from [1] to [2] on the System Interface.","“Where’s my demonic energy?!” The cloud of black mist shook its head in the air. “How can it be?!”","“Ahh!” The cloud of mist screamed in frustration. “You puny humans! You are mere humans; how can you deprive me of the demonic energy that I just condensed?!”","Undaunted, it sucked in the surrounding spiritual essence again.","“Gulp.”","Quickly, the new surge of spiritual essence slowly flowed through the misty thread into the door with golden engravings.","Mr. Fang had gotten a general idea of the mechanism and waved his hand at it. “Keep working. Although you don’t get a bonus for your work...” he leaned toward it with a harmless smile, “you will receive fewer beatings.”","“I don’t believe it! It’s impossible!” Then, it tried to condense spiritual essence again. On Mr. Fang’s System Interface, the teleportation array’s number of usages gradually grew.","When Fang Qi opened the shop, he saw a rare beam of sunshine shining through the clouds onto the gloomy city. After yesterday’s upheaval, a big area of the city was destroyed, and the whole city was busy with reconstruction today in an orderly way.","After all, all the buildings in the area except Mr. Fang’s shop were ruined.","Ruan Ning stood outside of her shop and directed the reconstruction with high spirits. “After I understand the Immortal-Slaying Grand Array, I will build one outside my shop!”","The biggest concern for people such as Tianxu Daoist and Wang Lingxiao was the demon. After making some arrangements in their factions, they hurried to the shop.","“Mr. Fang!” Wang Lingxiao cupped his hands. “I’ll take one bottle of Coke!”","“I wonder how you’re going to handle that demon?”","“Little Mo, get the bottles of Coke for the customers,” Fang Qi told Zou Mo to get the Coke for them and then said, “As for that, you guys can go upstairs and see it yourselves.”","“See it ourselves?” People like Wang Lingxiao, Tianxu Daoist, and Duan Yue took their Coke from Zou Mo, paid crystals, and took a big gulp from the bottles. Did Mr. Fang suppress the demon in this place?","They immediately went upstairs to check.","A dark cloud was turning around in the corridor in frustration. “What’s wrong?! I just can’t believe it! Ahh!”","It sucked in a mouthful of spiritual essence, and its whole body expanded like a full balloon.","Then, its body deflated while the spiritual essence leaked out.","“No! Again!” It sucked in another mouthful of spiritual essence.","“Hiss!” It leaked again.","“Again!” It sucked in another mouthful of spiritual essence.","“Hiss!”","It leaked!","“Puchi!” Wang Lingxiao laughed and spat out the Coke, and the dark liquid splashed onto the face of the black cloud.","“...”","– On the other side –","“Junior Sister, I’ve made a huge mistake, right?” Shui Xianyun had woken up, and she sat on the bed with dull eyes while she listened to the talk between her Junior Sister Xichi and the disciples. She had complicated feelings inside her.","“Senior Sister, we are all responsible for this disaster. Besides, in the past hundreds of years, you had been guarding the Forbidden Place of Nanhua Faction; the Forbidden Place of Nanhua Faction is the toughest to guard out of all the forbidden places, and you had a hard job. No one blames you for what happened. After all, despite the upheavals, the big factions mostly lost no more than some properties. Don’t take it to heart.”","“By the way, Faction Master said that the spiritual essence in your body has merged with the demonic energy, and even the combined forces of the Yimu Daoist Palace, the Haoran Faction, and our Nanhua Faction can’t do anything to it.”","“It means that my cultivation strength is destroyed, right?” Her eyes had no light in them as if she were dead inside.","“No.” Xichi Spiritual Master shook her head and said, “We still have one method...”","“You still have a method?” Shui Xianyun shook her head with a bitter smile and said, “Junior Sister, don’t try to comfort me with lies. If the combined forces of the Yimu Daoist Palace, the Haoran Faction, and our Nanhua Faction can’t do anything about it, where else can we find a method?”","“Of course, there’s a method!” the Xichi Spiritual Master said confidently.","“What is it?”","The Xichi Spiritual Master said earnestly, “You just need to eat a lot of instant noodles. One bowl of instant noodles each day, and it is better with a sausage.”","Shui Xianyun was stunned. “Eat what?!”","“Eat instant noodles!” Mo Xian explained for her master, “The instant noodles in Origins Internet Club is made of special secret ingredients and can purify our spiritual essence at great speed. It can also help you remove the impurities in your spiritual essence and increase its circulation. So, as long as you keep eating one bowl of instant noodles each day, the impurities in your spiritual essence will be removed eventually.”","Shui Xianyun was dumbfounded."]},{"number":367,"title":"Chapter 367 - Hidden Crisis","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Jiuhua City Shop –","Different from the all-year-round gloomy sky in Half City, this city was usually blessed with warm sunshine.","Even though it was early winter, the sunshine in the sky still brought people warmth.","Looking through the big glass window, one could see several young warriors practicing fist techniques on the street.","A young man wearing purple clothes swung his right hand toward the ground in a hook shape and yelled, “Die!”","Heated warrior qi turned into a bright red flame and shot to the ground at a great speed.","“Haha... Hahaha... Hahahaha!” The young man stuck his fingers in his hair and gave the trademark laughter. “From now on, call me Iori Yagami!”","“Get out!” Lin Shao rolled his eyes at him, “Iori Yagami’s Shiki Yami Barai shoots purple flames, but yours is red with the warrior qi from your Song Family’s Six-Sun Spell. It’s better for you to learn the fist techniques of Kyo Kusanagi.”","“Kyo’s fist techniques are not difficult for me!” Song Qingfeng laughed and punched out. Immediately, a flame exploded close to his fist, and more flames appeared when he used an upper-cut.","While he used the powerful punches, flames shot out in all directions, and heat waves spread all over the place, turning the cold winter’s day into a hot summer’s day.","“Awesome!”","“You’re just like Kyo Kusanagi!”","“Use Shiki Orochi Nagi!”","“I haven’t mastered it yet!” Song Qingfeng looked embarrassed.","“How difficult can that be?” At this moment, Nalan Mingxue and Lan Yan strolled toward the shop.","With a wave of her right hand, a mass of icy blue mist-like flame condensed by warrior qi appeared in her hand. Then, she shot out the icy blue mist flame!","Waves of pale blue warrior qi that looked like flames and mist shot out, and the extremely low temperature threatened to freeze the air in the area. The masses of ice crystals looked radiant and dazzling under the sun.","“Oh!” The others stared at her in a daze. “How come you learned it so fast?”","“Do you know how to cast the Ultimate Desperation Move, Mu Shiki?!”","“Not yet!” Nalan Mingxue’s lips curved up while she walked into the shop.","It was morning, and Jiang Xiaoyue was counting money at the counter while eating instant noodles. Nalan Hongwu bought a box of spicy sticks and a bowl of instant noodles and walked to sit on a couch with Elder Fu, who was carrying two bottles of Coke in his arms.","Su Tianji and her two disciples, Fenghua and Yuexin, had already begun eating their breakfast while sitting on a couch. Right now, An Huwei had just strode into the shop.","Lounging on a couch, Xu Zixin and Shen Qingqing sipped their Coke.","The upheavals in Half City didn’t disturb the serene and relaxed atmosphere in this place. Except for the expansion of the shop space, everything looked the same as when Fang Qi left.","“Kid Fang has gone to the Morning Star Sea Realm for a long time,” Nalan Hongwu shook his head and said, “Sometimes, I find that things are not the same without him, and I’m not used to it.”","“But we can still watch movies and TV Series with him,” Lan Mo said while eating instant noodles.","“That’s virtual reality and not real,” Su Tianji said.","“Well! I wonder when the Shop Owner will come back.” Song Qingfeng finally finished showing off his fist techniques and plunked down on a couch with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands. “I now have mastered the sword control technique. If I fly again, I will look dashing and proficient!”","He still remembered the incident in which he almost crashed into the ground face-first.","“Xiaoyue,” Lan Yan bought two bowls of instant noodles and said, “Mr. Fang as been out for a long time. Do you miss him?”","“Why should I miss the despicable Boss?” Pouting, Jiang Xiaoyue looked unhappy. “With the powerful cultivators and many beautiful girls in Half City, I think he’s enjoying himself and doesn’t want to come back. Humph!”","“Achoo!” At this moment, someone sneezed on the stairs. “It’s only the early morning, and I already hear someone saying bad things about me?”","“This voice... is quite familiar.”","Subconsciously, everyone turned their gazes toward that direction.","“Boss-?!” Jiang Xiaoyue covered her little mouth in disbelief. “How come you came down from upstairs?!”","“It is all because of my power!” A mass of reddish-black mist floated down after Fang Qi. “My power is almighty and teleported this kid from a place far, far away!”","The others looked even more baffled. “Sir, what’s that?!”","“I am a lofty Saint Demon born from nature!” An overbearing voice sounded from the mass of reddish-black mist. “You mortals should address me as the Saint Demon!”","“So powerful?”","“Saint Demon? How come it can be both a saint and a demon? What is it?”","The people began to talk among themselves since no one in the Jiuhua City Shop had ever seen such a thing!","“Get out!” Mr. Fang slapped it back upstairs. “It is the newly-made teleportation array. Due to some mistake in the creation process...”","He pointed to his head, saying, “It’s not right in here.”","All the people were at a loss for words.","“You are not right in your head!” The mass of black mist flew down again and yelled, “Listen up! I’m the legendary Saint Demon who has mastered the laws of nature. If any of you call me Saint Lord respectfully and obeys my orders, I will teach you how to understand the laws...”","Before it could finish, it was stepped to the ground by a foot.","“Ahh! Ahh! You dare to treat me like this? After I escape, I’ll skin you alive... Ahh!”","Bank! After some shrilling screams, it was kicked back upstairs.","The door to the staircase was shut.","After clapping his hands, Mr. Fang pinched Jiang Xiaoyue’s cheek casually and said, “Girl, you’ve got chubby with food.”","“...”","...","Meanwhile, in the distant Mystic Land of the Taixi Faction.","“B*stards of the Taixi Faction! You will die pathetically! Ahh!” A shrilling scream came from the depths of the Mystic Land.","Lightning bolts were flashing in the Mystic Land. Duyou Holiness, who was wearing a white robe with golden patterns, had a chilly expression on his face. “It’s been so long, and some of them are still resisting?”","A middle-aged cultivator walked up. “Holiness, the elders from different factions are here.”","The elders from major forces such as Remote Jade Hill Mountain, Dragon Sea Daoist Palace, and Linglang Mountain were invited to this place. A short and chubby cultivator wearing luxurious clothes was the first one to ask, “Holiness, how is the healing process of our disciples?”","Duyou Holiness didn’t answer; instead, he looked toward the middle-aged cultivator beside him.","“B*stards of Taixi Faction, are you afraid?” At this moment, a yell came from inside.","The middle-aged cultivator’s face fell as he said, “Most disciples are doing well, but sadly, a few of them have poison deep in their systems, and it doesn’t look good.”","“What?!” That middle-aged cultivator in the luxurious robe was shocked, and his expression changed drastically. “Is Internet Addiction so powerful?!”","The cultivator of the Taixi Faction said, “We are surprised as well. Fortunately, we discovered the problem in time. Otherwise, the Internet Addiction poison would have spread all over the cultivator world. If tens of thousands of cultivators contract this poison, even immortals can’t save us!”","“Then... what should we do now?!” In the past 1,000 years, the Three Saint Gates were the authority in the whole cultivation world. Although they rarely moved around in the world, their words had great weight among the cultivation factions.","The cultivator of the Taixi Faction said, “The only way to stop this catastrophe is to destroy that shop and cut off the source of this poison!”"]},{"number":368,"title":"Chapter 368 - Wage War Together","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the Half City Shop.","Although Mr. Fang didn’t do any advertisements for his shop, the battle against the big demon had far better promotional effects than any advertisement campaigns.","More importantly, each customer could enter the shop and see the big demon free of charge.","After this battle, the high-level people in the inner city of Half City who were trying to do things stopped their schemes against Fang Qi’s shop.","Obviously, with the example set by the big demon, they began to weigh their options again. Although they wanted to take the good stuff from the shop, they needed to be alive to enjoy it. After all, even the big demon was suppressed by the shop.","After this battle, Half City still looked chaotic, but it was more peaceful and stable than before.","Meanwhile, the old games in Jiuhua City, such as Resident Evil, Diablo 2, and the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, were released in the Half City Shop one by one. These games covered many genres including modern fiction, occidental fantasy, and oriental Xianxia, and they attracted large groups of players.","In the category of Xianxia, the shop now had the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, Jade Dynasty, and even Shu Mountain. The cultivators were excited that they could experience all kinds of cultivation factions and see many powerful spiritual spells and spiritual treasures.","The elements such as cultivators, warriors, spiritual spells, and spiritual treasures were too common for them. In contrast, the science-based civilization in Resident Evil and Grand Theft Auto 5 and the magical civilization in Diablo 2 and Harry Potter brought them more amazement and sense of novelty.","That was why the new games and movies attracted many players whenever they were released. For the players, the increase of cultivation strength was now second to the exciting experiences that they could have in various amazing and novel civilizations.","For this reason, even Grand Theft Auto 5, a leisure game for the cultivators, remained highly popular.","For example, after Jun Yangzi became fatigued from his research on the spiritual spells and spiritual artifacts in Shu Mountain, he would go and drive his beloved race car in Grand Theft Auto 5 while playing classic music that he bought in Qzone. It was enjoyable to drive along the streets and try the local delicacies in this amazing and dazzling city.","Of course, it would be better if he partnered with several Daoist friends and robbed some banks, making small money while increasing their cultivation strengths and levels.","Besides, after they earned money, they could acquire the blueprints for these ‘mechanical spiritual artifacts’ and lots of fundamental knowledge about ‘scientific artifact-making’.","For the forces such as the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, the research area wasn’t limited to the high-end spiritual artifacts such as the Heavenly Mirror.","While the cost for going online in Mr. Fang’s shop wasn’t a big issue for them, the materials and research cost for the high-end spiritual artifact projects such as the Heavenly Mirror would easily drain the resources of Wuwei Daoist Alliance and bankrupt them.","Even the Morning Star Sea Realm found it was hard to afford to make a second imitation of the Heavenly Mirror after their first try.","Therefore, the artifact masters turned the focus of the research projects to the low-end but widely used objects such as magic instillation, new communication jades, and new cars.","For some forces, they found many new objects that they might use later, so it was not wrong to take the opportunity to get to know them better.","After all, while the advanced cultivators were studying the high-end objects, such as the Heavenly Mirror and the Purple-Green Dual Swords, the ordinary cultivators who couldn’t handle these projects couldn’t stay idle.","Li Haoran couldn’t put too much time on the research of the super spiritual treasures such as the Heavenly Mirror; he would only learn from his master from time to time. He focused most of his energy on the items in Grand Theft Auto 5.","At this moment, he was sitting at the long table in the research room with some artifact masters who were in his generation. The communication jade in his hand was obviously smaller and more exquisite than the one he was using. After he injected some spiritual essence in the jade, a vague shadow appeared on it, showing the scene of a battle between cultivators.","Li Haoran said, “I’m sure that you’ve seen this spiritual spell before; we are no strangers to spells such as Impartial shadows, Illusion Shadows, and voice transmission from 500 kilometers away.”","In fact, some powerful cultivators could recreate the scenes that happened within one hour or even one day in an area by producing images with spiritual essence, so this was not unfamiliar to them.","“However, this kind of spell can’t be used in the communication jade for ordinary cultivators. Do you guys have any suggestions?”","“Ugh...” The artifact masters looked at each other and said, “Maybe we can use the method of saving images with scrolls; the cost of producing the 3D pictures would too much.”","“Besides, instead of controlling the new communication jade with a finger which is similar to the smartphones, we can use mental energy or spiritual essence to control it,” another artifact master said, “After all, the users of this type of communication jades will be mostly ordinary cultivators. For one thing, the jade can help increase the control of spiritual essence for ordinary cultivators. For another, it will save us a lot of time and energy.”","“Indeed. The finger control is too hard to achieve,” several other middle-aged artifact masters nodded and said, “We’d better control it with spiritual essence and warrior qi.”","“Right. I think we can also attach a storage jade slip to store important information.”","“We can also make some small programs like those used in the cell phones.”","“...”","After the brainstorm-session of the cultivators, the research project progressed very swiftly.","“Thank you for your suggestions. If we can produce the communication jade according to our designs and ideas, we will probably take the leader position in the market of communication jades in the entire cultivation world!”","“Besides,” Li Haoran said, “You must have experienced Lester’s amazing method to disrupting his target’s monitoring, security systems, and even communication.”","The artifact masters all nodded.","Li Haoran said, “I call it communication warfare. We have studied spiritual spells all-year-round, but maybe we’ve neglected the effects of the communication in wars? Imagine what would happen if our enemies’ communications are completely cut off in a war, but ours is intact.”","...","Meanwhile, in the Taixi Faction.","The disciples who were healed looked listless and dull; their eyes didn’t emit any spiritual light,","“This healing is effective, but there are some side effects left in them,” Feng Xi explained. “In fact, the addiction is too harmful, so we had to do this. I hope you don’t blame us for this.”","“Of course, we don’t blame you!” The elders of the major factions said in hatred, “It’s unforgivable that Dajin shelters this evil practice! If not for them, our disciples wouldn’t have ended this way. Don’t worry. After we go back, we’ll gather forces from all major factions and wage war against Dajin together!”","“Wage war together!” Seeing the changes in their disciples, many cultivators joined in the declaration with hatred. “We have to destroy these evil people to vent our anger!”","“After we return, we’ll report it to the Faction Masters and plan the war!”"]},{"number":369,"title":"Chapter 369 - The Most Righteous Spiritual Spell in the World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Origins Internet Club in Jiuhua City –","Despite the storm outside, this shop was always lively with a big crowd.","“Well! When I first came to this shop, it only had a few seats.” Nalan Hongwu lounged on a couch and said, “But now, it’s so huge.”","“Hehe, Senior, you were not here on the first day of business,” Song Qingfeng said with a smile. “When I came, it was so small that there were only four computers. Four!”","“At that time, only me, this fat guy, and Old Liang were here.” He pointed at Wang Tai and Liang Shi who were busy eating instant noodles and said, “There was only Resident Evil and nothing else. It was completely different from now.”","“Right!” Lin Shao said in a loud voice, “You probably didn’t experience that. We didn’t have online games or online games guilds; we all played solo!”","“Hahaha! The Shop Owner was a great player back then, and we watched him play every day.”","“Am I not a great player now?” Mr. Fang walked over with a bowl of instant noodles.","“Now that you mentioned guild...” Lan Yan frowned while sitting beside them. “Did you notice that people like Little White and Qi Xian haven’t been online for a long time?”","“Who are they?” Mr. Fang was nonplussed. “Are they customers of the shop?”","“Yeah,” Lan Yan said with a frown. “After you went to the Morning Star Sea Realm, the Legend of Mir 2 was released. We established our guild and recruited many new players. Some of them were close to us, but they have been absent for a long time now.”","She still remembered a girl named Little White who was about 16 years old; they were on good terms with each other, and it wasn’t like her to disappear without a word.","“Maybe she went to play other games,” Mr. Fang said.","“Impossible,” Lan Yan said, “It’s weird that she hasn’t been on QQ since then.”","“Now that you mention it...” Mr. Fang said in confusion, “Several new players in our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild ensured us that they would be online every day, but now they just disappeared.”","“As the Guild President, why don’t you ask about their whereabouts?” Lan Yan said, “After all, you are the Guild President.”","“Where can I take the inquiry?” Mr. Fang said in contempt. “Do you want me to visit their homes one by one? Even if I want to do it, I don’t know their true identities since I only know them online.”","“So annoying,” Lan Yan complained, “I told her that I would take her to play the next day, and then she just disappeared.”","“Who are you talking about?” A teenage girl wearing pale blue clothes walked into the shop in high spirits. She was Ye Xiaoye, and she came in with a couple of cultivators of the Cloud Ocean Faction. “Who disappeared?”","“The new players in our guild. They were nice, and we had a good time chatting on the guild channel,” Lan Yan answered. “Then, they just disappeared.”","“Disappeared?” Ye Xiaoye immediately asked, “You mean... they were just not online on the next day and couldn’t be contacted through QQ or communication jade? It is like they had just vanished?”","“How do you know?!” Not only Lan Yan, but people like Nalan Mingxue and Song Qingfeng turned their attention to her.","Ye Xiaoye said, “I don’t know much. Do you remember my Senior Sister Zhou Hongying? It was she who brought me to the shop in the first place.”","“Don’t tell me she disappeared as well!”","“She didn’t,” Ye Xiaoye said, “A while ago, a few cultivators came with Senior Sister Zhou and Brother Bai, those few sorcerers who got into top 16 for Diablo Competition, do you remember? Senior Sister Zhou told me that they were summoned back to their factions, and they couldn’t be contacted anymore.”","“What?!” Not only Lan Yan, but Mr. Fang had sensed the seriousness of this issue as well.","“They haven’t been found since then?” People like Dong Qingli came over to join the conversation, and the grandmasters including Nalan Hongwu slightly frowned.","“I sense foul play in this...” Lan Mo, Nalan Hongwu, and the other grandmasters looked at each other.","“When did that happen?” Nalan Hongwu asked.","“About half a month ago,” Lan Yan said.","“Only half a month?” Mr. Fang said. “The time doesn’t seem to fit. Those few in my guild disappeared about one month ago. I thought they didn’t play because they were short of funds.”","“...”","The atmosphere in the Taixi Faction was different from that in the Origins Internet Club.","For most of the players in the Origins Internet Club, today was probably another enjoyable day spent on playing games.","However, for the small number of players in the Mystic Land in the Taixi Faction, they had to stay here and spend another day in darkness.","This had been a cultivation field for cultivators of the Taixi Faction, but now it had been modified. Restriction arrays were set up around this place. Locked inside, they couldn’t escape even if they could dig out a tunnel, let alone flee by flying.","Disciples from various factions were forced into wearing greyish-white ‘prison uniforms’, and their spiritual essence was depleted with tough and high-intensity training.","A genial-looking, middle-aged man who was wearing white clothes was responsible for disciplining them. Although Duyou Holiness was behind this, he entrusted the execution of his plan to this cultivator named Tian Leizi who cultivated lightning spells.","“Lightning spells are the most righteous spells in the world!” the aquiline-nosed Tian Leizi said with a gloomy expression as he stared at the cultivators from different factions, “Holiness asked me to watch you, and I can use the lightning spell to remove the evil poison from your bodies!”","He stared at a disciple tied to a post with a gloomy expression and said, “The Taixi Faction has you under monitor for 24 hours a day in case you lose control due to the evil poison in your body. If you can’t control the evil poison in you,” he pointed at the disciple tied on the post and said, “Then, I will have to help you.”","He cast a spell with both hands, and many pale blue lightning bolts viciously struck the brass pole behind this disciple. Then, everyone heard an extremely shrilling scream!","These disciples from different major factions had excellent talents and abundant spiritual essence, but right now, they were full and didn’t even dare to glance over when they heard this scream. They continued their drills which were designed to drain their spiritual essence, and they looked scared and behaved like zombies.","A row of birds flew across the bright blue sky, and many disciples looked up at the flying birds in envy.","“Maybe you’ve heard that the disciples who had removed the evil poison have returned to their factions with their elders,” Tian Leizi said, “If you cooperate with my healing process, maybe you can return to your factions one day as well!”","The disciples’ eyes lit up in excitement but then quickly dimmed. Perhaps they were hoping for something else.","“Someone, please come and save us!”","“Sister Lan Yan... I miss you guys...” With tears in her eyes, a girl who looked to be 16 years old looked at the high walls covered with restriction arrays and thought in desperation, “I hope someone will come and rescue us...”"]},{"number":370,"title":"Chapter 370 - The Power that Shocks the World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After the elders returned to their respective major factions with their disciples, the master and decision makers of different factions and forces soon gathered together.","The Jade Hill Mountain Master was an elegant middle-aged man wearing a jade-green silk robe and holding a jade flute. “Since everyone is here, I guess all of you know the purpose of our meeting.”","The Dragon Sea Daoist Palace Master was an old Daoist wearing a white robe with embroidered black-and-white divinatory symbols, and he said in a cold voice, “Of course. My Dragon Sea Daoist Palace emphasizes cleansing one’s heart and limiting desires, which represents the perfect mindset to cultivate the techniques of Daoism. My biggest fear is that our disciples will get entangled in worldly affairs. To our astonishment, these disciples have such deep obsessions already!”","“Ay...” A chubby cultivator heaved a heavy sigh. He was the Zhu Family Master; the Zhu Family was one of the three big families of Linglang Mountain. “If not for the early discovery of this issue, the core disciples of my Zhu Family would have become spies inside the family. The level of illusions from this shop is close to that of demons and devils! We must get rid of this evil, lurking force!”","“Guys, I heard that... even cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm are involved in this issue. I wonder if it’s true.”","“What if they are?” The old Daoist of the Dragon Sea Daoist Palace said with a reddened face, “I don’t believe that they will interfere with the internal affairs of my Dragon Sea Daoist Palace! If so, we’ll ask the Three Saint Gates to do justice for us!”","The Zhu Family Master said with a snicker, “With the combined forces of our major factions which represent more than half of the cultivation world, we’re not afraid of the Yundian Upper Realm!”","“Well said! Zhu Family Master!” A cultivator wearing red clothes said, “If they dare to interfere, we will show them our power by razing the Yundian Upper Realm to the ground!","“You’re right!” A middle-aged man wearing white clothes stood up while he rolled his eyes and thought, “It’s about time to carry out Holiness’s plan.”","Immediately, he yelled, “My disciple used to go out of faction every day and totally deserted cultivation, Even though the poison in his body has been removed, he’s no longer his former self, and I’m afraid that it will affect his future. All these damages were afflicted by that evil force, and I won’t stop until I destroy it!”","Hearing his words, the others got even more indignant. “Well said! We won’t stop until we destroy this evil force!”","After all, if they didn’t blame it on the so-called evil force, were they going to blame themselves?","...","Before now, there were ways to interrupt information transmission and even intercept the messages between other factions and cultivators.","In fact, all of that could be one using arrays.","However, the creation of arrays took a lot of time, and they had quite a few drawbacks such as they weren’t mobile and were hard to hide.","This method was rarely useful on enemies in a war unless one could fool the enemies and disguise it.","Besides, while cultivators could use arrays to block the transmission of enemies’ communication jade, they would also block the information sent to their own communication jades from their people. Even if their arrays had the ability to distinguish friends from the foes, it was hard to tell the difference between enemies’ messages and their own.","The best solution was to create a totally different communication method for themselves. This way, they could destroy the enemies’ transmission environment and cut off communications without affecting their own.","“As you all know, we must rely on the spiritual essence that exists everywhere in the world to transmit our messages through communication jades, and the top-quality communication jade can even send strong spiritual signals for a long distance in places without any spiritual essence.”","With a communication jade in his hand, Li Haoran explained, “Now that we’ve found a very special communication method, we must conduct some in-depth research on it. For example, this communication method uses a special ‘wave’, and the ‘radio wave’ that they used on battlefields are different from what they use in daily life.”","“Right now, you might not understand what this means to us,” Li Haoran said, “Or, you think it is just a substitute of our traditional communication method. However, I have to say that this is an incorrect understanding.”","Li Haoran said solemnly, “With this new communication method, we can disrupt the communication of a whole region and even intercept almost all the messages sent by spiritual essence. In the meantime, we don’t have to worry about negative effects on our own communications!’","Some of the people had been nonplussed as for why Li Haoran summoned so many of them here, but now...","“Junior Brother Li, your words hit us like a silver dagger!”","“Excellent! This idea is indeed excellent!”","“If we do that, the enemies won’t be able to send messages to each other on the battlefield, and it will be difficult for them to issue orders between different spiritual boats!”","...","Meanwhile, in the High-Level Artifact Masters Communication Group.","Jun Yangzi: [Have you created the Heavenly Mirror?]","Duan Yue: [Of course! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\"> It’s so powerful that even a big demon can’t block it! Do you know what big demons are?]","Jun Yangzi: [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f628.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F628;\">Daoist friend, you can’t boast like this. Who has seen a legendary demon before? How do you know that the mirror can defeat demons if you have never seen demons before?]","Duan Yue: [Didn’t the shop owner tell you that the big demon in the shop was suppressed by us?]","Jun Yangzi: [Isn’t it the spirit in Mr. Fang’s spiritual artifact? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f628.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F628;\"> What’s the deal with the big demon?! We’re also making the Heavenly Mirror right now; can you... give us some advice?]","Soon, they began to dig deeper into the topic. Obviously, the Morning Star Sea Realm had more basic techniques and resources compared to the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, which was why the Heavenly Mirror was first created in the Morning Star Sea Realm.","Since these two regions were extremely far apart, they didn’t have conflicts of interest, so the two parties didn’t find it necessary to hide the fruits of their research from each other.","The exchange of information obviously benefited both parties.","Jun Yangzi: [Thank you very much! With your advice, we can avoid many mistakes during the creation process. It seems that we will make the Heavenly Mirror very soon!]","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang, who had been playing the King of Fighters, received a new task.","[New task: The Power that Shocks the World","Task Mission: 1. Rescue the players who are being tortured due to them playing games in our shop; 2. Establish dominance","Task Description: Don’t scheme to destroy our shop’s business by suppressing the customers; it’s time to establish dominance and shock the enemies","Task Reward: Prize Wheel (Can randomly win things such as movies, games, or items that can strengthen one’s body)]"]},{"number":371,"title":"Chapter 371 - Hurry and Stop Mr. Fang!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“System, are you sure that you’re not playing tricks on me?” Mr. Fang looked at the route showed on the System Interface and found the destination extending all the way to the northwest from the southeast. “It’s so far from here?!”","“Also, why are the players of our shop being tortured?!” Mr. Fang yelled, “I’ve never heard of anyone being tortured because of playing games! Do they take playing games as a crime?! Do you think you can fool me with this nonsense?”","The System didn’t respond as if it were saying, “Suit yourself.”","“Can I really win a prize for body strengthening?” Mr. Fang asked, “Do you have a simple item that can strengthen my power without hurting me?”","After all, when he used the T-Virus, which was claimed to have no side effects, he had suffered from excruciating pain; he didn’t want to experience that again.","Meanwhile, the price for increasing his strength in the Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room or the Game Cultivation Room was being beaten senseless, which was why Mr. Fang was reluctant to cultivate using this method.","System: [With Host’s luck, it’s highly likely that you will win a game or a movie. (So, don’t think of the impossible things)]","“Damn it! Will you die if you just remain silent?” Mr. Fang’s face twitched. After all, he had a chance to win a prize after the sales target of Grand Theft Auto 5 was reached. He just didn’t believe that he couldn’t win something good!","At this moment, Su Tianji, Ye Xiaoye, and a few other people who hadn’t gone online yet were talking casually about why some players in the guild had been absent. Then, Mr. Fang took a piece of paper and a pencil to them and drew something on the paper. “You guys, have a look of it. If Dajin is in this position...”","He pointed at the bottom right corner of the map and then at the upper left position above the center. “Where’s this place roughly?”","After all, Mr. Fang had a terrible sense of direction and wouldn’t recognize the place even if he had a map.","“What place what position?” Su Tianji was the first to look over, and she stared at the map where Mr. Fang only drew out Dajin which only occupied a small region. “Dajin is so small here? Then, at that position...”","“Phoenix Mountain?” She shook her head. “No. Phoenix Mountain is more to the right. It might be the Taixi Saint Faction. Why do you ask?”","“Taixi Saint Faction?” Mr. Fang pondered. “What faction is it? A saint faction? Is it very powerful?”","“Of course,” Su Tianji said. “It’s one of the most ancient factions on this continent. The Yundian Upper Realm which attacked Dajin last time was quite powerful, right? But it’s just a minion of the Three Saint Factions.”","“Is the Yundian Upper Realm very powerful?” Mr. Fang said, “Didn’t you capture the leaders of their army, and they were only released after compensating a mountain of crystals?”","Su Tianji’s face turned dark. “Are you thinking of messing with them? I’ll warn you: you won’t have a chance unless the Senior behind you shows his hand. I advise you to give up the plan if you want to go there yourself; you will save a lot of headaches.”","“Hehe. Why would I want to mess with them?” Mr. Fang said with a smirk, “I don’t know them. Do you think I’m someone who wants to travel tens of thousands of kilometers to make trouble for them?”","“You’d better not.” Su Tianji gave him a hard stare and said, “I warned you for your own good. After all, your current cultivation strength is not enough to make a dent on them.”","Mr. Fang nodded, saying, “Of course! Of course!”","With the map in his hand, Mr. Fang scratched his head. “Are you trying to trick me? It’s one of the most ancient factions, and it is probably full of grandmasters without thinking. I’m only at the Grand Ancestor Warrior Realm, and you want me to mess with them? What if I can’t make it back?","“Perhaps you want to get me killed, so you can find a new host? It’s really not decent of you.”","“...”","After a long while, the System Interface showed, [Please explore it yourself, Host.]","“Explore... Damn it.” Mr. Fang looked sullen. “You just want me to get beaten in the cultivation room, right?”","“Okay. Okay.” He checked his time limit for the cultivation rooms and found he had one day in the Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room and two days in the Game Cultivation Room.","“Well...”","Soon, Fang Qi returned to his room and began the next stage of cultivation.","“Should I level up Sword God?” Mr. Fang looked at Li Xiaoyao before him with a frown. “No... My cultivation isn’t high enough for it, and I’ll benefit little from it.”","“I must find someone with moderate cultivation strength...”","Soon, a young man wearing a brown uniform with flames in his hands appeared before him. He was Kyo Kusanagi from King of Fighters’ 97.","He launched one punch with horrifying red flames around it; the strength he released here was much higher compared to in the game.","Mr. Fang launched the same fist technique with the violent qi in his body, crashing it forward viciously!","...","One day in the real world was one year in the virtual world. After Mr. Fang spent two years in the Game Cultivation Room, the spiritual light in his eyes looked sharper and purer as if flames were jumping in them. Like a volcano which would erupt at any moment, he emitted an explosive power even when he remained still.","Immediately, Fei went to the next destination. A crude straw house in a bamboo forest appeared before him with the melancholic music of an Erhu.","[TL Note: The erhu, or urheen, is a two-stringed bowed musical instrument, more specifically a spike fiddle, which may also be called a Southern Fiddle, and sometimes known in the Western world as the Chinese violin or a Chinese two-stringed fiddle.]","A middle-aged man who was wearing a greyish-blue robe stood up with a mild expression; he was holding an Erhu in his hands.","He was No Name, a hermit who had no interest in worldly affairs from the world of Wind and Cloud.","00% strength!","The current No Name wasn’t the No Name who battled with Jue Wusheng with only 10% of his strength left in his body; he was at the very peak of Sword Dao – Heavenly Sword.","He looked mild and serene, strolling like an ordinary person who was taking a walk in the courtyard; he didn’t look like he was about to be in a battle at all.","However, at this moment, Fang Qi sensed a sword spirit which soared up high into the clouds, looking down at the creatures on the land. At this moment, all the swords in the world submitted to it!","The sword in Fang Qi’s hand shook continuously as if it was going to kneel like a civilian before the emperor!","...","Half a day passed in the real world.","A young man was walking up along the mountain path from the foot of Emei Mountain.","Suddenly, many flying sabers crashed down from the sky like a crazy storm!","“Dan Chenzi?!”","The moment that Mr. Fang used Innumerable Sword Scroll, a horrifying flood of many flight sabers instantly destroyed his flight sword.","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark. “F*ck!”","He was instantly killed!","– Kunlun Mountain –","“Xuan Tianzong!”","A blue crystal flame suddenly shot toward him!","Mr. Fang died.","“Damn it!”","He was instantly killed again.","– Golden Peak of Emei Mountain –","“Old White Brow!”","“Heavenly Mirror!”","Mr. Fang: “...”","After getting beaten in the cultivation rooms for years, only a few days had passed in the real world.","When Mr. Fang walked down from upstairs, he had jelly legs and dark circles under his eyes.","“Sir! Tell us about what you did last night!” The people who sat on the couch and ate instant noodles looked at him in doubt and suspicion.","“I was cultivating!” Mr. Fang said, “Tomorrow, I plan to raze the so-called Taixi Saint Faction to the ground. Is there anyone who wants to go with me?”","“Pu!” Su Tianji instantly spat out a mouthful of Coke.","After spitting out the Coke that she had just drank, she stared at Fang Qi dumbfoundedly. “Do you remember what you promised me?!”","All of them looked at each other and shouted, “Hurry! Stop him!”","A few days ago, he had been at the early stage of Grand Ancestor Warrior Realm. Now, he had just reached the late stage of this realm. However, he insisted on messing with the Taixi Faction.","Had he gone mad?"]},{"number":372,"title":"Chapter 372 - Target – Taixi Faction","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Don’t stop me. Is the Taixi Faction so f*cking powerful?! I can deal with ten of them!” Mr. Fang, who had been beaten senseless in the cultivation rooms for a long time, yelled wildly.","“You can deal with ten of their disciples? But they have 100 or even 1,000 elite disciples!” They pointed out the flaw in Mr. Fang reasoning without mercy.","“How do you know that I can’t deal with 100 or 1,000 of them?!”","“Xiaoyue, come and stop your boss!”","A group of people surrounded Mr. Fang, cutting off all the paths.","“Can you tell us why you must go and raze the Taixi Faction to the ground?” Nalan Hongwu asked solemnly, “Kid Fang, waging war isn’t a game. If you are not careful, people will die. Explain yourself first. I, an old man who has lived long enough, don’t mind going with you on a wild mission, but you can’t lead others into danger, right?”","The others looked at Fang Qi in bafflement as well. After all, the lofty Taixi Faction and Mr. Fang moved in different circles, and they wondered how the former had messed with him.","“Right,” Su Tianji chimed in, “Tell us the trouble that you are facing, so we can help you. Otherwise, we will worry about you after you go and mess with the Taixi Faction.”","Although cultivation strength didn’t represent 100 percent of one’s true power, one’s true power was limited if one’s cultivation strength wasn’t high. Even true immortals couldn’t maintain their power and status if they lost their cultivation strength. Right now, Mr. Fang’s realm wasn’t even that high.","Besides, he was going to the headquarters of the Taixi Faction where traps and arrays were everywhere, and it wouldn’t be a safe trip even for people with many trump cards.","“Razing people’s headquarters to the ground is what I do best. If you submit to me and call me Saint Lord respectfully...” A dark cloud floated over.","Boom!","“Ahh! Kid, you’ll die pathetically for beating me, the Saint Lord!”","With a shrilling scream, it was kicked back upstairs.","After this small interlude, Mr. Fang was about to explain it when Su Tianji’s communication jade blinked.","Meanwhile, others including Ji Wu, who was playing the Legend of Mir 2, also found their communication jades blinking rapidly.","They all received the same message – [Factions have gathered forces and sent troops to three borders of Dajin.]","“What’s happening?” All of them were nonplussed.","What are the major factions and forces doing at the borders of Dajin? they wondered.","Outside Cold Stone Fort in the north region of Dajin country, many spiritual boats and cultivators gathered in the sky before Dajin’s border.","The guarding soldiers of Cold Stone Fort were ready for battle with grim expressions.","“What brings you to Dajin’s fort?” a general asked loudly.","A Daoist wearing a white Daoist robe with patterns of divinatory symbols shouted back, “Tell your emperor to hand over the head of Origins Internet Club, or we’ll raze Dajin to the ground and catch him ourselves!”","“What?!”","“Arrogance!”","“You are going too far!”","While the generals and soldiers cussed at the enemies, Ji Wu, who had received the urgent report from the fort in Origin Internet Club, was livid with fury as well. “They are so overbearing! They have absolutely no regard for our Dajin!”","Mr. Fang shrugged and said, “Do you see it now? It’s useless even if you stop me.”","“Aren’t they the major factions near the country?” Fenghua asked, “What does it have to do with Taixi Saint Faction?”","Su Tianji said with a sneer, “Without a mastermind behind them, how can these factions unite with each other?!”","“However... eh...” Ji Wu looked at Fang Qi in bafflement and said, “Why are they after you, Mr. Fang?”","“How would I know?” Mr. Fang shrugged. “I’ve been at the Morning Star Sea Realm recently.”","“Is it because of the incident of Demon-Suppressing Cauldron?”","“Don’t worry,” Su Tianji said in a loud voice, “Handing this kid to them? I won’t allow it!”","“Allow it?” Nalan Hongwu said with a cold smile, “Whoever wants to do that must ask for my permission first!”","“Anyone who dares to agree to them would have been kicked out by me,” Mr. Fang said with a dark expression, “You want to know why I want to mess with Taixi Faction? Do your guilds have missing members? They were good and well, but then they just went offline one day as if they had just vanished.”","“Ugh?” Song Qingfeng said, “Isn’t it the same issue that we talked about a few days ago?”","“Is it because...” Nalan Mingxue sharply sensed a conspiracy behind the whole thing. If she connected everything together from the new members of the guilds who were missing, the disciples from different factions, and the Taixi Saint Faction...","“Bad news!” At this moment, Ye Xiaoye walked into the shop anxiously and said, “I got the news about those people. Brother Bai Lang, those few cultivators with him, and the new members of your guilds are all imprisoned in a mystic land of the Taixi Faction, and...”","“And what?!” If it were another time, they would have doubted if such a piece of explosive news was true. But now that the factions had stationed troops at their door, they didn’t have a doubt on their mind.","“And they have been tortured by lightning spells. They must admit that they have contracted a poison named Internet Addiction here, otherwise...”","“What?!”","“Are the masters and elders of these factions pigs?!”","“How can they allow such a thing to happen to their disciples?!”","“Where did you get the news?” Ye Songtao asked, “How come I know nothing about it?”","Ye Xiaoye said sadly, “It took Brother Bai great efforts to send information to Senior Sister Zhou, and I just heard it from her. Hurry up and rescue them. I am afraid if the Taixi Faction knows someone leaked out the news...”","Ji Wu said with a dark expression, “They won’t do anything to the elders and masters of the factions who think we’re the villains, but the cultivator who leaked the news will probably be in danger!”","Mr. Fang shrugged. “Now, do you still want to stop me from going to the Taixi Faction?”","“They are going too far!” Nalan Hongwu said, “I’ll go with you!”","Su Tianji said in a cold voice, “Me too!”","“Me as well!”","“Count me in!”","“Let’s go to the Taixi Faction and argue the case!”","“Argue the case? They sent troops to our door! Let’s raze Taixi Faction to the ground!”","The others raised their arms and yelled in agreement!","“Okay,” Nalan Mingxue said, “If we all go, it will fit their plan. We’ll leave an unguarded country to them, and they will enter Dajin and raze our country to the ground.”","“In my opinion, the Shop Owner and the old man of my family can go to the Taixi Faction while the rest of us stay here to guard the country against the troops of the major forces.”","“I will go as well!” Su Tianji was obviously not satisfied with this arrangement.","“Okay! Okay! Okay! You just tried to stop me, and now you can’t bear to be left behind. Let’s go then.” Mr. Fang waved his hand and said, “So, you won’t blame me for not taking you along.”","“It’s I who takes you!” Su Tianji glared at him and said,","“Fine.” Mr. Fang showed a harmless expression. “But I must make it clear before we go that I’m not responsible for your safety. If something happened, I’ll just run and won’t help you.”","Su Tianji who had planned to help this kid was infuriated when she heard his declaration, and she replied in anger, “I don’t need your help! Just don’t become a burden yourself!”","“That’s settled then,” Fang Qi said, “The three of us will go to the Taixi Faction.”"]},{"number":373,"title":"Chapter 373 - You don’t know my intention without seeing the excavator?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Alliance Master Lan, what do you think?” Ji Wu looked grim. After all, Dajin had never faced such a big threat of war since its establishment; even the army of the Yundian Upper Realm wasn’t nearly as big as this one.","Ji Wu asked, “This time, most of the factions of the cultivation world have joined forces to invade Dajin. If we can’t resist them, maybe we should stall them for a few days...”","“If it were before, I would have agreed with Your Majesty,” Lan Mo said, “But now...”","He continued, “Now that they are at our door, do you think they will allow our stalling strategy? With their combined forces, they think suppressing a country comprised mostly of warriors is as easy as killing an ant, and even Yundian Upper Realm wouldn’t dare to face their troops directly. Do you think they want to negotiate with us, Your Majesty?”","“Alliance Master Lan, do you think they have no intention of negotiation and settling this?” Ji Wu asked, “Then, what are they waiting for?”","“With so many forces in the united army, they do have the numbers advantage, but they also face the problem of arranging and commanding different forces,” Lan Mo said with a chuckle, “They are probably discussing how to divide the property in Your Majesty’s Royal Palace after razing Dajin to the ground.”","Of course, he was just kidding with the last comment, but he was right that their enemies hadn’t unified the command of the army. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have given Dajin time to prepare.","“With the speed of Duke Nalan and his companions, they will soon reach Taixi Faction, which is an extremely dangerous place,” Lan Mo said mildly, “Maybe they will need our help. So, we must...”","He whispered something to Ji Wu.","...","Meanwhile, Li Haoran said to the group of artifact masters, “As you all know, this wave can be transformed into electrical signals; the spiritual essence that we use can also be transformed into lightning and flames, and some special techniques can even transform lightning and flames back into pure spiritual essence.”","He held up a piece of heavy jade which was bigger than ordinary communication jades and said, “I believe you will think that this communication jade is not small and exquisite, but we can put some special array patterns into this special spiritual light jade and give it some special functions. For example, in the environment where the spiritual essence transmission is interrupted, we can send messages using the new wave-style information delivery method. When the messages enter the ordinary communication jade, they will automatically transform into spiritual essence messages.”","“If we can intercept and decode the special symbols of our enemies’ spiritual essence transmission, we can even pretend to be their leaders and issue orders after disrupting their communication,” Li Haoran said, “I’m happy to tell you that it’s our artifact master friends in Half City of the Morning Star Sea Realm who provided us with this special artifact-making method. I guess they must often read others’ messages in secret.”","The others were amused.","“In short, our plan is plausible even though it’s still crude,” Li Haoran declared, “If we make it a reality, it will be the greatest creation in the history of in our cultivation world!”","Meanwhile in Dajin, 15 warships took off. If the people from Yundian Upper Realm were here, they would recognize that these were the Gongshu Family’s warships!","After their defeat, the warships of the Gongshu Family were captured and taken by Dajin. After some repairs, they became great war weapons again!","Although the Gongshu Family was defeated, their warships were unrivaled in the whole cultivation world!","Meanwhile, Jun Yangzi and a large group of artifact masters gathered in the artifact room inside the Wuwei Daoist Alliance. They were looking at a round mirror hovering in the air. The mirror looked neither gold nor jade, and they could see flowers and golden clouds in the vague green light inside the mirror at a closer look. In addition, cloud dragons, rare birds, and tadpole-like ancient characters were engraved on the surface of the mirror.","“It’s done!” All the artifact masters were stunned. “We truly did it!”","...","At this moment, two sword beams landed in front of the gate of the Taixi Faction in the blink of an eye.","Mr. Fang said, “I think maybe we can put it on the livestream?”","“Open... the livestream?!”","Before Nalan Hongwu could wake up from his shock, two figures appeared on the big screens in the shops.","One was an old man with white hair and a white beard, and the other was an ordinary-looking young man wearing a blue robe.","“B*stards of Taixi Faction! Come out and receive your deaths!” A furious roar shook sky and ground, and the mountains all trembled. It looked as if the Taixi Faction’s gate would be shaken off as well.","[F*ck?!]","[This can be livestreamed as well?!]","[The shop owner is awesome!]","[They arrived at the Taixi Faction so soon?!]","Instantly, the big screen was flooded with bullet comments.","“Who are you?!” Shouts of anger and alarm came from the mountain path. Soon, many disciples of the Taixi Faction surrounded the outsiders.","“Who dares to break into our Taixi Faction?”","“Do you know where you are?!”","“How dare you cuss our Taixi Faction in front of our gate?!”","“It’s you!” At this moment, a gloomy-looking young man wearing a white robe with golden patterns walked up, revealing himself to be Feng Xi. He was a bit surprised when he saw Fang Qi, but then he smiled coldly. “I have been planning to go and get you, but you made it easier for me by offering yourself to me to kill!”","“Offering myself to you for you to kill?” Mr. Fang said with a faint smile, “Are you kidding me? It seems like you don’t know my intentions if I don’t drive the excavator to this place.”","Nalan Hongwu’s face twitched. “What excavator?”","Feng Xi snorted. “These two men insulted our faction in front of our gate. Kill them!”","“Kill us?” Nalan Hongwu laughed and said, “Kid, aren’t you overestimating yourself? A group of cultivators at the True Lake Realm wants to kill me?”","“A warrior of the Emperor Warrior Realm?” Feng Xi said with a sneer, “Do you think you can disregard our Taixi Faction since you can deal with some Divine Ocean Realm cultivators? The Divine Ocean Realm cultivators of the Taixi Faction are not the Divine Ocean Realm wastrels in your Dajin!”","He waved his big sleeve, and the clear sky was instantly covered by dark clouds while spiritual essence began gathering around him. Thunder boomed in the sky as if many carts that were as heavy as Mountain Tai rolled above the thick dark clouds.","Feng Xi was only an ordinary disciple whose master was Duyou Holiness, but he could casually incite heavenly power!","“Are you shocked? Are you afraid?!” Standing in the sky like a god, Feng Xi looked down on Nalan Hongwu. “You are underestimating our power if you compare us with the ordinary Divine Ocean Realm cultivators whom you can defeat! You’ll be shocked if you think we are the same!”","However, a silver light beam shot into the high sky in the next moment.","“Great heavenly power, turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword!”","Many lightning bolts more powerful than the previous ones began to gather above Mr. Fang’s head. Furthermore, the heavenly lightning gathered by Feng Xi’s spiritual spell were dragged to the space above Mr. Fang by a mysterious force!","Extreme shock and terror appeared on Feng Xi’s face. “!!??”"]},{"number":374,"title":"Chapter 374 - Disgracing Himself in front of People outside the Continent","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What are you watching?” Upon entering the Half City Shop, Black Demon and his people saw lightning bolts rolling in the clouds on the big screen.","“Hurry up and watch this!” Tang Yuan, the Master of the Yuanheng Pavilion, was watching with great interest and holding a bowl of instant noodles in his hands. He pointed at the big screen with his chopsticks and said, “Some people near Jiuhua City are inciting the major factions to make trouble for Mr. Fang, and it’s said that they even captured many new players who had just joined the guilds. Right now, Mr. Fang is attacking this force’s headquarters!”","“Really? This dominating?!” Black Demon suddenly slapped on his thigh and yelled, “A while ago, my Black Demon Guild lured some new members into the guild with great efforts. I’ve been wondering why some of them are offline recently. Is it possible that they were...”","He gazed at the screen in concentration.","Soon, he realized the situation. “Could it be that these b*stards...?! How far is that place from here? Can I go there by flying on a sword?”","He jumped up with the urge to grab a weapon and kill those guys.","Meanwhile in the Jiuhua City Shop, people like Dong Qingli had just entered the shop. Seeing the rows of [Awesome!] on the big screen, she asked curiously, “What’s happening? How come the big screen is so lively today?”","“Hahahaha!” Laughing, Song Qingfeng pointed at the big screen and said, “You just missed an excellent scene. That kid of the Taixi Faction showed off his lightning spell, but the shop owner used the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell. Now, look at that kid’s face!”","“Where? Where?!” Hearing his words, many people turned their gazes toward the big screen and saw Feng Xi’s weird expression as if he had just swallowed a dead fly.","“What... What did you cast?!” Feng Xi yelled.","In the history of the whole cultivation world, the spiritual spells of the Taixi Faction had been the best, which was why he, a cultivator at the early stage of the Divine Ocean Realm, was so arrogant.","In theory, early stage Emperor Warriors could defeat early stage Divine Ocean Realm cultivators, but the cultivators of the Taixi Faction should be the exception!","Their skills on the spiritual spells were above most cultivation factions. But now...","The spiritual spell that he was proud of looked as ridiculous as a toddler who was learning to walk in front of Fang Qi; even the lightning energy that he gathered with great efforts joined the horrifying vortex of dark clouds above Fang Qi!","Then, the lightning bolts crashed down!","While shouts of alarm and shrilling screams sounded, Feng Xi, who had been overbearing a moment ago, turned ashen-faced!","“Ahhhh!” While screams sounded, lightning bolts that were as thick as a bucket crashed down!","Duan Yue soon sent a bullet comment. [Daoist friends of Jiuhua City, what faction is this? The Nanhua Heavenly Light before the improvements was no match for Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell. How dare this guy show off his lightning spell before Mr. Fang?!]","[Daoist friends of Half City are also watching the livestream?]","[Awesome, Sir! The cultivators of Half City are watching this too!]","Song Qingfeng put his palm on his forehead and sent a comment. [This messenger of the Taixi Faction disgraced himself in front of people outside this continent...]","[That seems to be true!]","[Hahahaha! Awesome!]","[He even disgraced himself overseas!]","“How dare you!” At this moment, several extremely powerful auras shot out from inside of the gate and crashed toward Fang Qi and Nalan Hongwu with aggressive force!","Standing before the gate, Fang Qi and Nalan Hongwu felt a horrifying spiritual suppression crashing down like a huge mountain!","A high-pitched voice came from the inside, “You are acting so overbearing with only this bit of strength?!”","A deep voice said, “Self-Important! How dare you show off in front of the Taixi Faction!”","In a small pavilion beside a cliff several kilometers away from the gate, two cultivators, one with black hair and the other with white hair, were playing chess.","“I’m surprised that they even defeated Feng Xi. They have some abilities.”","“Despite their abilities, they are only warriors. They pose no threat to us.”","The advantage of cultivators over warriors lied in all kinds of ranged attack methods; cultivators could kill warriors several times from miles away before the warriors could see them.","While the horrifying spiritual suppression crashed down, the black-haired cultivator put down one black chess piece on the chess board.","Before the gate, a Kirin statue suddenly became alive. With a roar, it pounced at the two invaders with tremendous force!","As the array was activated, Fang Qi and Nalan Hongwu felt as if they were sinking in a pool of mud and couldn’t move their legs under the horrifying spiritual suppression; it seemed like they were bound to huge boulders that weighed more than 10,000 pounds.","“No! It’s an array!”","“They are trapped!”","The audience watching the livestream were startled.","“F*ck off!” Nalan Hongwu yelled with fury while he punched onto the Kirin’s paws with vicious force!","With an earth-shaking noise, the surging force sent him flying backward!","Meanwhile, the white-haired cultivator put down a white chess piece.","A lightning bolt struck down toward Fang Qi silently! If not for his extremely quick reflexes, he would have been struck into a piece of scorched coal!","Meanwhile, dozens of statues around them became alive!","Many rare beasts and precious birds launched attacks. It looked random and messy, but they were in a mysterious pattern. Even 100 people couldn’t deal with these creatures, let alone just two!","“Hahaha! You overestimated yourselves.”","“Right,” the black-haired old man said with a smile, “The Stone-Grinding Array of our faction is designed for dealing with invaders. It doesn’t matter how high their cultivation strengths are; they will run out of spiritual essence and die in the array!”","“They can’t even deal with the Stone-Grinding Array at the gate,” the white-haired old man said with a snicker, “How do they dare to mess with our Taixi Faction?! They overestimated themselves by too much! They are seeking death!”","“This kind of warriors are just like ants.” The black-haired old man shook his head. “We can crush them with just our fingers!”","“I’m afraid that they will die pathetically and won’t know what happened before they can even see us,” the white-haired old man said smugly.","“Hahahaha!” Seeing Nalan Hongwu and Fang Qi, who were still struggling in the array, they looked at each other and laughed.","Before their laughter stopped, a black sword energy flew over out of the blue!","The sharp sword energy transformed instantly into a horrifying huge sword!","The smiles instantly froze on their faces.","Then, a terrified voice yelled, “Where did this sword come from?!”","Besides the black sword, a silver, snake-like light beam danced in the sky before turning into many swords; they looked like a sword curtain!","“This...” The white-robed old man yelled, “What’s this?!”","Comments appeared on the screens.","[This is the sword control technique! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f61c.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F61C;\">","[They should come out and broaden their view. The two old guys spend their days playing chess on the mountain; how dare they scheme against the shop owner?]","[Hahaha! You will probably die pathetically, not knowing what happened even after you see it!]"]},{"number":375,"title":"Chapter 375 - Plan in Calm","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Nalan Hongwu injected a tremendous amount of warrior qi into the sword, and the horrifying sword energy instantly cut open the protective spiritual light on these two cultivators’ protective spiritual artifacts!","“Impossible!”","“Who?! Who did it?!” The two cultivators looked around in terror but saw no one!","“Where is this person?! Who launched the sneak-attack?!” The black-haired cultivator roared, “It’s not righteous to sneak-attack! Come out and battle with me in the open if you dare!”","Horror was clearly written on their faces!","Comments flooded the big screens of the shops that belonged to Origins Internet Club.","[Now you want a battle in the open? Where were you a moment ago?]","[Hahaha! A group of old b*stards dare to incite the major factions to attack our Dajin?]","“The Shop Owner is awesome! Sir! Raze their headquarters to the ground!]","On the screen, the blades poured down like a real storm!","The entrance of the faction returned to normal while all kinds of huge rare beast stone statues returned to their original positions. Then, the sky cleared.","...","“Master! Master! Bad news!”","Inside the Taixi Faction, a disciple ran in from the outside in a panic.","In a white robe, Duyou Holiness looked calm with a fishing rod in his hand. “Calm down. Tell me; what happened?”","“The... that Mr. Fang of the Origins Internet Club is here to cause trouble to our faction!” The white-robed disciple said in panic.","“He has come?” Duyou Holiness laughed and said, “I’m surprised that he came so soon, but it’s what I want. Don’t worry; the gate is guarded by the Black and White Elders on top of many disciples. Even if he’s extremely powerful, it will take him some time to break in!”","“No...” the disciple explained, “They have broken in already!”","“Calm down. Do you remember what I taught you?” He withdrew the fishing rod and looked up, and he saw many swords forming a giant sword curtain in the sky!","Then, the swords poured down like the raindrops in a storm!","“Master...” The disciple shrieked in alarm, “What... What is that?!”","“How dare you!” Duyou Holiness immediately tossed away the fishing rod, and his face turned dark. “Where are Black and White? Where did they go?”","“The Stone-Grinding Array was broken!” the disciple said anxiously, “They’ve broken in! I’m afraid that something bad has happened to the Black and White Elders!”","“What?!” Duyou Holiness’s expression changed drastically. “B*stards! How dare they?!”","“They dare to break into my faction and mess with us?” With a cold smile, Duyou Holiness brushed the dust off his clothes and said, “Come out with me!”","“Shall... shall we activate the faction-guarding grand array?” the disciple asked.","“How many are there?”","“Two,” the disciple said while pointing out two fingers.","“Only two! Look at your panicking face!” Duyou Holiness said in a cold voice, “The faction-guarding grand array is the ultimate treasure that our ancestral masters left to us thousands of years ago. Do you think these two people deserve the activation of our faction-guarding grand array?”","“Summon some of your senior brothers and sisters to go out with me and check the situation!”","“Yes...” the disciple answered with sweat on his forehead.","...","Meanwhile at the eastern border of Dajin, a large group of warships from Linglang Mountain was making preparations with a large cultivator army.","“Ugh?”","“What’s happening?” A white-robed elder looked around the sky. “Strange...”","“Elder, what’s wrong?”","“Report!” At this moment, a messenger came to report, “Family Master sent a message, ordering us to move to Dao-Pursing Slope 15 kilometers away and meet with cultivators of the Dragon Sea Daoist Palace.”","Meanwhile, the cultivators of the Dragon Sea Daoist Palace also received a message.","“Report! Palace Master sent a message, saying that Dajin has moved its army to block the cultivators of Linglang Mountain; he ordered us to attack the Capital of Dajin directly!”","The cultivators of Jade Hill Mountain also received messages.","– Meanwhile, outside the gate of Dajin –","In a war of this scale, the masters of the major factions and big families didn’t need to battle in person; they just needed to move their troops and let the elders take charge. After all, it was an easy war for them.","Right now, the masters of the factions and big families gathered together to celebrate their imminent victory.","“It’s said that Dajin defeated the Yundian Upper Realm. Are you guys sure that we will win this war? How certain are you guys?” The fat Zhu Family Master from Linglang Mountain swallowed a mouthful of delicacies and wine before asking the question.","“I heard that the spiritual boats of Linglang Mountain are only second to those from the Gongshu Family, and the warships share the top position with those from the Gongshu Family in the Yundian Upper Realm,” the Jade Hill Mountain Master who was wearing a bright green robe clapped his hands and said admiringly, “Now that Linglang Mountain has sent as many as 30 warships, how can we doubt our ability of defeating a group of warriors?”","“Haha! Thank you for your praise,” the fat middle-aged cultivator said with a laugh. “I’m sure that my warships are as good as those from the Gongshu Family. Also, I heard that the arrays of the Dragon Sea Daoist Palace are unrivaled; my Linglang Mountain is no match for you in this area.”","“Thank you!” The old Daoist of the Dragon Sea Daoist Palace said with a smile, “In my opinion, the spiritual artifacts of Jade Hill Mountain are special and powerful, and I’m sure that they will catch Dajin off guard. Maybe we won’t even have a chance to cast our spells!”","“Hahahaha!” The Jade Hill Mountain Master said, “From the looks of it, it’s a piece of cake to raze Dajin to the ground, eh?”","“What then? These warriors are so poor that we won’t get much loot anyway.”","“I don’t agree. They have gained a lot of benefits after their battle with the Yundian Upper Realm. I heard that Yundian Upper Realm gave them mountains of crystals and all kinds of rare treasures!” The person who spoke was the white-clothed, middle-aged man who yelled that he wouldn’t stop until he destroyed the evil force in Dajin earlier. “We’d better remove all the evil forces this time! It will be a good deed for our cultivation world!”","“This is...” The Jade Hill Mountain Master looked at the white-clothed, middle-aged man and asked curiously.","“This is Heavenly Sun Faction Master,” the fat Family Master of Linglang Mountain introduced him. “The Heavenly Sun Faction seldom sends disciples into the outside world.”","“Since we all agree,” the Jade Hill Mountain Master said, “We just need to wait here for the news of victory.”","“Ugh?” At this moment, the old Daoist of Dragon Sea Daoist Palace took out his communication jade from his belt and observed it in his hand. “Strange.”","“What’s wrong?”","“I sent a message to Elder Liu of our faction, but I haven’t received a reply after a long time,” the Dragon Sea Daoist said in bafflement.","“Now that you mention it...” Zhu Family Master also took out his communication jade and said in puzzlement, “I haven’t received a reply either.”","“What’s wrong with these people?!” The Zhu Family Master said angrily, “Are they so absorbed by the many treasures of Dajin that they don’t have time to reply to us?!”","“Let’s drink!” Jade Hill Mountain Master said, “It’s just a mere Dajin. We’ll receive a reply after they capture Dajin’s emperor.”"]},{"number":376,"title":"Chapter 376 - The World-Ending Sword 23","paragraphs":["Chapter 376: The World-Ending Sword 23","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","A 1,000-step stairway led to the main gate of the Taixi Faction, disciples of Taixi Faction were swarming up like waves through the wide steps!","Furthermore, several extremely powerful auras soared up into the sky inside the faction!","“Who dares to mess with our Taixi Faction?!” a clear yell sounded.","“In the dream, I lay on snow-like jade in the clear void,” a male chanted the words.","Another voice continued, “Looking back on the mortal world, 1,000 years have passed!”","“Singing in the northern wind and laughing in the sky,” a female voice chanted, “I return to the peak of Taixi and seek Dao!”","Four figures stood at the top of the gate which was so high that it looked like a sharp sword piercing into the clouds.","People looked up and saw four celestial-looking cultivators standing there with their robes flapping and hair and beard fluttering in the wind; they looked like immortals descending into this world!","“Hahahaha!” Inside the Taixi Faction, celestial clouds and mist floated around the mountains as if some immortals were living in here.","“I’m surprised that Xu, Chen, Cang, and Dao, these four elders, have come out of seclusion cultivation today! Excellent!” An old man wearing a fluttering white robe with golden patterns flew over on a golden cloud with a group of cultivators!","The old man who was wearing a white robe in the middle of the group was Duyou Holiness.","Bullet comments flooded the big screens in the Origins Internet Club.","“Smooth!”","“They are actually reciting poems when they came out!”","“F*ck... They look so cool!”","“It’s indeed a major faction with all its celestial clouds and auspicious creatures!”","“I have a bad feeling for the shop owner...”","Meanwhile, the audience in the Half City Shop were watching the scene, sitting on the couch.","Black Demon said, “This faction looks f*cking awesome?”","Wang Lingxiao, the Xichi Spiritual Master, and Tianxu Daoist looked at each other. “Hiss! How come this faction looks even grander than ours.”","People like Mo Xian and Yue Yan were whispering to each other. “I thought they only had the Wuwei Daoist Alliance over there. How come they have such a powerful faction?”","“It’s said to be one of the most ancient factions in that continent...”","“Do you think the shop owner will be in trouble?”","“I hope not...”","“However, the shop owner once crashed while he took us flying...”","“What can he do then? He can run with the sword control technique. They won’t be able to catch him!”","“Shut up!”","Obviously, they began to worry when they saw this scene.","At this moment, standing high at the top of Taixi Faction’s gate, Qingxu, who was wearing a tall hat, said, “The warrior of the early stage Emperor Warrior Realm doesn’t deserve your attention. Let me deal with them!”","“The mountain gate is guarded by White and Black right? I wonder if those two old guys have gotten dumb with too much chess-playing that they couldn’t stop warriors of such a low realm!” Liaochen said with contempt.","Duyou Holiness said with a smile, “Thank you, Qingxu Spiritual Master.”","The Daoist with the high hat waved the Daoist Whisk in his hand and said in a cold voice, “You two can fight me together. Let me see what abilities you have!”","After all, his cultivation strength had reached level 7 of the Divine Ocean Realm, which was more than enough to deal with a warrior of the early stage of the Emperor Warrior Realm.","Meanwhile, the bullet comments flooded the big screens in Origin Internet Club.","[Awesome!]","[When can I be as awesome as you?]","“He dares to battle both Senior Nalan and Mr. Fang at the same time? So arrogant!”","A gust of wind lifted the Qingxu Spiritual Master into the air, and he beckoned at the two guys standing on the step. “Come on.”","Before he could finish his words, a figure shot toward him while stepping on a flying sword at a speed unimaginable to ordinary cultivators!","Before the Qingxu Spiritual Master could react, a pot-sized fist expanded before his eyes swiftly until it covered his whole face!","“Ahh!","With a shrilling scream, a figure was knocked down from the sky like a cannonball!","Boom!","The crash put a huge crater in the steps on the mountain path!","A figure struggled up from the huge crater with gritted teeth. His protective spiritual light barrier shattered, and he had a dark-purple fist-shaped bruise on his face while his nose had become crooked!","“Hahahaha! The cultivators of the Taixi Faction are so lame?!”","“This lame guy dares to take on both senior and the shop owner?”","The cultivators in the Origin Internet Club laughed so hard that they had stitches in their sides.","Nalan Hongwu beckoned at the four of them. “All of you! Come together!”","All the cultivators of the Taixi Faction were stupefied!","The Qingxu Spiritual Master wiped the blood from his face and said with a wicked expression, “I indeed underestimated you! But you dare to take on the four of us at the same time?!”","“Form the Four Symbol Grand Array!” At his sharp shout, the other three Daoists answered with clear and long yells!","“Changyang Position! Where’re the disciples for the Changyang Position?!” Furious, Qingxu roared and leaped up into the sky while disciples gathered under him!","“Shaoyang Position!” Liaochen flew down from the high mountain gate and took the second position. “Disciples for the Shaoyang Position!”","“Changyin Position!”","“Shaoyin Position!”","At the order of Qingxu, the disciples stood in formations. Instantly, violent winds rose, and the clouds surged while Nalan Hongwu and Fang Qi stood under the eye of the storm. The moment that the array was formed, a horrifying suppressive aura crashed down on them. More astonishing was that the array emptied all the spiritual essence around them, which meant that it was impossible to absorb spiritual essence from nature, let alone borrow the heavenly power!","“Do you see this?” Qingxu sneered after he was sure that these two people were trapped in the array. “But don’t panic. What you see now is just a fraction of the power of the Four Symbol Grand Array. In this array, you can’t use the essence of the surroundings, let alone draw power from the heaven and the earth. I’ll see how you can fight with us!”","Nalan Hongwu looked at Mr. Fang, and the latter shrugged. “It seems that I can’t use the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell anymore.”","– In the Origins Internet Café –","“Really? The Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell is restricted?”","“They are despicable! They are using the full strength of their faction against Mr. Fang and Senior Nalan!”","“They even formed an array!”","“Shame on them!”","“Hahahaha!” Qingxu laughed wildly and said, “You dare to take on all of us? I will satisfy your request!”","Duyou Holiness stroked his beard calmly and said with a nod, “They overestimated themselves. It seems I don’t have to show my hand.”","With a flick of his sleeves, he turned around and didn’t care to watch anymore. “Let’s go.”","“Yes, Master.”","The moment that the words were said, Duyou Holiness felt a horrifying soul-shaking sword spirit spreading all over the sky!","The terrifying sword spirit seemed to come from Hell, and one trace of it could sent chills down people’s spines!","“Master!” Then, he heard a scream of alarm, “My... body... how come I can’t move?!”","Nalan Hongwu yelled, “You dare to look down on warriors?","“Today, I’ll show you my World-Ending Sword 23!”"]},{"number":377,"title":"Chapter 377 - The Warriors Strike Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 377: The Warriors Strike Back","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Around the Four Symbol Grand Array, violent winds, dragon-like lightning bolts, and phoenix-like flames exploded with extremely horrifying power, sending sand and rocks flying.","The Four Symbol Grand Array combined the forces of many disciples of the Taixi Faction, and the array made changes according to the Great Dao of Nature. The moment that it emitted light, it could kill any grandmasters or grand warriors.","Qingxu’s lips curved up with a sneer. “I’ll see how long you can last!”","However, in the next moment, his smile froze on his face.","He saw the violent gusts of wind suddenly freezing in the air around the center of the big array. Instantly, the spiritual spells, spiritual light, and even the entire array stopped moving!","The dancing lightning bolts froze in the air, and the surging flood hovered in the sky strangely even though it didn’t freeze into ice; it just stayed there, not moving at all! It wasn’t flowing, and no water droplets fell from it!","Nalan Hongwu emitted a layer of crystal light all over his body, looking extremely weird!","In this instant, everything seemed to have paused in the long river of time that was flowing forward without stopping!","“What... what is this?!” If they could open their mouths, they would yell in horror. But at this moment, they couldn’t even open their mouths as if their bodies were not in their control!","As for the cultivators who hovered in the air under the support of spiritual essence, they didn’t fall from the sky even though the spiritual essence in their bodies had stopped circulating; they just froze in mid-air, as stiff as stone statues.","Their faces froze before they could reveal any horror, but the intense gloominess in their eyes showed the panic and fear inside.","With extreme shock, they watched the white-haired old man stroll up to them casually!","The sharp sword energies spread out as if it could cut open everything in the world, but no blood was seen spilling out.","The sky had darkened, turning this place into a pitch-black space.","The shadow of death engulfed everyone!","This was Sword 23, which looked like the Grim Reaper was entering the mortal world!","Even the audience in the shops could sense the horrifying sword spirit from the screens, let alone the cultivators in front of the gate of Taixi Faction!","Seeing Nalan Hongwu walking closer, Qingxu and the others desperately wanted to attack but found that they couldn’t move their bodies or even their spiritual essence.","No one could believe that the scene before them was truly happening; neither could one imagine that this attack was cast by a warrior.","However, in front of the undeniable fact, all the cultivators of the Taixi Faction had to admit that this man who brought them endless horror was a warrior that they had looked down upon!","This was the power of Sword 23. Once it was cast, everything lost the right to live, and everything had to wait to be butchered. It was a horrifying technique that could even suppress the laws of space!","This period of time seemed very long, as if 10,000 years had passed, and they had come to the end of time.","Even Duyou Holiness had a deep chill in his eyes, feeling as if a surge of cold air ran up from his spine to his skull!","The power was so horrifying that it went beyond his imagination!","Is this guy still a warrior?!","How can such a horrifying warrior exist in the world?!","At this moment, a yellow butterfly flew out of Duyou Holiness’ body and landed on his shoulder.","At a closer look, one could see that the butterfly looked like it was made of yellow jade. Duyou Holiness acquired it from the depth of the Cultivation Realm, and it was one of his best trump cards. With the help of this yellow jade butterfly which was said to be related to an ancient fallen immortal, and since he stood at the very edge of this horrifying hell, he had a chance to flee!","When Sword 23 was finished, most of the disciples gathered before the mountain gate, the Four Symbol Grand Array including Daoist Xu, Chen, Cang and Dao, and even the whole mountain gate was destroyed!","“My...” Duyou Holiness looked at the scene before him with horror; he hadn’t imagined such an end only one moment ago. “My Taixi Faction lost almost half of its elites here!”","“Hurry!” Like a fish out of water, Duyou Holiness panted frantically. “Hurry! Open the faction-guarding grand array!”","While yelling hysterically, he took out his communication jade with a terrified expression; all of his previous calmness was gone.","The audience in Origins Internet Club broke into loud cheers.","“Awesome!”","“So powerful!”","“I guess this old guy is so scared that his head is not working!”","Black Demon, Wang Lingxiao, and the other cultivators who hadn’t watched Wind and Cloud yet were stunned. “What... what is this technique?!”","“Is he really just a warrior?!”","Terrified, Tang Yuan immediately sent a bullet comment. [How come warriors over there are so powerful? But the warriors in our region are so weak!]","[I recommend you to watch Wind and Cloud.]","[So do I! I’m surprised that Senior has mastered the old Sword Saint’s Sword 23!]","Warriors including Ji Wu commented, [Its power is a little less than the strike used by the old Sword Saint. Otherwise, no one could leave this place alive.]","Meanwhile, a pair of eyes suddenly opened in the depth of Taixi Faction!","This black-clothed cultivator emitted an abyss-deep aura, and he was the tall, black-robed old man who had once sat beside Duyou Holiness by the lake.","“This sword spirit is so horrifying!” His face turned dark. “How come my Taixi Faction has made such a powerful enemy?!”","He was holding an Eight-Trigram disk which emitted waves of mysterious and mystical spiritual light. Meanwhile, stars surged in the sky above the Taixi Faction as if the circulation of energy in the array pulled on many stars in the high sky. Under the guidance of the array, many spiritual light beams condensed into huge beams of spiritual essence before crashing down from the stars. The spiritual essence in the earth also gathered and rose until a tremendous amount of spiritual essence surged up tempestuously in the space between the heaven and the earth!","“Faction-guarding grand array?!”","“Why is the faction-guarding grand array activated?!”","“What happened?!”","Darkness engulfed the faction gate, but the disciples of the Taixi Faction on other peaks saw huge beams of spiritual essence shooting down from the sky. “It has been thousands of years since the faction-guarding grand array was last activated!”","Everyone in the Taixi Faction turned their gazes to this place!","They had never imagined that their faction would be forced into such a tight corner by a warrior!","Obviously, the Taixi Faction had realized the power of its enemies and had thus activated its full force!"]},{"number":378,"title":"Chapter 378 - Godly Weapon Fragments.","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Got it!” The place where the Taixi Faction imprisoned the disciples of the different factions was extremely secret and hard to find. After all, th eTaixi Faction was large, and it wasn’t easy to find a small group of people in it.","Even with the clues provided by Mr. Fang, Su Tianji took a long time to find the Mystic Place.","One by one, under the watchful eyes of many cultivators, the disciples stood in a long line and walked toward the high platform before them.","On the high platform, there was a spiritual artifact that was attached to a piece of equipment which look like an iron helmet.","A couple of cultivators hustled forward a cultivator in the line and pushed him up to the platform. “Put it on!”","“No! No...” It was a young disciple who was about 17 years old, and he was wearing a pale grey robe. He looked at the item before him with a horrified expression and shrunk his body; it seemed like he had experienced something horrifying before and didn’t want to repeat it.","At this moment, the two grand cultivators of the True Lake Realm standing on both sides of him sneered and looked at each other.","Then, they grabbed his arms and sealed his spiritual essence, which was only at the Yuan River Realm, with their own powerful cultivation base before pressing him down on the high platform.","Tian Leizi looked at the scene without showing any emotions. “This guy has a lot of poison remaining in his body, which is why he is resisting so much. It seems that he needs more time with this lightning treatment.”","He showed a genial smile and said, “Little Guy, you must cooperate with the healing process if you want to recover soon. After we remove most of the poison in your body, I will alleviate the treatment intensity. Do you understand?”","Then, he waved his hand and said, “Begin.”","“No! No...” While struggling, the disciple was pushed up. Soon, everyone heard a series of shrilling screams!","“Despicable! Extremely despicable!” Su Tianji’s beautiful eyes were full of fury; she had never felt so furious before in her life.","She had heard from Mr. Fang that the Taixi Faction had imprisoned the disciples but didn’t know anything beyond that. Now, watching this scene, her heart turned cold.","What are they doing? Even criminals are not tortured in this inhumane way!","These disciples were mostly 17 or 18 years old, the perfect age for cultivation.","Furthermore, they were not ordinary disciples but highly talented ones. They would grow into excellent cultivators even if they couldn’t become core disciples; they would receive extra care and help even if they were at the Liuyun Daoist Palace.","They represented the future of their respective factions!","“No! No...” At this moment, a girl’s sobbing and fearful voice sounded. Su Tianji looked toward it and saw a round-faced girl who was about 16 years; despair was written all over her face.","Such a talented young female disciple would be doted by her senior brothers and master. But obviously, Tian Leizi didn’t have any pity for her, and he waved his hand.","“Ahhh!”","“Stop!” a furious yell came!","“Someone broke in!”","“Stop her!” Gloomy-faced, Tian Leizi didn’t know how this intruder had entered this place, but his top priority was catching her!","...","Meanwhile, huge beams of spiritual essence connected the heaven and the earth, and the tremendous spiritual essence from different mountains of the Taixi Faction came together and formed a huge, perfect array. Seeing this, Duyou Holiness, who had just fled from the horrifying sword spirit, felt relieved.","He turned his head and saw Nalan Hongwu’s pale face, and he laughed and said, “It seems that the technique you used consumed a lot of your warrior qi. After all, it’s not easy for you to deal with a big array formed by four cultivators of the late stage of the Divine Ocean Realm, right? What a pity...”","“Indeed. It’s a pity that I didn’t kill you, Old B*stard!” Nalan Hongwu snorted. Obviously, he had just understood Sword 23, and the power was limited. Although he had broken the Four Symbol Grand Array and killed many masters of the Taixi Faction, Duyou Holiness had escaped with the help of a rare treasure, which was a surprise to Nalan Hongwu.","“That’s not what I meant.” Duyou Holiness shook his head slowly.","“You’re only an Emperor Warrior, but you almost killed me here. You are the No.1 Warrior in the entirety of history, and I don’t expect that there will be another warrior as powerful as you in the future. Even I am jealous of you.”","“If you don’t die, you will probably change the power dynamic between cultivators and warriors on this continent for about 1,000 years! As an Emperor Warrior who was at the seventh realm for warriors, you possess the same combat ability as a cultivator of the same realm! (The seventh realm, Divine Palace Realm)!” His face turned dark while he snickered. “But today, you will die here!”","“Die here?” Nalan Hongwu sneered.","“You are almost running out of your strength.” Duyou Holiness stared at him and said coldly, “Do you still want to resist us?”","“Or...” His gaze turned to Fang Qi as if he was looking at an ant. “Do you really expect this wastrel at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm, two realms lower than yours, to help you escape?”","The moment that he finished his sentence, a lot of surging spiritual essence in the sky formed a huge Eight-Trigram pattern which covered the whole Taixi Faction!","Seeing that the huge Eight Trigram pattern was made, Duyou Holiness laughed wildly, “Do you see that?! This is the Eight-Trigram pattern that I inherited from the prehistoric Immortal Dao! It can even trap the legendary demi-immortals who are ready to ascend, let alone you, an Emperor Warrior!”","Of course, he exaggerated a bit. After all, this array was created long, long ago, and the successors could understand just a tiny part of its power, which meant that it was hard for them to unleash its full force.","Despite all this, it was more than enough to deal with an Emperor Warrior who had little warrior qi left in his body.","Nalan Hongwu glanced at Fang Qi and said in a deep voice, “Kid Fang, it’s time to go. Elder Su must have done her job now.”","“Go now?” Mr. Fang shook his head and said, “Didn’t I state my intention?”","“What intention?” Nalan Hongwu was nonplussed.","“I told you guys my intention before we came,” Mr. Fang said, “I asked you who wanted to come with me to raze the Taixi Faction to the ground.”","“What?!”","“So arrogant!”","Instantly, the cusses of Taixi Faction disciples resonated in the sky.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang glanced at his godly weapon fragments and the godly weapons trading list.","Immortal-Slaying Ancient Sword Fragment: single usage. Allow the user to achieve Complete Synchronization with a character in the TV Series Jade Dynasty. (Required Total Synchronization:20%).","Kusanagi Sword (The King of Fighters) Fragment: single usage; Allow the user to achieve Complete Synchronization with a game character who had used Kusanagi Sword. (Required Total Synchronization:20%).","Wuchen Sword Fragment...","Heavenly Mirror Fragment...","Yes. This was what the System meant when it told Mr. Fang to explore himself.","———————————————————————————————————–"]},{"number":379,"title":"Chapter 379 - Turning everything to nothing","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","However, since different godly weapons unleashed different forces, the godly weapons needed different numbers of godly weapon fragments. For example, two godly weapon fragments were needed to trade for one Heavenly Mirror fragments.","Even if he traded, he only had achieved 5% total synchronization with the White Brow Spiritual Master, which was still far from the target of 20% synchronization.","The Wuchen Sword was relatively cheap, but this godly weapon wasn’t very powerful, thus the synchronization time would be decreased.","“What should I choose this time?” Mr. Fang stroked his chin. “Since we’re on the livestream, and the audience in Half City Shop have already seen Sword God, maybe I will use something new today?”","“Kid Fang, what are you waiting for?!”","Nalan Hongwu saw that Fang Qi was still hesitant.","At this moment, Duyou Holiness flew to the Eight-Trigram platform outside the Taixi Palace. Holding an order flag which was embroidered with symbols of water, wood, wind, and fire. He pointed it to the south and said, “Li position! Burning Sun True Flame!”","A wave of horrifying burning flames poured down from the huge Eight-Trigram disk in the sky as if the Grand Supreme Daoist knocked over his Eight-Trigram Furnace!","[TL Note: Grand Supreme Daoist is a famous immortal in traditional Chinese legends.]","The horrifying red flames swept all over the space and even turned the surrounding air on fire!","Nalan Hongwu’s face turned dark since he could sense the horrifying high temperature even from afar; the flames felt so hot that they seemed like they could melt people instantly.","The flames pouring down from the sky would burn the two people on the ground to ashes in the next moment.","With a chilly expression, Duyou Holiness was determined to kill them and remove all potential future trouble!","He began to smile while he saw the scene. “Even though you are the most talented and most powerful warrior I’ve ever seen, you must die here today! I can’t let such a huge threat escape from me! It doesn’t matter how powerful you are, you can’t withstand the Burning Sun True Flame! Go to hell!”","However, at this moment, Fang Qi suddenly revealed a sword fragment in his hand while a row of mystic data flashed in his eyes.","Then, Fang Qi’s robe fluttered even though there was no wind; his black hair turned white, and it waved in the air as well.","His eyes opened slowly, emitting chilly spiritual light. His golden snake pupils contained endless darkness which looked like a black void.","Like the Heavenly Dao, his eyes emitted deep mercilessness and chilliness as if he disregarded everything in the world.","As if supported by an invisible force, he hovered silently in the air, disregarding any rules governing the heaven and the earth.","“This...”","“What’s the shop owner doing?!”","“I’ve never seen this before!”","At this moment, all the audience watching the livestream felt chills running down their spines; even Ruan Ning, who liked to mock Fang Qi, shivered uncontrollably!","Standing in the air, Fang Qi suddenly raised his hand.","A surge of a horrifying magnetic field appeared, and the force started to cycle around him as he waved his hand. In the blink of an eye, a horrifying black shadow appeared before him; the shadow expanded and contracted alternatively, swallowing the flames like a black hole or a hurricane sweeping across the land!","“That is...”","Song Qingfeng suddenly yelled in shock, “Shockwave! That’s Shockwave!”","Watching the livestream in concentration while sitting on the couch in Half City Shop, Liu Ningyun and Ning Bi who had played the King of Fighters jumped up in shock. “Sun Shockwave?!”","Almost all the audience yelled in astonishment, “Is this... Orochi?”","(Note: In the legends, the Kusanagi Sword was drawn out from the tailbone of Orochi.”","Boom!","With a series of huge noises, the Sun Shockwave crashed onto the Eight-Trigram disk in the sky with vicious force.","The spiritual patterns of the Eight-Trigram disk condensed by many beams of spiritual essence shook under this strike! It became unstable!","“Impossible!” Duyou Holiness’s face paled as he stared at the white-haired young man who was standing in the air.","“Who... Who are you?!” He roared in horror; the snake pupils sent chills down his spines!","However, no one answered him. Duyou Holiness saw the white-haired young man suddenly dim and then vanish silently!","In the next moment, the figure appeared behind him. The figure slightly waved his hand, and a huge, horrifying magnetic force rushed out like a storm!","Boom! Boom!","The moment that Duyou Holiness turned his head, the dense complicated Eight-Trigram patterns around his body lit up. These trigram patterns contained most of the array’s power, but they shook and looked as if they would fall apart under Fang Qi’s casual attack!","“How can it be?! Who on earth are you?!” Not daring to reserve his strength, Duyou Holiness activated all the power of the grand array!","Horrifying forces including earth, fire, water, and wind gushed out from the huge Eight-Trigram disk in the sky. These forces countered and complemented each other, forming an extremely powerful combined force in the array!","Meanwhile, the stars moved positions in the sky above the grand array while a lot of starlight fell and gathered in the middle of it!","“I’ll show you the true power of this grand array!” Duyou Holiness roared furiously, and the black-robed old man sitting in the center of the array injected all of his spiritual essence into the Eight-Trigram disk in his hand; the symbols on the disk moved and gradually derived out the most powerful pattern!","The mountains under the Taixi Faction shook continuously as if an earth dragon were making a turn; this was the shaking of the spiritual veins underground.","Obviously, the person controlling the array had activated most of the spiritual essence from the underground spiritual veins.","“Kid Fang, run!” Nalan Hongwu sensed that this force was beyond the resistance of human power.","However, at this moment, a huge crack opened in the dark clouds behind Fang Qi who was still hovering in the air.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi brought his arms to his chest and crossed them.","All the people stared at the scene in horror.","“This is...”","The players who had played the King of Fighters shouted, “This is the starting move of Orochi Divine Light!”","Meanwhile, Fang Qi’s lips slightly moved as if he was chanting a mysterious and incomprehensible incantation. But strangely, everyone could understand the meaning of the words. “Let everything return to nothing!”","In the sky covered by gloomy clouds and howling wind, the opening grew larger and larger as if the sky was cracking open!","Many light beams shot down, and everything was bathed in the sunlight. The audience watched while the huge Eight-Trigram disk in the sky, including the derived forces of earth, fire, water, and wind, was cut and disintegrated!","Around Duyou Holiness, the trigram patterns condensed by the array dimmed at a visible speed!","He had never looked so terrified before. “You... Impossible!”"]},{"number":380,"title":"Chapter 380 - You Deserve the Terrible Ending","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Duyou Holiness widened his eyes as if he was trying to better understand the scene and the young man before him.","He just couldn’t understand what force could be this terrifying! He felt that the energy in the faction-guarding grand array, the spiritual vein, and the stars were being consumed at a fast rate to fend off this force!","“No! Impossible!” Duyou Holiness roared, “This is an ancient grand array passed down from the prehistoric times... The Ancestral Master told us that it could even trap and kill demi-immortals!”","“Impossible! Absolutely impossible!” he murmured to himself, looking crazy and mad.","Then, he saw something even more terrifying: a crack appeared in the center of the huge Eight-Trigram pattern, which was purely condensed by spiritual essence.","Then, more cracks appeared; two, three, four...","Many cracks appeared, and the entire array was shaking!","The disciples and elders of the other two saint factions, Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain, all looked up at the terrifying scene in the distant sky in horror; it looked as if the end of the world had come.","“What is that?!”","“That’s in the direction of Taixi Faction!”","Seeing this scene, extreme horror and shock entered their eyes!","– In the Half City Shop and the Jiuhua City Shop –","The cultivators and warriors who hadn’t played the King of Fighters before stood up in horror. “What... what is that?”","Even Ning Bi stood up. She had only seen the overwhelming power of Orochi in the game; she couldn’t compare it with anything in the real world, thus she couldn’t really feel the power of these moves. However, now she saw the Orochi Divine Light technique being used in the real world.","The stunning sensation was many times stronger than what she got from the game.","Her eyes that were as green as jade stared at the screen while the array was being dismantled. “I decided; I’m going to put more effort into practicing the King of Fighters techniques in the future!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master was also gazing at the big screen without blinking. “Yun’er, do you know what this technique is? Can we learn it in the shop? How come I’ve never seen it before?!”","“It’s because you don’t play the King of Fighters, Master,” Liu Ningyun said earnestly.","“Yun’er, can you show me how to play the King of Fighters?!” The Xichi Spiritual Master asked in excitement, “If I can merge this technique into our Nanhua Heavenly Light...”","She began to dream about the bright future.","“...”","“Hahahaha! Destroyed... All destroyed!” Duyou Holiness watched while the Taixi Faction’s faction-guarding grand array collapsed. Even the mystical yellow jade butterfly which had saved him from the World-Ending Sword 23 shattered into pieces. With hatred in his eyes, his face was wicked like a ghost, and he fell from the sky, covered in blood.","Staring at Fang Qi in the sky with hatred, he said, “My Taixi Faction has done nothing to you; why are you doing this to us?! Aren’t you afraid that you will be punished by Heaven and struck by lightning?”","At least from his perspective, the Taixi Faction had never messed with Fang Qi in public.","“I’m here for the disciples of various factions; you imprisoned and are torturing them,” Fang Qi said solemnly.","“What torture?!” Duyou Holiness roared, “Tian Leizi! Where’s Tian Leizi?!”","He laughed hysterically and said, “You did this because of those lazy wastrels? Today, I’ll bring these wastrels to the tomb with my Taixi Faction!”","“Tian Leizi!”","“Holiness! Save me, Holiness!” At this moment, a figure covered in blood ran over with a terrified expression, chased by hundreds of furious disciples of various factions.","“Old B*stard, don’t run! I’ll let you have a taste of the lightning torture!”","“Old B*stard, I treated my master as my father, and the faction treated me as a son. But after today, my heart will feel cold even if I return to them. You destroyed the affection between my master and me that had been built over the past dozens of years! You villains have no right to live!”","“B*stards!” The round-faced girl who was about 16 years old yelled in tears, “You lied to my dad and made him take me to this place. After the worse-than-death days here, my home and my faction will not be the same to me...”","“No! It’s not me!” Spotting Duyou Holiness, Tian Leizi looked as if he saw his savior. He pointed at Duyou Holiness and said, “It’s him! He ordered me to do it; it’s not my idea! See? He even wants you to die with him!”","“B*stards! Today, I’ll give you a taste of lightning torture!”","“Ahhh!” Before Fang Qi could finish making a move, the two people were swallowed by the furious crowd. While spiritual essence turned into lightning energy and flashed in the crowd, shrill screams could be heard all over the mountain.","...","Meanwhile, the spiritual boats of Linglang Mountain followed the instructions given to them by their ‘superior’ and moved to the designated place. However, they were greeted by a wave of horrifying lightning light.","“This is...”","“The warfare spiritual spells of the Gongshu Family?!”","“Impossible! Has the Gongshu Family entered the war against us?”","“How come... there are arrays around us?!”","“No! We fell into a trap!”","“...”","While alarmed yells and shrill screams sounded, the huge group of spiritual boats received great damage under the attacks of the pre-arranged arrays and the AoE spiritual spells cast by the many warships confiscated from the Gongshu Family!","“Quickly send the message! Tell them that we’ve fallen into a trap!”","However, they received no reply, and all the messages they sent were lost like a mud doll in the ocean. The cultivators of Jade Hill Mountain didn’t set out until the cultivators of Linglang Mountain fled and most of the high-level members were captured.","The big forces soon ventured into the depths of Dajin like headless flies, doing battles separately rather than attacking Dajin together in unison which was the optimal strategy.","...","“Strange... How come Elder Xue still didn’t reply to my message.” Jade Hill Mountain Master wondered with the communication jade in his hand.","At this moment, noises came from outside, and they heard someone yell, “Listen up! You’ve been surrounded! Immediately hand over your spiritual artifacts and surrender to us!”","“What?!” All the people inside looked displeased. “We haven’t received any messages yet... Who’s making fun of us?”","After walking out of the palace, they saw about 10 top-level warships of the Gongshu Family slowly appearing in the vast blue sky above the city.","...","Meanwhile, in the Taixi Faction, the pungent smell of flesh burned by strong lightning permeated the air.","“You’re audacious!” Two powerful auras descended from the sky.","With magnificent presences, a man and a woman at the late stage of the Divine Ocean Realm landed.","The man wore a purple-gold headpiece and a purple Daoist robe with golden patterns; he looked handsome and valiant.","The woman wore a white Daoist robe with jade patterns; she looked elegant and celestial.","They coldly stared at the people before them.","Calmly, Mr. Fang lit up a cigarette and said, “You should ask about what they did to drive these furious disciples to do such a thing.”","He tapped his finger on the cigarette to knock down the ash from the burning end. “Of course, if you want to ignore the cause and avenge them since your three factions move together, I’m here to deal with you at any time.”","Even with high cultivation strengths, the man and the woman felt chilly inside; it was a sensation that was uncontrollable.","Then, remembering the horrifying light shooting down from the sky, they stood there in a daze, not knowing what to do next.","[Beep. The task of ‘The Power that Shocks the World’ is completed.]"]},{"number":381,"title":"Chapter 381 - Upholding Justice","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Even long after Fang Qi had left, the two still couldn’t calm down.","The man’s name was Li Longyuan, the eldest direct disciple of Xuanzhong Manor. “What do you think of the power of that spiritual spell as compared to those recorded in the ancient documents?”","The woman, Ling Wanyin, was the eldest direct disciple of Yuxu Mountain. She said in surprise, “You mean... No, we’ve never heard of it before... besides, the teleportation array had been sealed long ago; how could he have come to this continent?”","In the long history, only people of the Three Saint Gates shocked and dominated over others, not the other way around. Even if there were any people who had ever shocked and dominated the Three Saint Gates, they only existed in the secret scrolls of the various factions that recorded the incidents of the ancient times.","[New task: The Power that Shocks the World","Task Mission: 1. Rescue the players who are being tortured due to playing games in our shop; 2. Establish dominance (Completed)","Task Description: Don’t scheme to destroy our shop’s business by suppressing the customers; it’s time to establish dominance and shock the enemies","Task Reward: Prize Wheel (Claimed)]","Without the array drawing power from the heaven and the earth, the sky regained its clearness as the clouds and wind settled down.","However, in the clear blue sky, there seemed to be a pair of eyes that was watching the whole incident. This pair of eyes seemed to be there ever since the creation of the universe and hadn’t ever moved, but no one had ever noticed them.","When Fang Qi led the others out of the Taixi Faction, for some reason, he turned his head and looked at the distant sky.","However, he didn’t see anything extraordinary.","...","“The defeated factions must accept the reality and act like it.” The cultivators of the major factions and forces had thought that they would capture the emperor of Dajin, but now they were astonished to find that they had become prisoners; it was unimaginable.","Where are the cultivator troops?! Where are the battle reports?!","The old Daoist of Dragon Sea Daoist Palace was especially puzzled. After all, he had acquired his special communication jade from an ancient relic, and it was made of the top-quality ancient spiritual jade, which meant that even big arrays couldn’t affect the transmission of his messages.","“Kid Ji Wu, what do you want?” The fat Zhu Family Master roared in a fury, “Do you think that you can sit back and relax after killing us?”","Ji Wu tossed a list to him and said, “This is the list of costs that our Wuwei Daoist Alliance spent on the projects related to this war. If you have no objections, just sign your names on it. After your factions compensate all the damage that you caused to my country, I’ll release you guys for sure.”","“...”","“Despicable!”","“Shameless!”","Jade Hill Mountain Master looked at the long list and said, “Kid Ji Wu, this is blatant blackmail!”","Ji Wu ignored their shouts. Instead, he took out a heavy jade much bigger than the ordinary communication jade and injected a bit of warrior qi into it. “This is the communication jade that was newly developed by the Wuwei Daoist Alliance. By now, only a few seniors of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance have the right to use it.”","After the injection of warrior qi, he controlled the communication jade and created a virtual picture in the air above the jade.","“Different from your communication jade, this one can transmit pictures and videos besides messages.”","“Transmit what?!” They looked baffled, not knowing that there existed such a weird communication jade.","“This is a video that they just sent to me. You can watch it.”","In the video before them, young men and women had their limbs tied, and lightning energy got injected into their bodies by spiritual artifacts under the threats of the cultivators of Taixi Faction.","The shrill screams chilled the hearts of everyone present.","“What... What is this?!” They all looked horrified.","...","About one day later, the cultivators of Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain, the two biggest forces in the cultivation world on the continent, gathered together.","“What... happened to the Taixi Faction?” An old Daoist wearing a purple robe asked in a trembling voice.","“It was severely damaged. Most of the high-level cultivators were killed, and their faction-guarding grand array was shattered. Even the spiritual essence in the spiritual vein underground was almost emptied. Even if they can recover from this disaster, they will be reduced to a third-tier faction. In short, it is ruined.” Li Longyuan answered.","“They... went too far!” A grey-robed old Daoist yelled, “No one had ever beaten our Three Saint Gate so hard for many years! I’ll go and avenge the Taixi Faction!”","“Elder Yan!” The Daoist sitting at the head of the table wore a white robe and a jade belt. With a whisk in his hand, he looked very dignified. He opened his mouth and said, “I know that you are close to the elders in the Taixi Faction, but this time, Duyou Holiness worked behind us and incited the big factions to suppress the... ugh...”","He glanced at a disciple beside him, and the latter whispered, “The Origins Internet Club.”","“Ah... the Origins Internet Club,” he continued, “We must consider this issue carefully.”","“Consider what?!” A red-robed elder yelled in a fury, “We still need to consider after someone razed the Taixi Faction to the ground? Should we wait until our own factions are destroyed?! I don’t agree!”","“Right! I don’t agree as well!”","“Faction Master, I don’t agree either!”","“We all don’t agree!”","“We must avenge the Taixi Faction!”","The elders were indignant since no one had ever dared to show any disrespect to these three factions for the last thousands of years. But today, one of the factions was almost razed to the ground!","It was outrageous!","The two Faction Masters looked at each other with bitter smiles on their faces.","“You... you can’t enter!” At this moment, a terrified voice came from the door.","“You...”","“Report!” Several disciples guarding the door came in with reluctance and reported, “The masters of the different factions are here... We can’t stop them anymore!”","With a large group of elders and elite disciples behind them, the masters of Jade Hill Mountain, Linglang Mountain, Dragon Sea Daoist Palace, and the other big factions came into the room with fierce expressions on their faces.","“Guys, what do you want?” The elders of Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain stared at the intruders with cold eyes.","In a bright green robe, Jade Hill Mountain Master looked extremely gloomy with veins bulging on his forehead. “I seem to have heard someone say that they want to avenge the Taixi Faction?”","“Do you have any objections?” The red-robed elder looked at this group of people in disdain. In his mind, these people were useless and fought for small interests. Even if they gathered, they were nothing in his eyes.","However, this group of people was unified today; it was an unusual sight. Jade Hill Mountain Master waved his arm and yelled, “How dare you! Beat him for me!”","“Attack! My Linglang Mountain will throw caution out of the window! We trusted you Three Saint Gates so much, but you did such shameful things and treated us this way!”","“Beat him! Beat anyone who dares to avenge the Taixi Faction!”","Today, the useless factions in their eyes shared a mind, which dumbfounded even the masters of the two saint factions.","“What...What’s happening?!”"]},{"number":382,"title":"Chapter 382 - The New Items in the Shop","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hu... You mean you are using this kind of force now?!” Shui Xianyun had been on the ‘Instant Noodles Treatment’. After picking up noodles with her chopsticks, she didn’t eat but talked about Orochi Divine Light with amazement on her face; she didn’t wake up from the amazement until a while had passed.","“Yeah,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said with a nod.","“You mean... we can learn it too?”","“Of course. This shop has all kinds of ultimate techniques. The technique that the shop owner used is one of them.” The Xichi Spiritual Master drank up the soup of the instant noodles. “I must go now; Yun’er is calling me to play the King of Fighters.”","“...”","“It doesn’t feel right...” Having eaten instant noodles for several days now, Shui Xianyun said in bafflement, “How come both the spiritual essence and the demonic essence in my body are being purified right now? It just removed the impurities from the demonic essence but doesn’t get rid of it.”","“What should I do?!”","“Cackle...” At this moment, a black cloud floated by with gloomy laughter. “This shop can’t solve your problem, but I can. Now that you’ve gotten a part of demon physique, only I can help you!”","“Go away!” Shui Xianyun had the urge to throw the bowl of instant noodles onto its head.","Although she didn’t do that, she did punch it with her fists.","“Stupid Demon, do you think you can block the shop owner’s Divine Light?! Even at your prime, what percentage of Youquan Demon’s strength do you have?!”","“Auch... You dare to go against me! I’ll gather my spiritual essence and punish you for good!”","It took a deep breath and sucked in spiritual essence in anger.","On the other side, Mr. Fang glanced at the energy bar under the teleportation array. “Ugh? It increased again?”","...","– Meanwhile, in Mr. Fang’s Qzone –","A section in Mr. Fang’s living room was turned into a compartment to accommodate about 10 arcade machines. “It is okay if you can’t afford to buy the game. Come to my place, and you can buy one token with 15 gold coins. Insert the token, and you can start playing the game!”","Mo Xian walked in with Shui Xianyun and found many players in the compartment. A white-haired old man (Nalan Hongwu) was sitting on a bench with a purple-clothed young man (Song Qingfeng ), moving the joysticks wildly.","Clap! Clap! Clap! With sweat popping out on his forehead, Nalan Hongwu slammed his big hand on the gamepad.","Song Qingfeng controlled Iori Yagami and shouted, “Kuzu Kaze, Strong Punch, and Shiki Aoi Hana! Aya!”","“Light jump! Low kick!”","“Are you stunned?” Smugly, Song Qingfeng used Iori Yagami’s desperation move.","Clap! Clap! Clap! Clap! Nalan Hongwu shook the joystick wildly as if he could get out of the difficult situation by shaking the joystick and smashing the buttons.","Right now, Shui Xianyun was watching them play from behind, and Mo Xian whispered while her face twitched, “Let’s go and watch others play; this senior is a newbie.”","Nalan Hongwu’s face turned dark, and he was at a loss for words.","Soon, they walked over and stood behind Liu Ningyun and Xichi Spiritual Master’s seats.","They heard Liu Ningyun introduce the game, “You must come here to play the King of Fighters and learn the most proper combos. Master, I’ll show you how to play it.”","Then, she stared at the screen with a serious expression. “Look at my fat opponent; his name is Chang Koehan. Watch how I use a combo on him!”","“Okay!” Xichi Spiritual Master watched earnestly.","“This fat guy’s moves are very lethal, so we must dodge first and find a chance to fight back.” While Liu Ningyun explained, Chang Koehan on the screen smashed a chain hammer at her character.","“See? I’ve found his attack rhythm,” Liu Ningyun said while controlling Kyo Kusanagi, “Then, I will dodge and...”","Before she could finish her words, the big fat guy on the screen caught Kyo Kusanagi who tried to dodge and smashed him onto the ground right away with vicious force!","“I was careless... It was an accident... Let me start again!”","Thud! Thud! Thud!","“Ms. Liu, you are great at playing Chang Koehan.” Lin Shao and the others came over and glanced at the screen while saying blithely, “You took out Kyo Kusanagi without losing any HP?”","Liu Ningyun instantly blushed. “...”","Xichi Spiritual Master: “...”","Shui Xianyun: “...”","“Maybe... I’ll go and find the shop owner,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said hesitantly, “I heard that his skills in the King of Fighters are awesome.”","Liu Ningyun gritted her teeth and couldn’t say much.","...","– Meanwhile, at the tea table in the lounge of the Half City Shop –","“I heard that Dajin had won another war?” A mystical-looking young man with white hair and white clothes was eating spicy sticks while sitting on the couch.","“Yeah... They won the war by a landslide.” Black Demon nodded repeatedly. Despite the fact that he had gained a tremendous growth in his cultivation strength, he didn’t dare to show any disrespect to this young man.","The young man looked about 18 years old, but he had been at the top position among the forces in the inner city while the Reincarnation King’s Reincarnation Palace was still a small force in the outer city.","Black Demon explained, “They even used... em... some sort of communication warfare, and one of the methods they used came from our Half City. They used it on their new communication jade which could release special waves and tricked the combined army of dozens of forces. Who could have imagined this method of warfare if we didn’t hear it from them?!”","“By the way, they even allow us to purchase the findings of some of their research projects!”","“Purchase what?” The mystical-looking young man waved his hand and said, “If they can do it, we can do our own research as well. You just show me how to play it. They say that there is better stuff in there, right?”","“Ugh...” Black Demon froze for a moment and then said, “No problem!”","Then, he beckoned at a couple of Black Demon Guards and said, “Summon some guys, and we’ll go and rob the Pacific Bank! Get a few more Kurumas!”","“Rob? Bank? Kuruma?” The young man looked at Black Demon in bafflement while eating spicy sticks.","“Yeah! This is the fastest way to make money!” Black Demon said in high spirits, “When we have enough money, we can afford to research lots of stuff. I heard that the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had begun producing crystal cars!”","“I got it now... I’ll bring more people to rob this bank thing!”","“Let’s go and drive cars!”","“...”","...","Obviously, after watching Mr. Fang’s livestream, many players began playing the King of Fighters, and the sales of this small game had reached 900 and was still growing. The compartment for the King of Fighters in Mr. Fang’s Qzone was full of players shaking the joysticks and coming and going.","Meanwhile, curious about Dajin’s miraculous victory against the invasion, many forces began to study their tactics. As news spread, the sales of Grand Theft Auto 5 shot up again.","At this moment, Mr. Fang looked at the wheel on the System Interface and saw three items, three movies, and four games on it.","“Final Fantasy VII Advent Children? A Chinese Ghost Story? Devil May Cry 3? Onimusha 3? Resident Evil 3, Godly Weapon Fragment, Celestial Bean, random Bloodline Elixir...” While looking at the games, movies, and items, Mr. Fang began to turn the wheel.","“Bloodline Elixir?” Mr. Fang was tempted. “This is good! If I take it, no one will dare to criticize my poor talent anymore!”","One round, two rounds, three rounds...","Mr. Fang stared at the wheel when it stopped. “Devil May Cry 3.”","“...”","Meanwhile, a prompt appeared on Mr. Fang’s system interface. [The number of players for a single small game reaches 1,000, and you have achieved the accomplishment – Bringing in a Fortune Each Day. You got an achievement gift bag. Do you want to open it?]","[Open]","[You’ve obtained: Red Bean Milk Tea! (only sold in winter)]","Mr. Fang: “...”"]},{"number":383,"title":"Chapter 383 - Very Satisfied","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– At Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain –","The two faction masters have their hands full right now. The elders who clamored to avenge for the Taixi Faction were now surrounded by dozens of masters of various major forces. Despite the elders’ high strengths, they were outnumbered. After all, these elders were at the same level of the four elders of the Taixi Faction, Xu, Chen, Cang, and Dao, which meant that they were not extremely powerful.","The elders could play dumb, but the masters of the two saint factions didn’t dare to play dumb after hearing these masters recount the whole incident.","After Duyou Holiness created this scandal by trying to suppress a force, they couldn’t possibly butcher all the cultivators on the continent just to shut them up.","After all, as the faction masters of saint factions, it was wise to protect their own factions even though their Daoist friends were killed.","“Guys, to protect his personal interest and due to his distorted mind, Duyou Holiness made a huge mistake. Now that he is dead, and his accomplices were killed, I hope you guys can put this whole thing behind you,” the purple-robed, old Daoist said, “Due to our limited cultivation strength and lack of time, we weren’t able to discover his wrongdoings in time and thus can no longer call ourselves Saint Factions. From now on, we’ll cultivate in seclusion and...”","At this moment, their top priority was to appease these angry people. Otherwise, the elders who had clamored to avenge the Taixi Faction would be beaten to death by these furious cultivators.","“What kind of damn situation is this...” The two faction masters looked at each other, both appeared to be having headaches. Avenge? They would be thankful if they could get out of the current situation unscathed.","...","[Red Bean Milk Tea: 6 crystals/cup.]","Mr. Fang glanced at the introduction on the System Interface which said that the red bean in the milk tea was a top-quality spiritual crop from a plant named Fire Thorns, and it had a natural rich fragrance. The milk tea powder was ground from a black tea which had been cultivated after experimenting for generations and produced with many exquisite processes...","It even had a detailed explanation of the milk powder and the meticulously selective diary product. As for the water for making this milk tea, it was the volcanic cold rock spring water specially provided by the System, and this water had been used in making Sprite, Coke, and instant noodles.","While reading the introduction that comprised over ten lines of words, Mr. Fang wondered, It’s just milk tea. How can you make it sound so awesome?","...","Half City was gloomy and chilly, and its snow came earlier than Jiuhua City in the winter.","When Fang Qi opened the shop in the early morning, the snow outside the door was already thick. When one stepped into it, the snow could cover up to their ankles.","The warriors and cultivators could resist the severe chill by circulating the qi or essence in their bodies. Some high-level spiritual garments contained arrays which could adjust temperatures. For cultivators, the winter didn’t bring them many inconveniences, no matter how cold it was.","Zou Mo was shoveling snow in the street in front of the shop with Saint Spirit Sword Techniques. Despite the heavy snowfall, the business in the shop was as good as usual. While many of the customers were cultivators, the number of warriors in the shop began to grow, even though there were few of them in the Morning Star Sea Realm.","Black Demon, Yuanheng Pavilion, and the other forces had begun to recruit warriors. Since Nalan Hongwu almost killed Divine Palace Realm cultivators with Sword 23 at Taixi Faction, the status of warriors had grown in these people’s minds.","The cultivators in Half City used to look down upon this group of people, but now they began to put emphasis on them. At least for now, they realized the potentials of warriors.","The players living in Half City such as Ruan Ning, Xi Yue, and even Ning Bi from the inner city came very early to the shop in the morning. Now that some experienced players had mastered the sword control technique, all kinds of sword energies landed in front of the shop one after another.","“Ugh?” They blinked and looked up at the stairs leading to the second floor, nonplussed.","“Sir, how come your quilts fell down the stairs?”","“Ahhh! I’m so cold!” At this moment, a howl came all the way from the second floor to the first floor. A big pile of quilts was shivering at the foot of the stairs. “When... when are we going to Jiuhua City?! Achoo!”","A pair of red eyes peeked out from the quilt and gazed at Mr. Fang in hope.","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark. “What are you doing bundling yourself in Little Mo’s quilt?! Can’t you resist the chill with your spiritual essence?”","“I... I... Achoo!” It inhaled a mouthful of spiritual essence.","Then, Mr. Fang saw that the energy bar under the teleportation array grow again.","“...”","He kicked it back to upstairs and said, “You demons never die, right? Just take the cold as a way to strengthen your body.”","After this interlude, someone soon saw the new information written on the small blackboard. “Sir, what is red bean milk tea?”","“A new beverage.” Mr. Fang took out one cup and poured it for himself. Soon, a rich fragrance of milk mingled with faint tea scent permeated the air.","“It smells so good!” Ning Bi’s eyes brightened while she lightly licked her lips. “Sir, your food is always appetizing. If it continues, I’ll run out of money simply from buying the food in the shop. Can’t you sell it for less?”","“Will you run out of money because of food? What can poor people do then?” Mr. Fang saw through her and pointed it out mercilessly.","“Humph! You’re not fun.” She rolled her eyes at Mr. Fang. “I’ll take a cup.”","“One for me too!”","When they sipped the milk tea, the warm and silky fragrance of milk flowed from their mouths to their bellies and hearts.","“So delicious!” Pleased, Xi Yue sipped her milk tea again and sat down on the couch.","“It’s warm and cozy. Compared with Coke, this taste is more lingering.”","“Really? Is it... really so warm?!” A pile of ‘quilts’ came down shivering and looked at the people drinking milk tea with longing eyes.","Mr. Fang glanced at it. “Do you have money for it? If no, get out of here!”","“Who... who said that I don’t have money?! Achoo!” Then, one, two, three... six crystals were piled neatly on the counter.","“You still have crystals on you? How come I don’t know that?” Mr. Fang dragged over the ‘quilt’ and shook it as if he were shaking a piggybank, but no crystals came out.","“No more! No more! You can’t take any crystals from me!” With a series of scream, it was tossed aside by Mr. Fang, and it scrambled to pour itself a cup of milk tea.","Soon, a figure bundled in quilt sat on the couch. “Wow! It’s indeed warm! Hahahaha! I’m very satisfied with this... em ...milk tea!”","All the customers who were sipping milk tea were at a loss for words at the sight.","“Sir, what is Devil May Cry 3?” After all, it was quite rare for the shop to have two new items in one day."]},{"number":384,"title":"Chapter 384 - Devil May Cry 3","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[Devil May Cry 3 Virtual Reality Remake – 30 crystals for activation per person.]","“Is Devil May Cry a game in which we can beat devils or demons?” Baffled, the customers began to speculate. “We’ll be beating the devils and demons so hard that they will cry? Is this the reason for the name of this game?”","“Yeah. What’s this game about?” Upon entering the shop, Liu Ningyun immediately asked, “Is it like the Legend of the Sword and Fairy where we can kill devils and exterminate demons to support the Orthodox Dao?”","Obviously, she was interested in this genre.","Since the game’s name was Devil May Cry, Mr. Fang said, “You guys can just take it as a story about a half-devil.”","“Ugh... Half-devil?” Hearing the words upon entering the shop, Mo Xian involuntarily pulled her junior sisters further away from Ning Bi.","She whispered to Yuan Yan and the others, “It’s surely not something good.”","“Will we fall into Devil Dao by playing this game?”","“We’ll be in danger if we get qi deviation and fall into the Devil Dao in the game...”","“It seems like the shop owner is planning to play it himself now?” They watched Mr. Fang walk to Computer No. 1 with a cup of milk tea in his hand.","Meanwhile, the warriors and cultivators in Jiuhua City Shop had also noticed the new items of the shop.","Sitting happily at the counter, Jiang Xiaoyue poured herself a cup of milk tea before opening QQ. She was very pleased that Mr. Fang allowed her to move a computer onto the counter. [Boss, many customers are asking about the game ‘Devil May Cry’.]","Mr. Fang saw a loli’s avatar jump on QQ and immediately clicked it open. [Tell them that I’ll put the new game on the livestream.]","[Ok!]","...","Fang Qi glanced around the shop and saw that people were either playing the Legend of Mir 2, watching TV Series, or driving in Grand Theft Auto 5. Some were even playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and Diablo 2. It was quite lively in the shop.","“The shop owner is going to livestream the new game?”","It was still early, and some idling people were still lounging on the couches, eating instant noodles or sipping the newly-released milk tea.","Hearing that Mr. Fang would put the new game on the livestream, they immediately perked up.","“Another game with a weird name.” Sitting on the couch, Lan Yan looked at the big screen while eating instant noodles. “Ms. Nalan, what do you think this game is about?”","Nalan Mingxue said, “I hope it’s about warriors.”","After all, the previous released Grand Theft Auto 5 mainly featured potential spiritual artifacts, and Shu Mountain was undoubtedly about cultivators and their cultivation system. Warriors couldn’t relate, and it did little for them.","In other words, in the whole shop, only the King of Fighters and Wind and Cloud mainly featured warriors, but there was no virtual reality game focusing on warriors yet.","As a self-disciplined girl, Nalan Mingxue was eager to increase her strength.","“You’re right. It would be great if we have a game like the Legend of the Sword and Fairy but with a focus on warriors,” Lan Yan said, “But I guess it’s not plausible. After all, it’s usually cultivators who fight devils and demons, right?”","While they talked, the big screens were turned on.","Before them was a European-style building. The bright full moon rose high in the sky, giving the sky a weird blue color.","“You’ve heard of it, haven’t you? The legend of Sparda?”","It sounded like the beginning of a story while the smooth and reminiscent female voice brought the audience into that magical and amazing world.","“When I was young, my father would tell me stories about it. Long ago, in ancient times, a demon rebelled against his own kind for the sake of the human race. With his sword, he shut the portal to the demonic realm and sealed the evil entity off from our human world. But since he was a demon himself, his power was also trapped on the other side.”","Forgetting to swallow the instant noodles in her mouth, Lan Yan watched the fighting scenes on the big screen with widened eyes. After all, she was a girl who had never seen a real devil before, and she had never heard such stories before.","“No... Is this a story about a devil?!”","Liu Ningyun and Mo Xian were dumbfounded. Words like ‘Devil’ and ‘Saving humans’ were enough to completely flip their worldviews upside-down.","Subconciously, they glanced at the devil who was warming itself with a cup of milk tea while bundling itself in a big quilt.","No way! How can this thing save humans?","Baffled, they turned their gazes back to the big screen.","“Ahem! Why are you look at me? I don’t know anyone named Sparda!”","On the big screen, the calm but somewhat sentimental voice continued telling the story, “I never believed it. I thought it was just a child’s fairy tale. I discover that the so-called legend wasn’t a myth at all. Sparda existed. How do I know? Well... I met the sons of Sparda – Both of them.”","On the big screen, two figures became clear. One was a young man who looked handsome, valiant, and somewhat demonic; he wore a dark red coat and had a double-handed sword in his hands. The other looked 90 percent similar to the first young man, and he wore a blue windbreaker. They swung the sword and saber so fast that their movements were a blur to the audience; only the turbulent winds created by the movements of the weapons left grey arcs in the rain, showing that their swords had moved at an extremely fast speed!","Although they were both fighting at close-range with weapons, their combat styles were very different from those used by the warriors in this world. Without sword energies or even warrior qi attached to the swords, the winds created by the fast movements of the sword and the saber showed the audience that each move contained explosive strength.","The warriors in the audience were fascinated.","“Though the same blood of their father flows through their veins, the two battled each other fiercely like arch enemies. It seems as if they drive some twisted pleasure from this brotherly fighting.”","“But in the end... only one was left standing.” Like a lightning bolt, one of them pierced his sharp saber into the other’s chest.","“He died?” The audience gazed at the big screens without blinking, enthralled by the fierce and bloody fight.","“If these two little guys are like me... they can’t die.”","“But it seems that they are imposters; they don’t even have 1% of my power.” With that said, a devil sipped his milk tea smugly.","Then, the scene turned to sometime much later, and a white-haired young man walked out of a room in one piece.","“...”","“He’s indeed unkillable?!” It almost spat out the milk tea in its mouth!","Dante, the son of Sparda, was obviously the main character of the game.","The audience watched as Dante was raided by devils and demons in his own shop, and he was pierced by sabers, sickles, and other weapons. Then, he pulled out these weapons from his body before fighting his adversaries...","“F*ck!?”","“How come this guy is so awesome?!”","“He’s intact after being pierced like that?!”"]},{"number":385,"title":"Chapter 385 - Boast First","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Dante’s identity was like an investigator of mystical phenomenons. All his life, he had been fighting with supernatural demons and vicious devils, saving humans from the devils’ minions.","Of course, he didn’t plan to be a superhero. As a demon slayer and a descendant of a human and the legendary dark knight, his shop had not begun operation and didn’t even have a name yet. His main business was hunting the demons who had spread all over the human world.","His sword, a big one with a devil face engraved on the sword guard, was left to him by Sparda. It was named Rebellion since its owner had betrayed his kind to save humans.","It was a powerful demonic sword, and its thick body was excellent for close-range combat. However, when necessary, it could follow Dante’s mind and fly out to attack enemies.","Meanwhile, he had a pair of guns, Ebony and Ivory, which acted as long-range weapons.","“This guy can use guns?!” When Song Qingfeng and the others saw Dante accurately hit one of more than a dozen billiard balls that were sent to the air, and that the billiard ball hit another before it continued like a chain reaction until all the billiard balls were hit and struck the lesser demons who surrounded him...","“His marksmanship is... unrivaled!”","“This guy is so dashing!”","“How can one shoot so well! What technique is this?” Even Nalan Hongwu gazed at the big screen intently.","“He has the devil bloodline in his body.” Ning Bi looked very interested. “I’m surprised that he is the main character!”","After all, most of the cultivators in Half City were more scared of her than awed by her; some even repelled her unconsciously. However, now, she actually saw...","“I’m surprised he is the main character!”","Soon, it was time for Mr. Fang to control the character. The players watched as Mr. Fang swung the double-handed sword with whistling sounds.","Mr. Fang dodged an attack and appeared before a lesser demon in the blink of an eye, piercing the skeleton demon wrapped in a black robe and holding it up high with his sword. Then, he controlled Dante to jump high!","Fang Qi remembered that when he first played the game, he could hit the monsters repeatedly in mid-air in a combo. However, in the virtual reality version created by the System, Dante paused in mid-air while he launched several attacks at lightning speed before smashing his heavy sword down into the monster’s face!","Crack!","With a huge noise, the sword hacked the hard skull of the skeleton demon into two halves before cutting deep into the hard ground as if it were a piece of tofu!","Meanwhile, a devil on the side hacked a sickle toward Mr. Fang.","“Be careful!”","“This monster launched a sneak attack!”","“So sneaky!”","While people exclaimed in alarm, Dante spun the two handguns, Ebony and Ivory, in his hands, and the audience saw some energy gathering at the end of the gun barrel.","Not ordinary guns, they were guns that could kill demons.","At this moment, the sickle was almost about to cut into him with vicious force.","Boom!","Mr. Fang pulled the trigger, and a bullet shot out like a cannonball with red light, sending the demon flying backward with its sickle!","“This is...?”","The audience looked at each other. “The guns can be used like this?!”","Obviously, Dante had attached some demonic energy to the bullet, which was why this shot was so powerful.","The audience saw a new possibility that they had never imagined before.","Of course, it was not that they hadn’t thought of it, but that the ordinary guns couldn’t achieve this effect.","However, these were the guns for people with real cultivation strength!","Then, the double-handed sword that was as tall as one man hacked down viciously!","Boom!","It cut both the demon and the wall behind it into two halves!","The sword didn’t show any spiritual light, but Dante put all his strength into swinging the sword.","However, this horrifyingly powerful sword swing showed the viewers the ultimate fierceness of close-range combat!","The combat method of using the big sword and guns alternatively was unheard of before. At close range, he struck with his sword; from a distance, he used the guns. The movements were as smooth as flowing water. It fascinated not only fans of guns but the warriors who used cold weapons; they were all eager to try this battle method.","“This kind of combat is so enjoyable to watch!” Even the cultivators including An Huwei voiced their appreciation.","The Hell Vanguard managed the dead in Hell; they were the grim reapers that even the residents of Hell feared. Soon, Mr. Fang controlled Dante and killed his way out, and he encountered this demon.","“What’s this thing?!”","“It can teleport?!”","“It shouldn’t be teleportation. It moved very fast and disguised itself for one instant, which made it look like it teleported.”","The audience watched intently while this black-cloaked god of death hovered in the mid-air with a huge sickle in its hand; it kept disappearing and then appearing while its sickles struck from various impossible angles; each strike was lethal, and the viewers watched with their hearts in their throats.","“How come this monster at the beginning of the game is so strong!”","“Is it a boss?”","Intently, Mr. Fang controlled Dante to dodge the huge sickle that was coming from all directions; his dodges and counterstrikes made the audiences’ eye go blue and their heads become dizzy.","With even a small mistake, a huge wound would appear on Dante’s body.","The sword moved like shadows on the big screen while Dante moved in the ruins like a ghost, dodging and counterstriking.","“Awesome!” People like Song Qingfeng yelled in astonishment.","“This guy is f*cking good!” In the Half City Shop, people like Black Demon were also excited.","“What’s going on?” Ning Bi was baffled, wondering why these demons always fought at such close range.","From my understanding, we demons always use spiritual spells! Although our physiques are tough... how come they are fighting this way?!","However, while watching this enthralling combat, she tilted her head and bit her lower lip with her sharp teeth, looking hesitant. Should I use my strength this way as well? It doesn’t feel right though!","“Humph! He’s blessed with great strength but resorts to this low-level combat method like warriors.” On the side, the big demon said while sipping its milk tea, “Gulp... He’s indeed a weak junior left behind in the human world! He’s lucky that he didn’t meet me, or I would have sent him flying with one breath!”","Anyway, it was going to boast first."]},{"number":386,"title":"Chapter 386 - The Law of Time","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Dante’s elder brother, Vergil, who moved in the human world, visited Dante’s place. To gain more strength, he decided to awaken the power of their father, Sparda. While he searched for the forbidden book which contained the information about Sparda, he met Arkham who urged him to awaken the demonic tower, Temen-ni-gru, which had been sealed in the prehistoric times; this tower contained the portal leading to the demon world.","Under the setting sun, the ground cracked, and rocks surged up like waves. Looking down from the sky, the audience saw the huge city center consisting of all kinds of buildings which extended to the horizon.","In the center of these buildings, the ground suddenly cracked open, and a huge and grand tower slowly rose.","Wearing a blue windbreaker, Vergil stood on the tower. His chiseled face looked like a perfect demon statue under the setting sun, and the god of death lay on the ground behind him like an obedient pet.","Yamato, the name of Vergil’s katana, flashed, and he withdrew the saber without looking back.","Like a piece of garbage, the upper half of the god of death slid off its body and fell to the ground.","“This guy seems more powerful!”","“His saber technique is awesome!”","“So dashing!” people like Song Qingfeng yelled, “I want to play this game!”","Just imagine the scenario in which his saber flashes and the sneak-attacker behind him being hacked into two halves as he withdraws the saber!","It was super dashing!","A large group of people were watching the livestream in the Half City Shop.","“Do all the demons in this game engage in close-range combat?!”","“They don’t look weak at all!”","Baffled, they continued watching.","“Ugh? Can we learn techniques from the game?”","Soon, they saw Mr. Fang open the level-up interface and glanced at Dante’s techniques.","Mr. Fang had played it before, but in the virtual reality version where everything looked more real, he had to refresh his memory and get more familiar with the techniques.","At the beginning, Dante had four styles, each of which would change his techniques and move-set and affect the combat greatly.","The styles were Trickster, Swordmaster, Gunslinger, and Royalguard.","The Trickster style focused on agility and moving methods, which was similar to mastering footwork. It would enable Dante to dodge many attacks and get close to his opponents quickly, Also, he could dash in mid-air, scale buildings, and teleport a short distance.","The beginning level was level 1, and the players could level up by accumulating experience points through killing monsters in battle.","The Swordmaster style focused on the attacks of close-range weapons. This style would enable Dante to use powerful close-range techniques, and each melee weapon had its own style of attacks.","The Gunslinger style focused on the attacks of long-range weapons. It would allow Dante’s guns to launch very dashing techniques, such as Kalina Ann’s homing missiles.","The Royalguard style focused on defense, which required the players to have a high control of timing.","It couldn’t be used to completely block the damage coming from enemies alone. But if it were used at the instant when the enemies touched Dante, it could block the attacks and knock back demons without strong demonic energy as well as leveling up this style. Each successful complete defense would absorb the enemies’ attack, and the accumulated damage could be released onto the enemies, inflicting huge damage.","On the level-up interface, people saw that two styles at the bottom were greyed out, which meant that they couldn’t be activated at this stage.","[Quicksilver Style (not activated): it will consume Dante’s demonic energy and automatically stop when his demonic energy runs out.]","When it was used, all the people except Dante would move extremely slowly.","At this moment, the enemies’ attacks and movement speeds would be reduced to one-tenth of the normal speed while Dante’s speed won’t change.","[Doppelganger Style (not activated). This style can’t be leveled up, but it will consume Dante’s demonic energy and automatically stop when the demonic energy runs out. Can only be used when the demonic energy meter is more than three bars.]","When it is used, there will be two Dantes (one will be his shadow clone). The doppelganger will use Dante’s current weapons but won’t change weapons if the true form does. If the true form doesn’t change weapons, his doppelganger will use the same moves as the true form. The doppelganger will be invincible and possess the same damage as Dante.","“F*ck?!”","While the audience watched the combat, they were fascinated by this novel and powerful combat style. However, if they used this method on cultivators who were agile, far away, and knew the sword control technique, they would be at a disadvantage and forced into a passive situation similar to current warriors when they face cultivators in battle. Therefore, regardless of how powerful the strikes were, they were useless.","However, when they saw the Quicksilver style, they were stupefied, and their minds went blank.","“Is this...”","“Controlling time?! The Law of Time?!” The big demon who was sipping milk tea yelled, “What’s in this little guy’s bloodline?! He can even understand the law of time?!","“It’s something even I can’t access! Only the true kings of my kind have the right to understand it...” The cup of milk tea fell to the table. Fortunately, it was now empty, so nothing was spilled onto the ground. “What did I see?! It’s faked! Must be faked! Impossible!”","It was unimaginable! Just think about it; if a warrior combined teleportation with the control of time, even demons would be no match for this warrior, let alone cultivators!","Moreover, it would be more terrifying with a doppelganger, which meant that one could double their power. Besides, one of them was invincible!","Now remembering Dante’s horrifying hacking strike with explosive damage, people no longer thought that close-range combat was a disadvantage at all.","The people in the audience looked at each other and saw fear and shock in their eyes.","They couldn’t wait to try it.","Ning Bi said, “Sir! I want to play this game!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master followed, “30 crystals for activation? I’m leaving the money here; going online now!”","Black Demon added, “I’ll try it too!”","“...”","People like Mo Xian and Yue Yan had said that they looked down at this main character, but they quickly glanced at their master before looking at each other.","Shui Xianyun put down the crystals and said, “Junior Sister, wait! I’ll try it too!”","“Should we...” Mo Xian murmured, “Shall we try it as well?”","“Isn’t this guy a descendant of a demon? Will we experience qi deviation and turn demonic by playing this game?” Yue Yan asked.","“Did you see the shop owner experiencing qi deviation?”","“Let’s go! Hurry! We won’t be able to learn that so-called Law of Time if we’re slow! Don’t you see that Master and the others are playing it?!”","“Hey! Wait for me!”","When they arrived at the computer zone, the seats were all taken. Dazed, they asked, “Sir, are there any available seats?!”"]},{"number":387,"title":"Chapter 387 - Visitors from Three Factions","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Obviously, the game was so fascinating that some customers who had been engrossed in watching Mr. Fang play the game found that there were no seats available for them now since the others had grabbed them already; they had to stand behind the others and watch them play.","Although Devil May Cry 3 was a game leaning toward warriors, it didn’t mean that cultivators couldn’t play it. In fact, some cultivators had begun playing it already.","Some cultivators such as Shui Xianyun and even Ning Bi were considering if they should practice close-range combat techniques as well to increase their combat strength.","Soon, not only warriors but quite a few cultivators had begun playing the game.","-In Jiuhua City-","Song Qingfeng, the Royal Princess, the Second Prince, and other warriors had all grabbed seats anxiously to get online.","“What’s the hurry?” Xiao Lengyu, Li Xueyi, and other disciples from Shengjing Academy or Xiyi Academy, who had come late today and thus missed the livestream, were very curious.","“You don’t understand! It’s a new game!”","At this moment, two figures came to the door and looked inside before pushing open the door and cautiously walking in.","“Daoist Brother Li, is this the place?” The person who spoke was a snow-white female Daoist wearing white clothes and a jade belt, If Fang Qi were here, he would recognize that she was Ling Wanyin, the direct eldest disciple of the Yuxu Faction since he had met her at the Taixi Faction that day.","The other was a purple-clothed young man carrying a treasure sword on his back; he was Li Longyuan from Xuanzhong Manor.","“Humph! It doesn’t look like a dangerous place like the dragon’s lake and tiger’s den!” Li Longyuan said in a cold voice, “It’s just an ordinary shop.”","He pushed open the door and walked in.","“!!??”","“How come it’s so huge inside?!” His eyeballs almost popped out.","Although this shop was located on an ordinary street in Jiuhua City, it was full of cultivators and warriors including quite a few Divine Ocean Realm and Emperor Warrior Realm masters.","The customers each held a cup with a picture of red beans and milk on it in their hands, and a big straw was stuck in each cup. A white-haired senior sipped from the straw in full force, looking extremely intoxicated. The two newcomers hadn’t seen this expression on anyone else before.","“Ahh!” Elder Fu exclaimed after finishing his drink, “My Lord, this red bean milk tea is so good!”","“...”","Before they knew it, they walked to the counter and saw an exquisite loli.","“How can I help you?”","“Ugh...”","Li Longyuan whispered, “Master told us to gather information; we can’t draw attention to us by acting haughty!”","Of course, after witnessing the ‘Orichi Divine Light’ technique that day, even though they were the eldest direct disciples of two out of the Three Saint Gates, they had to keep a low profile and keep their tails between their legs in this remote country of warriors.","“We’ll take... em... red bean milk tea!” Ling Wanyin pointed at a passerby who had just poured himself a cup of milk tea and said, “Just like that one!”","“Right! Right!” Li Longyuan agreed and nodded. “One cup for each of us.”","“12 crystals for two cups.”","“So expensive?” Ling Wanyin mumbled.","“Not so expensive,” Li Longyuan said, “The spiritual jade marrows that we use in our factions are precious drinks that one can’t even buy with crystals.”","“The so-called milk tea can only fool these warriors of Dajin,” he whispered.","Then, he went over and poured two cups of milk tea. Not caring to try it, he said, “Let’s go and see what these guys are doing in this shop!”","“Hey!” At this moment, a golden-robed young man walked over. “Is this red bean milk tea in your hands?!”","“Yeah... what then?”","“You two have good taste!” The golden-robed young man waved his folding fan and said graciously, “From your looks, this is your first-time visiting in this shop, right? At first glance, you picked the shop’s new item for the winter, the red bean milk tea, that many cultivators crave for! Good choice! Good taste!”","“Oh?” Li Longyuan asked curiously, “Can you explain what you mean? Isn’t it just an ordinary beverage?”","How come cultivators crave for it?","“You may not know it,” the golden-robed young man said expansively, “But this red bean milk tea is made from red beans that aren’t ordinary, and the milk tea is from precious spiritual tea and spiritual milk mixed in a certain proportion; it’s rich but not greasy and has a lingering fragrance...”","They gaped at the golden-robed young man. “It is really that good?”","Li Longyuan sipped it subconsciously.","“Wow!”","Instantly, his eyes widened.","“Daoist Brother Li?” While holding her cup of milk tea, Ling Wanyin stared at Li Longyuan curiously, “What? Is it really so good?”","Li Longyuan took a deep drink. “Gulp... Gulp... Gulp...”","Soon, they could only hear the sounds of sucking on air.","“Daoist Brother Li?!” Even more baffled, Ling Wanyin asked, “How is it compared to the spiritual jade marrows in your faction? It’s not something special for us, right?”","“It’s all gone already?!” Before she could finish her words, Li Longyuan opened the cap and poured the red beans and left overs into his mouth.","“Burp!” He belched.","Ling Wanyin were dumbfounded by the extreme pleasure showing on his face.","“Hey! You gulped it down! It is a waste of this precious beverage!” The golden-robed young man stomped his foot in frustration. “How can you drink the milk tea this way?”","“Then, how should we drink it?!” Ling Wanyin’s interest was piqued, wondering how delicious this drink was that it had made Li Longyuan lose his composure?","Xiao Yulv explained, “You must put the straw deep to the bottom of the cup and sip the mixture of the red bean and the milk tea; the fragrances of the red beans and the milk tea combining and colliding in your mouth will create the best taste for you!”","“I didn’t know there is so much technique required in drinking milk tea!” Ling Wanyin sipped the milk tea following his instructions.","“!!”","She almost screamed!","“...”","Three minutes later, they each held a small tray with spicy sticks, instant noodles, and Coke on it. While enjoying the snacks, they stood behind one computer to watch this person play the game.","“Daoist Brother Li, I’m surprised that the delicacies in this shop are so delicious!”","“I wonder how good is the game that Gongzi Xiao mentioned.”","“It’s a pity that the house is full, and we can’t experience them now.”","“Don’t worry. We can enjoy the snacks while we wait in line for our turn,” Ling Wanyin mumbled with her mouth full while she sipped her milk tea and stuffed a spicy stick into her mouth","“Wow! The spicy sticks are so delicious!”","...","Meanwhile, Ning Bi and the others who were lucky to grab seats had begun their journeys in Devil May Cry 3."]},{"number":388,"title":"Chapter 388 - I lose if I fall","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This sword is so huge. How should I swing it?” While controlling Dante, Mo Xian held the broadsword ‘Rebellion’ with both hands and felt uncomfortable.","“Haya!” With a roar, she hacked the big sword forward but saw the small demon moving to the side weirdly.","The sword blade missed it by one inch, and it was intact.","Meanwhile, the other small demons surrounded her.","Seeing that a demon pounced at her with a sickle, Mo Xian copied the shop owner and spun the two guns in her hands very elegantly...","But they flew out and hit the demon in the face.","After the demon with the sickle was hit on the face by the guns, it roared and hacked the sickle toward Mo Xian’s head at a greater speed.","“Ahhhhh!” She hacked wildly with her sword.","“...”","It was clear that the Xichi Spiritual Master and the other cultivators were not doing any better. Although they could learn the basic sword techniques and shooting techniques that came with Dante while controlling him, the small demons’ damage, speed, and intelligence were not as low as those in the original version of the game. Even the residents in Hell, the lowest-level monsters, had cunning minds and high intelligence as well as battle abilities that ordinary people couldn’t match.","“Sir, how come this game is so difficult to play?!” Ruan Ning yelled already; she had just died at the entrance of Dante’s shop before meeting the Boss.","Mr. Fang said in contempt, “You are controlling the son of the legendary Dark Knight Sparda and got killed by some minions; you dare to tell me that the game is hard to play? You are just a noob.”","Ruan Ning’s face turned dark. “Scummy Shop Owner.”","“Should we follow Dante’s instincts and will and use the sword techniques accordingly?” a lazy voice sounded. On Ning Bi’s screen, she was battling with the Hell Vanguard.","“Of course,” Mr. Fang said, “If you don’t know the sword techniques and want to control the character with your own ideas to show-off, it’s natural that you will get killed by small demons.”","Then, he casually rolled his eyes at Ruan Ning and said, “Look at how smart she is.”","“...”","Obviously, the warriors in the Jiuhua City Shop didn’t have the same problem. Even Song Qingfeng and the others who didn’t have high cultivation strengths learned techniques and experiences from Dante’s moves; they could easily deal with these small demons.","“Ugh?!” While sipping milk tea, Ling Wanyin was watching the game from behind. “Daoist Brother Li, look at this guy! He’s so powerful! Is he a warrior as well?!”","On the screen, Nalan Hongwu controlled his character with ease while he swung the big sword with whistling sounds; he was so fast that his movements were a blur to others.","He watched all directions and heard all the sounds. When the Hell Vanguard silently appeared behind him, he turned abruptly while the sword vanished, leaving sword energies surging around. With the powerful demonic body and surging demonic energy, he could launch swift and heavy sword strikes at any moment. “Hahahaha! My swordsmanship is awesome, eh?”","He asked as if he had eyes on the back of his head.","The moment he said it, the Hell Vanguard god blocked Dante’s attack with its sickle, and the huge counterforce to this heavy hack send Nalan Hongwu stumbling back. Before he could regain his balance, the sickle hacked down at his head.","“Ahh! Damn it...” His face was covered in blood.","The two people who watched the game from behind froze.","After hearing Xiao Yulv’s brief explanations, they had barely understood what games were. They said in horror, “Are these warriors fighting with these horrifying monsters each day?”","Looking at the Hell Vanguard which floated around from left to right like a ghost on the screens, Ling Wanyin said, “Daoist Brother Li, look! Many of them are playing this game!”","“Should we... try this game later?”","In the Mr. Fang’s Group Tour chat on QQ, a new topic was brought up today.","Black Demon: [Anyone playing Devil May Cry 3? Where are you now?]","Tang Yuan: [I hate to say it, but this game is so hard to play. I haven’t gotten out of the shop yet.]","Song Qingfeng: [(Akita Inu’s cunning smile) I’m fighting the Hell Vanguard.]","Nalan Mingxue: [The Hell Vanguard is hard to fight.]","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu wiped the blood off his face and laughed, reporting in the group, [I’ve killed the Hell Vanguard! Anyone faster than me?!]","“...”","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was about to arrive at the gate guarded by Cerberus, the three-headed hell dog, without a word, but his movements and controls were a little strange.","Mr. Fang swung his sword upward and knocked up a huge monster that was holding a sickle.","This monster was obviously much stronger than the previous small demons. It had thicker skin and more HP, and it also moved faster and could teleport.","After slashing it into the sky, Mr. Fang murmured, “Drop hack... shoot... drop hack again... it should be like this, right?”","“How come I can’t connect the moves?”","Since all the virtual reality games followed the laws of the physics of the real world, the scenes in the original game where the monsters didn’t move after their bodies were pierced by various weapons would not appear in the remake version.","However, Mr. Fang was clearly undaunted.","While controlling Dante, Mr. Fang swung the big sword so swiftly that it became a blurry shadow. He hacked downward once before doing it again, and it seemed like two lightning bolts crashed down.","“In the new version, I have to drop hack twice with power to subdue the demon with my force, and I can then knock it into the air...” After his hypothesis was proven, he leaped up and hacked onto the demon in mid-air.","“Hack... and shoot...” After two strikes, Mr. Fang quickly landed.","“Ugh? I can’t do it...” In the original game, Mr. Fang could use the double-handed sword so well that he could make flowers out of it. But when everything followed the laws of physics, the moves that he used in the original version were no longer effective in the new version.","“Wait...” Mr. Fang thought about this problem while moving to the side to dodge another monster’s blade strike. My pause in mid-air wasn’t done right. Swift and powerful sword strikes can open the monsters’ bodies without causing too much momentum, but they will still fall to the ground. Also, the monsters of Hell have tough bones. There is no way that I can cut through their bodies without sending them flying...","The only solution is to strike its joints that are only connected by demonic energy, Fang Qi thought, Meanwhile, Dante can stay in the air a bit longer with the recoil force of firing the guns... Different from the original version, I must fire vertically down on the ground to obtain the largest upward momentum and achieve the longest pause in mid-air for Dante.","If the bullets are shot toward the ground, it would be best if they could bounce back and shoot the demons that I’m attacking to give them an upward momentum...","“I got it!”","Then, Mr. Fang controlled Dante to attack another demon.","With perfect timing, he launched two swift and heavy strikes and then knocked the monster up with his sword.","Then, Mr. Fang’s character moved so fast that it looked like Dante was twitching in mid-air. He was striking with his sword and firing his guns so fast that only afterimages and vague shadows could be seen on the screen.","At this moment, some nimble and clever players had killed the Hell Vanguard and passed the stage.","– In the chat group –","Song Qingfeng posted a screenshot. [I’m awesome! I killed the Hell Vanguard already!]","[It’s nothing. I did it long ago!]","Ning Bi also posted a screenshot. [I did it too!]","[I look up to you guys!]","[Advanced players!]","[Awesome!]","[Smooth!]","At this moment, someone yelled in astonishment in the internet café, “F*ck! How come the monster that the shop owner is fighting is not dropping to the ground!?”"]},{"number":389,"title":"Chapter 389 - Release – Grand First Show","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the blink of an eye, Mr. Fang struck out nearly 30 times, and the last Hell Sloth moved behind him with its sickle raised high!","Almost at the same time, Fang Qi controlled Dante to hack down at the Hell Sloth before him with vicious force while dodging the blade of the demon behind him.","By now, many players gathered behind him to watch him play. Now, the demon behind Mr. Fang struck down again after the first strike missed!","While controlling Dante, Mr. Fang seemed to be intoxicated in his own combat rhythm. With one foot stepping on a monster’s body, he slid out as if he were on a skateboard and fired his guns repeatedly, forcing the nearby monsters to retreat. During the process, he dodged their attacks with perfect timing!","In the end, he stomped on the elite monster under his foot, and it exploded into a cloud of demonic mist and shattered bones.","“Come on!” Under Mr. Fang’s control, Dante beckoned at the monster before him and taunted it mercilessly. Then, he slashed his sword abruptly. With a heavy sword strike, Mr. Fang knocked the last Hell Sloth out of the herd of demons and shot it onto the second floor.","Under Mr. Fang’s control, Dante repeatedly attacked the Hell Sloth that he had secluded from the herd of demons as if he were having a stroke. When the small demons followed him onto the second floor, Dante used the monster’s body as his skateboard and crashed down to the first floor while firing his guns wildly. The series of plays were dizzying to watch!","When Mr. Fang killed his way to the second boss Cerberus, the three-headed hell dog that was guarding the demonic tower, he had gotten proficient with the moves which were derived from Dante’s great strength and swordsmanship. After all, Fang Qi had his own deep understanding of the game, guns, and sword techniques.","“What’s the shop owner doing now?”","In Mr. Fang’s Group Tour in QQ, the players in the Jiuhua City Shop were baffled.","[I suggest you watch the shop owner play the game!]","[So powerful!]","[How powerful?] Nalan Hongwu was not pleased. [Kid Fang passed the Hell Vanguard, and so did I. What’s the difference?]","Yue Yan: [No. I feel like the shop owner is playing a different game compared to us!<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f622.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F622;\">]","Nalan Mingxue: [That strong? Don’t we all hack with the sword (Husky’s baffled face)?]","Su Tianji: [What’s this guy doing now?]","“Sir, don’t turn off the livestream!”","[Please, Sir! Continue the livestream for a bit longer!]","At this moment, Mr. Fang was leveling up his skills in front of the gate of the boss, and he noticed the boisterous group chat in QQ","“Okay...” Soon, Mr. Fang turned on the livestream, and a huge ice mountain appeared before Dante on the screen.","“Ugh? How come they are all watching the big screen?” At this moment, Ling Wanyin was busy eating instant noodles.","“Look!” Li Longyuan pointed at the big screen.","As if it had sensed the intrusion of an outsider, the ice mountain collapsed under violent shakes, and many huge ice blocks fell. A horrid demon with three heads walked out; it was as big as a mountain, and its whole body was covered in thick ice crystals.","This Cerberus didn’t only have great strength; it also excelled in ice-elemental magic spells, possessed great intelligence, and could speak the human language. Obviously, it was way more powerful than the Hell Vanguard.","It breathed out powerful chilly energy, which turned everything it touched into ice.","The horrifying chilly energy that it emitted could even stop the circulation of spiritual essence in the ordinary cultivators’ bodies!","It was another powerful demon!","“Do these guys fight this kind of monsters each day in the fantasy world?” Li Longyuan ate a spicy stick and said in a low voice, “Does the Shop Owner fight the monsters too?”","While swallowing down a mouthful of instant noodles, Ling Wanyin said curiously, “The character and the moves are the same; I wonder if the shop owner can play the game differently.”","Then, they turned their attention to the game on the livestream.","The Cerberus raised its heads, and intense, storm-like chilly energy rushed toward the tiny human before it.","The chilly currents swept across the ground, and Fang Qi soon had no place to stand on.","“Humph! This three-headed demon is smart for sealing the ground, knowing that this warrior can’t fly!” Li Longyuan said with a snicker, “This warrior looks strong but can’t fly. After all, warriors are far weaker compared to cultivators.”","The moment he said it, Fang Qi’s Dante jumped up high into the air and used the sword and fired the guns alternatively with swift movements while hovering in the air above the Cerberus’s heads. Ice debris flew from the heads of the Cerberus, and the ice crystal armor covering one of its heads was shattered by Mr. Fang’s swift, heavy strikes in the blink of an eye.","Soon, the other two heads slammed toward Fang Qi’s Dante, but he was already hovering in the air above another head of Cerberus with a red light flashing on his feet before striking and attacking repeated as if he were having a stroke.","In the original version, Dante couldn’t keep himself in the air for long by the recoil force of his guns. But now, Dante’s sword strikes produced a counterforce which added to the recoil force of the guns. With these two forces added, it seemed like Mr. Fang wasn’t going to land on the ground any time soon.","While striking and shooting, Mr. Fang explained, “Will I fall to the ground? No way. Look! It’s still spitting ice on the ground stupidly, but I just won’t fall to the ground.”","“Cough, cough, cough...” Ling Wanyin choked on a mouthful of milk tea, and her eyes instantly opened wide as if her eyeballs would pop out.","Li Longyuan almost dropped the spicy stick that he had just picked up!","The other two heads of the Cerberus launched attacks toward Mr. Fang crazily. However, the latter shot at the wall, and the recoil force helped him quickly fly away. Then, a dark-red magic array flashed beneath his feet, enabling him to jump in the air as if he were stepping on land. He doubled jumped in the air and turn to another direction, and sword strikes followed.","Soon, the ice crystal armor on all three heads of Cerberus was shattered by Dante’s wild attacks, which had also inflicted many wounds on the heads!","Undaunted, the Cerberus took a deep breath and spat again!","Mr. Fang had just landed on the ground, and he jumped up again and said, “What do we call this? I call it a moron who doesn’t learn from his mistakes.”","A series of wild strikes followed.","After several rounds, the Cerberus finally gave up its strategy of sealing the ground. With a roar, all three heads rapidly pounced at Mr. Fang!","Finally landing on the ground, Mr. Fang suddenly made a defensive move.","Then, a white light flashed abruptly.","Royalguard Style—Release!","This was a special defense technique which could absorb the enemy’s energy using perfect defense and return it to the attacker.","Although Fang Qi’s Royalguard Style didn’t have a high level, it was enough!","Everything happened in a flash. After the white flash disappeared, distinct horrid wounds appeared on all three heads of Cerberus. Before the audience could understand the situation, Cerberus fell to the ground with a sad howl.","“Da F*ck?!”","“What happened?!”","“Is this the end of the battle?!”"]},{"number":390,"title":"Chapter 390 - Can’t Do It Even After the Lesson?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The audience had been astonished that he could remain in the air for a long time and even perfectly dodge the attacks while doing so; they weren’t expecting a more stunning last move!","Obviously, the last strike was more powerful than the previous ones.","The most shocking to them was that Fang Qi’s Dante was intact and not injured at all under the attacks of this powerful demon.","Moreover, how come their Dante didn’t have these moves?","Just like what Yue Yan had said, “I feel like the shop owner is playing a different game!”","“You’re not a human, right?” Cerberus looked astonished.","Each of Dante’s weapons had an extraordinary background. For example, his first sword ‘Rebellion’ was left to him by his father the legendary dark knight.","Before Dante was another weapon.","The demons or demon beasts only submitted to great power. After Cerberus was defeated, its huge mountain-like body shrank slowly until a heavy tripartite nunchaku hovered in the air while emitting vague blue light.","The rods were like four-edged icy crystals. The moment that Fang Qi touched the weapon, he felt the powerful ice energy inside. An ordinary person would have been frozen into an ice statue upon touching it.","On the screen, Dante whistled and swung this weapon swiftly, making the others feel dizzy.","“Daoist Brother Li,” Ling Wanyin whispered with the bowl of instant noodle in her hands, “This guy seems... very powerful.”","Li Longyuan’s face twitched. “How come warriors can be so powerful?”","“It’s said that a warrior had broken the Four Symbol Grand Array, and he was only at the early stage of the Emperor Warrior Realm...”","Li Longyuan was at a loss for words.","All of a sudden, he felt like this shop presented a brand-new world to him; he was very unfamiliar.","How can warriors be so powerful?","Soon, the Game Interface gave the ranking for the entire gameplay for this level: [S]!","This game had a stylish ranking system, and the players would receive a ranking after clearing each stage.","The ranking would affect the rewards that each player reaped at the end of each stage.","In fact, it was a mechanism similar to the synchronization rate. From the interlude animation, people could see that Dante had a showy personality; he liked to show off his skills, and each of his moves and battles was dizzyingly dashing but very effective and to the point.","The better that players could use this kind of combat style, the higher synchronization rate with Dante they would obtain, thus getting more rewards such as more cultivation strength and experience points.","Under Mr. Fang’s S Ranking, people saw that the number of red orbs and stylish points was several times higher than what they got after killing the Hell Vanguard!","However, when Mr. Fang killed the Hell Vanguard, he got an A+ ranking, which was only a little higher than their rankings. Compared with Nalan Hongwu’s ranking of A-, Fang Qi received only a few more red orbs and stylish points.","“How come the gap is so big?!” They were dumbfounded. If they copied Mr. Fang’s combat style and obtained such a high ranking, they would achieve a tremendous increase in their cultivation strengths!","Even the grandmasters such as Nalan Hongwu would obtain an obvious increase in their cultivation strengths!","Besides, the virtual reality version was made according to the real world, which made them wonder if these moves could be used in battles in the real world","Their breaths began to slightly quicken.","“Sir! How did you do those moves?”","“How could you stay in mid-air for so long?”","“How did you use the last move? How come we don’t have it?!” After all, they all played the same character, and their levels were not too different. Ning Bi gazed at Mr. Fang’s screen and quietly asked, “Can you teach Big Sister?”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","They also wondered about the move which protected him from his enemy’s sudden powerful attack and afflicted great damage to the latter!","This combat technique was so powerful! If they could master it and use it in the real world, the warriors would get stronger under the attacks of their enemies, not vice versa. In this situation, the cultivators who couldn’t find a good solution to this technique wouldn’t dare to cast their spiritual spells. Otherwise, they would be killed by their own attacks!","“Kid Fang! Can you explain it to us?!” Nalan Hongwu yelled and sent a bullet comment onto the big screen.","“It’s simple,” Mr. Fang explained to the audience while the livestream was still on.","In virtual reality, Dante’s downward sword strike combined his own strength, the sword’s weight, and the demonic energy to increase the gravitational pull, which was why the force in the downward strike was much more powerful than the ordinary ones.","It explained why the damage of this strike was extraordinarily powerful, and why Mr. Fang killed the boss so quickly while everyone was watching, but they were stuck and had to take half a day to kill the Hell Vanguard in the first stage.","Mr. Fang continued to explain, “All of you know how to leap into the air and hack down, right? It is Dante’s downward strike.”","Then, he demonstrated the downward strike by putting all the weight on the sword and empowering it with his demonic energy to achieve great momentum. He quickly left a deep cut on the ground in the demonic tower.","Then, Mr. Fang continued to explain, “First, we need to use the complete downward strike onto the monster and then change the property of the demonic energy in the body to leap up. I believe you can all do that, right?”","With that said, he controlled Dante to demonstrate. While leaping into the air, he used only the recoil force of the two guns to keep him in the air for a long while before falling. This was the knowledge contained in Dante’s character, and all the warriors could have learned it long ago.","However, while Mr. Fang explained it, most of the people subconsciously had a bad feeling.","He told them that it was easy, but it didn’t sound so easy to them!","“When we knock the monster up into the air with the sword, we must precisely cut the sword into the monster’s joints, which will give the minimum momentum to the monster’s body. If we apply this technique to humans or animals, we call it ‘painless autopsy’...”","“!!??” Ning Bi and the others looked at each other. After all, most of them couldn’t even hit the monsters yet with their swords, and he wanted them to cut into the monsters’ joints without error?!","“While Dante is in mid-air, it is the best time to strike with the sword; I believe you all have witnessed his strike. However, we can’t land on the ground while striking,” Mr. Fang continued, “Instead, in the instant when the sword cut through the monster’s body, we need to withdraw the demonic energy that we used earlier to increase the weight and dropping speed before turning it into the light-body energy which will enable us to hover in the air with the assistance of the recoil force of firing the guns. Then, you shoot downward.”","Then, they watched as Mr. Fang found a monster to demonstrate the strike, shot, strike, shot...","On the big screen, the character had struck his sword over ten times in one instant as if he were having a stroke.","All the people were speechless, and they felt hopeless and desperate.","It must be noted that striking with the sword would happen in a flash, and so would firing the guns in mid-air. In this moment, they also had to convert demonic energy in their bodies!","They must repeat these moves again and again while their bodies rose and fell repeatedly.","More importantly, they had to strike with their swords with maximum force!?","How can a human do all these?!","Damn it! Are you a demon?!","Wait! This Dante seems to be a demon...","“Then, what about the white light at the end?!” Many people intently stared at Mr. Fang on the big screens, putting all their hopes on the next technique."]},{"number":391,"title":"Chapter 391 - Heaven or Hell","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Several conditions were required to use Dante’s sword strike and gun moves in the real world. First, the users’ bodies had to be strong enough to withstand two conflicting and alternating forces. Second, these people had to have powerful physical strengths and granular control. Lastly, they had to have insane sword attack speed and gun-drawing speed.","Besides, they need to have a handgun which could fire quickly and provide a great and stable recoil force.","Only when all these conditions were met could one achieve Dante’s stroke-like attack speed and launch heavy strikes while remaining in the air.","In theory, it could be achieved.","Of course, it was only in theory. After all, many people couldn’t even do it in the game, let alone in the real world.","Anyway, no one could master a technique in one try.","“What white light?” At this moment, the people put their hopes on the last horrid move with which Mr. Fang’s Dante ignored his enemy’s powerful attack and unleashed explosive damage.","“The move that killed the Boss!” Many players watching from behind Mr. Fang yelled in frustration.","“Tell us now! How come we couldn’t find this move?” They played the same character, so how come Mr. Fang had so many dizzying techniques but they didn’t?","These techniques were very powerful!","“You mean Release?” Mr. Fang opened Dante’s Skill Interface and pointed at the column of battle styles, saying, “This is even simpler!”","The Royalguard Style was indeed a simple battle style since it was easy to use in battle; the players just had to block the enemies’ attacks the moment before they deal damage, perfectly fending off the enemies.","This was Dante’s special battle technique which could store the enemies’ energy into his body when perfectly blocking the enemies’ attacks.","Mr. Fang explained, “Use this technique of Dante, you can release the charged energy with your own strength at the same time. Just like this.”","A demon pounced at Mr. Fang at this moment. With a white flash of light, it was instantly killed, leaving red orbs all over the ground!","“So easy?!” Everyone looked at the big screens, feeling like it was a bit too simple to believe.","“I feel like... it’s different from the move that you used on Cerberus,” Liu Ningyun said with a frown.","“Right!” Mo Xian stared at Mr. Fang and said suspiciously, “Sir, did you keep something from us? When you attacked Cerberus, you moved extremely fast, and your body left afterimages. But you didn’t do it just now.”","“You mean that one...” Fang Qi decided to explain it in detail so that he wouldn’t be bothered with this question every day by these people. “It’s because there are three forms of Release.”","The first one was the direct Release; it was an attack that only players who didn’t master the essence of this technique, and it had low damage.","The second level was the Royal Release right before the enemies’ attack. By launching this technique, the players could afflict great damage to the enemies while interrupting their attacks; only players who mastered a portion of the skills could use it.","The last one was called Ultimate Release, which was used at the very moment when the enemies’ attack was almost upon the players. This technique not only contained the Royal Release’s power but could block and absorb the enemy’s offensive energy and convert it into life power for the players! In other words, the enemies’ attacks would be neutralized, and the power of the players’ release would increase!","Only the Ultimate Release was fast enough to leave afterimages while being engulfed in white light. Since it had greater power, its attack was quicker and could cover a greater distance than the others.","“There are techniques this powerful?” People felt as if a gate to a new world of close-range combat opened to them, and they looked at each other in shock.","This technique sounded easy, but it was very risky to use, like licking the blood on a blade.","If a small mistake was made with the timing and they allowed the enemies’ attacks to hit them, the result was obvious!","On the other hand, this highly risky technique could bring players great benefits if it were launched successfully.","With this technique, it would even be hard for Cerberus, which had powerful life energy and a tough physical body, to survive one strike from Dante!","The Royalguard Style was powerful and even horrid, and it was not difficult to use. All that players needed to do was block and then release.","However, the Ultimate Release wasn’t a technique that ordinary players could use!","If it was successful, the players would be like a god in Heaven. If it wasn’t, the players would be like a human punching bag in Hell.","All the people fell silent.","The good thing was that they could practice the Ultimate Release in the game. If they practiced it in the real world, it wouldn’t be enough if they had thousands of lives.","“I advise you not to try the Royalguard Style until you have accumulated more battle experience and cleared stages several times.” Mr. Fang wanted to give out tips with a good heart, but the people already swarmed to the computers and rushed toward the demons.","Soon, the internet café was filled with screams of players who were being beaten and killed by demons!","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","To use the Ultimate Release, the players must be very proficient with the block technique of Royalguard and had tremendous battle experience and terrifying battle awareness. Otherwise, the players could only use the normal release and be ordinary, or they had to risk their lives and try to use the Ultimate Release by luck.","In fact, the Ultimate Release that Mr. Fang had used had an element of luck in it.","After Cerberus was severely wounded by him, Dante only needed to use Royal Release to end the battle. Since he was intact and had full HP, he wasn’t afraid even if the Ultimate Release failed; the worst scenario for him was trading some HP with Cerberus, and he would have killed the monster while losing some HP and not die.","Without any burden on his mind, he caught the right moment and launched the Ultimate Release successfully.","...","At this moment, the cultivators such as Mo Xian were still struggling with the basic combos let alone the high-level techniques such as Release. However, this didn’t affect them much. After all, without the Royalguard Style, they could still show off in other ways!","After all, leaving other things aside, Dante had many fancy, dashing, and effective moves to show off with!","“Sir, can you teach us something simpler?!” Completely lost, people like Liu Ningyun and Mo Xian came back with tears on their faces.","“Okay!” Mr. Fang controlled Dante to deal with the last two elite demons. He chose one of them and repeatedly hacked at it. Then, his arm swung the sword and pierced out many sword shadows before he shot at the ground again and again in mid-air. Lastly, he stepped on the demon’s body like he was standing on a skateboard and skidded around the place before crashing the other demon to the ground with a corpse of the demon below his feet.","While he played, the audience behind him screamed one round after another.","“So powerful!”","“We can play it like way?!”","Their eyes were red with envy; they were eager to learn.","Remembering their simple strikes... They never knew that battles could be this fancy!"]},{"number":392,"title":"Chapter 392 - Came from Across the Ocean","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Heavy snow lasted several days in Half City, but it didn’t dampen the customers’ enthusiasm.","After Mr. Fang demonstrated all kinds of high-level techniques and showy plays, the customers in the shop had a new topic added to their daily conversation.","With cups of milk tea in hand, Yue Yan and the other disciples of the Nanhua Faction quickly looked around, trying to find more than ten seats for their senior brothers and sisters, junior brothers and sisters, masters, and even aunt-master to sit together.","As the earliest customers from outside Half City who were brought here by Liu Ningyun, they usually followed the shop owner’s footsteps and played the newest stuff in the shop.","Soon, elders and disciples of the Nanhua Faction sat in a row with bowls of instant noodles or cups of milk tea in their hands. The first thing that they did was opening the game of Devil May Cry 3.","“Master! I thought hard for a whole day yesterday and came up with a combo!” While opening her game, Yue Yan said in excitement, “I feel like it will be even more powerful than those used by the Shop Owner!”","“Really? Are you serious? You came up with a combo?” Mo Xian rolled her eyes at Yue Yan and said, “Our master doesn’t use combos; she studied Royalguard all day yesterday and will continue today.”","“Oh...” Yue Yan had turned to another direction. “Aunt-Master Shui, do you want to see my new combo?”","...","Different from Origins Internet Café, the peaceful life which had lasted thousands of years in Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Faction was disrupted.","According to the ancient documents in the three saint factions, besides this huge continent, there were distant remote celestial islands on the sea outside the continent. There were cultivators and also all kinds of small mortal countries that would pop up frequently and quickly fall. Since there were many unknown dangers and risks in the vast ocean, those cultivators rarely had contact with the cultivators on this continent. Instead, those cultivators formed a system of their own, and they had also existed for many years.","It was clear that some ancestral masters had braved the rough ocean, took the high risks, and passed through the sea territories controlled by many terrifying fierce beasts. In the end, they drifted to that sea realm which was primarily comprised of the sea with islands scattered on it.","As a result, the three saint gates had recorded the customs and detailed information of that sea realm, and it was noted that it was a cultivation world as big as their own with grand masters of the Divine Palace Realm.","This was an area that the three saint factions had known about.","They also knew that this cultivation world wasn’t weaker than them, but the gap in strength between these two worlds wasn’t that big.","About 1,000 years ago, they even got the information that the other cultivation world was almost destroyed by a demon catastrophe, and it was highly unlikely that they had recovered their previous strength and even surpassed the three saint factions in only about 1,000 years.","However, the ancient documents also recorded that true immortals who lived in that realm had been to this continent as well, and they called this area the ‘Deserted Sea Realm’ and had even created teleportation arrays that led to their own mystical cultivation world.","It was said that in that mystical cultivation world, there were spiritual mountains, rich soil, and beautiful plants and flowers. Spiritual beasts flew in the sky, and spiritual plants grew all over the land. In that world, not only humans but demons had their own nations as well.","People all thought that the reason why the three saint factions could surpass other factions in cultivation techniques and spiritual spells without fighting over any spiritual mountains or treasure cave abodes with them was that they had the access to the Cultivation Realm. In fact, there was another reason for their dominance, which was that they had once had dealings with those distant cultivators and obtained huge benefits.","This was the only teleportation array that led to a place outside the Deserted Sea Realm. However, it couldn’t be used since a long, long time ago; it seemed to have been destroyed from the other end. As a result, the regions beyond the Deserted Sea Realm had become a legend among the high-level cultivators in the three saint factions. If not for the catastrophe in the Taixi Faction, they would have probably still taken it as a myth. After all, many years had passed, and the last group of disciples and elders who were teleported to the other end had never come back.","Who knew if the world on the other end still existed or not?","In the long river of time, the teleportation array had become a dead array. As time passed by, it was moved to another place for study.","If the building storing these ancient documents was burned down in a fire one day, perhaps the successors would soon forget this piece of useless history, and everything about that period would vanish in the river of time.","“Longyuan, Wanyin, you’re the most valued and talented disciples in Xuanzong Manor and the Yuxu Faction. With the Taixi Faction severely damaged, we’re in a crisis and have many issues on our hands, which is why we entrusted this task to you. I hope that you won’t disappoint us,” the Daoist of the Yuxu Faction who was wearing a white robe and a jade belt said slowly.","“How did your investigation go?” The purple-robed old man of Xuanzhong Manor stared at Li Longyuan and Ling Wanyin and asked succinctly, “Are they related to the people recorded in our ancient documents? Did they make things difficult for you?”","“No, they didn’t,” Li Longyuan answered, “But the stuff in this shop is indeed weird and amazing. They also have many delicacies such as milk tea and spicy sticks...”","Soon, the two disciples recounted all the snacks and games that they experienced.","“The newest and the most popular game they have now is Devil May Cry 3, which is a tough test for one’s control and skills. Although the game mainly focuses on warriors, cultivators can play it too.” When he got to the good parts, Li Longyuan talked while demonstrating Dante’s wicked sword techniques and fancy combos in the grand hall, thinking that it was very dashing.","The two faction masters looked at him and were at a loss for words.","...","Their report and demonstrations lasted half a day. After they were gone, the two faction masters looked at each other. “What do you get from their report?”","“The Law of Time?”","While murmuring these four words, they fell into deep thought.","...","There were demons in this world.","While humans usually cultivate for less than 100 years, demons cultivate for at least hundreds of years. Except for the royal members of the Demon Clan, the other demons must cultivate a long time before they could transform into human forms.","It took demons much longer time to increase their strength compared to humans, Likewise, the powerful demon clan usually enjoyed very long periods of power spikes.","Whenever a powerful demon master rose, it would bring a very long time of prosperity to the Demon Clan.","Of course, the Demon Clan’s degree of prosperity was much inferior to that of humans.","Demons were more like hermits in spiritual mountains, enjoying the life in the auspicious cave abodes hidden in all kinds of places and lingering in the ancient relics. In contrast, humans were more like explorers and conquerors, focusing on acquiring more land for generations without getting tired.","Humans usually lived in prosperity and luxury while demons enjoyed beautiful scenes and things that were rare in nature.","However, some demons liked the prosperity in the human world and came to the human civilization after transforming into their human form.","In the vast ocean, the dark sky merged with the dark water; it was dark all around. Right now, it seemed like a storm would come at any moment.","A majestic man wearing a silver robe with golden embroidered patterns stood on the ocean waves with a black-patterned heavy ji in his hand.","[TL Note: Ji, a Chinese polearm, is a hybrid between a spear and a dagger-axe.]","He bobbed up and down on the waves as if he were standing on boat, and the surging black waves underneath couldn’t affect him at all.","Soon, several huge ocean beasts rose from the bottom of the sea, and they were extremely respectful to the man and didn’t dare to do anything reckless.","They looked humble naturally as if this man was their master, and they were his subordinates.","With a deep voice, he seemed to be asking something, but it wasn’t any human language that was used on the continent.","His deep eyes gazed at the distance while a huge piece of land appeared from the horizon."]},{"number":393,"title":"Chapter 393 - The Demonic Energy","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang’s process in the game was always faster than the others. Whenever he played Devil May Cry, there were always a large group of people standing behind him to watch.","For cultivators, this game was indeed difficult. Just like the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, the main character in this game possessed powerful sword technique and combat abilities which could be used by the players. However, this wasn’t a game for ordinary people since Dante and the demons’ attack and movement speeds had been restored and altered to their original level.","For example, inside this ‘Temen-ni-gru’ demonic tower, the Gigapede, which was the boss after Cerberus, could control groups of lightning bolts and lightning balls. With this giant demonic centipede’s powerful demonic energy and talent, it took little time to cast spells.","In the original game, the lightning balls moved very slowly, probably less than five meters per second, and it could be easily dodged by any ordinary warriors in the shop, let alone Dante.","However, the lightning balls in the remake version were different. Lightning balls could move at an unimaginable high speed of more than 20,000 kilometers per hour in the real world, so it obviously followed the same speed in the game.","For the cultivators, it was difficult for them to deal with these situations with the methods of warriors.","Although the cultivators couldn’t use these techniques, they were eager to watch Mr. Fang play. Different from the warriors in Jiuhua City who were working hard, practicing their skills, the cultivators in Half City were more interested in watching.","At this moment, Divine Ocean Realm cultivators such as Black Demon and Tang Yuan, ordinary cultivators such as Mo Xian, and even Ning Bi were standing behind Mr. Fang and watching him play, each with a cup of milk tea in their hands.","A quilt also floated in the air. “I... I have high hopes for this guy. He has the presence as a member of our Saint Clan!”","Then, it sipped the milk tea and said, “Damn, why is it so cold?!”","Since Mr. Fang didn’t turn on the livestream, a large group of people gathered behind him.","This devil tower was occupied with many horrid demons, and Dante encountered many battles in there. During the process, he acquired many weapons as well.","For example, there was the Moon Goddess Gun ‘Artemis’, a demonic gun which could fire demonic energy arrows.","The creation principles of this gun were clearly different from that of the modern science guns; it was a real demonic gun.","While the science-based guns in Counter Strike, Resident Evil, and Grand Theft Auto 5 were basic guns, Ebony and Ivory, Artemis, and Lady’s, a heroine in the game, powerful guns such as the multi-functional missile launcher gave the cultivators a clear direction for making advanced weapons.","These firearms each had their own combat style.","For low-level cultivators, regular guns were like god-tier weapons since they consumed little strength and unleashed great power. But for grand cultivators, these weapons could offer little help in major warfare, which was why they rarely used guns in their battles.","However, the situation would change if they could produce the guns and combat styles shown in Devil May Cry 3.","Mr. Fang controlled Dante to move forward while he got even more experienced with the battles in this game.","While his techniques leveled up slowly, he could use many more combat styles, such as the Royalguard Style’s Air Block in mid-air and the Gunslinger Style’s various fancy shooting movesets.","After defeating the two headless knights of fire and ice who were known as Agni and Rudra, Dante acquired the Ice and Fire Dual-Saber which were transformed from these two headless knights.","“These two sabers can even talk?!” The audience was pleasantly surprised when the terrifyingly powerful dual sabers asked Dante to take them with him after being defeated.","Dante was thinking if he should bring them to play. After a moment of consideration, he said, “Okay! But you two are not allowed to speak!”","While he said that, he picked up the dual sabers that were engulfed in red and blue flames respectively. While he used them to strike, the red and blue flames danced in the great hall, forming a huge red-and-blue firestorm!","Exclamations rose from behind Mr. Fang.","The first battle with Vergil was even more astonishing. Vergil wanted to open the demonic tower and the portal connecting the human world and the demon world. As a demon slayer, Dante inherited his parents’ love for humans, and he had a human side to him deep down in his heart even though he didn’t admit it.","Driven by their fates, the twin brothers with opposite personalities began their first battle on the top of the demonic tower.","The soaring demonic tower was so high that it looked like the highest point of the world. It felt like the huge full moon hung beside the demonic tower, looking so near as if one could touch it by reaching out their hands.","“So, this is a so-called cozy family reunion, eh?” Dante was still sarcastic and playful while Vergil looked cold and solemn like a merciless demon with his katana in hand.","Dark clouds drifted over and vaguely covered the moon, and the wind fluttered the hem of his blue windbreaker while saber light flashed!","Yamato’s saber light was brighter than the moonlight, making the moon further away lose its glamour.","Obviously, Vergil was more powerful than Dante, and he revealed a small part of his frightening saber techniques in this battle.","Compared with Dante, Vergil’s saber techniques were more orderly and disciplined. He drew and withdrew his saber like an elegant aristocrat who showed great power with aplomb.","“How come I feel like this guy is more dashing than Dante!”","“Someone is more dashing than Dante?! Where?!”","More people came over.","“So fast!”","Vergil’s katana was not only fast but was able to explode the Hell Vanguard which was hard to kill, causing demonic energy to disperse into the area. Vergil’s saber looked like a death blade!","The audience felt like they were watching a fascinating movie instead of a game.","Of course, since Dante hadn’t learned the Demon Trigger yet, he was no match for Vergil in this battle. However, at the end of the battle, even from the screen, the audience could feel the frightening explosive power that Dante unleashed after he controlled the demonic energy in his body.","Obviously, this game was not only enjoyable to play; the viewers behind Fang Qi were having a thrilling time as well.","“Is this demonic energy?”","“Humph! This little guy’s power is still not as great as me, the Saint Lord! Gulp...” Above their heads came the sound of someone drinking milk tea with a straw."]},{"number":394,"title":"Chapter 394 - This Is a Teleportation Array, Not a Weapon","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In fact, the cultivators didn’t fear the strength of demons but rather the unknown.","In the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, they could experience Li Xiaoyao’s near-immortal power in person. Now in Devil May Cry 3, they could experience the power of demon bloodline, which was something that they had never imagined before.","While they played the game and watched Mr. Fang play the game, they gradually understood Dante’s personality. Dante was optimistic, had a good sense of humor, remained calm before crises, and had his own principles; he was more like a human even after he had awakened his demonic power.","However, his twin brother was more like a cold demon who was proud, admired power, and would do anything to achieve his goals.","However, different from the cultivators of the major factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm and the cultivators and warriors of Dajin, the local players in Half City liked Vergil more.","His disregard for trivialities to achieve his ambitious goal, aristocratic temperament, and great power enthralled them. Of course, his slight short-sightedness due to the crazy pursuit for power wasn’t that negative in the grand scheme of things.","Meanwhile, the two cultivation worlds had begun studying the weapons in Devil May Cry 3.","Dante had five close-range weapons. Besides the sword ‘Rebellion’, the other four were the loot he got after subduing or defeating powerful demons.","For example, in front of Dante, there was Nevan, a vampire witch who had red, wave-like hair and wore a black long dress.","Devil May Cry 3 had a totally different focus from other games. The Legend of the Sword and Fairy focused on fate and love; Diablo 2 focused on the fun of combining items with various properties with techniques; Grand Theft Auto 5 focused on a novel lifestyle; Devil May Cry 3 focused on combat.","Yes, combat.","While Grand Theft Auto 5 satisfied the needs of most of the chill and relaxed players, Devil May Cry 3 satisfied the needs of the avid fighters.","The vampire witch before Dante didn’t only have the traditional vampirical ability of transforming into a bat, but she could also summon powerful bats as shields. More importantly, she could control lightning.","Obviously, Mr. Fang got even better at playing the game, and he gave the audience a visual feast.","The witch’s powerful and swift attacks of bat shadows were almost all blocked by Dante with Royalguard.","Then, the bat witch summoned frighteningly powerful lightning currents which swept all over the room.","With clinking explosions, Dante remained intact while the attacks of this witch were so fast that everything became blurry, and his demonic energy continued to grow.","In the booming lightning flashes, Dante remained still and firm like a mountain, which showed the audience his frightening strength again.","As the combat styles leveled up, they would reveal even greater power, including styles such as Gunslinger and Swordmaster","But clearly, the Royalguard Style tested the players’ control of timing more than others.","Fang Qi had accumulated a lot of battle experience in the various cultivation rooms and became more familiar with the combat styles through constant fighting. Besides, he had played the original version of the game and thus knew most of his enemies’ attack styles and methods. For example, he perfectly knew how to deal with the witch’s sucking of HP.","His control of Dante had perfect timing, and the audience held their breaths while watching the fascinating battle. In fact, everything was so proper that people felt like it was Fang Qi fighting the monsters personally.","Maybe, it could no longer be called a battle, but an enthralling symphony of sounds of lightning and winds created by the sword. For Dante, perhaps it was only a beautiful dance party under the moon.","On the screen, the white light and red light mingled and exploded!","The demonic power under Demon Trigger was instantly unleashed. Together with the power of the Release, all the charged demonic energy was directed forward like an erupting volcano!","Demonic energy surged up like a turbulent flood, and the audience saw red and white light exploding on the screen!","Immediately, the red light shrank, and the exploded demonic energy was withdrawn after appearing for only one moment; the Demon Trigger was stopped.","The bat witch was now already lying on the ground.","The audience was silent.","After a long while, they finally found their voices and shouted, “What was that play?!”","“It was Release while Demon Trigger is activated.” Mr. Fang waved his hand calmly. On the screen, the bat witch had become a dark-purple electric guitar in Dante’s hands, and he played a piece of heart-throbbing electric guitar rock-and-roll music!","The rock-and-roll music wasn’t something that the cultivators and warriors could accept; it was way too modern.","However, a large group of them had heard many songs such as Glorious Times and Vast Ocean and Open Sky in Mr. Fang’s Qzone while playing the King of Fighters; they had gotten used to this kind of music.","“Awesome!”","“So thrilling!” Exclamations came one after another from behind.","“...”","Obviously, it was another powerful weapon.","Despite their great powers, these weapons couldn’t be copied since each of them was a powerful demon; the most that they could achieve was a mimic version.","At this moment, the demon bundled in the quilt found that the cultivators around it were looking at it with a weird look.","It seemed like they were looking at this demon as if they had just discovered a new continent!","“???” It was just looking at the screen on which Dante was playing his newly-acquired electric guitar, and it suddenly shivered. “Why are you staring at me?!”","“Do you think this one can be transformed into a weapon?” Yue Yan whispered.","“I think so,” Mo Xian whispered back, “Aren’t they the same kind?”","“What weapon do you think this one can transform into?”","They continued the discussion in low voices.","The demon shivered.","Mr. Fang explained, “This is a teleportation array, not a weapon.”","The demon said, “Right! Right! I’m a teleport...”","He paused while he was speaking, feeling like something wasn’t right.","“I say, Old Demon, do you have a relative or something?” Ning Bi suddenly giggled with a strange light flashing in her bright green eyes as if she had just discovered a gold mountain.","“No! I have none!” It almost stomped its foot even though it was a cloud now"]},{"number":395,"title":"Chapter 395 - From Old Devil Fang to Sensei Fang","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Due to the lack of materials, the cultivators couldn’t make these close-range weapons, but the guns were not restricted by this condition.","Dante also had five kinds of guns.","Handguns.","Shotgun.","Moon Goddess Gun – Artemis: it was a laser gun empowered by the demonic energy, and it could shoot purple laser beams. It had many kinds of attack methods including launching light balls that could trace the enemies.","Spiral: a powerful sniper rifle.","Kalina Ann: a multi-functional missile launcher borrowed from the heroine (the missiles had the thermal-homing capability).","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","People like Jun Yangzi and Li Haoran sat together and observed the guns. Jun Yangzi controlled Dante. When demonic energy gathered at the muzzles of the two guns and created red light, he fired.","Boom! A giant wave of red light shot out from the muzzles, and the bullets sent a demon that jumped at Dante flying!","“These guns are excellent!” Jun Yangzi studied the guns in his hands with appreciation while nodding repeatedly.","...","Meanwhile in the Half City Shop.","Almost every day, even if Mr. Fang didn’t play on the livestream, the people who had finished playing games or were waiting for their turns would gather behind him.","When he turned on the livestream, the audience was bigger.","Some of them were full of questions for him.","“Sir, how did you use Devil Trigger with Release? Also, I saw you keep withdrawing the Devil Trigger after using it when you are killing small demons; why did you do that?” These questions came from Mo Xian.","“I simply used Devil Trigger together with Release; I used the Devil Trigger combo when fighting the small demons.”","“Sir, how come I can’t defeat the headless knights, Agni & Rudra? Do you have a simpler method?” the Xichi Spiritual Master asked.","“The simpler method is to change to another combat style; don’t use Royalguard all the time,” Mr. Fang said. Then, he thought, You are a cultivator and want to use Royalguard? You are looking to get beat.","“Sir, can we learn Devil Trigger with Release?” Ning Bi asked earnestly.","“In theory, if you have a pent-up force similar to demonic energy, you can learn it.” The powerful demonic energy was stored and suppressed in Dante’s body, so he could live his life like a normal human.","The more suppressed the energy was, the more powerful it would be when it was released, which was why Dante’s strength could afflict great damage to everything around him like a storm once he activated Devil Trigger.","Then, Sensei Fang demonstrated the Devil Trigger combo, and he was now attacking a blood bird.","Mr. Fang who had turned into Sensei Fang said, “Cultivators rely on spiritual spells to fly. Likewise, the birds need to flap their wings to fly. Now, I’ll demonstrate the combo with this blood bird.”","He flipped up the bird with his sword. The moment before it fell to the ground, the demon bird had begun recovering its balance. In another instant, the demonic bird would regain its full balance, flap its wings, and fly away.","Under Fang Qi’s control, Dante activated Devil Trigger, and the demonic energy that was gushing out from his body swept toward the demonic bird, making it look like a small boat in a turbulent ocean. It couldn’t even control its own movements, let alone fly out of Fang Qi’s attack range.","All this happened in the blink of an eye!","Meanwhile, Fang Qi’s sword slashed out rapidly like a storm!","The moves were done in sequences seamlessly; they would be flawless even if they were used in the real world.","Fang Qi continued to explain, “I always heard people complain that they couldn’t hit their targets since they couldn’t cast the more powerful combat techniques quickly, or that they could only suppress enemies with lower cultivation strength and couldn’t lock down the ones with fast speed?”","“Now, I’ll teach you guys a very useful combo.”","Fang Qi stabbed his sword forward, and it was perfectly blocked by an elite demon.","However, Sensei Fang wasn’t surprised; he unleashed powerful demonic energy, forcing the demon that was in a defense mode to retreat, Meanwhile, he charged his strength and slashed out his sword forcefully before the demon could regain its balance.","The sword energy strike that brought powerful demonic energy hacked the demon into two halves and sent them flying for ten meters, leaving a deep cut in the wall.","“Remember, you must use your brain when fighting. If you are not sure that you can hit the demon, you must create an environment that can allow you to.”","“Ugh...”","“You seem to have a point.”","“Wait! The problem is that we don’t have demonic energy in us!” Some of them suddenly realized this problem.","How could they use the combo in the real world?","“Hahahaha!” The usually despondent Shui Xianyun suddenly burst into hysterical laughter.","“Senior Sister, what are you laughing about?”","“I’ve found a good use for the demonic energy that can’t be removed from my body!” Shui Xianyun had been troubled by this, but now she realized that she must practice hard in Devil May Cry 3 to take advantage of her special talent!","The others were silent with frustration, wishing that they could grow some special energy inside their bodies.","Despite their frustration, they knew that it was something that they couldn’t’ force to happen!","They had to think of another way. For example...","“Sir,” many people asked eagerly, “How do we unlock the Quicksilver Style?”","At this moment, Mr. Fang had killed his way to the 12th mission, and he was standing before the demonic horse, Geryon.","Geryon was once a horse of legend ridden by countless heroes, but now it was a demonic beast who had learned spells to control time in its long life. It was now pulling on a carriage full of weapons and battling alongside it.","Fang Qi’s Dante waved the big sword in his hand and stared at the demonic horse that was emitting blue flames. “Today, I’ll become a horse trainer.”","With his excellent combat techniques that were getting better, Mr. Fang’s Dante couldn’t be stopped by this demonic horse. After some of his dazzling plays, the demonic horse had turned into a blue flame hovering in the air.","Blue flame of time!","Then, the audience saw many boulders collapsing and falling from the ruined underground arena while a mysterious force spread out swiftly in all directions from Dante.","Suddenly, all the falling boulders and everything around them began to move very slowly as if time had stopped.","“So powerful!”","“Is this the force that can control time?!”","The magical scene stunned everyone, making them temporarily lose the ability to speak.","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly heard a prompt from the System, telling him that he had received a new task.","[New Task: Building Internet 2","Task Target: Open branches in new and unknown places and build cross-regional internet","Task Reward: Godly Weapon Fragment","Task Time Limit: 40 days","Additional Bonus: Cross-regional teleportation (Usage: once)","Additional Bonus: Gaming Cultivation Room (Usage: three days)]","The second internet building task began."]},{"number":396,"title":"Chapter 396 - He Is Your Big Brother?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“That girl is indeed here.” A man wearing a silver robe and a golden belt gazed at the high city walls of the moderately grand city and the bustling crowds.","“Mortals?” He frowned.","“The Deserted Sea Realm has the largest number of mortals,” someone said from behind him, “After all, it’s a... em... abandoned place.”","The man waved his hand as if he didn’t like this topic. “The top priority is finding the little princess... Besides, we must make the least possible contact with people in the Deserted Sea Realm, understand?”","“Yes, Your Highness.”","...","– In Jiuhua City –","The situation with the Jiuhua City Shop was different from before.","It was livelier than the Half City Shop; the mild climate was only one of the reasons.","Another reason was that Jiuhua City was a place cohabited by ordinary people, warriors, and cultivators, so it had busier streets and a bigger population compared to Half City.","The Jiuhua City Shop was located in the residential area of ordinary people.","Each Monday and Tuesday night, some nearby civilians would gather in the shop to watch the TV Series, Jade Dynasty, and Wind and Cloud. After all, the broadcast of TV Series was free.","Even though they could only see the plot and couldn’t get increased strength, it was far more exciting and interesting compared to the stories told in the restaurants.","In the city, almost every resident could retell a part of Jade Dynasty and was very familiar with the names “Wind God Nie Feng” and “No-Cry Death God Bu Jingyun”.","Since the major factions outside Dajin corrected their mistakes and no longer forbad their disciples from learning and making friends in Origins Internet Club, the shop was always packed.","People began waiting in line from the early morning.","The Royal Princess in her long black royal dress was reading an exquisite, colored, hard-cover book. A red demon face was printed on the black cover – Diablo 2.","“What are you reading?” The Fifth Prince plunked down on the couch beside her with two cups of milk tea and handed one to the Royal Princess.","“The last volume of the official hardcover edition of Diablo!” While sipping the milk tea, she continued reading the book. “Although I haven’t played the game yet, the story is fascinating... Following the Dark Wanderer’s footsteps, they fought their way to the Hell Forge and destroyed the soulstones of the lords of Hell... This is a legend of heroes that we can only see in the myths.”","She asked casually, “Didn’t you play this game?”","“Yeah... But in the game, we must experience Nightmare Difficulty to see the real Hell,” The Fifth Prince said with a shake of his head, “I have just passed the easiest Normal Difficulty. The higher I go, the more difficult it will be. Anyway, only Duke Nalan and a few others are playing Hell Difficulty. It’s really hard.”","“It’s said that in Hell Difficulty, players have no restrictions and can use any martial art techniques or spiritual spells and combat techniques that they have learned in the shop. Is that true?” the Royal Princess asked while turning to another page.","“Almost. They have gotten used to using skills such as the sword control technique with the energy in the game. Despite all this, they still can’t clear the stage yet; they are all stuck in Act II.”","Obviously, in Hell Difficulty, Diablo 2 had fully reinstalled the original power for Andariel, Duriel, and the three mighty lords of Hell. For most of the players, even if they were equipped with powerful items and had high skill levels, they would be hindered if their own cultivation strengths and realms were low, and the game progress would be very slow.","The Royal Princess sipped the milk tea while she read the end of the official novel of Diablo 2. Baal and its demon legion were finally defeated by heroes, and the polluted Worldstone was also destroyed. Despite the destruction of the demon legion, the home of the Barbarians was also destroyed together with the demon legion at the Worldstone Chamber. The whole world plunged into chaos after the destruction of the Worldstone.","After closing the book, the Royal Princess sat on the couch and looked at the sunshine outside the shop, slowly savoring the content. I wonder what lives the heroes will have in the future. Will the only surviving Barbarian hero rebuild his homeland?","I wonder if there are more stories about them... She curled her lips while she thought about it. Then, a tall figure came to the entrance of the shop and blocked the sunshine that was shining through the glass door.","The shop was bustling with people, and it wasn’t strange to see customers going into the shop. After all, as the shop’s reputation spread, many disciples of major factions and forces including the three saint factions came to visit the shop, which explained why some strange faces would occasionally show up outside the shop.","However, Royal Princess Ji Yu found that she couldn’t tell what cultivation style this man had. Even though this man didn’t try to hide his aura and presence, she couldn’t connect the mystical sensation to any factions or forces.","There was a mysterious and proud sensation on him, and she didn’t know how to compare that to the people of the three saint factions.","The most puzzling was that this man released an aristocratic presence, which wasn’t ostentatious but could be felt in each of his casual moves. It was an innate nobility deep in the bones.","He was about 30 years old and was wearing a silver robe with luxurious golden embroidered patterns. Looking at his bigger-than-usual size, Ji Yu suspected that he was a warrior, but then she found that the contour of his face was softer than the tough features of ordinary warriors; he didn’t look like a weathered warrior but a well-maintained cultivator.","He was flanked by two men who looked like his guards.","“Who’s this guy?” The Fifth Prince whispered.","“No idea.” The Royal Princess frowned. “How come I feel like he isn’t here to get online?”","“Is he here to make trouble?”","“Make trouble?” Hearing these two words, the other cultivators sitting on the couches looked over.","While they stared at the newcomers, the latter was staring at them as well.","They saw some seniors inside with bowls of instant noodles in their hands or spicy sticks between the chopsticks in their hands.","Lan Mo, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance Master, was sipping milk tea with a straw. Noticing the situation around him subconsciously, he looked up with widened eyes.","Su Tianji slurped on the instant noodles and got a mouthful. Then, she looked up nonplussed. “What’s wrong?”","“What’s happening?”","Everyone suddenly fell silent.","“Your Highness,” the two guards glanced around the shop and said, “This place feels weird.”","“Uh huh...” The silver-robed man nodded.","Instantly, the atmosphere got tense.","“Are these three guys here to make trouble?” Su Tianji asked with a mouthful of instant noodles; her question couldn’t be heard that clearly.","“Master... I think it’s highly likely! Slurp!” Fenghua replied while eating instant noodles as well.","“With me sitting here, who dares to make trouble?!” With a snort, Nalan Hongwu sipped his milk tea and instantly sighed in pleasure, feeling a warm flow of essence enter his body.","Then, he stood up from his seat.","Before he could speak, a small head stuck out from behind the computer on the counter. She blinked her big eyes and said, “Big brother?”","“Royal... Little Sister?!” The man looked pleasantly surprised.","“Ugh?!” All the people who were brewing for a fight froze.","“Is he your big brother?!” They all gaped at Jiang Xiaoyue."]},{"number":397,"title":"Chapter 397 - Have to Go to school?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I didn’t know that Xiaoyue had a big brother.”","“Strange... How come I never heard of it before?”","“Yeah. They don’t look alike...” Everyone looked at the guy before them up and down.","Jiang Xiaoyue immediately selected all the cute pictures of her on the desktop before uploading them into a private folder in QQ.","The icon of QQ, which was a penguin wearing a red scarf, was jumping. She quickly clicked it open and saw that Mr. Fang was still talking to her about the combo and techniques in Devil May Cry. She sent a message to him. [Boss, we’ll talk later (Husky’s cute face).]","Then, she jumped out from behind the counter.","Not sure about the situation in this shop, Jiang Xuan cut to the point with a solemn expression, “You just slipped out without a word. Do you know that in the past year, our fa...”","He had wanted to say ‘His Majesty’ but quickly changed to, “How much our Lord Father has been worried about you.”","“Ahem!” Nalan Hongwu lightly coughed and said, “This girl has stayed in this shop for a long time without seeing any dangers or being bullied. You can rest assured about that.”","“I know that!” This man’s manner and tone were impeccable, but perhaps due to his innate nobility or some other reasons, he sounded proud and cold.","“I’m afraid that it’s beyond the abilities of the cultivators of the Deserted Sea Realm to bully Little Lady,” the two guards sounded contemptuous.","“Ugh?”","“What Deserted Sea Realm?”","They all looked at each other in puzzlement.","However, it didn’t stop them from hearing the slight and contempt in the tone.","Many people slightly frowned.","Jiang Xuan stared at Jiang Xiaoyue and said, “You’ve been outside for so long. It’s about time to return.”","Hearing the word ‘return’, Jiang Xiaoyue was instantly displeased. She said with a pout, “No! I don’t want to return to that cold and quiet place!”","More importantly, she wouldn’t be able to play games and eat the delicacies of the shop if she returned!","Jiang Xuan got serious. “With your identity, you shouldn’t have stayed with these cultivators.”","The two guards also tried to persuade her. “Little Lady, how can you stay in this nation of mortals? With your status, it’s not right for you to stay here. Please come back with Young Master!”","Jiang Xiaoyue averted her face, refusing to go.","“Our Lord Father talked to Master Long of the Heavenly Academy and enrolled you for the spring term next year.” Jiang Xuan shook his head and said, “I’m on your side, but our Lord Father wants you to return and go to school in Heavenly Academy.”","“Go to what school?” Jiang Xiaoyue was even more reluctant and said in a loud voice, “I don’t want to go to school! I have been fine staying here; why should I go to school?”","Jiang Xuan said solemnly, “The enrollment in Heavenly Academy is very important; if you don’t go, the consequences will be huge and not only affect you!”","“No! I won’t go!” Holding her arms before chest, Jiang Xiaoyue was stubborn and yelled, “Why must I go? If it’s important, Dad can go to school himself!”","Jiang Xuan’s face twitched.","“Are you serious?”","“I don’t want to go! I won’t go!”","“Huh...” At this moment, Su Tianji said, “If this girl doesn’t want to go to the...em... Heavenly Academy, she can stay here. Why must she go there?”","“Yeah...” Lan Yan muttered, “I’ve never heard of the Heavenly Academy before. If she must go to school, she can go to our Lingyun Academy. With her talent, Xiaoyue will definitely be put in Class A.”","“Right!” Jiang Xiaoyue agreed to this suggestion immediately. “If I must go to school, why can’t I go to Lingyun Academy? Why must I go to the Heavenly Academy?!”","“Lingyun Academy?” The three newcomers looked baffled. Jiang Xuan asked, “What is the Lingyun Academy?”","Jiang Xiaoyue pointed out the door. “Over there! It’s one of the biggest academies in Dajin.”","Jiang Xuan: “!!??”","“Nonsense!” He slammed his hand on the desk and said angrily, “What do you think Heavenly Academy is? How can you compare it with a tiny warrior academy for ordinary people in this small country?”","“Why not?” Jiang Xiaoyue said earnestly, “I like Lingyun Academy very much. The people in it have talent and are good game players. Why can’t I go to Lingyun Academy?”","Ye Xiaoyue walked up to her side and whispered, “You’re right. Or you can come to our Cloud Ocean Faction. Why should you go to the Heavenly Academy which I’ve never heard before; I don’t know if it’s a good school or not.”","“You’re a frog sitting in a well; it’s ridiculous that you don’t even know about the Heavenly Academy!” one of the guards said with a snicker.","“Is it very good?” Ye Xiaoye looked puzzled. “Is it in the area around Half City? Humph! Do you know that the cultivators of Half City have to beg for artifact-making techniques from our Wuwei Daoist Alliance?”","“What Half City?” The guard snickered, “The Heavenly Academy has existed since the primitive era; the disciples of the Heavenly Academy include not only princes and princesses from all cultivation countries but masters and elders of the ancient families such as Xuanyuan and Qingqiu, let alone the famous legendary cultivator Wang Zixiao who studied there.","“Who’s Wang Zixiao?”","“I haven’t heard of him...”","The people in the shop looked at each other, having not heard of the Heavenly Academy nor the ancient families named Xuanyuan and Qingqiu.","“Daoist Brother Li,” Ling Wanyin whispered, “Isn’t that spiritual master in our ancient documents called Zixiao Spiritual Master?”","“I think...” Li Longyuan looked shocked. “I think... you’re right!”","“Are they...” The both of them looked shocked. “Are they people from the other realm?”","“Are they people from the place recorded in our ancient documents?!”","“Zhen Yan.” Jiang Xuan gave the red-faced guard a hard look. “It’s not necessary to say these things!”","“I’m sorry! Young Master!”","Jiang Xuan looked at Jiang Xiaoyue and said, “Do you know why our Lord Father asked me, your older brother, to come to this place? He knows that you’re stubborn and willful and will not come back willingly, so he sent me to fetch you.”","While shaking his head, he sighed slightly. “Our Lord Father told me that I must take you back even if you don’t want to come back.”","“Ugh...” The people in the shop looked at each other, thinking that it wasn’t right to interfere with the internal affairs of a family.","However, they didn’t think it right to stand back and watch either.","They had no choice but to send a message on QQ.","Song Qingfeng, [Sir! Bad news! Someone wants to forcefully take Xiaoyue from the shop!]","[(Husky’s baffled face) What do you mean by someone wants to forcefully take Xiaoyue from the shop?] Mr. Fang was still busy showing off his skills in Devil May Cry 3. [Don’t bother me!]","[Don’t you want to help your Xiaoyue?] Soon, Su Tianji also sent a message to him."]},{"number":398,"title":"Chapter 398 - Teach the Black-Hearted Boss a Lesson","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In a hurry, Mr. Fang finished his battle with a Boss and finally got the time to reply. [What happened to Xiaoyue? Do you mean someone dares to make a move in my shop? Are you trying to fool me? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f612.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F612;\">]","[Someone from Xiaoyue’s family is here to take her back and make her to go to school.] Su Tianji sent him an angry face emoji. [How come you know nothing about it?!]","“???” Mr. Fang was baffled. [This girl is at the age to go to school, so it is nothing unusual for her family to take her to school. How come someone scared me, saying that she is being taken away by force?]","“...” Su Tianji froze for a moment, thinking that he had a point.","“No!” Her face turned dark since that she had almost agreed with Mr. Fang. [She will be taken to a place named the Heavenly Academy that I’ve never heard of before. Xiaoyue doesn’t want to go, but her family is determined to take her back anyway.]","“Ugh...” Mr. Fang finally exited from the game. After some consideration, he replied, [It seems that I can’t do anything about it, right? Do you want me to beat the people from her family? Do you think it’s a good idea <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f633.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F633;\">?]","Then, he grabbed the big quilt that was floating above his head.","“Hey! Why are you grabbing me?!” Yells came from above.","“We’ll go to Jiuhua.”","“We are finally going to Jiuhua?!” The old demon was elated and excited. “Go! Go! Go! Hurry! I’m so cold here!”","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","The atmosphere was tense.","“I say... what’s happening?” Mr. Fang walked down the stairs, followed by a cheerful dark cloud without the big quilt.","Obviously, Jiuhua City was much warmer.","“Boss!” Seeing Mr. Fang, Jiang Xiaoyue looked as if she had found a savior. Immediately, she hid behind him.","“What’s wrong?” Mr. Fang was nonplussed. “They are here to take you to school, right? I graduated from elementary school at your age. There’s nothing to be afraid of.”","“Can’t I go to a school nearby?” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted. “What’s so good about the Heavenly Academy? If it’s so good, Dad can go there himself!”","“You are...” Jiang Xuan stared at the man before him warily. He wasn’t worried that his little sister would get bullied in the Deserted Sea Realm, but he was afraid that she might get tricked by a weak and ignorant cultivator.","“Oh! He’s my boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted and then begged pitiably, “Boss, if I’m gone, who will keep an eye on the shop for you? I don’t want to go to that school which is so far away from here!”","Hearing her words, Jiang Xuan’s face turned dark as he realized something that he didn’t pay attention to before.","“What did you say?! You are keeping an eye on this shop?!”","“You... are too willful!” Jiang Xuan snorted and said, “I thought you just sneaked out to play, but in fact you’ve been a clerk in this shop?!”","“I... planned to give him some protection and get some fees...” Jiang Xiaoyue mumbled.","However, Mr. Fang didn’t need her protection, so she had to act as a cashier and keep an eye on the shop...","After a while, she just didn’t want to leave.","“...” Jiang Xuan’s face turned dark at the thought that she, a princess, had come to this place to be a shop clerk!","It was a disgrace to the Jiang Family!","“If our Lord Father knew about your antics,” he said with a snort, “he will probably send troops over and raze this small country of mortals to the ground. Go home with me now, and I will probably pretend that this didn’t happen and not report it to our Lord Father.”","Ji Wu, who was passing them with a bow of instant noodles in his hands, was at a loss for words, and his face twitched, wondering why people kept threatening to raze his Dajin to the ground. Who did he offend?","Zhen Yan whispered beside him, “However, the shop owner looks to be a despicable man, and we must teach him a lesson. Otherwise, the princess will...”","“Okay!” Jiang Xuan nodded.","This despicable shop owner had ordered the princess to do low tasks such as keeping an eye on the shop for him; it was unforgivable!","Of course, if they knew that Mr. Fang didn’t pay Xiaoyue for her work for three months, they would probably want to kill him immediately.","“Zhen Yan,” Jiang Xuan said coldly, “You go and find out what abilities this owner has; how dare he be my little sister’s boss!”","“Girl,” Mr. Fang turned around and stared at Jiang Xiaoyue. Then, he bent down and pinched her cheek and said, “You are just making trouble for me.”","With a pout, Jiang Xiaoyue looked at Mr. Fang imploringly and said, “I don’t want to go to the Heavenly Academy; please help me...”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","Jiang Xiaoyue added, “I’m your employee. If I’m gone, who will keep an eye on the shop for you? You must do something!”","The guard named Zhen Yan smirked. “I advise you to mind your own business and not to interfere with other people.”","Mr. Fang shrugged and replied, “I don’t like minding others’ business, but since this girl calls me ‘Boss’, it is not proper for me not to do anything for my employee.”","Hearing the word ’employee’, Zhen Yan’s face turned chiller.","There was an old saying that the subordinates must die when their master was insulted.","Perhaps it didn’t mean much to others, but as a servant of the Royal Family, he took it as a great insult that this young man from nowhere dared to call the princess ‘his employee’. With a cold contemptuous expression, he said, “Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm? I won’t bully you; I’ll battle with you with the same power of your realm. What do you think?”","“Ugh?” Mr. Fang nodded immediately and said, “Good. We’ll pull our punches when the point is made to avoid severe injuries. Let’s go outside!”","“Okay!” Zhen Yan seemed to have a higher opinion of him and said with a nod, “It’s good that you don’t overestimate yourself.”","Jiang Xuan’s face was always cold and unreadable.","Hearing the conversation, the faces of the members of the audience in the internet café twitched.","“I think he doesn’t understand that Mr. Fang doesn’t what to cause him grave injuries...” Lan Yan whispered.","Song Qingfeng said, “He really has no idea.”","Xu Zixin added, “Three seconds of condolence for him.”","They walked out of the shop.","Zhen Yan grinned. “A warrior? According to what I know, warriors can’t fly at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm, right?”","He stretched and said, “Then, I’ll fight you on the ground.”","He beckoned at Mr. Fang and said, “Come on! I’ll admit defeat if you can even injure me slightly.”","Mr. Fang’s face twitched. “This request is stepping over the line, don’t you think so?”","“Stepping over the line?” Zhen Yan’s gaze was even more contemptuous. “Then, I’ll admit defeat if you can touch the edge of my clothes. Are you satisfied now?”","Jiang Xuan frowned slightly as well. He had thought that this Mr. Fang must have had some abilities, but now it seemed like he had been wrong.","However, Mr. Fang shook his head and said, “No. I’m afraid that you will lose in the blink of an eye. We can’t call it a proper fight then.”","“What?!”","“Arrogance!”","“Today, I’ll teach you a good lesson, you arrogant and black-hearted shop owner!” With a chilly expression, Zhen Yan yelled in a fury while his aura expanded explosively!"]},{"number":399,"title":"Chapter 399 - A Senior Who Can Only Play Erhu","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","True to his word, Zhen Yan only released the aura of a pinnacle stage Grand Ancestral Warrior, the same realm as Mr. Fang.","With a snicker, he lifted his fists, and red flames appeared and engulfed them. “You are a warrior, eh? Then, I’ll fight you in close-range.”","The temperature of the flames emitting from his hands rose quickly. Soon, the heat energy coming off it wave after wave became so hot that it seemed like they would burn everything into black coal!","When the people around him looked surprised, Zhen Yan revealed a little of his smugness. “The people of the Deserted Sea Realm are ignorant; my Bite of Devouring Flame is enough to deal with the cultivators here even without the assistance of any spiritual spells!”","At this moment, Mr. Fang slowly raised his right hand, holding a bright red flame.","This flame wasn’t ostentatious, and people didn’t even feel its heat.","“Shiki Orochi Nagi?!” many people in the audience exclaimed.","“How come I don’t feel any power in his Shiki Orochi Nagi?!” Song Qingfeng said in surprise.","Zhen Yan’s lips curved up. “You have it coming!”","He yelled in a fury, “Bite of Devouring Flame!”","An explosive flame surged up like a huge wave and transformed into a dragon made of burning flames; it opened its huge mouth and bit at Fang Qi!","Meanwhile, Fang Qi’s arm only waved.","“Stupid.” Jiang Xuan shook his head, thinking that the technique with the strange name ‘Shiki Orochi Nagi’ was quite weak.","At Fang Qi’s wave, the flame shot out from his hand. However, feeling the slight heat from the flame, Jiang Xuan’s expression suddenly changed drastically!","Different from others’ cultivation methods, Fang Qi mainly obtained his pure cultivation strength through playing games and the synchronizations with the characters through the Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room and Game Cultivation Room.","With his talent, he would obtain more benefits in playing games than cultivating like others.","The strength that he got from the System was very pure. In theory, it could adapt to any changes. However, he needed synchronization practice if he wanted to unleash the same level of power as those in the game.","Since Mr. Fang planned to follow the path of a warrior, he had worked hard on all close-range combat techniques, let alone Kyo Kusanagi’s desperation move, Shiki Orochi Nagi.","The people around him couldn’t feel the heat of his flame since all its heat energy was concentrated in his palm!","“Don’t reserve your strength!” Jiang Xuan yelled out a warning.","Faced with such a technique, reserving strength while fighting at the same realm was seeking death!","“What?!” Zhen Yan’s face turned grim, and the dragon before him suddenly looked even livelier as if it were a real dragon. With a roar, it viciously crashed toward the curtain of flames that Fang Qi pushed toward him.","When the two burning flames collided, Shiki Orochi Nagi finally revealed its extremely high heat energy, even gradually melting the ground beneath their feet!","Feeling an overwhelming heat wave surging toward him, Zhen Yan’s eyebrows and hair were almost seared off.","After piercing the Biting Flames, Shiki Orochi Nagi’s heat wave forced Zhen Yan to retreat repeatedly. If not for his strength which was much higher than the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm, he would have been wounded!","“Go! Go! Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue clapped her hands and cheered. “Use Shiki Orochi Nagi first and then show him the ultimate desperation move, Mu Shiki!”","Mr. Fang: “...”","“Do you still have ultimate skills?” At this moment, Zhen Yan finally turned serious. “I didn’t know that I would meet a young man like you in the Deserted Sea Realm.”","With a snicker, he shook his head and continued, “However, I can’t take back my words; if I lose to you, a young man in the Deserted Sea Realm, it would be a great humiliation for me!”","“Watch!” With a loud yell, he said, “I’ll use a great technique to fight you, showing you that the huge gap between us is too large for you to cross!”","Mr. Fang replied, “Ugh... I understand that.”","“No. You don’t understand,” Zhen Yan said while shaking his head. “Otherwise, you won’t continue with this futile struggle.”","He brought his hands together before his chest, forming a mystical spell seal one after another one.","The sky behind him suddenly dimmed. Vaguely, people seemed to hear ocean waves coming from the distance.","That sounds got closer, and it sounded as if huge and turbulent ocean waves were surging behind him and slapping boulders.","It felt as if a deep and dark abyss stood behind him instead of the sky.","Then, a black dragon shadow leaped up from the turbulent waves behind him and soared up into the clouds!","It was a true dragon!","“Admit defeat!” A gust of black wind swept across the land and Zhen Yan’s wild laughter was empowered by the booming noises of the rumbling thunder in the sky. Giant, bean-sized raindrops fell, and it looked as if a real dragon was flying in the sky, creating rain in the clouds.","The horrible suppression sent chills down the spines of the people standing around them!","“This technique comes from the true power derived from the depths of my ancient bloodline. Although I only understand one trace of it, ordinary cultivators who are even a large realm higher than me can’t block it!” Zhen Yan’s gaze was as cold as that of a wild beast. “Do you understand the gap between us now?”","“This...”","With his hands in his pockets, a sword spirit suddenly dashed into the sky from Mr. Fang’s body.","With aloof eyes, Mr. Fang seemed to have merged with the sword spirit and transformed into an ultimate heavenly sword.","“I learned this sword spirit from a senior who can only play the Erhu, even though I only understand a trace of it,” Mr. Fang said, “But ordinary cultivators might find it difficult to move their weapons when they face me.”","Zhen Yan, “!!??”","A senior who can only play Erhu?! What nonsense is he talking about?! people thought to themselves.","Jiang Xiaoyue also looked puzzled. “Who is the senior that can only play Erhu? How come I’ve never seen him?”","Nalan Mingxue said, “Haven’t you discovered that Senior No Name likes to stay home and play Erhu when he was at his prime; he came out to the world when he had only 10% of his strength left. I wonder if he is the senior who the shop owner is referring to.”","“Heavenly Sword, No Name,” Su Tianji said with a nod. “This sword spirit should be it!”","As soon as she said it, a wave of dense sword shadows appeared in the sky.","It formed a curtain of swords, covering the sky!","Even from far away, they could feel the overwhelming sword spirit contained in each of the swords.","Even more horrible was that the sword spirit emitting from the young man in front of him gave Zhen Yan a feeling that he could cut the sky into two halves!","If this attack fell on him, Zhen Yan probably wouldn’t be able to block it with his full strength, let alone the strength of the Grand Ancestor Warrior Realm.","“Impossible!” Zhen Yan didn’t believe that a warrior in the Deserted Sea Realm could be so powerful!","“You’re bluffing!” He said with a snort, “I’ll see how long your bluffing can last!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The moment that he said those words, many flying swords dashed down like the raindrops in a storm, and the silver sword lights looked like a river of swords pouring from Heaven!","When the many flying swords whistled past his ears, the stunning sword waterfall dumbfounded not only Zhen Yan but Jiang Xuan, as well.","Is he really a warrior from the Deserted Sea Realm?!","They suddenly felt like they might have come to the wrong place!"]},{"number":400,"title":"Chapter 400 - I’ll Fight After Eating","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Xiaoyue.”","“Ugh?” Jiang Xiaoyue was engrossed in the battle when she heard someone call her name.","“Yes, Sister Xue’er?” She looked at Nalan Mingxue in puzzlement.","Nalan Mingxue whispered something at her ear.","...","After many flying swords passed him, the ground around Zhen Yan was turned into a dense forest of swords!","Only the ground beneath him was left intact, leaving a blank area that looked like the shape of one person.","Dazed, Zhen Yan stood on the street while drops of sweat fell to the ground. At this moment, it seemed like it was extremely difficult to raise even a finger.","“Who on earth are you?!” Jiang Xuan’s face fell, and he looked at Fang Qi as if the latter was a monster.","Is this the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm?!","Suddenly, he felt like he couldn’t understand the people standing around him.","If the Grand Ancestral Warriors were this powerful, he wondered how powerful the King Warriors and Emperor Warriors were.","Impossible! He comforted himself silently. It is impossible for other people to be as powerful as him; one is already shocking enough.","However, he had clearly heard them mention... a senior named No Name.","It sounded like they were all familiar with the so-called Shiki Orochi Nagi.","At this moment, he saw some people getting restless in the crowd.","Song Qingfeng raised his right hand and condensed some flames. “The shop owner isn’t as dashing as me. Watch my Shiki Orochi Nagi!”","Lin Shao looked disdainful. “Shiki Orochi Nagi is nothing. Watch my Innumerable Sword Scroll!”","Then, dozens of flying swords rose behind him!","Jiang Xuan and his guards were stunned.","Liang Shi commented from the side, “Shop Owner’s heavenly sword spirit combined with the Innumerable Sword Scroll indeed resembles the feeling of Senior No Name...”","“He indeed has some of the magnificence of Senior No Name!”","“I still think Senior Nalan’s Sword 23 that day is more powerful; he even suppressed space! All the people in the Four Symbol Grand Array couldn’t move or escape; even the Divine Palace Realm cultivators almost got killed! He got about 50 to 60 percent of the Old Sword Saint’s power...”","These newcomers’ faces turned uglier while they listened to the conversations among the audience.","“It is still no match for Shop Owner’s Orochi Shockwave or Orochi Divine Light...”","“I wonder if Shop Owner has mastered Dante’s control of time yet...”","“It’s said the shop owner has acquired the blue flame of time; maybe he has mastered the control of time.”","Jiang Xuan: “...”","Zhen Yan: “...”","The other green-faced guard, Xue Ming, was also at a loss for words.","They were almost stupefied due to fear.","How come these people were each more powerful than the next?","Leaving other aside, they can even suppress space and control time?!","Have the people in the Deserted Sea Realm developed to this high realm?!","Jiang Xuan had planned to take Jiang Xiaoyue with him by force. But now judging from the gazes of the people around him, he knew he had a low chance of succeeding.","According to what he had known about the Deserted Sea Realm, he had thought that he could go and leave however he wanted.","But now, he got himself ready for the worst-case scenario while coldly staring at Fang Qi.","He had thought that the Deserted Sea Realm was just a small fish pond, but it turned out to be the homebase for dragons and tigers.","He raised his hand, and a black-patterned heavy ji appeared in his hand.","The atmosphere around them turned chilly and grim.","“Growl!” At this moment, a weird sound appeared.","All the people looked toward Zhen Yan.","“...” Zhen Yan looked embarrassed. After all, he hadn’t had the time for a meal in the long journey!","He had been fine, but he had sweated profusely with this scare; he wasn’t able to control this stamina and energy that well now.","“Em...” He sniffed. “This rich sour fragrance smells so good. What is it?!”","Jiang Xiaoyue handed a bowl of instant noodles to Jiang Xuan.","When he opened the lid, the sour fragrance was even richer. On the golden noodles were a layer of crystal-like pickled vegetables.","The fragrance and the appetizing colors could even tempt fasting cultivators who weren’t supposed to eat, let alone the demons who had big appetites.","“Growl...” Jiang Xuan’s face turned dark.","“Here! This is the most delicious instant noodles of our shop!” Jiang Xiaoyue’s big eyes curved up like the crescent moon with her smile. “Besides its fragrance and rich flavor, the instant noodles can purify the spiritual essence in your body. I even prepared it for you.”","Jiang Xuan stared at the noodles with widened eyes.","“Fine!” It seemed like he finally found a way out of this difficult situation. With the heavy ji in his hand, he said with a dark expression, “I’ll deal with you after eating the instant noodles that my little sister prepared for me. Humph!”","He gave Mr. Fang a hard stare.","After swallowing one mouthful of the instant noodles, his eyes widened. “Wow! So delicious!”","“Slurp... Slurp...”","The two guards swallowed their saliva repeatedly.","“We have more in the shop!” Mr. Fang said, “You are guests from a distant place, so the noodles are on me. But you must prepare them yourselves.”","“...”","Soon, three more people appeared on the couches in the ship, and they were devouring instant noodles with loud slurping sounds.","“I’m surprised that you’re so smart, girl.” If not for the instant noodles, the situation would probably have turned worse and become harder to deal.","The practice fight might have turned into a fierce battle later on.","After all, they couldn’t afford to humiliate the Jiang Family.","Mr. Fang didn’t like thinking too much, and it was clear that Jiang Xiaoyue was also a girl who never thought of consequences.","Sitting on a couch, Nalan Mingxue was enjoying her milk tea.","She turned her head and saw Jiang Xiaoyue give her a victory sign with her hand while showing two small canine teeth.","– On the other side –","“How can it be?!”","“Such a delicacy! It’s a precious delicacy in the world!” Zhen Yan yelled, “I’m surprised that there’s such a delicacy on this tiny deserted land.”","While sipping the soup of the noodles, Jiang Xuan looked serious as well. “While I eat the noodles and drink the soup, I sense that the spiritual essence in my body is being refined; it’s a high-level cultivation method!”","Jiang Xiaoyue handed them each a bottle of Coke.","“Gulp... Gulp...”","Spicy sticks...","Milk tea...","– An hour later –","“Sir! Do you have more food or beverages? Bring them all to us! We can afford them all!”","“In fact, my big brother has a very big appetite... My Dad told me that when my big brother was little, he had once stolen and eaten all the spiritual herbs of a major faction. When he got home...” Jiang Xiaoyue whispered some little secrets about her big brother to Mr. Fang.","When she told Fang Qi the information, she didn’t look at her own small round belly at all.","Mr. Fang yelled, “No more! You have to wait until tomorrow if you want more!”","“What??!!”"]}]);
